  ('481681506364027391', 'Bikini Warriors', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Kana Ueda, Ai Kakuma, Chiaki Takahashi, Shizuka Itoh, Manami Numakura', 'TV-MA', 'Prepare yourself for an adventure of epic proportions. With warriors so skilled at battling questionable slimes and taming tumescent tentacles, there''s no need for all that bulky armor.', 'Prepare yourself for an adventure of epic proportions. With warriors so skilled at battling questionable slimes and taming tumescent tentacles, there''s no need for all that bulky armor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3Cqimi0eXWGVH5PEkZbZLuMYgI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70716'),
