  ('498602002734312958', 'Blood Curse', 2023, 'Mystery', 'Kimo Stamboel', 'Bayu Kurnia, Khalid Kashogi, Agasyah Karim', 'Mikha Tambayong, Lukman Sardi, Imelda Therinne, Deva Mahenra, Justin Adiwinata, Kiki Narendra, Shenina Cinnamon, Ruth Marini', null, 'A young woman witnessing black magic attack on her family which changes her view towards the world. Driven to protect them at any cost, the woman will go to the ends of the earth to find out who is responsible and hold them to account.', 'A young woman witnessing black magic attack on her family which changes her view towards the world. Driven to protect them at any cost, the woman will go to the ends of the earth to find out who is responsible and hold them to account.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u2dpmG0oB3jrTbRYnmQHbFwU54.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221166'),
  ('893457755429946591', 'Blood Drive', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James Roland', 'James Roland', 'Alan Ritchson, Christina Ochoa, Thomas Dominique, Colin Cunningham, Marama Corlett', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a near-dystopian future, a former cop is forced to take part in a death race where the cars run on human blood. You lose a leg and you lose your head.', 'Set in a near-dystopian future, a former cop is forced to take part in a death race where the cars run on human blood. You lose a leg and you lose your head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB9PBQMyKrp8diKGxVpfayKZbgd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71693'),
  ('511095830957968964', 'Blood Flowers', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Barış Baktaş, Yağmur Yüksel, Ekrem Aral Tuna, Dilek Güler, Nuray Şerefoğlu, Hasan Balliktas, Hilal Kuvvet, Yilmaz Ulutas', null, 'The narrative of Dilan, whose aspirations and hopes were dashed on the one hand, and Baran, who had to marry to stop the feud and save her brother from this cycle on the other. This marriage, however, is a prison for the two of them, and his uncle, who is jealous of his wealth, wishes to renew the rivalry. This conflicted relationship will cause strong winds to blow between two hearts; will this marriage become a true marriage?', 'The narrative of Dilan, whose aspirations and hopes were dashed on the one hand, and Baran, who had to marry to stop the feud and save her brother from this cycle on the other. This marriage, however, is a prison for the two of them, and his uncle, who is jealous of his wealth, wishes to renew the rivalry. This conflicted relationship will cause strong winds to blow between two hearts; will this marriage become a true marriage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6tosm7V0SMBlI1KsTUxPM9Papp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:219290'),
  ('378907538596538549', 'Blood Free', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Lee Su-yeon', 'Lee Su-yeon', 'Ju Ji-hoon, Han Hyo-joo, Lee Hee-jun, Lee Mu-saeng, Jun Suk-ho, Park Ji-yeon, Kim Sang-ho, Yi Seo', null, 'After diving down a rabbit hole of tangled leads, a former bodyguard finds himself recruited to protect the CEO of a controversial lab-grown meat company who is also a survivor of the fateful attack that changed his life.', 'After diving down a rabbit hole of tangled leads, a former bodyguard finds himself recruited to protect the CEO of a controversial lab-grown meat company who is also a survivor of the fateful attack that changed his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxd86XTik9QfPLXxbMiMdsg407V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209750'),
  ('968802659839122066', 'Blood Lad', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Iori Nomizu, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Ryota Osaka, Yuuka Nanri, Ryohei Kimura', 'TV-14', 'Staz is a vampire from the surreal "Demon World", and Fuyumi, an ordinary girl, accidentally wanders into the Demon World through a portal. Subsequently after meeting each other, Fuyumi is killed by a carnivorous plant and turned into a ghost, causing Staz to take responsibility and pledge to help bring her back to life.', 'Staz is a vampire from the surreal "Demon World", and Fuyumi, an ordinary girl, accidentally wanders into the Demon World through a portal. Subsequently after meeting each other, Fuyumi is killed by a carnivorous plant and turned into a ghost, causing Staz to take responsibility and pledge to help bring her back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ySatbrYDxvHkXaq7ZjIRRmJuQB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57577'),
  ('260554171284572388', 'Blood Legacy', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Treasure Nkosi, Xolile Tshabalala, Buyile Mdladla, Mike Ndlangamandla, Connie Chiume, Sello Maake Ka-Ncube, Pallance Dladla, Anthony Oseyemi', 'TV-MA', 'After years of estrangement, Khanyi Adesina returns home to fight for her family''s business empire as it threatens to collapse under corruption.', 'After years of estrangement, Khanyi Adesina returns home to fight for her family''s business empire as it threatens to collapse under corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59jB3ECurFN3iz61Bs9zhq5p6ad.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270364'),
  ('62515682058421125', 'Blood of Zeus', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Charley Parlapanides, Vlas Parlapanides', null, 'Derek Phillips, Fred Tatasciore, Jessica Henwick, Elias Toufexis', 'TV-MA', 'In a brewing war between the gods of Olympus and the titans, Heron, a commoner living on the outskirts of ancient Greece, becomes mankind''s best hope of surviving an evil demon army, when he discovers the secrets of his past.', 'In a brewing war between the gods of Olympus and the titans, Heron, a commoner living on the outskirts of ancient Greece, becomes mankind''s best hope of surviving an evil demon army, when he discovers the secrets of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXRR5tgGLtKrRmuN4ko9SLAdCiZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:111111'),
  ('97029387165147698', 'Blood River', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Munan Zhou', null, 'Gong Jun, Peng Xiaoran, Chang Huasen, Yang Yutong, Kong Xue''er, Shawn Zhang, Liang Yongni', null, 'Blood River is the realm''s most feared assassin guild, jointly run by the Su, Mu, and Xie clans. They can strike royals in court and crush great sects in the wild. When the patriarch is poisoned on a mission, the three clans vie for the top seat. Su Muyu leads the Spider-Shadow unit and shields the dying leader on the road to a cure. He clashes with elder Su Zhe and old friend Su Changhe, and meets master healer Bai Hehuai. After brutal power struggles, Su Changhe becomes new patriarch and Su Muyu heads the Su clan. They launch the "Other Shore Plan" to drag Blood River out of the shadow and forge a new destiny, free from being anyone''s blade.', 'Blood River is the realm''s most feared assassin guild, jointly run by the Su, Mu, and Xie clans. They can strike royals in court and crush great sects in the wild. When the patriarch is poisoned on a mission, the three clans vie for the top seat. Su Muyu leads the Spider-Shadow unit and shields the dying leader on the road to a cure. He clashes with elder Su Zhe and old friend Su Changhe, and meets master healer Bai Hehuai. After brutal power struggles, Su Changhe becomes new patriarch and Su Muyu heads the Su clan. They launch the "Other Shore Plan" to drag Blood River out of the shadow and forge a new destiny, free from being anyone''s blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvxV9A8IcgeCqnagkfCsHSg4y5J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261663'),
  ('95991975975251283', 'Blood Sisters', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Temidayo Makanjuola', null, 'Ini Dima-Okojie, Nancy Isime, Kate Henshaw-Nuttal, Ramsey Nouah, Deyemi Okanlawon, Genoveva Umeh, Gabriel Afolayan, Kehinde Bankole', 'TV-MA', 'Connected by a dangerous secret, best friends Sarah and Kemi are forced to flee after a wealthy groom disappears at his own engagement party.', 'Connected by a dangerous secret, best friends Sarah and Kemi are forced to flee after a wealthy groom disappears at his own engagement party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUXHRoecSwzKc0k15sIIriQqwJs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197428'),
  ('35574820674897915', 'Blood Ties', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Tanya Huff, Peter Mohan', null, 'Christina Cox, Dylan Neal, Kyle Schmid', 'TV-14', 'Blood Ties is a Canadian television series based on the Blood Books by Tanya Huff; the show was created by Peter Mohan. It is set in Toronto, Canada and has a similar premise to an earlier series also set in Toronto, Forever Knight, in which a vampire assists police in dealing with crime. It premiered in the United States on March 11, 2007 on Lifetime Television, and during fall of 2007 on Citytv and Space in Canada. In May 2008, Lifetime declined to renew the series.', 'Blood Ties is a Canadian television series based on the Blood Books by Tanya Huff; the show was created by Peter Mohan. It is set in Toronto, Canada and has a similar premise to an earlier series also set in Toronto, Forever Knight, in which a vampire assists police in dealing with crime. It premiered in the United States on March 11, 2007 on Lifetime Television, and during fall of 2007 on Citytv and Space in Canada. In May 2008, Lifetime declined to renew the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfUkWEtIl0U4ZpaVyshzrQXXojS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5100'),
  ('833571951525921418', 'Blood Ties', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Mateo Stivelberg', null, 'Shany Nadan, María José Vargas, Estefania Piñeres, Luis Mesa, Coraima Torres, Brian Moreno, Eloi Costa', null, 'In early-1800s Colombia, three high-society sisters act as spies to help rebels fight against Spanish rule, and to seek justice for their mother''s death.', 'In early-1800s Colombia, three high-society sisters act as spies to help rebels fight against Spanish rule, and to seek justice for their mother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgtyjTlm28h1Vbylv4uMcG66vOV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197979'),
  ('477070496708711793', 'Blood vs Duty', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, 'Dindo C. Perez, Cenon Palomares, Jann Mendoza', 'Richard Gutierrez, Gerald Anderson, Bela Padilla, Barbie Imperial, Baron Geisler, Rommel Padilla, Jeric Raval, Jaime Fabregas', null, 'In the world of crime and injustice, dangerous missions force those on opposite sides of the law to choose between protecting family and doing their duty.', 'In the world of crime and injustice, dangerous missions force those on opposite sides of the law to choose between protecting family and doing their duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qslwgFoHYYEk9Os596USGVvjL7R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:311837'),
  ('826341765991595238', 'BLOOD-C', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Kenji Nojima, Keiji Fujiwara, Masumi Asano, Misato Fukuen, Atsushi Abe, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Miho Miyagawa', 'TV-MA', 'Saya Kisaragi is an outwardly normal girl who serves as the shrine maiden to a country town; in reality, she is a skilled swordswoman charged by her father to defeat Elder Bairns, monsters who feed on human blood. As her battles grow more desperate and more people she cares for fall victim to the Elder Bairns, Saya begins finding faults in her reality, and eventually uncovers a disturbing truth about herself, the town and her surviving friends.', 'Saya Kisaragi is an outwardly normal girl who serves as the shrine maiden to a country town; in reality, she is a skilled swordswoman charged by her father to defeat Elder Bairns, monsters who feed on human blood. As her battles grow more desperate and more people she cares for fall victim to the Elder Bairns, Saya begins finding faults in her reality, and eventually uncovers a disturbing truth about herself, the town and her surviving friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2zwaN5vbBtWBS6eUvEIl8CinrA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43270'),
  ('1050894786361153716', 'Blood-Stained Intrigue', 1986, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Jimmy Au Shui-Wai, Ng Sai-Mei, Yung Wai-Man, Newton Lai Hon-Chi, Wong Wan-Choi, Kenneth Tsang, Bao Fang, Carrie Choi', null, 'The series started off with the Bak family being hunted down by the people of the martial arts world. They are a well-known family and consist of 5 members: the father--Bak Fung Tin, the mother, and their 3 children: Jin Man, Yuk Ying, and Jin Mo. Fung Tin was said to have murdered the leaders of 4 powerful sects, so the head of the martial arts world ordered that his whole family be killed.', 'The series started off with the Bak family being hunted down by the people of the martial arts world. They are a well-known family and consist of 5 members: the father--Bak Fung Tin, the mother, and their 3 children: Jin Man, Yuk Ying, and Jin Mo. Fung Tin was said to have murdered the leaders of 4 powerful sects, so the head of the martial arts world ordered that his whole family be killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1cZ5BTdQW7Z18t9ylyEvJHKNpi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108078'),
  ('808386730456383651', 'Blood, Sex & Royalty', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jillian Mannion', null, 'Amy James-Kelly, Adam Astill, Lois Brabin-Platt, Callum Coates, Simonas Mozūra, Max Parker, Jhon Lumsden, Sophie Boettge', 'TV-MA', 'A modern take on the British royal drama, this steamy series offers a window into the lives of history''s deadliest, sexiest and most iconic monarchs.', 'A modern take on the British royal drama, this steamy series offers a window into the lives of history''s deadliest, sexiest and most iconic monarchs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ov3BkiVaY6t3YypbZ4eulbn8U04.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214257'),
  ('192656695971583987', 'Blood+', 2005, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Katsuyuki Konishi, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Akiko Yajima, Hochu Otsuka, Jurota Kosugi, Takashi Nagasako, Yuhko Kaida', 'TV-MA', 'Unable to remember the past, high school senior Saya Otonashi must rediscover her destiny in order to defeat the chiropteran vampires that threaten her loved ones'' existence.', 'Unable to remember the past, high school senior Saya Otonashi must rediscover her destiny in order to defeat the chiropteran vampires that threaten her loved ones'' existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xljI1AQ9j4BXUbJWSTjbd8wQlJE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19849'),
  ('101907669350573202', 'Bloodhounds', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Jason Kim', null, 'Woo Do-hwan, Lee Sang-yi, Rain, Hwang Chan-sung, Choi Si-won, Choi Young-jun, Tae Won-seok, Ryu Soo-young', 'TV-14', 'Faced with ruthless foes with a violent thirst, two young boxers band together — risking life and limb to bring justice and protect their loved ones.', 'Faced with ruthless foes with a violent thirst, two young boxers band together — risking life and limb to bring justice and protect their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu4oHDi6kO3cYXdmEnYT6SibATj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:127529'),
  ('794455120406917616', 'Bloodivores', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chen Ye', null, 'Ajie, Qiao Shiyu, Ao Lei, Sheng Feng, Yang Tianxiang, Su Shangqing', 'TV-MA', '60 years ago, a strange case of insomnia struck the population, forcing them to stay awake for more than a full week. The victims, completely sleep deprived, all went mad. To cure this illness, a new medicine was produced, but the side effects turned the patients into vampires. Humanity went to war against this new species and triumphed, but some of the vampires managed to survive. Born from a Human and a Vampire, the main character Mi Liu, "The Child of Hope," is to represent the new hope that will connect the two species. (Source: MAL, Emon via ANN)', '60 years ago, a strange case of insomnia struck the population, forcing them to stay awake for more than a full week. The victims, completely sleep deprived, all went mad. To cure this illness, a new medicine was produced, but the side effects turned the patients into vampires. Humanity went to war against this new species and triumphed, but some of the vampires managed to survive. Born from a Human and a Vampire, the main character Mi Liu, "The Child of Hope," is to represent the new hope that will connect the two species. (Source: MAL, Emon via ANN)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/754gv8fWDHNEqPaR0wxTerXoatm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68078'),
  ('294654489677179873', 'Bloodlands', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Brandon', null, 'James Nesbitt, Lorcan Cranitch, Charlene McKenna, Lola Petticrew, Chris Walley, Victoria Smurfit', null, 'Northern Irish police officer DCI Tom Brannick connects a suicide note with an infamous cold case with enormous personal significance.', 'Northern Irish police officer DCI Tom Brannick connects a suicide note with an infamous cold case with enormous personal significance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zswKnKs9AMXNaSZHU66UM9tuUQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119191'),
  ('480502065978164582', 'Bloodline', 2015, 'Drama', 'Glenn Kessler, Daniel Zelman, Todd A. Kessler', null, 'Kyle Chandler, Linda Cardellini, Norbert Leo Butz, Jamie McShane, Sissy Spacek, Beau Bridges, Chloë Sevigny', 'TV-MA', 'A dramatic thriller that explores the demons lurking beneath the surface of a contemporary American family. The Rayburns are hard-working pillars of their Florida Keys community. But when the black sheep son comes home for the 45th anniversary of his parents'' hotel, he threatens to expose the Rayburns'' dark secrets and shameful past, pushing his siblings to the limits of family loyalty.', 'A dramatic thriller that explores the demons lurking beneath the surface of a contemporary American family. The Rayburns are hard-working pillars of their Florida Keys community. But when the black sheep son comes home for the 45th anniversary of his parents'' hotel, he threatens to expose the Rayburns'' dark secrets and shameful past, pushing his siblings to the limits of family loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEaqgEjAShqrziUia4XBzvXXGXP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61986'),
  ('1131340666788663915', 'Bloodride', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Kjetil Indregard, Atle Knudsen', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The doomed passengers aboard a spectral bus head toward a gruesome, unknown destination in this deliciously macabre horror anthology series.', 'The doomed passengers aboard a spectral bus head toward a gruesome, unknown destination in this deliciously macabre horror anthology series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYhbw1wAgSy0bTATlAw4OgfG0Ly.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100043'),
  ('249859962553152161', 'Bloods', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Samson Kayo, Nathan Bryon', null, 'Samson Kayo, Jane Horrocks, Lucy Punch, Julian Barratt, Adrian Scarborough, Aasiya Shah, Sam Campbell, Kevin Garry', null, 'When tough-acting loner paramedic Maleek is paired with over-friendly divorcee Wendy, their partnership looks dead on arrival. But pretty soon they''re giving each other life support.', 'When tough-acting loner paramedic Maleek is paired with over-friendly divorcee Wendy, their partnership looks dead on arrival. But pretty soon they''re giving each other life support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ01Wz8lePZCHtpvoL6KzLs6AYM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119792'),
  ('1147262869197447525', 'Bloody Flower', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ryeoun, Sung Dong-il, Keum Sae-rok, Shin Seung-hwan, Lee Na-ra, Yoon Chae-na', 'TV-MA', 'A former medical school dropout claiming to be able to cure terminal illnesses is sentenced to death for the murder of 17 people. Is he a monstrous killer, or a savior holding the cure for humanity?', 'A former medical school dropout claiming to be able to cure terminal illnesses is sentenced to death for the murder of 17 people. Is he a monstrous killer, or a savior holding the cure for humanity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDoAdJLEAiCRj8B0QRAz2wt2xfv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310024'),
  ('850537984295584103', 'Bloody Heart', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Park Pil-joo', 'Lee Joon, Kang Hanna, Jang Hyuk, Park Ji-yeon, Heo Sung-tae, Ha Do-kwon, Choi Ri, Kang Shin-il', null, 'It is a fictional historical drama about the story of King Seonjong who ascends to the throne due to a rebellion, and Lee Tae who becomes the King after him.', 'It is a fictional historical drama about the story of King Seonjong who ascends to the throne due to a rebellion, and Lee Tae who becomes the King after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTiempmGquBdYhsd3Yyk1gCmV08.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136733'),
  ('525511811272102527', 'Bloody Mistress', 2018, null, 'Marika Devic, Egor Anashkin', null, 'Yuliya Snigir, Severija Janušauskaitė, Fyodor Lavrov, Kristina Babushkina, Yuriy Tsurilo, Anastasiya Ukolova', null, '18th century, The Russian Empire. The series tells the life story of Darya Saltykova, who was called Saltychikha by serfs. The landowner brutally tortured about one and half hundreds peasants, for which "Russian Elizabeth Bathory" was imprisoned at underground prison, where she spent 33 years until her death. How a young girl who was brought up in a monastery turned into a monster?', '18th century, The Russian Empire. The series tells the life story of Darya Saltykova, who was called Saltychikha by serfs. The landowner brutally tortured about one and half hundreds peasants, for which "Russian Elizabeth Bathory" was imprisoned at underground prison, where she spent 33 years until her death. How a young girl who was brought up in a monastery turned into a monster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o683WoSyjDYbtk8LdmzfvXu3YMZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83874'),
  ('221069346400370707', 'Bloody Monday', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Ryumon Ryo', null, 'Haruma Miura, Takeru Satoh, Michiko Kichise, Hiroki Narimiya, Mina Fujii, Yutaka Matsushige, Eri Tokunaga, Sei Ashina', null, 'A genius high school student and also a hacker uses his sophisticated hacking techniques to fights against "Bloody Monday", the worst and most evil form of viral terrorism, in order to save his family, friends, and the entire world.', 'A genius high school student and also a hacker uses his sophisticated hacking techniques to fights against "Bloody Monday", the worst and most evil form of viral terrorism, in order to save his family, friends, and the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aimoer77O8q4wwRv35AWm6IjIgf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38634'),
  ('29097158566417514', 'Bloody Romance', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Miu Wenjing, Ding Ya, Guangjin Shu', 'Li Yitong, Qu Chuxiao, Wang Duo, Puff Kuo, Li Zifeng, Jill Hsu, Chai Ou, Li Yixuan', null, 'What doesn’t break you can make you stronger. Qi Xue is a beautiful 16-year-old whose life takes a horrific turn when her father sells her to a brothel. There, she undergoes unspeakable abuse that nearly breaks her spirit. But when Qi Xue enters a mysterious new city, she is given a new identify of Wan Mei and undergoes training to become an assassin. Now able to use her beauty as a weapon, Wan Mei is no longer a victim of all the cruel people around her during the waning days of the Tang Dynasty. As Wan Mei takes on dangerous missions that puts her life on the line, the mysterious Chang An watches over her like a shadow. But when she becomes embroiled in a deadly conspiracy, can Wan Mei survive?', 'What doesn’t break you can make you stronger. Qi Xue is a beautiful 16-year-old whose life takes a horrific turn when her father sells her to a brothel. There, she undergoes unspeakable abuse that nearly breaks her spirit. But when Qi Xue enters a mysterious new city, she is given a new identify of Wan Mei and undergoes training to become an assassin. Now able to use her beauty as a weapon, Wan Mei is no longer a victim of all the cruel people around her during the waning days of the Tang Dynasty. As Wan Mei takes on dangerous missions that puts her life on the line, the mysterious Chang An watches over her like a shadow. But when she becomes embroiled in a deadly conspiracy, can Wan Mei survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wjeTo5bEEDKMe0Y0ixGMee6q4c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81465'),
  ('968440089683624136', 'Bloom', 2019, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Glen Dolman', null, 'Tom Budge, Phoebe Tonkin, Lucy Barrett, Toby Schmitz, Jacqueline McKenzie, Jackson Heywood, Bryan Brown, Bella Heathcote', null, 'One year after a devastating flood kills five locals in an idyllic country town, a mysterious new plant appears with the power to restore their youth.', 'One year after a devastating flood kills five locals in an idyllic country town, a mysterious new plant appears with the power to restore their youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQLvvlRcOvHogJjYxnqAbhGc8hR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:85232'),
  ('16880698874363163', 'Bloom Into You', 2018, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yuuki Takada, Minako Kotobuki, Taichi Ichikawa, Ai Kayano, Konomi Kohara, Yuka Terasaki', 'TV-14', 'Yuu has always dreamt of receiving a love letter but feels numb when a boy gives her one. Confused, she starts high school and meets Touko. Will Yuu''s heart finally skip a beat?', 'Yuu has always dreamt of receiving a love letter but feels numb when a boy gives her one. Confused, she starts high school and meets Touko. Will Yuu''s heart finally skip a beat?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zJKW7OX968nhUg6NnkmkAmESlo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82861'),
  ('1050235461617154542', 'Bloque de búsqueda', 2016, 'Crime', 'Jörg Hiller', 'Jörg Hiller', 'Rafael Novoa, Sebastián Martínez, Laura Londoño, Verónica Orozco, Carolina Gómez, Brian Moreno, Laura Rodríguez, Jorge Herrera', null, 'Group of policemen trained to capture Pablo Escobar. It tells the story of the family of some of its members and what they had to experience during the drug trafficking era in Colombia.', 'Group of policemen trained to capture Pablo Escobar. It tells the story of the family of some of its members and what they had to experience during the drug trafficking era in Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LU5gO3gVOm9IgxLfhSBpMUVYW6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102918'),
  ('1080257017456964998', 'Blossom', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Don Reo', null, 'Mayim Bialik, Joey Lawrence, Michael Stoyanov, Jenna Von Oÿ, Ted Wass, Finola Hughes, Samaria Graham, Courtney Chase', 'TV-PG', 'Blossom Russo is a highly intelligent and spunky teenager. The youngest of three, she lives with her divorced musician father, Nick, eldest brother and recovering substance abuser Anthony, and decidedly not-so-bright middle brother Joey. Along for the ride is Blossom''s ditzy best friend, Six, who sometimes shows flashes of great perception.', 'Blossom Russo is a highly intelligent and spunky teenager. The youngest of three, she lives with her divorced musician father, Nick, eldest brother and recovering substance abuser Anthony, and decidedly not-so-bright middle brother Joey. Along for the ride is Blossom''s ditzy best friend, Six, who sometimes shows flashes of great perception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZVQ73nf4N43LLvKzs0cSkXRne5.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4545'),
  ('1034434099804938160', 'Blossom', 2024, 'Drama', 'Zhi Zhi', null, 'Meng Ziyi, Li Yunrui, Kong Xue''er, Xia Zhiguang, Yan An', null, 'After a troubled childhood, Dou Zhao retreats to a village, where she meets Song Mo, a merchant with a hidden past. To navigate family schemes and personal challenges, they form an alliance, growing from reluctant partners to trusted allies as they strive to protect what matters most.', 'After a troubled childhood, Dou Zhao retreats to a village, where she meets Song Mo, a merchant with a hidden past. To navigate family schemes and personal challenges, they form an alliance, growing from reluctant partners to trusted allies as they strive to protect what matters most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38WomXthArq5cKRfkHkxYRo6DLe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249972'),
  ('790545160092236596', 'Blossoms in Adversity', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'He Fang, Luo Xuan', 'Hu Yitian, Zhang Jingyi, Caesar Wu, Lu Yuxiao, Bian Cheng, Yang Minna, Tian Ai, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee', null, 'A devastating tragedy of the asset forfeiture befalls the Hua family suddenly. The men are forced into exile, leaving behind the women and children in dire straits. Hua Zhi, the young lady of the family, no longer stays low-key and steps up. She braves hardship and leads the women of her household to manage to avoid starvation and danger. She transforms not only their lives but also the feared leader of the Seven Constellations, Gu Yanxi, into her beloved "Mr. Yan". During these lively and heartwarming moments, Hua Zhi rises from a sheltered lady to the head of her family, leading her toward a brighter future.', 'A devastating tragedy of the asset forfeiture befalls the Hua family suddenly. The men are forced into exile, leaving behind the women and children in dire straits. Hua Zhi, the young lady of the family, no longer stays low-key and steps up. She braves hardship and leads the women of her household to manage to avoid starvation and danger. She transforms not only their lives but also the feared leader of the Seven Constellations, Gu Yanxi, into her beloved "Mr. Yan". During these lively and heartwarming moments, Hua Zhi rises from a sheltered lady to the head of her family, leading her toward a brighter future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnEkVpuuFo3kzGi8d4ZEqgEDT8d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248579'),
  ('284499714233725096', 'Blossoms Shanghai', 2023, 'Drama', 'Wong Kar-Wai', null, 'Hu Ge, Ma Yili, Tang Yan, Xin Zhilei, Ryan Zheng, You Benchang, Chen Long, Dong Yong', null, 'Set against the backdrop of massive economic growth in the 1990s, the story follows A Bao, a self-made millionaire and his journey from being a young opportunist with a troubled past to accumulating dazzling wealth in the city of Shanghai. It also follows his entanglement with four women who represent the pursuits of his life: adventure, honour, love and innocence.', 'Set against the backdrop of massive economic growth in the 1990s, the story follows A Bao, a self-made millionaire and his journey from being a young opportunist with a troubled past to accumulating dazzling wealth in the city of Shanghai. It also follows his entanglement with four women who represent the pursuits of his life: adventure, honour, love and innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcL4VKmit4MI9QEzquRm5h4RrNw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106841'),
  ('550526914988180485', 'Blown Away', 2019, 'Reality', null, 'Ron Carroll', 'Katharine Gray, Hunter March', 'TV-PG', 'Ten master artists turn up the heat in glassblowing sculpture challenges for the chance to win $60,000 in prizes and the title of champion.', 'Ten master artists turn up the heat in glassblowing sculpture challenges for the chance to win $60,000 in prizes and the title of champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YmSm6x2aER6a7vfoOTDL9cKEuF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91056'),
  ('1110878804967698383', 'Bludgeoning Angel Dokuro-chan', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saeko Chiba, Reiko Takagi, Rie Kugimiya, Mitsuo Iwata, Ayako Kawasumi', 'TV-MA', 'In the future, a man named Sakura is destined to create the technology for eternal life, which (due to Sakura''s lolicon tendencies) freezes all women''s aging once they turn twelve. God refuses to allow this, so he sends his angels to the past to kill Sakura before he can do this. But one angel, Dokuro-chan, decides to try to change the future without killing him. Problem is, Dokuro is very temperamental, and is constantly killing Sakura (and lots of other people too) in incredibly bloody ways with her giant spiked club. Good thing she can bring people back to life - if only to gruesomely kill them again the next time she loses her temper.', 'In the future, a man named Sakura is destined to create the technology for eternal life, which (due to Sakura''s lolicon tendencies) freezes all women''s aging once they turn twelve. God refuses to allow this, so he sends his angels to the past to kill Sakura before he can do this. But one angel, Dokuro-chan, decides to try to change the future without killing him. Problem is, Dokuro is very temperamental, and is constantly killing Sakura (and lots of other people too) in incredibly bloody ways with her giant spiked club. Good thing she can bring people back to life - if only to gruesomely kill them again the next time she loses her temper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJOKiT6BCfmiP1qpnJj0oy3b3lD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42870'),
  ('253503253552847225', 'Blue', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García', null, 'Julia Stiles', null, 'Blue is a mother with a secret life. She''ll do anything to keep it from her son. But her past has other plans.', 'Blue is a mother with a secret life. She''ll do anything to keep it from her son. But her past has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvkDcuaJ4yMP8ExIcedBhc80sok.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:49525'),
  ('138172292139707898', 'Blue Archive the Animation', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ogura, Yumiri Hanamori, Ayaka Ohashi, Chiyuki Miura, Sayaka Harada, Reina Kondo, Yukiyo Fujii, Erika Ishitobi', 'TV-14', 'The city''s academies are divided into their own districts and are considered mostly independent. The General Student Council acts as a governing board to manage the academies as a whole. However, the group''s ability to govern has come to a halt since the mysterious disappearance of the General Student Council president. Countless issues have begun to surface throughout Kivotos in the absence of the president''s leadership. To avoid disaster, the General Student Council requests assistance from the Federal Investigation Club, otherwise known as Schale. In fact, Schale is the city''s newest club and the last to be approved before the president''s disappearance. To accomplish its task, Schale relies on the guidance of a Sensei who can help them resolve the incidents around Kivotos.', 'The city''s academies are divided into their own districts and are considered mostly independent. The General Student Council acts as a governing board to manage the academies as a whole. However, the group''s ability to govern has come to a halt since the mysterious disappearance of the General Student Council president. Countless issues have begun to surface throughout Kivotos in the absence of the president''s leadership. To avoid disaster, the General Student Council requests assistance from the Federal Investigation Club, otherwise known as Schale. In fact, Schale is the city''s newest club and the last to be approved before the president''s disappearance. To accomplish its task, Schale relies on the guidance of a Sensei who can help them resolve the incidents around Kivotos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RkURIXHgWtCemtDS1Cnp3FIl2R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218833'),
  ('296011756135369967', 'Blue Birthday', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Moon Won-young, Ku So-yeon', 'YERI, Yang Hong-seok, Lee Sang-jun, Kim Gyeol-yu, Ju Hyeon', 'TV-14', 'The series tells the story of Oh Ha-rin, who travels to the past through mysterious photos left by her first love, Ji Seo-jun. Since they were eight years old, they had been close friends, but he died by suicide on her birthday ten years ago.', 'The series tells the story of Oh Ha-rin, who travels to the past through mysterious photos left by her first love, Ji Seo-jun. Since they were eight years old, they had been close friends, but he died by suicide on her birthday ten years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huTPjtVs1VMmzxnu0elfUD3QGL8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128586'),
  ('21599431008614693', 'Blue Blind', 2012, 'Crime', 'Yang Wenjun', null, 'Yu Hewei, Sha Yi, Wang Likun, Liu Xiangjing, Wu Xiubo, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Su Yan, Jiao Gang', null, 'This drama is the first film and television drama in China to describe the theme of jailbreak. It is called the "Chinese version of jailbreak". The plot mainly tells about a treacherous death game in the war. A perfect escape after a period of death, one to escape. Incoming jailbreakers, a full schedule of "high IQ jailbreak" in black jail.', 'This drama is the first film and television drama in China to describe the theme of jailbreak. It is called the "Chinese version of jailbreak". The plot mainly tells about a treacherous death game in the war. A perfect escape after a period of death, one to escape. Incoming jailbreakers, a full schedule of "high IQ jailbreak" in black jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjBN75gLKe70nx9msds2ZK8JIKT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115829'),
  ('866072323003464918', 'Blue Bloods', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robin Green, Mitchell Burgess', null, 'Tom Selleck, Donnie Wahlberg, Bridget Moynahan, Will Estes, Len Cariou, Gregory Jbara, Abigail Hawk', 'TV-14', 'A drama about a multi-generational family of cops dedicated to New York City law enforcement. Frank Reagan is the New York Police Commissioner and heads both the police force and the Reagan brood. He runs his department as diplomatically as he runs his family, even when dealing with the politics that plagued his unapologetically bold father, Henry, during his stint as Chief.', 'A drama about a multi-generational family of cops dedicated to New York City law enforcement. Frank Reagan is the New York Police Commissioner and heads both the police force and the Reagan brood. He runs his department as diplomatically as he runs his family, even when dealing with the politics that plagued his unapologetically bold father, Henry, during his stint as Chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1WlrxnCvNhBjJ4N7V0JQXjnIBN.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:32692'),
  ('112079389253507930', 'Blue Box', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Reina Ueda, Akari Kito', 'TV-PG', 'Taiki Inomata loves badminton, but he has a long way to go before he can reach nationals. When Taiki sees upperclassman Chinatsu Kano practicing her heart out on the girls’ basketball team, he falls for her hard. After an unexpected turn of events brings the two closer together, sports might not be the first thing on their minds anymore!', 'Taiki Inomata loves badminton, but he has a long way to go before he can reach nationals. When Taiki sees upperclassman Chinatsu Kano practicing her heart out on the girls’ basketball team, he falls for her hard. After an unexpected turn of events brings the two closer together, sports might not be the first thing on their minds anymore!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVAWCCNBxPX3EUf9XhcFff4wW5V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:207347'),
  ('502751462535088099', 'Blue Canvas of Youthful Days', 2024, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Guo Jiale, Zhang Xuanyu, Yao Xinghao, Xiao Zizhuo, Li Juexuan, Hu Zeming', null, 'Trapped by legacy and pride, a privileged art student clashes with a struggling painter—unaware he''s the online muse he''s secretly longed for.', 'Trapped by legacy and pride, a privileged art student clashes with a struggling painter—unaware he''s the online muse he''s secretly longed for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pp6OiXADyTkzzZAJ67zuGnPMAp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250833'),
  ('288979918131475369', 'Blue Comet SPT Layzner', 1985, 'Animation, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Ryosuke Takahashi', 'Shōji Tonoike', 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Hiroko Emori, Hideyuki Umezu, Katsumi Toriumi, Fumi Hirano, Yuji Kanomata, Keiko Toda, Mari Yokoo', null, 'Blue Comet SPT Layzner, sometimes translated as Blue Meteor SPT Layzner, is an anime series produced by Sunrise and Tatsunoko Production between 1985 and 1986. Its original creator was Ryousuke Takahashi of Armored Trooper Votoms fame who served as the writer and wrote the scripts for such shows as Panzer World Galient, Tetsuwan Atom, Zero Tester, Fang of the Sun Dougram, Cyborg 009, Gasaraki and Blue Gender.', 'Blue Comet SPT Layzner, sometimes translated as Blue Meteor SPT Layzner, is an anime series produced by Sunrise and Tatsunoko Production between 1985 and 1986. Its original creator was Ryousuke Takahashi of Armored Trooper Votoms fame who served as the writer and wrote the scripts for such shows as Panzer World Galient, Tetsuwan Atom, Zero Tester, Fang of the Sun Dougram, Cyborg 009, Gasaraki and Blue Gender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSpWOFawvb8crIHEl05Nl4Br92J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19829'),
  ('692742713306546123', 'Blue Demon', 2016, 'Action & Adventure', 'Alejandro Martínez Beltrán, Carlos Algara', 'Larissa Andrade, Luis Gamboa, Fernando Abrego', 'Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Alejandro de Marino, Ana Brenda Contreras, Ianis Guerrero, Joaquín Cosío, Ana Layevska', null, 'The fictionalized life-story of Mexican wrestler Alejandro Muñoz Moreno, who wore a blue and silver mask and was known as ''Blue Demon.''', 'The fictionalized life-story of Mexican wrestler Alejandro Muñoz Moreno, who wore a blue and silver mask and was known as ''Blue Demon.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGydBkQfOQbuiVH6dRCj65hV0wQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69169'),
  ('8761673024165751', 'Blue Dragon', 2007, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keiko Nemoto, Masaya Takatsuka, Daisuke Namikawa, Koji Ochiai, Erino Hazuki, Konomi Tsuboi, Sakiko Uran, Jin Horikawa', 'TV-PG', 'A terrible and mysterious enemy attacks the small village of Shu and his friend Kluke. The great warrior Zola, followed by Jiro, will help them discover the ability to evoke shadows.', 'A terrible and mysterious enemy attacks the small village of Shu and his friend Kluke. The great warrior Zola, followed by Jiro, will help them discover the ability to evoke shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz1WUNjTUnjQCYvvpn4Jx0ZV22A.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36210'),
  ('839847911109580393', 'Blue Dragon Series Awards', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jeon Hyun-moo, Yoona', null, 'The Blue Dragon Series Awards (BSA) is a new annual awards ceremony for original streaming content in South Korea.', 'The Blue Dragon Series Awards (BSA) is a new annual awards ceremony for original streaming content in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MxjHQV9HSoPM34hZvE8jk8ozNz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:230983'),
  ('455862907555714168', 'Blue Exorcist', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya', 'TV-14', 'Humans live in the world of Assiah, demons in Gehenna. The two dimensions are not meant to interfere with each other, but demons still possess creatures in Assiah in spite of this. The humans who can fight these demons are known as exorcists. Rin Okumura is a boy who bears the curse of being Satan''s illegitimate son. His foster father sacrificed himself to save him from demons. To avenge his foster father''s death as well as to prove himself, Rin decides to follow the path of an exorcist and defeat his own father, Satan. To hone his raw skills, Rin enters True Cross Academy to train with other exorcist candidates.', 'Humans live in the world of Assiah, demons in Gehenna. The two dimensions are not meant to interfere with each other, but demons still possess creatures in Assiah in spite of this. The humans who can fight these demons are known as exorcists. Rin Okumura is a boy who bears the curse of being Satan''s illegitimate son. His foster father sacrificed himself to save him from demons. To avenge his foster father''s death as well as to prove himself, Rin decides to follow the path of an exorcist and defeat his own father, Satan. To hone his raw skills, Rin enters True Cross Academy to train with other exorcist candidates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpNoqNmElzGUEcEoZyfFwvYXMsR.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:38464'),
  ('917750838068790357', 'BLUE EYE SAMURAI', 2023, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Amber Noizumi, Michael Green', null, 'Maya Erskine, George Takei, Masi Oka, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Brenda Song, Darren Barnet, Randall Park, Kenneth Branagh', 'TV-MA', 'Driven by a dream of revenge against those who made her an outcast in Edo-period Japan, a young warrior cuts a bloody path toward her destiny.', 'Driven by a dream of revenge against those who made her an outcast in Edo-period Japan, a young warrior cuts a bloody path toward her destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXm3JT4WLQVnwukdvghtAblc1wc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:225180'),
  ('33995034984726586', 'Blue Eyes', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', 'Petra Revenue, Fredrik Morheden, Zoula Pitsiava', null, 'Louise Peterhoff, Sven Nordin, Karin Franz Körlof, David Lindström, Kjell Wilhelmsen, Anna Bjelkerud, Adam Lundgren, Erik Johansson', null, 'High adrenaline Swedish political thriller from the creative talent behind Humans – An extreme right-wing party is heading towards its best election result when the chief of staff at the Justice Department disappears without a trace. Racism, immigration and nationalism are explored in this series praised by New York Times.', 'High adrenaline Swedish political thriller from the creative talent behind Humans – An extreme right-wing party is heading towards its best election result when the chief of staff at the Justice Department disappears without a trace. Racism, immigration and nationalism are explored in this series praised by New York Times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEAmFHk761J0XeUE1EX9YiWaQOo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63813'),
  ('539164745822374806', 'Blue Gender', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Kenji Nojima, Katsunosuke Hori, Yukitoshi Hori, Junko Hagimori, Shunsuke Shima, Houko Kuwashima', 'TV-MA', 'In the 2030s Earth has been overrun by the Blue, which are mutated insect-like creatures that kill and harvest humans for food. Most of the surviving human race has moved to Second Earth, a huge spaceship that orbits the planet. Yuji and Marlene must work together to reach Second Earth and fight against the Blue.', 'In the 2030s Earth has been overrun by the Blue, which are mutated insect-like creatures that kill and harvest humans for food. Most of the surviving human race has moved to Second Earth, a huge spaceship that orbits the planet. Yuji and Marlene must work together to reach Second Earth and fight against the Blue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1fkIjgSiFvW3edqtG9sSaurcFI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19855'),
  ('29624922322482587', 'Blue Heelers', 1993, 'Drama', 'Tony Morphett, Hal McElroy', null, 'John Wood, Julie Nihill, Ditch Davey, Simone McAullay, Samantha Tolj', null, 'Blue Heelers was one of Australia''s longest running weekly television drama series. Blue Heelers is a police drama series set in the fictional country town of Mount Thomas. Under the watchful eye of Tom Croydon (John Wood), the men and women of Mount Thomas Police Station fight crime, resolve disputes and tackle the social issues of the day. We watch their successes and their failures and learn to grow with them and their loved ones as the heart of the series develops.', 'Blue Heelers was one of Australia''s longest running weekly television drama series. Blue Heelers is a police drama series set in the fictional country town of Mount Thomas. Under the watchful eye of Tom Croydon (John Wood), the men and women of Mount Thomas Police Station fight crime, resolve disputes and tackle the social issues of the day. We watch their successes and their failures and learn to grow with them and their loved ones as the heart of the series develops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxCyxmFSHiAonsb94s1QScyHBAk.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:2233'),
  ('501614347197855593', 'Blue Lights', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Declan Lawn, Adam Patterson', 'Declan Lawn, Adam Patterson', 'Sian Brooke, Katherine Devlin, Nathan Braniff, Martin McCann, Joanne Crawford, Andi Osho, Frank Blake, Michael Smiley', null, 'Follows rookie police officers working in Belfast, a city in which being a frontline response cop comes with unique pressures and dangers.', 'Follows rookie police officers working in Belfast, a city in which being a frontline response cop comes with unique pressures and dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sBx40gwTCSiZ9NI8WWARjQq1hm.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:218344'),
  ('691358495217612922', 'BLUE LOCK', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Kazuki Ura, Tasuku Kaito, Yuki Ono, Soma Saito, Junichi Suwabe, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'High school soccer players from across Japan gather for a controversial project designed to create the best — and most egoistic — striker in the world.', 'High school soccer players from across Japan gather for a controversial project designed to create the best — and most egoistic — striker in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTDTy73OYmKY51EK94Mc6AxogzR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131041'),
  ('902871054576300197', 'Blue Miburo', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Chiaki Kobayashi, Shun Horie, Yohei Azakami, Kensho Ono, Ryota Takeuchi, Tomokazu Sugita', 'TV-14', 'The year is 1863, with the story being based in Kyoto. We follow a youth named Nio who is an honest and kind soul who''s considerate of his family, yet he also has a hidden burning passion for seeking justice. From the time he came across Toshizou Hijikata and Souji Okita, members from a group of hated ronin known as the Miburo, his life then takes a turn to a bluer, and clearer path. Nio, alongside the other men whose hearts burn bravely and true, step forth towards an honest path with their blue wills adorned on their hearts!', 'The year is 1863, with the story being based in Kyoto. We follow a youth named Nio who is an honest and kind soul who''s considerate of his family, yet he also has a hidden burning passion for seeking justice. From the time he came across Toshizou Hijikata and Souji Okita, members from a group of hated ronin known as the Miburo, his life then takes a turn to a bluer, and clearer path. Nio, alongside the other men whose hearts burn bravely and true, step forth towards an honest path with their blue wills adorned on their hearts!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuBTOsLsQEXHkMWgmpmswFjSJXr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234776'),
  ('1139371116444340988', 'Blue Moon', 2016, 'Drama', 'Luc Dionne', null, 'Karine Vanasse, Éric Bruneau, David La Haye, Patrice Godin, Charlotte Aubin, Alexandre Landry, Clauter Alexandre, Émile Proulx-Cloutier', 'TV-14', 'Justine Laurier, an ex-Canadian soldier, just inherited her father''s shares of Blue Moon, a security company that carries out sensitive operations for the Canadian government. While Justine discovers what Blue Moon is all about, she receives troubling information regarding the death of her father. Alone, she must find the truth in a universe of lies.', 'Justine Laurier, an ex-Canadian soldier, just inherited her father''s shares of Blue Moon, a security company that carries out sensitive operations for the Canadian government. While Justine discovers what Blue Moon is all about, she receives troubling information regarding the death of her father. Alone, she must find the truth in a universe of lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApkI74103COVduIDmcr45tlQU2g.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67222'),
  ('269573212440387603', 'Blue Mountain State', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Chris Romano, Eric Falconer', null, 'Darin Brooks, Alan Ritchson, Chris Romano, Ed Marinaro, Denise Richards', 'TV-MA', 'Three incoming freshman in a big-time, Midwestern college football program have to juggle football, girls, class and nonstop hazing.', 'Three incoming freshman in a big-time, Midwestern college football program have to juggle football, girls, class and nonstop hazing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPAOv8kE2AuD4jliyJ6ziKQIAGi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31941'),
  ('118648196514655863', 'Blue Murder', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Cath Staincliffe', null, 'Caroline Quentin, Ian Kelsey, Paul Loughran, Eden Garrity, Saskia Wickham, Nicholas Murchie, Ceallach Spellman, Belinda Everett', null, 'Blue Murder is a British crime drama television series based in Manchester. Shown on ITV from 2003 until 2009 when it was cancelled by the network, it starred Caroline Quentin as DCI Janine Lewis.', 'Blue Murder is a British crime drama television series based in Manchester. Shown on ITV from 2003 until 2009 when it was cancelled by the network, it starred Caroline Quentin as DCI Janine Lewis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ATWbRtKL90AGGM3JRsSYlC9Agp.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:13955'),
  ('875944969809941706', 'Blue Orchestra', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Shimba Tsuchiya, Ai Kakuma, Minako Sato', null, 'In the fall of his third and final year of middle school, Hajime Aono, a violin prodigy, stopped playing violin for his own personal reasons. But it was also that year when he got to know a girl who told him about a high school with a prestigious school orchestra. Suddenly, the gears in the clock of Aono''s life began to turn again. This is the story of a youth drama that brings forth the harmony between music and the heart!', 'In the fall of his third and final year of middle school, Hajime Aono, a violin prodigy, stopped playing violin for his own personal reasons. But it was also that year when he got to know a girl who told him about a high school with a prestigious school orchestra. Suddenly, the gears in the clock of Aono''s life began to turn again. This is the story of a youth drama that brings forth the harmony between music and the heart!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FVHmNW0ARlYSa7R0BZCuEfo7ei.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197368'),
  ('30254004094792577', 'Blue Period', 2021, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Hiromu Mineta, Yumiri Hanamori, Daiki Yamashita, Kengo Kawanishi, Yume Miyamoto, Mayu Aoyagi, Fumi Hirano, Masaya Fukunishi', 'TV-14', 'Bored with life, popular high schooler Yatora Yaguchi jumps into the beautiful yet unrelenting world of art after finding inspiration in a painting.', 'Bored with life, popular high schooler Yatora Yaguchi jumps into the beautiful yet unrelenting world of art after finding inspiration in a painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK669RsJ4xaZYHvc144iKlEyzJ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116983'),
  ('1045385953796563278', 'Blue Planet II', 2017, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'There is nowhere more powerful and unforgiving yet more beautiful and compelling than the ocean. Join us and explore the greatest yet least known parts of our planet.', 'There is nowhere more powerful and unforgiving yet more beautiful and compelling than the ocean. Join us and explore the greatest yet least known parts of our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1NsoYYDYHnPkRr7Enqr8tlexgO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74313'),
  ('213250203114557500', 'Blue Reflection Ray', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Manaka Iwami, Haruka Chisuga, Yuka Takakura, Hitomi Ohwada, Reina Ueda, Nina Tamaki, Rui Tanabe, Shiori Izawa', 'TV-14', 'Optimistic Hiori can’t turn away anyone in need. Awkward Ruka can’t make friends, even when she tries. But they have one thing in common: they’re magical girls, Reflectors! Now this pair will use powers to help resolve emotional struggles and protect Fragments of people’s hearts.', 'Optimistic Hiori can’t turn away anyone in need. Awkward Ruka can’t make friends, even when she tries. But they have one thing in common: they’re magical girls, Reflectors! Now this pair will use powers to help resolve emotional struggles and protect Fragments of people’s hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8prrax8LxG2EqBV8mS2ewuJkBx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118610'),
  ('73836328635339253', 'Blue Ridge', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gary Wheeler', null, 'Johnathon Schaech, Sarah Lancaster, Taegen Burns, Alyshia Ochse, Grayson Russell, Erin Cahill, Mitch Westphal, Jesse Kove', 'TV-PG', 'Former Green Beret, Justin Wise, leaves his dangerous life to be near his ex-wife and young daughter. As sheriff of a small, sleepy town cut out of the Blue Ridge Mountains, his quiet life is soon disrupted as he tries to keep the mountain community safe from violence and corruption.', 'Former Green Beret, Justin Wise, leaves his dangerous life to be near his ex-wife and young daughter. As sheriff of a small, sleepy town cut out of the Blue Ridge Mountains, his quiet life is soon disrupted as he tries to keep the mountain community safe from violence and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q5rWbRdBAKRNLm9uMmyInL4fSH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226259'),
  ('457490868378429783', 'Blue Seed', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Megumi Hayashibara, Kotono Mitsuishi, Ai Orikasa, Akio Otsuka, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Yuji Ueda, Sakiko Tamagawa', 'TV-14', 'Momiji Fujimiya, is a descendant of the mythical Princess Kushinada. When Japan is menaced by Aragami spawned by Yamato-no-Orochi, Momiji is intended to be sacrificed to appease the Aragami. She instead, however, becomes a member of the Terrestrial Administration Center, a secret agency charged with fighting them.', 'Momiji Fujimiya, is a descendant of the mythical Princess Kushinada. When Japan is menaced by Aragami spawned by Yamato-no-Orochi, Momiji is intended to be sacrificed to appease the Aragami. She instead, however, becomes a member of the Terrestrial Administration Center, a secret agency charged with fighting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYigwpjKqbhEHDs8c1mlygs7vxQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12634'),
  ('798654838407541941', 'Blue Skies', 2026, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Straiton', null, 'Scarlet Hunter, Markian Tarasiuk, Veronica Long, Miranda Edwards, David Lennon, Shaughnessy Redden, Darius Willis', null, 'National Park Investigator Jodi Larsen and a lost dog named Blue team up to solve mysteries in the wilderness, forging an unexpected bond amidst danger and healing.', 'National Park Investigator Jodi Larsen and a lost dog named Blue team up to solve mysteries in the wilderness, forging an unexpected bond amidst danger and healing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pui0mhQ3ZutkpeSDGA0UN771ioy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:308051'),
  ('277553814026104215', 'Blue Spring Ride', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Yuki Kaji, Ai Kayano, KENN, Mikako Komatsu, Daisuke Hirakawa', 'TV-14', 'At the end of her first year of high school, Futaba Yoshioka suddenly has a chance encounter with her first love, Kou Tanaka. Three years ago, he transferred schools before she was able to say how she felt about him. After meeting each other again, Futaba realizes that he has gone through many changes. He acts more cool and even had his last name changed to Mabuchi. Gradually the two rekindle their love while piecing together what had happened in the time that they were apart.', 'At the end of her first year of high school, Futaba Yoshioka suddenly has a chance encounter with her first love, Kou Tanaka. Three years ago, he transferred schools before she was able to say how she felt about him. After meeting each other again, Futaba realizes that he has gone through many changes. He acts more cool and even had his last name changed to Mabuchi. Gradually the two rekindle their love while piecing together what had happened in the time that they were apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJbG3paFR4TeCENN7ognYyZ2Xhy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62602'),
  ('65981470653264881', 'Blue Submarine No. 6', 1998, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hozumi Goda, Yukana, Unsho Ishizuka, Kinryu Arimoto, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Miki Nagasawa, Showtaro Morikubo', null, 'The once famous and well respected scientist Zorndyke has bred a new genre of living being, one that thrives on the oceans and lives to destroy humans. Zorndyke believes it is time that the humans were relieved of their rule of the earth. It is up to Blue Submarine No. 6 and the rest of the Blue fleet to put an end to Zorndyke''s madness and creations.', 'The once famous and well respected scientist Zorndyke has bred a new genre of living being, one that thrives on the oceans and lives to destroy humans. Zorndyke believes it is time that the humans were relieved of their rule of the earth. It is up to Blue Submarine No. 6 and the rest of the Blue fleet to put an end to Zorndyke''s madness and creations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sw3ou88XsMWhxalSvWUYl7tMzq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30431'),
  ('72957670986031138', 'Blue Thunder', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Guy Magar', null, 'James Farentino, Dana Carvey, Sandy McPeak, Dick Butkus, Bubba Smith', null, 'Blue Thunder is a 1984 ABC television series based on the movie of the same title featuring the Blue Thunder helicopter. The series uses the converted Aérospatiale Gazelle helicopter and large portions of stock footage from the 1983 film. A ground unit named "Rolling Thunder" backed up the helicopter in the television series. This was a large support van with a desert camouflage off-road vehicle stored inside. The television series cast includes James Farentino, Dana Carvey, and former professional American football players Bubba Smith and Dick Butkus. The series was canceled by ABC after they felt the similar Airwolf on CBS would win the ratings battle. Also, the series aired at the same time as the CBS soap opera Dallas on Friday nights, and lost. Eleven episodes were made before the series was cancelled.', 'Blue Thunder is a 1984 ABC television series based on the movie of the same title featuring the Blue Thunder helicopter. The series uses the converted Aérospatiale Gazelle helicopter and large portions of stock footage from the 1983 film. A ground unit named "Rolling Thunder" backed up the helicopter in the television series. This was a large support van with a desert camouflage off-road vehicle stored inside. The television series cast includes James Farentino, Dana Carvey, and former professional American football players Bubba Smith and Dick Butkus. The series was canceled by ABC after they felt the similar Airwolf on CBS would win the ratings battle. Also, the series aired at the same time as the CBS soap opera Dallas on Friday nights, and lost. Eleven episodes were made before the series was cancelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVajSQihZaDpUI5PcaqH7EErKbv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11573'),
  ('477197236429416785', 'Blue Veins', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Kay Tse, Grace Chan, Eddie Kwan Lai-Kit, Joel Chan, Wong Yau-Nam, Anjaylia Chan, Winki Lai', null, 'After getting struck by lightning during the The Great Vampire War, Ying Wuet Tseuk and his gang of thieves become The Undead, a race of immortal beings. For the next 500 years, Ying Wuet Tseuk kept his identity hidden and secludes himself in the city, spending sleepless nights managing a late-night food hall. Skilled in martial arts, Ying Wuet Tseuk also operates a martial arts training hall and accepts two disciples under his wing. Ying Wuet Tseuk is in love with forensic scientist Lam Mung Nam, a vampire who had her memories and powers completely sealed away. Unaware of her vampiric identity, her only remaining power is the ability to revive the dead for one minute. For years, Ying Wuet Tseuk stayed by her side silently, helping her piece memories back together one by one.', 'After getting struck by lightning during the The Great Vampire War, Ying Wuet Tseuk and his gang of thieves become The Undead, a race of immortal beings. For the next 500 years, Ying Wuet Tseuk kept his identity hidden and secludes himself in the city, spending sleepless nights managing a late-night food hall. Skilled in martial arts, Ying Wuet Tseuk also operates a martial arts training hall and accepts two disciples under his wing. Ying Wuet Tseuk is in love with forensic scientist Lam Mung Nam, a vampire who had her memories and powers completely sealed away. Unaware of her vampiric identity, her only remaining power is the ability to revive the dead for one minute. For years, Ying Wuet Tseuk stayed by her side silently, helping her piece memories back together one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk6x4AooeKlkd5jbVSxGvpuSnpx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83128'),
  ('1133040408835461362', 'Blue Water High', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kristen Dunphy, Chris Hawkshaw', 'Jennifer Mellet', 'Gabrielle Scollay, Ryan Corr, Cariba Heine, Sophie Luck, Craig Horner, James Sorensen, Tahyna MacManus, Khan Chittenden', 'TV-PG', 'Blue Water High is an Australian television drama series, broadcast by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation on ABC1 and on Austar/Foxtel Nickelodeon channel in Australia and on various channels in many other countries. Each season follows the lives of a young group of students at Solar Blue, a high-performance surf academy where several lucky 16-year-olds are selected for a 12-month-long surfing program on Sydney''s northern beaches. There are three series in Blue Water High. The first two series were screened in 2005 and 2006 and the producers did not intend to create a third series. However, due to popular demand by fans, they relented and made one more series with only Kate Bell returning in a main role. Series three ended with the closure of Solar Blue, indicating that the show would most likely not continue.', 'Blue Water High is an Australian television drama series, broadcast by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation on ABC1 and on Austar/Foxtel Nickelodeon channel in Australia and on various channels in many other countries. Each season follows the lives of a young group of students at Solar Blue, a high-performance surf academy where several lucky 16-year-olds are selected for a 12-month-long surfing program on Sydney''s northern beaches. There are three series in Blue Water High. The first two series were screened in 2005 and 2006 and the producers did not intend to create a third series. However, due to popular demand by fans, they relented and made one more series with only Kate Bell returning in a main role. Series three ended with the closure of Solar Blue, indicating that the show would most likely not continue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHnD4vbVGorHal7zuEyiSir1V1h.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:109'),
  ('678936696917110875', 'Blue''s Clues', 1996, 'Kids, Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Traci Paige Johnson, Angela Santomero, Todd A. Kessler', null, 'Steve Burns, Donovan Patton, Traci Paige Johnson, Aleisha Allen, Nick Balaban', 'TV-Y', 'Blue''s Clues is a colorful and learning series that is targeted at the younger crowd, but can be enjoyed by all. The host, Steve Burns, invites viewers daily into the Blue''s Clues house to help him out, learn and have fun. The show is based around the host looking for three clues that Blue provides by labelling them with a pawprint to figure something out and in the process, having an adventure.', 'Blue''s Clues is a colorful and learning series that is targeted at the younger crowd, but can be enjoyed by all. The host, Steve Burns, invites viewers daily into the Blue''s Clues house to help him out, learn and have fun. The show is based around the host looking for three clues that Blue provides by labelling them with a pawprint to figure something out and in the process, having an adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSCi1cLsKiQ7713m8Lf9J8iHbRH.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:10821'),
  ('737722373120548359', 'Blue''s Clues & You!', 2019, 'Kids, Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Joshua Dela Cruz, Jacob Soley', 'TV-G', 'Follow Blue as she invites viewers to join her and Josh on a clue-led adventure and solve a puzzle in each episode. With each signature paw print, Blue identifies clues in her animated world that propel the story and inspire the audience to interact with the characters. A remake of the groundbreaking, curriculum-driven interactive series Blue’s Clues.', 'Follow Blue as she invites viewers to join her and Josh on a clue-led adventure and solve a puzzle in each episode. With each signature paw print, Blue identifies clues in her animated world that propel the story and inspire the audience to interact with the characters. A remake of the groundbreaking, curriculum-driven interactive series Blue’s Clues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXgrjyQTjTYaaS0iNcKWXl4UgSK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:92885'),
  ('366729669028451698', 'Blueming', 2022, 'Drama', 'Tak Bon', null, 'Cho Hyuk-jun, Kang Eun-bin, Moon Hye-in, Kim Sun-hoa, Jang Yoon-jung, Kim So-bin, Ahn Do-gyu', 'TV-PG', 'Si-won has worked hard and diligently to raise his popularity in college after being a victim of childhood bullying. But will he lose his composure once he meets Da-woon, who was born with the popularity Si-won has worked so hard to attain?', 'Si-won has worked hard and diligently to raise his popularity in college after being a victim of childhood bullying. But will he lose his composure once he meets Da-woon, who was born with the popularity Si-won has worked so hard to attain?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqfPsfdeso2tsT3Nb7uC0W5uqm0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195840'),
  ('488537788689007135', 'Bluestone 42', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, War & Politics', 'Richard Hurst, James Cary', 'Richard Hurst, James Cary', 'Laura Aikman, Tony Gardner, Keeno Lee Hector, Scott Hoatson, Matthew Lewis, Katie Lyons, Jamie Quinn, Stephen Wight', null, 'Bluestone 42 is a comedy drama about a British bomb disposal detachment in Afghanistan. So what’s the average working day for a hero? Make your keen young colleague deal with the boring paperwork? Wind up your fellow employees? Flirt with the new girl on the team? Or deal with an unseen enemy who’s trying to blow you up? Bluestone 42 is a comedy drama about a bunch of soldiers who just happen to be risking their lives diffusing hidden bombs. But who says they can’t have some fun alongside the serious professional stuff? This hilarious and often surprising series follows the adventures of a bunch of diverse characters living and working together at an army base in Afghanistan. This is a show about something easily forgotten; soldiers really enjoy being soldiers, but it’s not just a show for soldiers and it’s not just about the Army: it’s also a show for anybody who has ever fallen in love, experienced status battles at work or had a fear of failure. It is packed with the lively workmate banter and relationship minefields that most people will recognise. Even if they don’t face danger on a daily basis...', 'Bluestone 42 is a comedy drama about a British bomb disposal detachment in Afghanistan. So what’s the average working day for a hero? Make your keen young colleague deal with the boring paperwork? Wind up your fellow employees? Flirt with the new girl on the team? Or deal with an unseen enemy who’s trying to blow you up? Bluestone 42 is a comedy drama about a bunch of soldiers who just happen to be risking their lives diffusing hidden bombs. But who says they can’t have some fun alongside the serious professional stuff? This hilarious and often surprising series follows the adventures of a bunch of diverse characters living and working together at an army base in Afghanistan. This is a show about something easily forgotten; soldiers really enjoy being soldiers, but it’s not just a show for soldiers and it’s not just about the Army: it’s also a show for anybody who has ever fallen in love, experienced status battles at work or had a fear of failure. It is packed with the lively workmate banter and relationship minefields that most people will recognise. Even if they don’t face danger on a daily basis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxHMf7PnrVHv5y5GWHCJyN9zYWV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46844'),
  ('88998243302988511', 'Bluey', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Joe Brumm', null, 'Dave McCormack, Melanie Zanetti', 'TV-Y', 'Bluey is an inexhaustible six year-old Blue Heeler dog, who loves to play and turns everyday family life into extraordinary adventures, developing her imagination as well as her mental, physical and emotional resilience.', 'Bluey is an inexhaustible six year-old Blue Heeler dog, who loves to play and turns everyday family life into extraordinary adventures, developing her imagination as well as her mental, physical and emotional resilience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9mY0X5T20ZM073hoa5n0dgmbfN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:82728'),
  ('972101772820028936', 'Bluey Minisodes', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Joe Brumm', null, 'Dave McCormack', 'TV-Y', 'A collection of funny and sweet episodes featuring Bluey and her family and friends. This collection of every day moments introduces some new characters and games they have been playing together.', 'A collection of funny and sweet episodes featuring Bluey and her family and friends. This collection of every day moments introduces some new characters and games they have been playing together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEQSyxyeBLsH9ZjxAuGUfP4aOcO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256953'),
  ('723682041379276271', 'Bluff City Law', 2019, 'Drama', 'Michael Aguilar, Dean Georgaris', null, 'Jimmy Smits, Caitlin McGee, Barry Sloane, Michael Luwoye, Maameyaa Boafo, Stony Blyden', 'TV-14', 'The lawyers of an elite Memphis law firm specializing in the most controversial landmark civil rights cases and led by legendary lawyer Elijah Strait and his brilliant daughter, Sydney Keller, take on the toughest David-and-Goliath cases while navigating their complicated relationship.', 'The lawyers of an elite Memphis law firm specializing in the most controversial landmark civil rights cases and led by legendary lawyer Elijah Strait and his brilliant daughter, Sydney Keller, take on the toughest David-and-Goliath cases while navigating their complicated relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4kMxeRENGn7YQVvllqNxIXtaK3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86968'),
  ('421440647111751826', 'Blunt Talk', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Ames', 'Jonathan Ames', 'Patrick Stewart, Adrian Scarborough, Timm Sharp, Dolly Wells, Jacki Weaver, Mary Holland, Karan Soni', 'TV-MA', 'A British newscaster moves to Los Angeles with his alcoholic manservant and the baggage of several failed marriages to host a sanctimonious talk show.', 'A British newscaster moves to Los Angeles with his alcoholic manservant and the baggage of several failed marriages to host a sanctimonious talk show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4in78wNjE5yRkJdL3K1kKbq8LB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62238'),
  ('536548446302504403', 'Blutige Anfänger', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Esther Schweins', null, 'Practical semester at the Halle/Saale Police College: Finally out of the seminar rooms and into real life - which for the students means: real murder cases. With the support of their trainers in the homicide squad, they will have to solve this. The beginners sometimes overshoot the mark, make mistakes and have to learn new things on their way to becoming fully qualified detectives. In each episode, a case between the university and real life is dissected, discussed and solved, while the private complications of the students, lecturers and trainers are not neglected.', 'Practical semester at the Halle/Saale Police College: Finally out of the seminar rooms and into real life - which for the students means: real murder cases. With the support of their trainers in the homicide squad, they will have to solve this. The beginners sometimes overshoot the mark, make mistakes and have to learn new things on their way to becoming fully qualified detectives. In each episode, a case between the university and real life is dissected, discussed and solved, while the private complications of the students, lecturers and trainers are not neglected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8PhO6gibElh6kcD5cqKnE2g00H.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:98811'),
  ('751397339633738268', 'BMF', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Randy Huggins', null, 'Lil Meech, Da''Vinchi, Jerel Xavier Alston', 'TV-MA', 'The drug trafficking drama is inspired by the true story of two brothers who rose from the decaying streets of southwest Detroit in the late 1980s and gave birth to one of the most influential crime families in the country. It revolves around brothers Demetrius "Big Meech" Flenory and Terry "Southwest T" Flenory, who together took their vision beyond the drug trade and into the world of hip-hop. The drama, per Starz, will tell a story about love, family and capitalism in the pursuit of the American dream.', 'The drug trafficking drama is inspired by the true story of two brothers who rose from the decaying streets of southwest Detroit in the late 1980s and gave birth to one of the most influential crime families in the country. It revolves around brothers Demetrius "Big Meech" Flenory and Terry "Southwest T" Flenory, who together took their vision beyond the drug trade and into the world of hip-hop. The drama, per Starz, will tell a story about love, family and capitalism in the pursuit of the American dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gUlUufL3fom30qxKawwlWuD7kC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:101591'),
  ('430979350289292418', 'BNA', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sumire Morohoshi, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Maria Naganawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Gara Takashima, Michiyo Murase, Hiroshi Naka, Kimiko Saito', 'TV-14', 'Morphed into a raccoon beastman, Michiru seeks refuge, and answers, with the aid of wolf beastman Shirou inside the special zone of Anima-City.', 'Morphed into a raccoon beastman, Michiru seeks refuge, and answers, with the aid of wolf beastman Shirou inside the special zone of Anima-City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwFYXaQz0mrY8v1HDky2wJsYa7t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92592'),
  ('791688775930616659', 'Bo'' Selecta!', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Leigh Francis', null, 'Leigh Francis, Barunka O''Shaughnessy', null, 'Bo'' Selecta! is a British sketch show written and performed by Leigh Francis, which lampoons popular culture and is known for its often surreal, abstract toilet humour.', 'Bo'' Selecta! is a British sketch show written and performed by Leigh Francis, which lampoons popular culture and is known for its often surreal, abstract toilet humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3SXR2WcVOIFUWjE5kUgz76fWRL.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:608'),
  ('19644578543410860', 'Boar Hunt', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Cho Beom-gi', 'Park Ho-san, Kim Soo-jin, Lee Hyo-je, Ye Su-jeong, Lee Min-jae, Lee Gyu-hoe, Kwak Ja-hyung, Yoo Soon-woong', null, 'This drama tells a story that happened in an ordinary village in which a missing case occurs on the day of a wild boar hunting and the secrets of the villagers surrounding the case are being unfolded one by one.', 'This drama tells a story that happened in an ordinary village in which a missing case occurs on the day of a wild boar hunting and the secrets of the villagers surrounding the case are being unfolded one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5or3IqU6lxkNTTXT0peyTLFECxa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206618'),
  ('360724390396675403', 'Board James', 2009, 'Comedy', 'James D. Rolfe', null, 'James D. Rolfe, Mike Matei, Brendan Castner', null, 'A new series from Cinemassacre''s James Rolfe, creator of the infamous Angry Video Game Nerd. As Board James he still takes us back to the past, but this time to revisit the classic board games of years gone by.', 'A new series from Cinemassacre''s James Rolfe, creator of the infamous Angry Video Game Nerd. As Board James he still takes us back to the past, but this time to revisit the classic board games of years gone by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzDMjvIevxVAlpAW5rKML4Ab6Mw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60718'),
  ('729999728787174229', 'Boarders', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Lawrence Taylor', null, 'Jodie Campbell, Sekou Diaby, Aruna Jalloh, Myles Kamwendo, Josh Tedeku, Ruxandra Porojnicu, Niky Wardley, Maxim Ays', null, 'Brace yourselves - the new kids are here. Five talented black scholarship students, and an elite private school with a reputation problem. One of them will have to change...', 'Brace yourselves - the new kids are here. Five talented black scholarship students, and an elite private school with a reputation problem. One of them will have to change...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHcPEs8rDXW4mwlOZxbVXxowl4M.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:242189'),
  ('537105514582720796', 'Boarding School Juliet', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Ai Kayano, Ayane Sakura, Yu Shimamura, Rina Hidaka, Yui Ogura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'Grigio Academy Boarding School. Students who attend this school in two countries and reside in their own dormitories. Inazuka and Persia are rival dormitory leaders, but in secret they love each other. Now, they have to keep their relationship a secret from their dorm mates, or ruined things will happen to them.', 'Grigio Academy Boarding School. Students who attend this school in two countries and reside in their own dormitories. Inazuka and Persia are rival dormitory leaders, but in secret they love each other. Now, they have to keep their relationship a secret from their dorm mates, or ruined things will happen to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrGqMlzN6RP8DUHenkm4woAFPxn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82823'),
  ('573042087881378387', 'Boardwalk Empire', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Terence Winter', null, 'Steve Buscemi, Kelly Macdonald, Michael Shannon, Shea Whigham, Stephen Graham, Vincent Piazza, Michael Kenneth Williams, Paul Sparks', 'TV-MA', 'Atlantic City at the dawn of Prohibition is a place where the rules don''t apply. And the man who runs things -- legally and otherwise -- is the town''s treasurer, Enoch "Nucky" Thompson, who is equal parts politician and gangster.', 'Atlantic City at the dawn of Prohibition is a place where the rules don''t apply. And the man who runs things -- legally and otherwise -- is the town''s treasurer, Enoch "Nucky" Thompson, who is equal parts politician and gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL6SqlVPpfAof2nQbh1VxkUuXBQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1621'),
  ('1070186656183144615', 'Boat Story', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', null, 'Paterson Joseph, Daisy Haggard, Tchéky Karyo, Craig Fairbrass, Joanna Scanlan, Ethan Lawrence, Phil Daniels, Michele Austin', null, 'Two hard-up strangers stumble across a haul of cocaine on a shipwrecked boat. After agreeing to sell it and split the cash, they become entangled with police, masked hitmen, and a sharp-suited gangster known as ''The Tailor''.', 'Two hard-up strangers stumble across a haul of cocaine on a shipwrecked boat. After agreeing to sell it and split the cash, they become entangled with police, masked hitmen, and a sharp-suited gangster known as ''The Tailor''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaSiJDRPSgVAUHcP8GRz0Tsw0HS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234377'),
  ('289211332314780459', 'Boate Kiss: A Tragédia de Santa Maria', 2023, 'Documentary', null, 'Fernando Rinco, Gabriel Mitani', 'Marcelo Canellas', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOCdlxYhYrDZ9SgCjfK7lSVQ6vB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217218'),
  ('397980462516197582', 'Bob', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Bill Steinkellner, Cherie Steinkellner, Phoef Sutton', null, 'Bob Newhart, Carlene Watkins, Cynthia Stevenson, Jere Burns, Eric Allan Kramer, Megan Cavanagh, Betty White', null, 'Bob McKay is the creator of the 1950s comic book superhero "Mad-Dog". When a Senate sub-committee decided such reading material could corrupt young readers, Mad-Dog faded into oblivion, and Bob became a greeting card artist. Years later the American-Canadian Trans-Continental Communications Company buys the rights to the series, and Bob is offered a chance to revive Mad-Dog.', 'Bob McKay is the creator of the 1950s comic book superhero "Mad-Dog". When a Senate sub-committee decided such reading material could corrupt young readers, Mad-Dog faded into oblivion, and Bob became a greeting card artist. Years later the American-Canadian Trans-Continental Communications Company buys the rights to the series, and Bob is offered a chance to revive Mad-Dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5954m87GfbQVSCbsh8j99io6a9n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13169'),
  ('468078756600706919', 'Bob & Rose', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Russell T Davies', null, 'Alan Davies, Lesley Sharp, Jessica Hynes, Barbara Marten, Katy Cavanagh', null, 'Gay thirtysomething schoolteacher Robert ''Bob'' Gossage finds himself attracted to a woman, Rose Cooper, exploring their unconventional relationship and the challenges it presents to their identities and those around them, including Rose''s heartbroken ex-boyfriend Andy, Bob''s jealous best friend Holly, and Rose''s gay rights activist mother Carol.', 'Gay thirtysomething schoolteacher Robert ''Bob'' Gossage finds himself attracted to a woman, Rose Cooper, exploring their unconventional relationship and the challenges it presents to their identities and those around them, including Rose''s heartbroken ex-boyfriend Andy, Bob''s jealous best friend Holly, and Rose''s gay rights activist mother Carol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzAYvLfe2KdLtlb0QE5t2Ho8p0C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11219'),
  ('268854841550466162', 'Bob and Margaret', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Fine, Alison Snowden', null, 'Andy Hamilton, Brian George, Adrian Truss, Jayne Eastwood, Doon Mackichan, Peter Baynham, Ron Pardo, Steve Coogan', 'TV-PG', 'Revolves around married English couple named Bob and Margaret Fish, a middle class 40-ish working couple with no children and two dogs named William and Elizabeth. Bob is a dentist and Margaret is a chiropodist. Bob and Margaret struggle with everyday issues and mid life crisis. Stories often revolve around the mundane, but in a way which is eminently relatable. In the first two seasons, Bob and Margaret live in England, in the South London community of Balham. For the third and fourth seasons, they move to Toronto, Canada, allowing the writers to explore the humour of the culture clash.', 'Revolves around married English couple named Bob and Margaret Fish, a middle class 40-ish working couple with no children and two dogs named William and Elizabeth. Bob is a dentist and Margaret is a chiropodist. Bob and Margaret struggle with everyday issues and mid life crisis. Stories often revolve around the mundane, but in a way which is eminently relatable. In the first two seasons, Bob and Margaret live in England, in the South London community of Balham. For the third and fourth seasons, they move to Toronto, Canada, allowing the writers to explore the humour of the culture clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A59OJ6Q7E0CKnly9hcZxlap6D5r.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4999'),
  ('725485402097696548', 'Bob Hearts Abishola', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Lorre, Gina Yashere, Eddie Gorodetsky', null, 'Billy Gardell, Folake Olowofoyeku, Gina Yashere, Christine Ebersole, Matt Jones, Maribeth Monroe, Shola Adewusi, Barry Shabaka Henley', 'TV-14', 'A love story about a middle-aged compression sock businessman from Detroit who unexpectedly falls for his cardiac nurse, a Nigerian immigrant, while recovering from a heart attack and sets his sights on winning her over.', 'A love story about a middle-aged compression sock businessman from Detroit who unexpectedly falls for his cardiac nurse, a Nigerian immigrant, while recovering from a heart attack and sets his sights on winning her over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NQRz0RcN2ohT98fZv287YEddtW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:92461'),
  ('811253746757000604', 'Bob Hope Presents the Chrysler Theatre', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy, Talk', null, 'Arnold Perl, David Rayfiel, S. Lee Pogostin', 'Bob Hope', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 4, 'tmdb:tv:11576'),
  ('221147120203206173', 'Bob the Builder', 1999, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Keith Chapman', null, 'Greg Proops, Rupert Degas, Lorelei King, David Menkin, Lachele Carl, Alan Marriott, Vincent Marzello, Emma Tate', 'TV-Y', 'Bob the Builder and his machine team are ready to tackle any project. Bob and the Can-Do Crew demonstrate the power of positive thinking, problem-solving, teamwork, and follow-through. The team always shows that “The Fun Is In Getting It Done!”', 'Bob the Builder and his machine team are ready to tackle any project. Bob and the Can-Do Crew demonstrate the power of positive thinking, problem-solving, teamwork, and follow-through. The team always shows that “The Fun Is In Getting It Done!”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfIAxRMSLuMjczB0ezl8L9Ukzfi.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:10938'),
  ('151568724560278338', 'Bob''s Burgers', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Loren Bouchard, Jim Dauterive', null, 'H. Jon Benjamin, John Roberts, Kristen Schaal, Eugene Mirman, Dan Mintz, Larry Murphy', 'TV-14', 'Bob''s Burgers follows a third-generation restaurateur, Bob, as he runs Bob''s Burgers with the help of his wife and their three kids. Bob and his quirky family have big ideas about burgers, but fall short on service and sophistication. Despite the greasy counters, lousy location and a dearth of customers, Bob and his family are determined to make Bob''s Burgers "grand re-re-re-opening" a success.', 'Bob''s Burgers follows a third-generation restaurateur, Bob, as he runs Bob''s Burgers with the help of his wife and their three kids. Bob and his quirky family have big ideas about burgers, but fall short on service and sophistication. Despite the greasy counters, lousy location and a dearth of customers, Bob and his family are determined to make Bob''s Burgers "grand re-re-re-opening" a success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIHsQe3Qjs3NH62HdamyQEPeqTR.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:32726'),
  ('789955511775420332', 'Bobby Kennedy for President', 2018, 'Documentary, Drama', null, null, 'Robert F. Kennedy, John F. Kennedy, John Lewis, Harry Belafonte, Martin Luther King Jr., James Baldwin, Jacqueline Kennedy, Lyndon B. Johnson', 'TV-MA', 'Historic footage and leading voices of the era examine the "Bobby Phenomenon" of the 1960s and the legacy of the man who helped redefine the country.', 'Historic footage and leading voices of the era examine the "Bobby Phenomenon" of the 1960s and the legacy of the man who helped redefine the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHp8igpFvtoIPHslSoJJyYUzXaU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78704'),
  ('71616638184512154', 'Bobby''s World', 1990, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Howie Mandel', null, 'Howie Mandel, Gail Matthius, Charity James, Pamela Adlon, Tino Insana, Frank Welker, Debi Derryberry', 'TV-Y', 'Bobby Generic lives in a typical suburban neighborhood and uses his overactive imagination to discover a world of daring adventure, incredible wonder and lots of laughs — all in pint-sized perspective.', 'Bobby Generic lives in a typical suburban neighborhood and uses his overactive imagination to discover a world of daring adventure, incredible wonder and lots of laughs — all in pint-sized perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrcPIkzTim0ICyc6h81LfmBSQgB.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1767'),
  ('161218268775725363', 'Bobcat Goldthwait''s Misfits & Monsters', 2018, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', null, null, 'TV-14', 'This scripted anthology series mashes up wildly different genres to tell suspenseful stories with funny, imaginative twists. Each episode turns familiar tropes inside out to create a curated and eclectic collection of stories filled with equal parts nostalgia and modern satire.', 'This scripted anthology series mashes up wildly different genres to tell suspenseful stories with funny, imaginative twists. Each episode turns familiar tropes inside out to create a curated and eclectic collection of stories filled with equal parts nostalgia and modern satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAuMF19ikiBkm6wyH9LeZorfRiR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80286'),
  ('1130195541619433535', 'Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Yoshio Sawai', null, 'Takehito Koyasu, Ai Nonaka, Masaya Onosaka, Shinichiro Ohta', null, 'Based on the manga by Yoshio Sawai, Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo is one of the weirdest, yet funny animes using puns, cross-dressing, and lots of visual gags. Taking place in the year 300X, an evil organization knows as the Bald Empire (Margarita Empire) is planning to take over the world by stealing everyones hair. The Bald Empire, led by Emperor Baldy Bald, will have to go through Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo, who is determined to put a stop to them once and for all, if they plan to succeed. But it won''t be easy, because Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo was trained to "hear the voices of the hair," enabling him to command his own body hair to perform various martial arts stunts to defend himself. Along the way, he will eventually need the help of all the different, yet weird friends he encounters in order to defeat the evil Bald Empire.', 'Based on the manga by Yoshio Sawai, Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo is one of the weirdest, yet funny animes using puns, cross-dressing, and lots of visual gags. Taking place in the year 300X, an evil organization knows as the Bald Empire (Margarita Empire) is planning to take over the world by stealing everyones hair. The Bald Empire, led by Emperor Baldy Bald, will have to go through Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo, who is determined to put a stop to them once and for all, if they plan to succeed. But it won''t be easy, because Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo was trained to "hear the voices of the hair," enabling him to command his own body hair to perform various martial arts stunts to defend himself. Along the way, he will eventually need the help of all the different, yet weird friends he encounters in order to defeat the evil Bald Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7zxUGC2S8xuPj5rYkvDsESB7ab.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35236'),
  ('766849544120943520', 'BOCCHI THE ROCK!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoshino Aoyama, Sayumi Suzushiro, Saku Mizuno, Ikumi Hasegawa', 'TV-14', 'Hitori Gotoh, a shy, awkward, and lonely high school student dreams of being in a band despite her doubts and worries, but when she is recruited to be the guitarist of a group looking to make it big, she realises her dream may be able to be fulfilled and come true.', 'Hitori Gotoh, a shy, awkward, and lonely high school student dreams of being in a band despite her doubts and worries, but when she is recruited to be the guitarist of a group looking to make it big, she realises her dream may be able to be fulfilled and come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af4tZ3eKjKWXG4vfiQ8R1NJomAP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119100'),
  ('325160124352737915', 'Bodacious Space Pirates', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Yuichi Sasamoto', 'Michiko Itou', 'Shizuka Itoh, Keiji Fujiwara, Mikako Komatsu, Kana Hanazawa, Masaya Matsukaze, Yui Horie, Kenta Miyake, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', null, 'Marika is a high school student living on a planet known as Uminoakeboshi. One day she finds out that her deceased father was the captain of the space pirate ship called the "Bentenmaru". More importantly, the one to inherit the captain''s title has to be a direct descendant—meaning that Marika is now the captain of the ship.', 'Marika is a high school student living on a planet known as Uminoakeboshi. One day she finds out that her deceased father was the captain of the space pirate ship called the "Bentenmaru". More importantly, the one to inherit the captain''s title has to be a direct descendant—meaning that Marika is now the captain of the ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqyWLgaCnhWNm6RMHYFrNviLWHU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42501'),
  ('774075176033672170', 'Bodiel L''héritière', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Seydou Nourou Wone', null, 'Aissata Athie, Ousseynou Camara Ba, Ibrahima Kane, Aminata Diao, Fatimata Barry, Fatoumata Wane, Cheikh Sadibou Dia, Sire Kane', null, 'A young woman''s life is turned upside down and she finds herself in the crosshairs of her brothers following the death of her father, who decided to bequeath all his possessions to her.', 'A young woman''s life is turned upside down and she finds herself in the crosshairs of her brothers following the death of her father, who decided to bequeath all his possessions to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdnp1iTy5EbKDygKwWtzpYCr3RJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316167'),
  ('655239141777757059', 'Bodies', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jed Mercurio', null, 'Max Beesley, Patrick Baladi, Keith Allen, Tamzin Malleson, Simon Lowe, Vicky Hall, Preeya Kalidas, Hattie Morahan', null, 'Bodies is an award-winning British television medical drama produced by Hat Trick Productions for the BBC. Created by Jed Mercurio, the series began in 2004 and is based on his book Bodies. In December 2009, The Times ranked Bodies in 9th place in its list of "Shows of the Decade". The Guardian has ranked the series among "The Greatest Television Dramas of All-Time".', 'Bodies is an award-winning British television medical drama produced by Hat Trick Productions for the BBC. Created by Jed Mercurio, the series began in 2004 and is based on his book Bodies. In December 2009, The Times ranked Bodies in 9th place in its list of "Shows of the Decade". The Guardian has ranked the series among "The Greatest Television Dramas of All-Time".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQKgVGaHSxIOsSDDyGH5QZpWp4e.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2371'),
  ('465271845049956315', 'Bodies', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Paul Tomalin', null, 'Jacob Fortune-Lloyd, Shira Haas, Amaka Okafor, Kyle Soller, Greta Scacchi, Stephen Graham', 'TV-MA', 'One victim, found dead on a London street. Four detectives, in four different time periods, must solve the mystery to protect Britain''s future.', 'One victim, found dead on a London street. Four detectives, in four different time periods, must solve the mystery to protect Britain''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWX71nLvoLsBNPEjddZMC75lq6I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233629'),
  ('1040395712343337495', 'Bodkin', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jez Scharf', 'Mike O''Leary, Paddy Campbell', 'Siobhán Cullen, Robyn Cara, Chris Walley, David Wilmot, Will Forte', 'TV-MA', 'A ragtag crew of podcasters sets out to investigate mysterious disappearances from decades earlier in a charming Irish town with dark, dreadful secrets.', 'A ragtag crew of podcasters sets out to investigate mysterious disappearances from decades earlier in a charming Irish town with dark, dreadful secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvpYJkQaeon5kmxioIPHFmgA2v5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241257'),
  ('1019483323755050986', 'Body Cam', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Body cameras capture the life-or-death decisions made by police officers, from domestic disputes to traffic stops gone dangerously awry.', 'Body cameras capture the life-or-death decisions made by police officers, from domestic disputes to traffic stops gone dangerously awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bL1y8H5lmowJH4iVzNZGWAvggKf.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:91183'),
  ('504448628955723055', 'Body of Proof', 2011, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Christopher Murphey', null, 'Dana Delany, Jeri Ryan, Geoffrey Arend, Windell Middlebrooks, Elyes Gabel, Mark Valley, Mary Mouser, Joanna Cassidy', 'TV-PG', 'Dr. Megan Hunt was in a class of her own, a brilliant neurosurgeon at the top of her game. But her world is turned upside down when a devastating car accident puts an end to her time in the operating room. Megan resumes her career as a medical examiner, determined to solve the puzzle of who or what killed the victims.', 'Dr. Megan Hunt was in a class of her own, a brilliant neurosurgeon at the top of her game. But her world is turned upside down when a devastating car accident puts an end to her time in the operating room. Megan resumes her career as a medical examiner, determined to solve the puzzle of who or what killed the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LyLUgvwawgnNKOzIFX5lSgTNeq.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:32708'),
  ('756242915891364978', 'Bodyguard', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, War & Politics, Mystery', 'Jed Mercurio', null, 'Richard Madden, Keeley Hawes, Sophie Rundle, Gina McKee, Pippa Haywood, Stuart Bowman, Paul Ready, Ash Tandon', 'TV-MA', 'A troubled war veteran is assigned to protect a controversial politician who may be the target of a terror plot.', 'A troubled war veteran is assigned to protect a controversial politician who may be the target of a terror plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DUJTrHTRLHLCKWriPhdusQogAv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80307'),
  ('1101601601970861211', 'Bodyguard (2018)', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery, War & Politics, Action', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Jed Mercurio', 'Richard Madden, Keeley Hawes, Sophie Rundle, Gina McKee, Pippa Haywood', 'TV-MA', 'War veteran David Budd finds work as a police sergeant in the Royalty and Specialist Protection branch. He is assigned to protect the home secretary, the Rt. Hon. Julia Montague MP, a controversial and ambitious politician.', 'War veteran David Budd finds work as a police sergeant in the Royalty and Specialist Protection branch. He is assigned to protect the home secretary, the Rt. Hon. Julia Montague MP, a controversial and ambitious politician.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5DUJTrHTRLHLCKWriPhdusQogAv.jpg', 1, 'plex:tv:bodyguard-2018'),
  ('435421932489386737', 'Bodyguards', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Kenny Ho Ka-King, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Chen Hung-Lieh, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Shen Meng-Sheng, Tiffany Lau Yuk-Ting, Xuan Chen, He Qing', null, 'The drama follows the Long Wind Escort Agency as they are led by young master Guo Xu to thwart the conspiracy plots. Along the way, the romantic and chivalrous Guo Xu encounters various people during their escort missions.', 'The drama follows the Long Wind Escort Agency as they are led by young master Guo Xu to thwart the conspiracy plots. Along the way, the romantic and chivalrous Guo Xu encounters various people during their escort missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IZuk715j04ixmNaITv3kwnppXY.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90465'),
  ('1137097620228555674', 'Bodyguards', 2023, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Oleg Gaas, Egor Ovchinnikov, Alexandr Levin, Dmitry Lysenkov, Sergey Makovetskiy, Kristina Kucherenko, Yana Koshkina, Polina Davydova', null, 'Three boxers from Chelyabinsk decide to earn extra money at the Moscow tournament on fights without rules before flying to the World Championship. After learning about the violation of the sports regime, the head coach excludes them from the national team. The guys are eating sadly in a restaurant, discussing the inglorious homecoming. In the same institution, a business dinner of a well-known Moscow lawyer is held, with the protection of which, through no fault of the guys, a conflict ensues. Boxers demonstrate their skills and naturally end up in the police. They face imprisonment. However, the lawyer offers a deal: become his bodyguards or go to jail. The brave trio decides to change their tracksuits to classic ones.', 'Three boxers from Chelyabinsk decide to earn extra money at the Moscow tournament on fights without rules before flying to the World Championship. After learning about the violation of the sports regime, the head coach excludes them from the national team. The guys are eating sadly in a restaurant, discussing the inglorious homecoming. In the same institution, a business dinner of a well-known Moscow lawyer is held, with the protection of which, through no fault of the guys, a conflict ensues. Boxers demonstrate their skills and naturally end up in the police. They face imprisonment. However, the lawyer offers a deal: become his bodyguards or go to jail. The brave trio decides to change their tracksuits to classic ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDtHxGvYgklcMAqbSxVVLpbgLaC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:229564'),
  ('259963435432597767', 'BOFURI: I Don''t Want to Get Hurt, so I''ll Max Out My Defense.', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Ruriko Noguchi, Saori Hayami, Satomi Arai, Ai Kakuma, Nanaka Suwa, Noriaki Sugiyama, Satomi Sato', 'TV-14', 'Kaede Honjou is invited by her friend Risa Shiramine to play a virtual reality MMO game with her. While Kaede doesn''t dislike games, what she really, truly dislikes is being in pain. She creates a character named Maple, and decides to put all her points in VIT to minimize pain. As a result, she moves slowly, can''t use magic, and even a rabbit can get the best of her. But as it turns out, she acquires a skill known as "Absolute Defense" as a result of her pumping points into VIT, as well as a "Counter Skill" that works against special moves. Now, with her ability to nullify all damage, she goes on adventures.', 'Kaede Honjou is invited by her friend Risa Shiramine to play a virtual reality MMO game with her. While Kaede doesn''t dislike games, what she really, truly dislikes is being in pain. She creates a character named Maple, and decides to put all her points in VIT to minimize pain. As a result, she moves slowly, can''t use magic, and even a rabbit can get the best of her. But as it turns out, she acquires a skill known as "Absolute Defense" as a result of her pumping points into VIT, as well as a "Counter Skill" that works against special moves. Now, with her ability to nullify all damage, she goes on adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdcMiknnRcmVgWb9wGS9TxE06cG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96402'),
  ('770043835157168603', 'Bogus Skill «Fruitmaster» ~About that time I became able to eat unlimited numbers of Skill Fruits (that kill you)~', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Takuma Nagatsuka, Lynn, Haruna Mikawa, Hana Tamegai, Akira Sekine, Sayaka Ohara, Ai Kakuma, Katsuhisa Houki', 'TV-14', 'In a world where Skill Fruits grant powers, aspiring adventurer Light is stuck with the useless «Fruitmaster» skill. Eating another one results in death, so no do-overs. Meanwhile, his childhood friend Rena quickly rises to S Rank. But when Light accidentally eats a second Skill Fruit, he survives and discovers his true power: He can consume unlimited Skill Fruits and gain their abilities!', 'In a world where Skill Fruits grant powers, aspiring adventurer Light is stuck with the useless «Fruitmaster» skill. Eating another one results in death, so no do-overs. Meanwhile, his childhood friend Rena quickly rises to S Rank. But when Light accidentally eats a second Skill Fruit, he survives and discovers his true power: He can consume unlimited Skill Fruits and gain their abilities!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZiuJtxzOlvvbQcgrCSnwefqkcp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276204'),
  ('521907309432432036', 'Boiling Life', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Elvis Han, Kan Qingzi, Zhou Tingwei, Jing Ruyang, Ren Shuai, Cao Yanyan, Li Jie, Li Zhenglin', null, 'Ai Changan and Shen Xia represent Huaqi employees along with other college students who have joined the company as interns. Their stories are connected to the Chinese automobile industry from which their livelihoods depended on. In the mid-1980s, a group of college graduates came to an automobile factory located in the northwest to start their internship. Shen Xia who intended to study abroad witnessed the development of the 7-ton truck and decides to stay. Together with Ai Chang''an, a young technician at the factory, they begin their journey to turning the tide for the industry. The market is ruthless such that the new generation of dedicated men and women face countless difficulties. The backbone of Huaqi has almost been completely dug out by opponents.', 'Ai Changan and Shen Xia represent Huaqi employees along with other college students who have joined the company as interns. Their stories are connected to the Chinese automobile industry from which their livelihoods depended on. In the mid-1980s, a group of college graduates came to an automobile factory located in the northwest to start their internship. Shen Xia who intended to study abroad witnessed the development of the 7-ton truck and decides to stay. Together with Ai Chang''an, a young technician at the factory, they begin their journey to turning the tide for the industry. The market is ruthless such that the new generation of dedicated men and women face countless difficulties. The backbone of Huaqi has almost been completely dug out by opponents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fTs2OjOR0oBMgDHy4Xwu7EUihU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211056'),
  ('1012381488770523741', 'Boiling Point', 2023, 'Drama', 'Stephen Graham, James Cummings, Philip Barantini', 'James Cummings', 'Vinette Robinson, Stephen Graham, Hannah Walters, Gary Lamont, Áine Rose Daly, Taz Skylar, Daniel Larkai, Hannah Traylen', null, 'Eight months after her mentor Andy Jones suffered a heart attack, Head Chef Carly is battling to forge a name for new London restaurant Point North alongside her old kitchen crew. With the pressure to draw in new, hungry customers and the financial squeeze to keep the business profitable, the team must find a way to manage their complicated personal lives whilst creating quality food day in, day out.', 'Eight months after her mentor Andy Jones suffered a heart attack, Head Chef Carly is battling to forge a name for new London restaurant Point North alongside her old kitchen crew. With the pressure to draw in new, hungry customers and the financial squeeze to keep the business profitable, the team must find a way to manage their complicated personal lives whilst creating quality food day in, day out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W6z0r3CsN4P5Ra7AWCLQtCU7D8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219443'),
  ('486297220708115122', 'BoJack Horseman', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Raphael Bob-Waksberg', null, 'Will Arnett, Aaron Paul, Alison Brie, Amy Sedaris, Paul F. Tompkins', 'TV-MA', 'Meet the most beloved sitcom horse of the ''90s , 20 years later. He''s a curmudgeon with a heart of...not quite gold...but something like gold. Copper?', 'Meet the most beloved sitcom horse of the ''90s , 20 years later. He''s a curmudgeon with a heart of...not quite gold...but something like gold. Copper?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JFWzlChcGgLiIUo2COgNlWGFKy.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61222'),
  ('169918985602240798', 'Boksen', 2025, 'Reality', 'Aleksander Herresthal, Tonje Haabeth, Håkon Bolstad', null, 'Benedicte Adrian, Frode Grodås, Morten Hegseth, Tuva Billing, Anette Trettebergstuen, Emil Wæraas, Kasper Kvello, Margrethe Røed', null, 'In Boksen, 12 famous people are placed in a separate box. When the doors are opened, they must solve unknown challenges. In the end, only one participant remains as the winner.', 'In Boksen, 12 famous people are placed in a separate box. When the doors are opened, they must solve unknown challenges. In the end, only one participant remains as the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpJltYlLgjNVIzQJLkfL2d7Ea6L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:279055'),
  ('19424256573995125', 'Boku no Nee-chan', 2021, 'Family', null, null, 'Haru Kuroki, Yosuke Sugino, Sayu Kubota, Takuya Wakabayashi, Kami Hiraiwa', null, 'Chiharu and her younger brother Junpei live together. Chiharu is 30-years-old and she is funny, but also has a sharp tongue. Junpei is a good brother and he is considerate to Chiharu. After they come home from work, they eat and drink together. Doing that, they talk about various subjects like love, work, and their interests.', 'Chiharu and her younger brother Junpei live together. Chiharu is 30-years-old and she is funny, but also has a sharp tongue. Junpei is a good brother and he is considerate to Chiharu. After they come home from work, they eat and drink together. Doing that, they talk about various subjects like love, work, and their interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgjrQ2XDEgAcUlI6cXbGlB3e7lS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134151'),
  ('453740682163326841', 'Bokura ga ita', 2006, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Nozomi Sasaki, Hiroshi Yazaki, Takuji Kawakubo, Erina Nakayama', 'TV-14', 'Nanami Takahashi is a high school student entering her first year. Immediately on her first day however, she becomes the victim of a practical joke by the school''s most popular guy, Motoharu Yano, who coincidentally also ends up in her class.', 'Nanami Takahashi is a high school student entering her first year. Immediately on her first day however, she becomes the victim of a practical joke by the school''s most popular guy, Motoharu Yano, who coincidentally also ends up in her class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBYOXOnlKAB2wlw3H2BPhrcZQcw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22577'),
  ('110399049482827128', 'Bokurano', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Minagawa, Akira Ishida, Naomi Shindo, Yuko Sanpei, Kana Asumi, Shinji Kawada, Mamiko Noto, Kenji Nojima', 'TV-MA', 'During a summer camp, 15 children, 8 males and 7 females, find a grotto by the sea. Deep within they discover working computers and some electronic equipment, and later the owner, a man called Kokopelli. Kokopelli claimed to be a programmer working on a brand new game, in which a large robot has to defend the Earth against fifteen alien invasions. He persuades the children to test the game and sign a contract. All but one of them signs; barely a moment later they mysteriously awaken on the shore believing what happened was just a dream.', 'During a summer camp, 15 children, 8 males and 7 females, find a grotto by the sea. Deep within they discover working computers and some electronic equipment, and later the owner, a man called Kokopelli. Kokopelli claimed to be a programmer working on a brand new game, in which a large robot has to defend the Earth against fifteen alien invasions. He persuades the children to test the game and sign a contract. All but one of them signs; barely a moment later they mysteriously awaken on the shore believing what happened was just a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxsG82r30eKyybItqVJjOCPbpwD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34765'),
  ('888249418582117997', 'Bola de Locos', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Abel Solis', null, 'Violeta Isfel, Carlos Eduardo Rico, Liliana Arriaga', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCg2rC0ijAb6IgG3hywjJF07v7D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226573'),
  ('787568254872143134', 'Bolek and Lolek', 1962, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, null, 'Bolek and Lolek are two Polish cartoon characters from the TV animated series by the same title. They are based on Władysław Nehrebecki''s sons, named Jan and Roman, and were partially created by German-born Alfred Ledwig before being developed by Władysław Nehrebecki and Leszek Lorek. The series is about two young brothers and their fun and sometimes silly adventures which often involve spending a lot of time outdoors. They first appeared in an animated film in 1963. The names of the two characters are diminutives of Bolesław and Karol. In English, the cartoon was distributed as Jym & Jam and Bennie and Lennie. Some episodes were seen as part of Nickelodeon''s Pinwheel. In 1973 the creators of the film placed on the request from the female viewing audience a girl character by the name of Tola. The first time she appeared in occurred in the episode entitled "Tola". In total, Tola appeared in 30 episodes. Most episodes do not have dialogues. Exceptions are feature-length films and the series from the 1980s, where the main characters'' voices were done by: Bolek – Ewa Złotowska, Ilona Kuśmierska; Lolek – Danuta Mancewicz, Danuta Przesmycka. During the period of the Peoples Republic of Poland, Bolek and Lolek were reproduced in a large quantity of toys: action figures, movies, postcards, online arcades, puzzles, etc., which can be seen in the Museum of Dobranocki of the PRL. They are also currently made in computer programs, coloring books, general picture books and games.', 'Bolek and Lolek are two Polish cartoon characters from the TV animated series by the same title. They are based on Władysław Nehrebecki''s sons, named Jan and Roman, and were partially created by German-born Alfred Ledwig before being developed by Władysław Nehrebecki and Leszek Lorek. The series is about two young brothers and their fun and sometimes silly adventures which often involve spending a lot of time outdoors. They first appeared in an animated film in 1963. The names of the two characters are diminutives of Bolesław and Karol. In English, the cartoon was distributed as Jym & Jam and Bennie and Lennie. Some episodes were seen as part of Nickelodeon''s Pinwheel. In 1973 the creators of the film placed on the request from the female viewing audience a girl character by the name of Tola. The first time she appeared in occurred in the episode entitled "Tola". In total, Tola appeared in 30 episodes. Most episodes do not have dialogues. Exceptions are feature-length films and the series from the 1980s, where the main characters'' voices were done by: Bolek – Ewa Złotowska, Ilona Kuśmierska; Lolek – Danuta Mancewicz, Danuta Przesmycka. During the period of the Peoples Republic of Poland, Bolek and Lolek were reproduced in a large quantity of toys: action figures, movies, postcards, online arcades, puzzles, etc., which can be seen in the Museum of Dobranocki of the PRL. They are also currently made in computer programs, coloring books, general picture books and games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPO6noyrRW1B3GIGAjABzpRDJ2v.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:15179'),
  ('684808419402476346', 'Bolívar', 2019, 'Drama', 'Juana Uribe', null, 'José Ramón Barreto, Luis Gerónimo Abreu, Rosmeri Marval, Irene Esser, Shany Nadan, Sergio Borrero, Carlos Torres, Juan Felipe Muñoz', 'TV-MA', 'This dramatization depicts the life -- and loves -- of Venezuelan Gen. Simón Bolívar who helped liberate several Latin American countries from Spain.', 'This dramatization depicts the life -- and loves -- of Venezuelan Gen. Simón Bolívar who helped liberate several Latin American countries from Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRmGDjDL4EIIkaHedrndB9rlsvD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90602'),
  ('321382160911764410', 'Bomb Girls', 2012, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Michael MacLennan', null, 'Meg Tilly, Jodi Balfour, Charlotte Hegele, Ali Liebert, Peter Outerbridge, Anastasia Phillips, Michael Seater', null, 'Focusing on a group of women working in a munitions plant during World War II, this ensemble drama depicts the dangers and new experiences they face.', 'Focusing on a group of women working in a munitions plant during World War II, this ensemble drama depicts the dangers and new experiences they face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZvYxdrvIXFtIYBR5R4bq9LseW4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43268'),
  ('457305140364748177', 'Bombay Begums', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Pooja Bhatt, Shahana Goswami, Amruta Subhash, Plabita Borthakur, Aadhya Anand, Manish Chaudhary, Vivek Gomber, Danish Husain', 'TV-MA', 'From boardrooms to society''s margins, five ambitious women from various walks of life navigate dreams, desires and disappointments in modern Mumbai.', 'From boardrooms to society''s margins, five ambitious women from various walks of life navigate dreams, desires and disappointments in modern Mumbai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v90D18LBN6oJgOrwlSoIG17e8X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119148'),
  ('348433524755237233', 'Bomberman Jetters', 2002, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hiroki Takahashi, Kenichi Ogata, Risa Mizuno, Naoki Tatsuta, Tomoko Kaneda, Hiroki Takahashi, Koji Ishii, Masami Iwasaki', null, 'The space police force known as the "Jetters" fight against the villains making sure that the universe is safe.', 'The space police force known as the "Jetters" fight against the villains making sure that the universe is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS6qmyYovFhteOqx6soqltp3rK3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9112'),
  ('213949447523930388', 'Bon Appetit', 2023, 'Drama', null, 'Yong Hee-gyeong', 'Lee Gi-taek, Yoo Jung-hun, Yoo Jang-hee, Seo Dong-jin, Yoon Seo-bin', null, 'Yoon-soo is a dedicated office worker who immerses himself in his job, shuttling between home and the office day in and day out.', 'Yoon-soo is a dedicated office worker who immerses himself in his job, shuttling between home and the office day in and day out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0nGFeP7OrV4Vb7XtUHlns3VYHm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234267'),
  ('202396290684562954', 'Bon Appétit, Your Majesty', 2025, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jang Tae-yoo', null, 'Yoona, Lee Chae-min, Kang Hanna, Choi Gwi-hwa, Oh Eui-sik, Seo Yi-sook, Park Young-woon, Yoon Seo-ah', 'TV-14', 'After time traveling to the Joseon era, a talented chef meets a tyrant king. Her modern dishes captivate his palate, but royal challenges await her.', 'After time traveling to the Joseon era, a talented chef meets a tyrant king. Her modern dishes captivate his palate, but royal challenges await her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzYSIw9FTzQXUcWsnDSwlcwok3C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280945'),
  ('619156982702730624', 'Bon Voyage', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Oliver Brown', 'Éric Bruneau, Rachael Blake, Ben Miles, Fay Ripley, Daniel Ryan, Emily Beecham, Macha Grenon, Sally Taylor-Isherwood', 'NR', 'When Neil and Elizabeth take their children on a camping holiday to France, they find themselves continually bumping into over-friendly couple Simon and Linda. Elizabeth finds the couple weird, but when they begin to spot Simon and Linda''s campervan in their rear view mirror, and a young boy goes missing from the campsite, they realise the couple are more than creepy....they''re dangerous.', 'When Neil and Elizabeth take their children on a camping holiday to France, they find themselves continually bumping into over-friendly couple Simon and Linda. Elizabeth finds the couple weird, but when they begin to spot Simon and Linda''s campervan in their rear view mirror, and a young boy goes missing from the campsite, they realise the couple are more than creepy....they''re dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soSsEgMDLyDQpljlkwdjzMBorfp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35417'),
