  ('123277275733924889', 'Bone Ritual', 2026, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Li Jingyi, Liu Jingyi, He Lingyao, Wang Ronghong, Li Ming, Shi Xuanru, Kong Qinsan, Qiu Yushuo', null, 'Cao Lao, a renowned bone-reading master, and his apprentice Zheng Yu are invited to inspect the Wang family’s bones—but the appointment is a trap, pulling them into a deadly and mysterious bloodshed. To survive and restore justice, the pair embark on a calculated path of revenge, uncovering secrets that reveal a heart-wrenching tragedy of their time.', 'Cao Lao, a renowned bone-reading master, and his apprentice Zheng Yu are invited to inspect the Wang family’s bones—but the appointment is a trap, pulling them into a deadly and mysterious bloodshed. To survive and restore justice, the pair embark on a calculated path of revenge, uncovering secrets that reveal a heart-wrenching tragedy of their time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvqckCUu9v2IwCuXk9Wm2aK1fCz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313718'),
  ('466010073956625807', 'Bonekickers', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ashley Pharoah, Matthew Graham', null, 'Hugh Bonneville, Adrian Lester, Michael Maloney, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Julie Graham', 'TV-14', 'Bonekickers was a BBC drama about a team of archaeologists, set at the fictional Wessex University. It made its début on 8 July 2008 and ran for one series. It was written by Life on Mars and Ashes to Ashes creators Matthew Graham and Ashley Pharoah. It was produced by Michele Buck and Damien Timmer of Mammoth Screen Ltd and co-produced with Monastic Productions. Archaeologist and Bristol University academic Mark Horton acted as the series'' archaeological consultant. Adrian Lester has described the programme as "CSI meets Indiana Jones [...] There''s an element of the crime procedural show, there''s science, conspiracy theories – and there''s a big underlying mystery that goes through the whole six-episode series." Much of the series was filmed in the City of Bath, Somerset, with locations including the University of Bath campus. Additional locations included Brean Down Fort and Kings Weston House, Chavenage House for episodes 5 & 6 and Sheldon Manor. On 21 November 2008 Broadcast magazine revealed the show would not be returning for a second series.', 'Bonekickers was a BBC drama about a team of archaeologists, set at the fictional Wessex University. It made its début on 8 July 2008 and ran for one series. It was written by Life on Mars and Ashes to Ashes creators Matthew Graham and Ashley Pharoah. It was produced by Michele Buck and Damien Timmer of Mammoth Screen Ltd and co-produced with Monastic Productions. Archaeologist and Bristol University academic Mark Horton acted as the series'' archaeological consultant. Adrian Lester has described the programme as "CSI meets Indiana Jones [...] There''s an element of the crime procedural show, there''s science, conspiracy theories – and there''s a big underlying mystery that goes through the whole six-episode series." Much of the series was filmed in the City of Bath, Somerset, with locations including the University of Bath campus. Additional locations included Brean Down Fort and Kings Weston House, Chavenage House for episodes 5 & 6 and Sheldon Manor. On 21 November 2008 Broadcast magazine revealed the show would not be returning for a second series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNbAPZZrjHKZGa1JByYna6vQ66o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7422'),
  ('722166371595532253', 'Bones', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hart Hanson', null, 'Emily Deschanel, David Boreanaz, John Boyd, Michaela Conlin, Tamara Taylor, T.J. Thyne', 'TV-14', 'Dr. Temperance Brennan and her colleagues at the Jeffersonian''s Medico-Legal Lab assist Special Agent Seeley Booth with murder investigations when the remains are so badly decomposed, burned or destroyed that the standard identification methods are useless.', 'Dr. Temperance Brennan and her colleagues at the Jeffersonian''s Medico-Legal Lab assist Special Agent Seeley Booth with murder investigations when the remains are so badly decomposed, burned or destroyed that the standard identification methods are useless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyTu5c8LniVciRZIOSHTvvkkgJa.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:1911'),
  ('567680189464106994', 'BONJOUR♪Sweet Love Patisserie', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Yui Ishikawa, Kaito Ishikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Tetsuya Kakihara', null, 'Sayuri Haruno dreams of becoming a pastry chef and enrolls in Fleurir Confectionary Academy, an elite school located in Tokyo’s trendy Aoyama district. At Fleurir, she finds herself surrounded by charming boys, each one distinctly unique... As Sayuri pours her heart and soul into making her dream a reality, she encounters many happenings…', 'Sayuri Haruno dreams of becoming a pastry chef and enrolls in Fleurir Confectionary Academy, an elite school located in Tokyo’s trendy Aoyama district. At Fleurir, she finds herself surrounded by charming boys, each one distinctly unique... As Sayuri pours her heart and soul into making her dream a reality, she encounters many happenings…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF5j2sGnwHEE0jVbac7SAqUoZ6i.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84158'),
  ('456387145568500579', 'Bonkers', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, 'Jim Cummings, Karla DeVito, Frank Welker, Sherry Lynn, Earl Boen, Ron Perlman', 'TV-Y', 'Bonkers is an animated American television series that aired from September 4, 1993 to August 24, 1995 in first-run syndication. The syndicated run was available both separately, and as part of The Disney Afternoon. The show was last seen on Toon Disney, but was taken off the schedule in late 2004.', 'Bonkers is an animated American television series that aired from September 4, 1993 to August 24, 1995 in first-run syndication. The syndicated run was available both separately, and as part of The Disney Afternoon. The show was last seen on Toon Disney, but was taken off the schedule in late 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZW4rWFY356fBAGNG9SrsyU6WMH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6616'),
  ('975080809176360762', 'Bonn', 2023, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Martin Rehbock, Claudia Garde, Peter Furrer', 'Mercedes Müller, Max Riemelt, Sebastian Blomberg, Martin Wuttke, Juergen Maurer, Katharina M. Schubert, Inga Busch, Luise von Finckh', null, 'Bonn depicts the rise of the young West Germany, a country struggling to break free from the terrors and legacies of World War II and longing for a ''normal'' life. Into this heady and volatile mix steps Toni, a young woman determined to seize every opportunity, overcome every obstacle and make her own way in what is still a very male-dominated society. But what at first appears to be only an entry-level office job at one of the country''s two competing secret services soon sucks her ever deeper into a clandestine world of secrets and suspicion. Based on true events.', 'Bonn depicts the rise of the young West Germany, a country struggling to break free from the terrors and legacies of World War II and longing for a ''normal'' life. Into this heady and volatile mix steps Toni, a young woman determined to seize every opportunity, overcome every obstacle and make her own way in what is still a very male-dominated society. But what at first appears to be only an entry-level office job at one of the country''s two competing secret services soon sucks her ever deeper into a clandestine world of secrets and suspicion. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NozZWzA9QUR3chxSWwUVPkcIoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215780'),
  ('573880125500457029', 'Bonnie & Clyde', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Holliday Grainger, Emile Hirsch, Sarah Hyland, Lane Garrison, William Hurt, Holly Hunter, Austin Hébert, Elizabeth Reaser', 'TV-14', 'Clyde Barrow, a charismatic convicted armed robber, sweeps Bonnie Parker, an impressionable, petite, small-town waitress, off her feet, and the two embark on one one of most infamous bank-robbing sprees in history.', 'Clyde Barrow, a charismatic convicted armed robber, sweeps Bonnie Parker, an impressionable, petite, small-town waitress, off her feet, and the two embark on one one of most infamous bank-robbing sprees in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOLZpg3fxxdbkkMZWT3WfOM5d4k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62829'),
  ('55218158846240203', 'Bonsoir bonsoir!', 2019, 'Talk', null, null, 'Jean-Philippe Wauthier', null, 'Each day, Jean-Philippe Wauthier welcomes guests on the show in warm, friendly setting. His interviews focus on their newsworthy achievements but also, and most importantly, on their passions, interests and opinions.', 'Each day, Jean-Philippe Wauthier welcomes guests on the show in warm, friendly setting. His interviews focus on their newsworthy achievements but also, and most importantly, on their passions, interests and opinions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cCTEwOTiGEF4jRtQ1NRk9TIkKM.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:88191'),
  ('819327281517317036', 'Bonus Family', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Felix Herngren, Moa Herngren, Clara Herngren', null, 'Erik Johansson, Vera Vitali, Emma Peters, Fredrik Hallgren, Nour El Refai, Matheo Bittar Johansson, Frank Dorsin, Jacob Lundqvist', null, 'A new couple, their exes and their children navigate the emotional challenges and tricky logistics of blended family life in this Swedish dramedy.', 'A new couple, their exes and their children navigate the emotional challenges and tricky logistics of blended family life in this Swedish dramedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQuvTYr5KheV0U6n3wJh9bRoNUn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70748'),
  ('527132162871129122', 'Boo, Bitch', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Erin Ehrlich, Lauren Iungerich, Tim Schauer', 'Vivian Huang', 'Lana Condor, Zoe Colletti, Mason Versaw, Aparna Brielle, Tenzing Norgay Trainor, Jami Alix', 'TV-14', 'Two senior BFFs make a last-ditch attempt to be seen. But when one of them becomes a ghost, she''ll need to really live her best life — while she can.', 'Two senior BFFs make a last-ditch attempt to be seen. But when one of them becomes a ghost, she''ll need to really live her best life — while she can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3zagQAHUUePg29xjp9SYoxtsv7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132188'),
  ('518556489394622827', 'Booba', 2014, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Comedy', 'Nikolay Okorokov', null, 'Roman Karev, Elena Kareva, Dakeshi, Vyacheslav Kataev, Valery Pankov', 'TV-Y', 'The world is a mystery to little Booba. But he approaches the curiosities around him with wonder, finding adventure in his everyday surroundings.', 'The world is a mystery to little Booba. But he approaches the curiosities around him with wonder, finding adventure in his everyday surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omnPz8NvgYDty6XsMA0YcA895CW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:81700'),
  ('452072427782687200', 'Boogie Oogie', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Rui Vilhena', 'João Avelino, Maria Elisa Berredo, Alice de Andrade', 'Isis Valverde, Bianca Bin, Marco Pigossi, Giulia Gam, Alessandra Negrini, Marco Ricca, Heloísa Périssé, Daniel Dantas', 'NR', 'In the swing of the 70s, two women fight for the love of the same man without knowing their fates were already intertwined.', 'In the swing of the 70s, two women fight for the love of the same man without knowing their fates were already intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldC08QIkER7muxNVd4hXnBW3doc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84612'),
  ('844056968643615806', 'Boogiepop and Others', 2019, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Saori Onishi, Chiaki Kobayashi, Yuji Murai, Sayaka Kinoshita, Shuhei Sakaguchi, Minami Tsuda, Junya Enoki', 'TV-MA', 'There is an urban legend that tells of a shinigami that can release people from the pain they are suffering. This "Angel of Death" has a name—Boogiepop. And the legends are true. Boogiepop is real. When a rash of disappearances involving female students breaks out at Shinyo Academy, the police and faculty assume they just have a bunch of runaways on their hands. Yet some students know better. Something mysterious and foul is afoot. Is it Boogiepop or something even more sinister...?', 'There is an urban legend that tells of a shinigami that can release people from the pain they are suffering. This "Angel of Death" has a name—Boogiepop. And the legends are true. Boogiepop is real. When a rash of disappearances involving female students breaks out at Shinyo Academy, the police and faculty assume they just have a bunch of runaways on their hands. Yet some students know better. Something mysterious and foul is afoot. Is it Boogiepop or something even more sinister...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lz95Bn85XN2pAXbHcSQreiUMv5b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84163'),
  ('332088641532383993', 'Boogiepop Phantom', 2000, 'Animation, Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Yuu Asakawa, Kaori Shimizu, Sanae Kobayashi, Kozue Yoshizumi, Mayumi Asano, Kyo Nagasawa, Jun Fukuyama, Gakuto Furuhara', 'TV-14', 'Five years ago, a string of grisly murders shook the city to its core and now the rumors have begun once more. Boogiepop... Everyone knows about Boogiepop: meet her one dark night and you are taken. People tell each other the stories and laugh: no one believes that she can possibly exist in this day and age. Still, strange things appear to be going on and the darkness is taking on many forms. Something is out there.', 'Five years ago, a string of grisly murders shook the city to its core and now the rumors have begun once more. Boogiepop... Everyone knows about Boogiepop: meet her one dark night and you are taken. People tell each other the stories and laugh: no one believes that she can possibly exist in this day and age. Still, strange things appear to be going on and the darkness is taking on many forms. Something is out there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z2p2DbQ6HdNzcOtcWPOO94vaYR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34152'),
  ('281233267208311962', 'Booker', 1989, 'Drama', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Richard Grieco, Marcia Strassman, Carmen Argenziano, Katie Rich, Lori Petty', null, 'Booker is an American crime drama series starring Richard Grieco that aired on the Fox Network from September 24, 1989 to May 6, 1990. The series is a spin-off of 21 Jump Street and the second installment of the 21 Jump Street series. The character of Dennis Booker was originally a recurring character on that police drama during its third season. The theme song for the series, "Hot in the City", was performed by Billy Idol.', 'Booker is an American crime drama series starring Richard Grieco that aired on the Fox Network from September 24, 1989 to May 6, 1990. The series is a spin-off of 21 Jump Street and the second installment of the 21 Jump Street series. The character of Dennis Booker was originally a recurring character on that police drama during its third season. The theme song for the series, "Hot in the City", was performed by Billy Idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nRV7WiAIu48xzCpmSKBs5bjNpu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9883'),
  ('1108703487767209873', 'Bookie', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Nick Bakay, Chuck Lorre', null, 'Sebastian Maniscalco, Omar J. Dorsey, Jorge Garcia, Andrea Anders, Vanessa Ferlito, Maxim Swinton, Rob Corddry', 'TV-MA', 'A veteran bookie struggles to survive the impending legalization of sports gambling, increasingly unstable clients, family, co-workers, and a lifestyle that bounces him around every corner of Los Angeles, high and low.', 'A veteran bookie struggles to survive the impending legalization of sports gambling, increasingly unstable clients, family, co-workers, and a lifestyle that bounces him around every corner of Los Angeles, high and low.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g2ioERz9CwdfAXv5ykQR7h3Ie3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:221486'),
  ('199000587446937045', 'Bookish', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Mark Gatiss', 'Mark Gatiss, Matthew Sweet', 'Mark Gatiss, Polly Walker, Elliot Levey, Buket Komur, Connor Finch', 'TV-MA', 'Gabriel Book, proprietor of an antiquarian bookshop, relies on his vast collection to unravel baffling cases. He nurtures a group of lovable yet troubled individuals, providing informal protection and guidance.', 'Gabriel Book, proprietor of an antiquarian bookshop, relies on his vast collection to unravel baffling cases. He nurtures a group of lovable yet troubled individuals, providing informal protection and guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9StiB7RgLunR7EcMM3i6C9yCUou.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251597'),
  ('60885231443768545', 'Boom! Boom! The World vs Boris Becker', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Boris Becker', 'TV-MA', 'An inside look at the controversial life and career of tennis great Boris Becker—featuring interviews with John McEnroe, Novak Djokovic, Björn Borg, and other icons.', 'An inside look at the controversial life and career of tennis great Boris Becker—featuring interviews with John McEnroe, Novak Djokovic, Björn Borg, and other icons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCqGNFllZakJsdepvHMqxbD3LkW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216681'),
  ('845156554951944370', 'Boomers', 2014, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Philip Jackson, Alison Steadman, Russ Abbot, Stephanie Beacham, Paula Wilcox, James Smith', null, 'Sitcom following the ups and downs of three retired couples living in Thurnemouth, ''Norfolk''s only West-facing resort''.', 'Sitcom following the ups and downs of three retired couples living in Thurnemouth, ''Norfolk''s only West-facing resort''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kwp2XKGihs7fRzgVJMMNJyUyoh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66029'),
  ('115989585562319688', 'Boomtown', 2002, 'Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Graham Yost', null, 'Donnie Wahlberg, Neal McDonough, Mykelti Williamson, Gary Basaraba, Lana Parrilla, Jason Gedrick', null, 'Each episode of this series, set in contemporary Los Angeles, examines one crime from many different viewpoints - uniformed cops, detectives, witnesses, the media, the fire department and rescue squad, even the criminals themselves.', 'Each episode of this series, set in contemporary Los Angeles, examines one crime from many different viewpoints - uniformed cops, detectives, witnesses, the media, the fire department and rescue squad, even the criminals themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUrryaypDvHSUYRElzFqMKVl4qT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:707'),
  ('341763859498553264', 'Boon', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Michael Elphick, David Daker, Neil Morrissey, Elizabeth Carling, Amanda Burton, Saskia Wickham, Rachel Davies', 'TV-14', 'Boon is a British television drama and modern-day western series starring Michael Elphick, David Daker, and later Neil Morrissey. It was created by Jim Hill and Bill Stair and filmed by Central Television for ITV. It revolved around the life of a modern-day Lone Ranger and ex-firefighter, Ken Boon.', 'Boon is a British television drama and modern-day western series starring Michael Elphick, David Daker, and later Neil Morrissey. It was created by Jim Hill and Bill Stair and filmed by Central Television for ITV. It revolved around the life of a modern-day Lone Ranger and ex-firefighter, Ken Boon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjbb4DLt9dnjNvSFWAy3rNZQZJU.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2559'),
  ('435643016782617941', 'Boonie Bears: Autumn Awesomeness', 2016, 'Animation, Kids', 'Ding Liang', 'Yun Xu, Bo Jiang', 'Zhang Wei, Tan Xiao, Zhang Bingjun, Guang Chen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuO393tUHR5S2TGioXX0dvoqnBs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106221'),
  ('400254823459619018', 'Boots', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, War & Politics', 'Andy Parker', null, 'Miles Heizer, Max Parker, Vera Farmiga, Liam Oh, Cedrick Cooper, Ana Ayora, Angus O''Brien, Kieron Moore', 'TV-MA', 'After impulsively joining the U.S. Marine Corps, a bullied teen finds new purpose — and unexpected brotherhood — with his motley team of fellow recruits.', 'After impulsively joining the U.S. Marine Corps, a bullied teen finds new purpose — and unexpected brotherhood — with his motley team of fellow recruits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEwe68oPFFDU4ehZ3sXiETE44Rt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225647'),
  ('985577690906307042', 'Booze Traveler', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jack Maxwell', 'TV-PG', 'Actor/adventurer Jack Maxwell learned a lot working in South Boston bars, and one lesson stood out: Enjoy a couple of drinks with a stranger, and the whole world opens up. Those experiences inspired "Booze Traveler," which follows Maxwell to various countries to quench his curiosity about what people drink, why, and the tales it prompts. In Armenia, Belize, Lithuania, Mongolia, Nepal and elsewhere, Maxwell learns its intoxicating traditions, meets with locals, joins in activities, and even helps with the alcohol-making process. He finds a unique drink, makes friends and shares stories in each spot.', 'Actor/adventurer Jack Maxwell learned a lot working in South Boston bars, and one lesson stood out: Enjoy a couple of drinks with a stranger, and the whole world opens up. Those experiences inspired "Booze Traveler," which follows Maxwell to various countries to quench his curiosity about what people drink, why, and the tales it prompts. In Armenia, Belize, Lithuania, Mongolia, Nepal and elsewhere, Maxwell learns its intoxicating traditions, meets with locals, joins in activities, and even helps with the alcohol-making process. He finds a unique drink, makes friends and shares stories in each spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AKpxs5xTDkrmYVzFCpoGfWn6QB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62058'),
  ('797437275703874745', 'BoOzy’ OS', 2009, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'J.K. Arsyn', null, 'J.K. Arsyn, Georges Colazzo', null, 'In a prehistoric fantasy world, BoOzy’ OS, a brawny caveman, lives wacky adventures.', 'In a prehistoric fantasy world, BoOzy’ OS, a brawny caveman, lives wacky adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rswoMF8yOtpFRj86FA28eIIgDRj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61358'),
  ('153856071040126384', 'Borat’s American Lockdown & Debunking Borat', 2021, 'Comedy, Reality', 'Kahane Cooperman', null, 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Maria Bakalova', 'TV-14', 'Live the real-life drama of Sacha Baron Cohen, as Borat Sagdivev, where he spends five days at the peak of the Covid-19 pandemic with two conspiracy theorists. Then, in Debunking Borat, see the two conspiracy theorists have their theories debunked by some of the world’s leading experts.', 'Live the real-life drama of Sacha Baron Cohen, as Borat Sagdivev, where he spends five days at the peak of the Covid-19 pandemic with two conspiracy theorists. Then, in Debunking Borat, see the two conspiracy theorists have their theories debunked by some of the world’s leading experts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flEQeImhhciXu77EKMnR7LEVswx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126326'),
  ('477716345984822372', 'Border', 2014, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Shun Oguri, Munetaka Aoki, Haru, Kenichi Endo, Arata Furuta, Kenichi Takitoh, Toru Nomaguchi, Kenta Hamano', 'NR', 'Ishikawa Ango is a very capable detective that lives only for his job. One day, while investigating a crime scene, he gets shot in the head by the criminal that was still lurking about. Ango gets thrown over that line that divides life and death but, though he dies, doctor''s are able to reanimate him and he pulls through. Yet, the bullet remains stuck in his head as the operation to remove it is very dangerous. Shortly after, he goes back to work and soon realizes that he''s now able to see and talk with the recently departed.', 'Ishikawa Ango is a very capable detective that lives only for his job. One day, while investigating a crime scene, he gets shot in the head by the criminal that was still lurking about. Ango gets thrown over that line that divides life and death but, though he dies, doctor''s are able to reanimate him and he pulls through. Yet, the bullet remains stuck in his head as the operation to remove it is very dangerous. Shortly after, he goes back to work and soon realizes that he''s now able to see and talk with the recently departed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrsVRxNqIg0ybvFVOUYx9ySfgUF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64031'),
  ('549992589929763488', 'Border Control Türkiye', 2025, 'Reality, Crime', 'Yusuf Esenkal', null, null, null, 'Elite teams battle smugglers at Turkey''s land, air, and sea borders in a nonstop fight to protect national security.', 'Elite teams battle smugglers at Turkey''s land, air, and sea borders in a nonstop fight to protect national security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7IiVgvBai3B4XAyGf2KWsYgF3H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:302030'),
  ('995919214164437539', 'Border Control: Spain', 2016, 'Reality, Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Follows the offers of the Security and Customs Services at the borders of Spain, which are under the constant threat from drugs, weapons, and suspected terrorists.', 'Follows the offers of the Security and Customs Services at the borders of Spain, which are under the constant threat from drugs, weapons, and suspected terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmREkDMxNsn7PgVfhm3D7aw7jvR.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:83959'),
  ('572776565298388087', 'Border Control: Sweden', 2022, 'Reality, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'Thousands of people cross Sweden''s borders every day. We follow customs officers, investigators, scouts and dog handlers who daily secure Sweden''s borders, ports and airports.', 'Thousands of people cross Sweden''s borders every day. We follow customs officers, investigators, scouts and dog handlers who daily secure Sweden''s borders, ports and airports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LkKmv3TN4fPUv8b0arEkkwhAnD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:210062'),
  ('353844565071667911', 'Border Patrol', 2002, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Timothy Balme', null, 'Border Patrol is a New Zealand reality television series, focusing on the Customs, the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry, and the New Zealand Immigration Service. It is narrated by Tim Balme. They are checking through packages, travelers and goods to find if they try to smugle prohibited or undeclared goods. They have trained staff, dogs and technology to find this out.', 'Border Patrol is a New Zealand reality television series, focusing on the Customs, the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry, and the New Zealand Immigration Service. It is narrated by Tim Balme. They are checking through packages, travelers and goods to find if they try to smugle prohibited or undeclared goods. They have trained staff, dogs and technology to find this out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4viKujuBL0zZIZ9d54kVCRXD7Uj.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:19910'),
  ('99383788038618107', 'Borderline', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chris Gau, Michael Orton-Toliver', 'Chris Gau, Michael Orton-Toliver', 'Jamie Michie, David Avery, Liz Kingsman, David Elms, Jackie Clune, Ralf Little', null, 'Mockumentary based in the border security office of fictional Northend Airport, a small provincial airport which may lack a little in glamour, but still must abide by the same rules as larger international airports', 'Mockumentary based in the border security office of fictional Northend Airport, a small provincial airport which may lack a little in glamour, but still must abide by the same rules as larger international airports', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPYzGX23YHKWHjToY7PKaxeUGYg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67387'),
  ('760890749740705770', 'Borderline', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Forte', null, 'Amy De Bhrún, Eoin Macken, Lochlann Ó Mearáin, Sophie Vavasseur, Naoimh Whelton', null, 'Forced to collaborate on a serious crime, contrasting detectives Philip Boyd and Aoife Regan, with clashing personalities and backgrounds, overcome initial friction to form an unlikely but formidable crime-fighting partnership.', 'Forced to collaborate on a serious crime, contrasting detectives Philip Boyd and Aoife Regan, with clashing personalities and backgrounds, overcome initial friction to form an unlikely but formidable crime-fighting partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pITarGliaAOFryTslXtVPr3F9Oq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:265228'),
  ('260015599124674046', 'Borderliner', 2017, 'Drama', 'Alexander Opsal, Megan Gallagher', null, 'Tobias Santelmann, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Eivind Sander, Benjamin Helstad', 'TV-MA', 'To protect his family, police detective Nikolai covers up a murder case. But when his co-investigator Anniken suspects foul play, he is trapped in a dangerous game on duty, blurring the line between right and wrong.', 'To protect his family, police detective Nikolai covers up a murder case. But when his co-investigator Anniken suspects foul play, he is trapped in a dangerous game on duty, blurring the line between right and wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGRMKHKi6l8Jzkjy6PqHDMt7G4q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73314'),
  ('801126666388873416', 'Borders of Love', 2004, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Güliz Kucur', 'Güliz Kucur', 'Nehir Erdoğan, Özgür Çevik, Erdal Özyağcılar, Sumru Yavrucuk, Arif Erkin Güzelbeyoğlu, Seray Gözler, Zeki Alasya, Engin Akyürek', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugW8lozhM22cRgnqGApUPyLtsfE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15576'),
  ('801798763585878704', 'Bordertown', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mark Hentemann', null, 'Zach Villa, Judah Friedlander, Hank Azaria, Missi Pyle, Jacqueline Pinol, Efren Ramirez, Alex Borstein, Nicholas Gonzalez', 'TV-14', 'The comedy, which takes place in a fictitious desert town near the U.S.-Mexico border, centers on the intertwining daily lives of neighbors Bud Buckwald and Ernesto Gonzales. Bud, a married father of three, is a Border Patrol agent who feels threatened by the cultural changes that have transformed his neighborhood. Living next door is Ernesto, an industrious Mexican immigrant and father of four, who is proud to be making it in America. As Bud and Ernesto’s paths begin to cross, their families become bound by friendship, romance and conflict.', 'The comedy, which takes place in a fictitious desert town near the U.S.-Mexico border, centers on the intertwining daily lives of neighbors Bud Buckwald and Ernesto Gonzales. Bud, a married father of three, is a Border Patrol agent who feels threatened by the cultural changes that have transformed his neighborhood. Living next door is Ernesto, an industrious Mexican immigrant and father of four, who is proud to be making it in America. As Bud and Ernesto’s paths begin to cross, their families become bound by friendship, romance and conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikMzMxJjHgmPymi9RIMWAeGX02p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63039'),
  ('1001324775093438012', 'Bored to Death', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Jonathan Ames', null, 'Jason Schwartzman, Zach Galifianakis, Ted Danson, Heather Burns', 'TV-MA', 'Jonathan Ames, a young Brooklyn writer, is feeling lost. He''s just gone through a painful break-up, thanks in part to his drinking, can''t write his second novel, and carouses too much with his magazine editor. Rather than face reality, Jonathan turns instead to his fantasies — moonlighting as a private detective — because he wants to be a hero and a man of action.', 'Jonathan Ames, a young Brooklyn writer, is feeling lost. He''s just gone through a painful break-up, thanks in part to his drinking, can''t write his second novel, and carouses too much with his magazine editor. Rather than face reality, Jonathan turns instead to his fantasies — moonlighting as a private detective — because he wants to be a hero and a man of action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCHirPRvImk6wTLJMKI8vVNVcOT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31078'),
  ('1071965884403982562', 'Borgen', 2010, 'Drama', 'Adam Price, Camilla Hammerich', 'Adam Price', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Mikael Birkkjær, Lars Knutzon, Søren Malling, Benedikte Hansen, Emil Poulsen, Thomas Levin', 'TV-MA', '40-year old political leader Birgitte Nyborg secures her party a landslide victory through her idealism and huge effort, then faces the biggest challenge of her life: how most effectively to use the newly won seats, and how far she is willing to go in order to gain as much influence as possible.', '40-year old political leader Birgitte Nyborg secures her party a landslide victory through her idealism and huge effort, then faces the biggest challenge of her life: how most effectively to use the newly won seats, and how far she is willing to go in order to gain as much influence as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wB4R3Ac3lKSQWKpoU0zeRY8XqL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42445'),
  ('983533048395973627', 'Borgen - Power & Glory', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Adam Price', 'Emilie Lebech Kaae', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Søren Malling, Peter Mygind, Lucas Lynggaard Tønnesen, Lisbeth Wulff, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Angunnguaq Larsen', 'TV-MA', 'Foreign Minister Birgitte Nyborg finds her career in jeopardy when a dispute over oil in Greenland threatens to become an international crisis.', 'Foreign Minister Birgitte Nyborg finds her career in jeopardy when a dispute over oil in Greenland threatens to become an international crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lWlsYjsDQeRqCrYhDDgmtTjBPk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203281'),
  ('579159302449268392', 'Borgia', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Tom Fontana', null, 'John Doman, Mark Ryder, Assumpta Serna, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Marta Gastini, Rafael Cebrian, Alejandro Albarracín, Babsie Steger', 'TV-MA', 'The name Borgia stands for betrayal, intrigue and corruption in the Vatican, which was the center of the world during the Renaissance.', 'The name Borgia stands for betrayal, intrigue and corruption in the Vatican, which was the center of the world during the Renaissance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrLEvAT3DxgzC5QeAWkHHHQAHMH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34388'),
  ('1066315903622224970', 'Boris', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Luca Manzi, Carlo Mazzotta', 'Mattia Torre', 'Francesco Pannofino, Alessandro Tiberi, Pietro Sermonti, Carolina Crescentini, Caterina Guzzanti, Antonio Catania, Antonino Bruschetta, Paolo Calabresi', 'TV-PG', 'Boris is an Italian television series created by Luca Manzi and Carlo Mazzotta, initially produced from 2007 to 2010, with a revival season premiered in 2022. The show brings to the stage the behind the scenes of a television set where a troupe is shooting Gli occhi del cuore 2 (The eyes of the heart 2), a satirical portrait of the many fictions airing on the Italian TV networks.', 'Boris is an Italian television series created by Luca Manzi and Carlo Mazzotta, initially produced from 2007 to 2010, with a revival season premiered in 2022. The show brings to the stage the behind the scenes of a television set where a troupe is shooting Gli occhi del cuore 2 (The eyes of the heart 2), a satirical portrait of the many fictions airing on the Italian TV networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iR7ufink0F23Wx19SetKaYqhjAZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:36189'),
  ('972897942393266389', 'Born Again', 2020, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jang Ki-yong, Jin Se-yeon, Lee Soo-hyuk, Kim Jung-nan, Kim Hee-jung, Jang Won-young, Cha Min-jee, Lee Seo-el', null, 'Life, death and second chances take center stage in this story about three people whose intertwined destinies travel through space and time with haunting results. It’s the 1980s and Detective Cha Hyung Bin has devoted his life to criminal justice, and his heart to Ha Eun, a bookshop owner suffering from heart disease who keeps her illness a secret. But Cha Hyung Bin isn’t the only one pining after Ha Eun: serial killer Gong Ji Chul has also fallen in love with her. Their lives collide with tragic results, but 30 years later, they’re reincarnated and fate brings them together again. The more time passes, the more their new lives become tangled in the devastating web of history. Will they manage to escape the past, or be forced to come face to face with it?', 'Life, death and second chances take center stage in this story about three people whose intertwined destinies travel through space and time with haunting results. It’s the 1980s and Detective Cha Hyung Bin has devoted his life to criminal justice, and his heart to Ha Eun, a bookshop owner suffering from heart disease who keeps her illness a secret. But Cha Hyung Bin isn’t the only one pining after Ha Eun: serial killer Gong Ji Chul has also fallen in love with her. Their lives collide with tragic results, but 30 years later, they’re reincarnated and fate brings them together again. The more time passes, the more their new lives become tangled in the devastating web of history. Will they manage to escape the past, or be forced to come face to face with it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l4YkHNBANt0VfUIYrcPxUK1bNX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100857'),
  ('279998646689121082', 'Born and Bred', 2002, 'Drama', 'Nigel McCrery, Chris Chibnall', null, 'Jenna Russell, Polly Thompson, Evan Fortescue, Peter Gunn, Tracey Childs, Maggie Steed, Naomi Radcliffe, Samuel J. Hudson', 'TV-PG', 'In the 1950s at the fictional Lancashire village of Ormston, a father and son, both doctors, navigate the challenges of running a cottage hospital under the newly established National Health Service.', 'In the 1950s at the fictional Lancashire village of Ormston, a father and son, both doctors, navigate the challenges of running a cottage hospital under the newly established National Health Service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Zd1rOuRmSYPLZ9zubNqCYa7URq.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:12733'),
  ('315684499909571532', 'Born Evil: The Serial Killer and the Savior', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ian Kincaid, Jack Truitt, Chaz Riddle, Hayden Clark, Chris Smorto', null, 'Explore the life and crimes of Hadden Clark, a lesser-known serial killer. Dive into the inner workings of the volatile and dysfunctional Clark family, Hadden''s path of depravity, and the shocking confessions he made to his cellmate that sent investigators on a search to solve the cold cases allegedly linked to him.', 'Explore the life and crimes of Hadden Clark, a lesser-known serial killer. Dive into the inner workings of the volatile and dysfunctional Clark family, Hadden''s path of depravity, and the shocking confessions he made to his cellmate that sent investigators on a search to solve the cold cases allegedly linked to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBv80THexr4o274WbrXL5jMEmUI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:261449'),
  ('1136327509220425446', 'Born for the Spotlight', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yen Yi-wen', 'Kitten Huang', 'Hsieh Ying-shiuan, Cheryl Yang, Simon Hsueh, Annie Chen, Cherry Hsieh, Yang Kuei-mei, Chung Hsin-ling, Vicky Tseng', 'TV-MA', 'Chasing glamour, fame and artistry, women with a passion for acting must push the limits to pursue their dreams in the ruthless world of show business.', 'Chasing glamour, fame and artistry, women with a passion for acting must push the limits to pursue their dreams in the ruthless world of show business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5p9NGYvs2PXyh8IiiAGEJ6omeQx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245264'),
  ('438318415042563596', 'Born This Way', 2015, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Born This Way follows a group of young adults with Down syndrome as they pursue their dreams and explore their friendships, romantic relationships, and work.', 'Born This Way follows a group of young adults with Down syndrome as they pursue their dreams and explore their friendships, romantic relationships, and work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmUcqLSTEuo5gsNzxluARTYnMms.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64682'),
  ('968600403311308257', 'Born to Be Alive', 2026, 'Drama', null, 'Wang Sanmao, Wang Lei', 'Yang Zi, Hu Ge, Li Guangjie, Zhang Zhehua, Jinpa, Feng Bing, Gengdan, Su Xin', null, 'In 1990s Qinghai’s Maji County, rampant poaching plunged the region into poverty. Deputy County Head Dorje’s mountain patrol team shifted from mineral exploration to protecting antelopes. Bai Ju, a fearless female officer raised by a Tibetan doctor, grew into a leader fighting for a nature reserve with her comrades and journalist lover, only to face Dorje’s mysterious disappearance. Decades later, as coal mining threatens the eco-balance again, Bai Ju reunites with allies to solve the cold case and uphold the legacy of safeguarding the Tibetan Plateau’s untouched beauty.', 'In 1990s Qinghai’s Maji County, rampant poaching plunged the region into poverty. Deputy County Head Dorje’s mountain patrol team shifted from mineral exploration to protecting antelopes. Bai Ju, a fearless female officer raised by a Tibetan doctor, grew into a leader fighting for a nature reserve with her comrades and journalist lover, only to face Dorje’s mysterious disappearance. Decades later, as coal mining threatens the eco-balance again, Bai Ju reunites with allies to solve the cold case and uphold the legacy of safeguarding the Tibetan Plateau’s untouched beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtFZomHhlOQICIOPJeeJdRqfKmy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282558'),
  ('619149935566174564', 'Born to Bowl', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Liev Schreiber, Kyle Troup, Anthony Simonsen, EJ Tackett, Cameron Crowe, Jason Belmonte', null, 'Go inside the colorful world of professional bowling and follow five stars of the sport as they chase glory, respect, and much-needed prize money on the Professional Bowlers Association (PBA) Tour.', 'Go inside the colorful world of professional bowling and follow five stars of the sport as they chase glory, respect, and much-needed prize money on the Professional Bowlers Association (PBA) Tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vTG083oV7EHBtlXKeREvNJRSl2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314922'),
  ('629851159986842300', 'Born to Kill', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kate Ashfield, Tracey Maloney', 'Kate Gartside', 'Jack Rowan, Romola Garai, Daniel Mays, Lara Peake, Simon Bubb, Richard Coyle, Earl Cave, Harry Capehorn', null, 'A haunting exploration of the mind of Sam, a teenager who''s on the verge of acting out hidden psychopathic desires.', 'A haunting exploration of the mind of Sam, a teenager who''s on the verge of acting out hidden psychopathic desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80uMPyA0KK3CPtodXUAEEAmJbIn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71379'),
  ('994548773589584056', 'Boruto: Naruto Next Generations', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuko Sanpei, Cocoro Kikuchi, Ryuichi Kijima, Ryoko Shiraishi, Shinji Kawada', 'TV-14', 'The life of the shinobi is beginning to change. Boruto Uzumaki, son of Seventh Hokage Naruto Uzumaki, has enrolled in the Ninja Academy to learn the ways of the ninja. Now, as a series of mysterious events unfolds, Boruto’s story is about to begin!', 'The life of the shinobi is beginning to change. Boruto Uzumaki, son of Seventh Hokage Naruto Uzumaki, has enrolled in the Ninja Academy to learn the ways of the ninja. Now, as a series of mysterious events unfolds, Boruto’s story is about to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0B6i48kxdRkMcK4tR4YNfXGWOc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70881'),
  ('784981101085659193', 'Bosch', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Eric Overmyer', null, 'Titus Welliver, Jamie Hector, Amy Aquino, Lance Reddick, Madison Lintz', 'TV-MA', 'Harry Bosch, an LAPD homicide detective, stands trial for the fatal shooting of a serial murder suspect. A cold case involving the remains of a missing boy forces Bosch to confront his past. As daring recruit Julia Brasher catches his eye and departmental politics heat up, Bosch will pursue justice at all costs.', 'Harry Bosch, an LAPD homicide detective, stands trial for the fatal shooting of a serial murder suspect. A cold case involving the remains of a missing boy forces Bosch to confront his past. As daring recruit Julia Brasher catches his eye and departmental politics heat up, Bosch will pursue justice at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQPwNJ6DRpmRfTrKy8A94c7IvU3.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:60585'),
  ('966643874173842408', 'Bosch: Legacy', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom Bernardo, Eric Overmyer, Michael Connelly', null, 'Titus Welliver, Mimi Rogers, Madison Lintz, Stephen A. Chang, Denise G. Sanchez, Paul Calderon', 'TV-MA', 'Bosch is now making a living as a private investigator two years after he quit the LAPD and finds himself working with one time enemy and top-notch attorney Honey “Money” Chandler. Meanwhile, Bosch''s daughter Maddie is venturing into the world of the LAPD.', 'Bosch is now making a living as a private investigator two years after he quit the LAPD and finds himself working with one time enemy and top-notch attorney Honey “Money” Chandler. Meanwhile, Bosch''s daughter Maddie is venturing into the world of the LAPD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usknS4tr8FUTm3FVWyLbWEPSGHa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:153657'),
  ('895287941071756355', 'Bosé', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Iván Sánchez, José Pastor, Valeria Solarino, Alicia Borrachero, Juan Felipe Muñoz', 'TV-14', 'The fascinating life of Miguel Bosé: an artist whose passion and unique personality were destined to break the mold in a Spain on the verge of change.', 'The fascinating life of Miguel Bosé: an artist whose passion and unique personality were destined to break the mold in a Spain on the verge of change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUb9U3eCJfSW1LuTTjLxrf4xhiU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212464'),
  ('72276889031779489', 'Bose: Dead/Alive', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Rajkummar Rao, Naveen Kasturia, Patralekhaa, Edward Sonnenblick, Anna Ador, Surendra Rajan', null, 'The man. The legend. The mystery. He fascinated us in life, and long after his "death". This is the story of India''s biggest cover-up: Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose and the mystery of his alleged death.', 'The man. The legend. The mystery. He fascinated us in life, and long after his "death". This is the story of India''s biggest cover-up: Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose and the mystery of his alleged death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avXCgz1dJAZwCUxPyLrFbNZWHJL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75200'),
  ('492602566866586837', 'Bosom Buddies', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Chris Thompson', null, 'Tom Hanks, Peter Scolari, Donna Dixon, Holland Taylor, Telma Hopkins, Wendie Jo Sperber', 'TV-PG', 'Kip and Henry, two young studs working for a New York ad agency, must disguise themselves as women to live in the one apartment they can afford.', 'Kip and Henry, two young studs working for a New York ad agency, must disguise themselves as women to live in the one apartment they can afford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocUYoa7QptPAg4jsyQB88f5M8tP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2574'),
  ('641157307740490227', 'Boss', 2011, 'Drama, War & Politics, Crime', 'Farhad Safinia', null, 'Kelsey Grammer, Connie Nielsen, Hannah Ware, Jeff Hephner, Kathleen Robertson, Troy Garity, Rotimi, Jonathan Groff', 'TV-MA', 'Mayor Tom Kane sits like a spider at the center of Chicago''s web of power; a web built on a covenant with the people. They want to be led, they want disputes settled, jobs dispensed, and loyalties rewarded. If he achieves all this through deception and immorality, so be it. As long as he gets the job done, they look the other way. Yet despite being the most effective mayor in recent history, a degenerative brain disorder is ripping everything away from him. He can''t trust his memory, his closest allies, or even himself.', 'Mayor Tom Kane sits like a spider at the center of Chicago''s web of power; a web built on a covenant with the people. They want to be led, they want disputes settled, jobs dispensed, and loyalties rewarded. If he achieves all this through deception and immorality, so be it. As long as he gets the job done, they look the other way. Yet despite being the most effective mayor in recent history, a degenerative brain disorder is ripping everything away from him. He can''t trust his memory, his closest allies, or even himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foV4LJFlFaxLBqSd6Dih9HVupkj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38922'),
  ('486794387256469041', 'BOSS', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Amami, Tetsuji Tamayama, Yutaka Takenouchi, Erika Toda, Kendo Kobayashi, Junpei Mizobata, Yoichi Nukumizu, Riko Narumi', null, 'Osawa Eriko is a beautiful career woman who has just returned from training in the U.S. and is appointed as the "boss" of this division. But despite her intelligence and capabilities, she can never understand a man''s heart, so she remains unable to find a husband.', 'Osawa Eriko is a beautiful career woman who has just returned from training in the U.S. and is appointed as the "boss" of this division. But despite her intelligence and capabilities, she can never understand a man''s heart, so she remains unable to find a husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHW1WbLBKITZyImBhnp9Z3GPxk6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45884'),
  ('803214745230046182', 'Boss & Me', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gu Man', 'koo-man', 'Hans Zhang, Zhao Liying, Chengyuan Li, Huang Youming, Shi Anni, Wang Ting, Liu Yujin, Long Yiyi', null, 'A sweet, food-loving office worker whose boss secretly plans to fatten her up as a potential blood donor for his sister, but her irresistible charm and endless appetite soon win over his heart instead.', 'A sweet, food-loving office worker whose boss secretly plans to fatten her up as a potential blood donor for his sister, but her irresistible charm and endless appetite soon win over his heart instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCJhdM9CAtcZWxXrx8U2Cnm7kjW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61054'),
  ('478228425586039427', 'Bossam: Steal the Fate', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kwon Seok-jang', 'Park Chul, Kim Ji-soo', 'Jung Il-woo, Kwon Yu-ri, Shin Hyun-soo, Kim Tae-woo, Shin Dong-mi, So Hee-jung, Lee Jae-yong, Ko Dong-ha', null, 'Ba-Woo is a degenerate man. He gambles, steals, fights and will do bossam (customary remarriage procedure where a widow is kidnapped) for money. He hides his real identity. While performing a bossam, he mistakenly kidnaps Princess Hwain. She is the daughter of Prince Gwanghae and the daughter-in-law of his enemy Lee Yi-Cheom. For a secret political agreement, she married the older brother of a man she loved, but, on the day of her wedding, her husband died. She then became a widow.', 'Ba-Woo is a degenerate man. He gambles, steals, fights and will do bossam (customary remarriage procedure where a widow is kidnapped) for money. He hides his real identity. While performing a bossam, he mistakenly kidnaps Princess Hwain. She is the daughter of Prince Gwanghae and the daughter-in-law of his enemy Lee Yi-Cheom. For a secret political agreement, she married the older brother of a man she loved, but, on the day of her wedding, her husband died. She then became a widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6tKynnesWeZqjGQSJzkKz16F6E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113623'),
  ('701341758466693068', 'Boston Blue', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Brandon Margolis, Brandon Sonnier', null, 'Donnie Wahlberg, Sonequa Martin-Green, Ernie Hudson, Maggie Lawson, Gloria Reuben, Marcus Scribner, Mika Amonsen', 'TV-14', 'NYPD Detective Danny Reagan takes a job with the Boston PD and is paired with Detective Lena Silver, part of a law enforcement family comprised of District Attorney Mae Silver, Police Superintendent Sarah Silver, rookie cop Jonah Silver and Rev. Edwin Peters. Reagan hopes to reconnect with his son, Sean, in Boston.', 'NYPD Detective Danny Reagan takes a job with the Boston PD and is paired with Detective Lena Silver, part of a law enforcement family comprised of District Attorney Mae Silver, Police Superintendent Sarah Silver, rookie cop Jonah Silver and Rev. Edwin Peters. Reagan hopes to reconnect with his son, Sean, in Boston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pyxutHxpgBt8ZwbIG2TZWCW394.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284736'),
  ('145812263955890602', 'Boston Common', 1996, 'Comedy', 'David Kohan, Max Mutchnick', null, 'Anthony Clark, Hedy Burress, Traylor Howard, Tasha Smith, Steve Paymer, Vincent Ventresca', null, 'After moving to Boston from Virginia, to spy on his sister who just started college, Boyd finds himself working for the student union where he raises hell more often than he should.', 'After moving to Boston from Virginia, to spy on his sister who just started college, Boyd finds himself working for the student union where he raises hell more often than he should.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5a70wBkSRc3JSeREDAT868eLCc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:868'),
  ('799795081463474750', 'Boston Legal', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'James Spader, William Shatner, Candice Bergen, John Larroquette, Tara Summers, Christian Clemenson', 'TV-14', 'Alan Shore and Denny Crane lead a brigade of high-priced civil litigators in an upscale Boston law firm in a series focusing on the professional and personal lives of brilliant but often emotionally challenged attorneys. A spin-off of long-running series The Practice.', 'Alan Shore and Denny Crane lead a brigade of high-priced civil litigators in an upscale Boston law firm in a series focusing on the professional and personal lives of brilliant but often emotionally challenged attorneys. A spin-off of long-running series The Practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0bXUCfpcsgQ6EVVmucU2G76ixT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4598'),
  ('888289335589291119', 'Boston Public', 2000, 'Drama', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Chi McBride, Anthony Heald, Loretta Devine, Jeri Ryan, Sharon Leal, Fyvush Finkel, Michael Rapaport, Natalia Baron', 'TV-PG', 'Principal Steven Harper runs Winslow High School as best as he can while dealing with the demands of the faculty, the students and their parents.', 'Principal Steven Harper runs Winslow High School as best as he can while dealing with the demands of the faculty, the students and their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUEMfetlqwab7mOzrZIoAOGwfKi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:127'),
  ('1141177580492561943', 'Botan Kamiina Fully Blossoms When Drunk', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sayumi Suzushiro, Yoshino Aoyama, Minako Kotobuki, Yurina Amami, Miyu Tomita, Maki Kawase', null, 'Botan Kamiina is a 20-year-old college student. At the welcome party for the dorm she was assigned to, the dorm leader Ibuki gives her a highball to drink and she becomes tipsy, leading to her involvement with Ibuki from now on... A tipsy teasing girl''s comedy!', 'Botan Kamiina is a 20-year-old college student. At the welcome party for the dorm she was assigned to, the dorm leader Ibuki gives her a highball to drink and she becomes tipsy, leading to her involvement with Ibuki from now on... A tipsy teasing girl''s comedy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qIzYYAMgFdlcHYy4IfJG3VuVlq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283905'),
  ('174915131220172951', 'Botched', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Terry Dubrow, Paul Nassif', 'TV-14', 'In the multi-billion dollar world of plastic surgery, beauty is in the eye of the beholder... or is it? For some patients, their quest for ultimate perfection ends in disastrous results. World renowned doctors Paul Nassif and Terry Dubrow — the best of the best and leaders in their field — will be tasked with some of the most difficult operations of their careers when they try to reverse the effects of horrendous plastic surgeries.', 'In the multi-billion dollar world of plastic surgery, beauty is in the eye of the beholder... or is it? For some patients, their quest for ultimate perfection ends in disastrous results. World renowned doctors Paul Nassif and Terry Dubrow — the best of the best and leaders in their field — will be tasked with some of the most difficult operations of their careers when they try to reverse the effects of horrendous plastic surgeries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cP2ierZIiyH94AcpEYxnnSqMr6e.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:62317'),
  ('745724201130518847', 'Bottle Fairy', 2003, 'Comedy, Animation', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Kaori Nazuka, Yui Horie, Ai Nonaka, Kisho Taniyama, Haruko Momoi', 'TV-G', 'Bottle Fairy follows a quartet of cute fairies as they play, study, and learn (often incorrect) lessons about the human world.', 'Bottle Fairy follows a quartet of cute fairies as they play, study, and learn (often incorrect) lessons about the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgimkNaV0GAsYMlqWoDsnwWFYWg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12423'),
  ('904789829481763368', 'Bottom', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Rik Mayall, Adrian Edmondson', null, 'Adrian Edmondson, Rik Mayall', 'TV-MA', 'Richie Richard (socially awkward, sexually inexperienced) and Eddie Hitler (carefree alcoholic ) are two social outcasts living on the dole. Trapped together in a squalid flat in Hammersmith, London they are perpetually skint, bored and sexually frustrated. They spend their days scheming, bickering, and being nasty and sadistic to each other.', 'Richie Richard (socially awkward, sexually inexperienced) and Eddie Hitler (carefree alcoholic ) are two social outcasts living on the dole. Trapped together in a squalid flat in Hammersmith, London they are perpetually skint, bored and sexually frustrated. They spend their days scheming, bickering, and being nasty and sadistic to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOrajiWj3Rax8KZ4ZZWcw2KpJD6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4292'),
  ('157361278900754971', 'Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Gen Sato, Hisako Kanemoto, Ikumi Hasegawa, Ai Kayano, Ryoko Maekawa, Nene Hieda, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'TV-14', 'Tomozaki is one of the best gamers in Japan, and in his opinion, the game of real life is one of the worst. No clear-cut rules for success, horribly balanced, and nothing makes sense. But then he meets a gamer who’s just as good as him, and she offers to teach him a few exploits…', 'Tomozaki is one of the best gamers in Japan, and in his opinion, the game of real life is one of the worst. No clear-cut rules for success, horribly balanced, and nothing makes sense. But then he meets a gamer who’s just as good as him, and she offers to teach him a few exploits…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86sP2j7NdslbZywy98qPDtzgvEV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99083'),
  ('260473939292167610', 'Boulevard Bio', 1991, 'Talk', null, null, 'Alfred Biolek', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h82lDSpXvdO7vR3GKcFbQ54W63U.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:62797'),
  ('818899127672006699', 'Bound by Fate', 2025, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'İlsu Demirci, Emin Günenç, Ezgi Dalgiç, Erol Yavan, Pervin Mert, Firat Kaya, Işıl Mete, Kaan Arkat', null, 'Ateş, a man haunted by childhood scars and consumed by rage, returns to destroy the family that shattered his life years ago. His weapon is not a sword, but a marriage: 187 days with Mercan, the daughter of his enemy. Mercan, already promised to Nezir, is thrust into a battle she never chose, while Ateş binds her to him believing she is the key to his revenge. Yet the woman he intends to destroy becomes the one who threatens to undo him. And in the shadows, Aslı – driven by jealousy, seizes every chance to tear them apart.', 'Ateş, a man haunted by childhood scars and consumed by rage, returns to destroy the family that shattered his life years ago. His weapon is not a sword, but a marriage: 187 days with Mercan, the daughter of his enemy. Mercan, already promised to Nezir, is thrust into a battle she never chose, while Ateş binds her to him believing she is the key to his revenge. Yet the woman he intends to destroy becomes the one who threatens to undo him. And in the shadows, Aslı – driven by jealousy, seizes every chance to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yYZoYgeNshoS2aODwUvCXIa8yn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306118'),
  ('89001030437836579', 'Boundless', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Patxi Amezcua', 'Patxi Amezcua', 'Álvaro Morte, Rodrigo Santoro, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Carlos Cuevas, Niccolò Senni, Adrián Lastra, Pepón Nieto, Bárbara Goenaga', 'TV-MA', 'The First Circumvallation Around the World, tracking the 1519–22 voyage initiated by Ferdinand Magellan and culminated by Juan Sebastián Elcano.', 'The First Circumvallation Around the World, tracking the 1519–22 voyage initiated by Ferdinand Magellan and culminated by Juan Sebastián Elcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug4DCGWKIDMVTOFltSepD5XzUng.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128032'),
  ('678861917909939631', 'Boundless Love', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Soap', 'Bahadır Özdener', 'Bahadır Özdener', 'Deniz Can Aktaş, Miray Daner, Mehmet Korhan Fırat, Naz Çağla Irmak, Burak Sevinç, Cansın Şenel, Emre Bulut, Yaren Yapici', null, 'When he was a little child, Halil İbrahim lost his father due to a blood feud and was exiled to Istanbul. Twenty years later, he returns to his homeland in the Karadeniz region as a handsome, powerful young man. He plans to marry the girl he loves, Yasemin, and start a new life. However, events do not allow this. Halil İbrahim embarks on a journey of revenge, and his life will change completely when he encounters Zeynep from the Leto family.', 'When he was a little child, Halil İbrahim lost his father due to a blood feud and was exiled to Istanbul. Twenty years later, he returns to his homeland in the Karadeniz region as a handsome, powerful young man. He plans to marry the girl he loves, Yasemin, and start a new life. However, events do not allow this. Halil İbrahim embarks on a journey of revenge, and his life will change completely when he encounters Zeynep from the Leto family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BQSLOIvjnBzrxkXjX9R0JfHTWI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231100'),
  ('417856292911213576', 'Box 21', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mani Maserrat-Agah', null, 'Mimosa Willamo, Leonard Terfelt, Bahador Foladi, Kristofer Kamiyasu, Simon J. Berger, Cristian Bota, Edda Magnason, Sandra Andreis', null, 'Romanian Lidia is lured to Sweden, where she is locked up and prostituted. In her search for revenge, her fate is intertwined with the police officer Ewert Gren, who chases a dangerous criminal.', 'Romanian Lidia is lured to Sweden, where she is locked up and prostituted. In her search for revenge, her fate is intertwined with the police officer Ewert Gren, who chases a dangerous criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhhhYQBlaizOA7kosvBqraHX42w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98036'),
  ('703382154663681862', 'Box of Goblins', 2008, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Hiroaki Hirata, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Takaaki Seki, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'TV-MA', 'Between August and October, 1952, a series of unusual crimes takes place in Musashino and Mitaka: the attempted murder of 14-year-old Kanako Yuzuki, Kanako''s abduction from the strange research "hospital" where she was recovering, then abductions of other girls, followed by their severed limbs in custom-fitted boxes being placed in surrounding towns. News editor Morihiko Toriguchi and crime fiction writer Tatsumi Sekiguchi investigate with the help of onmyōji Akihiko Chūzenji.', 'Between August and October, 1952, a series of unusual crimes takes place in Musashino and Mitaka: the attempted murder of 14-year-old Kanako Yuzuki, Kanako''s abduction from the strange research "hospital" where she was recovering, then abductions of other girls, followed by their severed limbs in custom-fitted boxes being placed in surrounding towns. News editor Morihiko Toriguchi and crime fiction writer Tatsumi Sekiguchi investigate with the help of onmyōji Akihiko Chūzenji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNpdxX6mmogeJJJ6vDpuFwYTtCJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42960'),
  ('60414729709065238', 'Boy For Rent', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Pretty Princess', null, 'Sananthachat Thanapatpisal, Sarunchana Apisamaimongkol, Tanutchai Wijitvongtong, Thanat Lowkhunsombat, Chatchawit Techarukpong, Rutricha Phapakithi, Pinyadar Salinvarradar, Jirakit Kuariyakul', null, 'Smile has a crush on her handsome senior, Kyro, but when she confesses he refuses, telling her he doesn''t like childish girls. Smile decides to hire a "Boy For Rent" to learn how to make a man''s heart beat. Liz believes her boyfriend Badz is cheating on her, and decides to use the Boy For Rent service to get back at him without feeling guilty... Neither knows that renting a man will change their lives forever.', 'Smile has a crush on her handsome senior, Kyro, but when she confesses he refuses, telling her he doesn''t like childish girls. Smile decides to hire a "Boy For Rent" to learn how to make a man''s heart beat. Liz believes her boyfriend Badz is cheating on her, and decides to use the Boy For Rent service to get back at him without feeling guilty... Neither knows that renting a man will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYlWu7ZxnVlpQaw0bUA0xj0AQkl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89381'),
  ('404823099892051653', 'Boy Meets Girl', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'David Allison', 'David Allison', 'Martin Freeman, Rachael Stirling, Marshall Lancaster, Paterson Joseph, Angela Griffin, Peter Wight, Tamzin Malleson, Lisa Millett', null, 'Dreamer Danny Reed''s life is turned upside down when he is struck by lightning and wakes to find himself trapped in a woman''s body. Instead of being a scruffy DIY store worker with no prospects, he has now swapped lives with glamorous female fashion journalist Veronica Burton. Danny suddenly must learn how to walk in stilettos and put on a bra, deal with the amorous advances of Veronica''s boyfriend Jay and pass himself off as a fashion expert while also finding out what has happened to his old self.', 'Dreamer Danny Reed''s life is turned upside down when he is struck by lightning and wakes to find himself trapped in a woman''s body. Instead of being a scruffy DIY store worker with no prospects, he has now swapped lives with glamorous female fashion journalist Veronica Burton. Danny suddenly must learn how to walk in stilettos and put on a bra, deal with the amorous advances of Veronica''s boyfriend Jay and pass himself off as a fashion expert while also finding out what has happened to his old self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcIRdzL8YKemeoMlm6wgCqXZELg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18627'),
  ('884704365119498488', 'Boy Meets World', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'April Kelly, Michael Jacobs', null, 'Ben Savage, Rider Strong, Danielle Fishel, William Daniels, Will Friedle, Betsy Randle, William Russ, Matthew Lawrence', 'TV-G', 'The coming of age events and everyday life-lessons of Cory Matthews, a Philadelphian who grows up from a young boy to a married man.', 'The coming of age events and everyday life-lessons of Cory Matthews, a Philadelphian who grows up from a young boy to a married man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dk5702N6dlB3Mjr4w4bR6PFPln.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:1777'),
  ('91126648444789730', 'Boy Swallows Universe', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'John Collee', null, 'Phoebe Tonkin, Lee Tiger Halley', 'TV-MA', 'A young boy growing up in the suburbs of 1980s Brisbane faces the harsh realities of life — and the looming dangers that threaten his family.', 'A young boy growing up in the suburbs of 1980s Brisbane faces the harsh realities of life — and the looming dangers that threaten his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb0ek7qonE0YkyaB4dsAw5J9NoH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209332'),
  ('699440123810456602', 'Boyfriend on Demand', 2026, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Namgung Do-young, Kim Jung-sik', 'Namgung Do-young', 'JISOO, Seo In-guk, Gong Min-jeung, Cho Han-cheul', 'TV-MA', 'Seo Mi-rae is worn out by work. Love? It''s the last thing on her mind. But a virtual dating service sparks feelings — and maybe a real shot at romance.', 'Seo Mi-rae is worn out by work. Love? It''s the last thing on her mind. But a virtual dating service sparks feelings — and maybe a real shot at romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vBWQjdCnK7xSGuNbK1gBK1iIQL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281016'),
  ('164587023371286851', 'Boyhood', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Lee Myung-woo', 'Kim Jae-hwan', 'Yim Si-wan, Lee Sun-bin, Lee Si-woo, Kang Hye-won, Kim Jeong-jin, Lee Sang-jin, Kim Yoon-bae, Heo Geon-young', null, 'Jang Byeong-tae is a small and weak boy living in Onyang in South Chungcheong Province. He''s at the bottom of the school''s social ladder and when he transfers to the neighboring Buyeo Agricultural High School, he faces an unexpected incident that becomes a turning point in his life.', 'Jang Byeong-tae is a small and weak boy living in Onyang in South Chungcheong Province. He''s at the bottom of the school''s social ladder and when he transfers to the neighboring Buyeo Agricultural High School, he faces an unexpected incident that becomes a turning point in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeqV7Oy6KWQC5PnXn5FYqMxYnTC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:232812'),
  ('1121642819967124233', 'Boys Be Brave!', 2024, 'Drama', 'Seok Young', null, 'Kim Sung-hyun, Nam Shi-an, Ahn Se-min, Jung Yeo-jun, Jung Yoo-hyeon', null, 'Jin Woo doesn''t want a roommate—or to fall for one. But Ki Sub moves in anyway, turning quiet disdain into something far more complicated.', 'Jin Woo doesn''t want a roommate—or to fall for one. But Ki Sub moves in anyway, turning quiet disdain into something far more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOjX3bReDpHBijo7KgmShr1DhBJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249838'),
  ('929338243379763109', 'Boys from the Blackstuff', 1982, 'Drama', 'Alan Bleasdale', null, 'Bernard Hill, Michael Angelis, Tom Georgeson, Alan Igbon, Peter Kerrigan, Gary Bleasdale, Julie Walters, Jean Boht', null, 'Alan Bleasdale''s five-part series relates the further experiences of unemployed Liverpudlian tarmac layers Dixie, Chrissie, Loggo and Yosser, and their revered older friend, retired longshoreman and union leader, George Malone. As they struggle to make ends meet in a depressed economy, and to hold together their financially battered families, they are harrassed by the petty bureaucrats of the DHSS. But the lumbering investigational juggernaut is, both comically and tragically, guided by drivers with only a provisional license.', 'Alan Bleasdale''s five-part series relates the further experiences of unemployed Liverpudlian tarmac layers Dixie, Chrissie, Loggo and Yosser, and their revered older friend, retired longshoreman and union leader, George Malone. As they struggle to make ends meet in a depressed economy, and to hold together their financially battered families, they are harrassed by the petty bureaucrats of the DHSS. But the lumbering investigational juggernaut is, both comically and tragically, guided by drivers with only a provisional license.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhAwRMLs3R0kJoj530RNRE9Zu5s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2052'),
  ('1078132289906455948', 'Boys In Love', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Suwanun Pohgudsai', 'Peemsan Sotangkur, Metas Opas-iamkajorn, Puttipong Jitbut, Ratiphat Luengvoraphan, Kanthee Limpitkranon, Tanan Lohawatanakul, Suphakorn Sriphotong, Phromphiriya Thongputtaruk', null, 'This semester, studious Shane is tasked with tutoring feckless and flirtatious Kit. Meanwhile, just when Kim is ready to give up on love, new kid Mon arrives and it''s love at first sight.', 'This semester, studious Shane is tasked with tutoring feckless and flirtatious Kit. Meanwhile, just when Kim is ready to give up on love, new kid Mon arrives and it''s love at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNQTlxzGq6iwenWKK89qBENFrzi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278166'),
  ('1102481657862351005', 'Boys Over Flowers', 1996, 'Animation, Drama', 'Shigeyasu Yamauchi, Yoko Kamio', null, 'Maki Mochida, Naoki Miyashita, Koji Yamamoto, Rumi Shishido, Yuuta Mochizuki, Yoshihiko Akaida, Keiko Imamura, Hiroki Takahashi', null, 'Tsukushi Makino, a girl who comes from a poor family, just wants to get through her two last years at Eitoku Academy quietly. But once she makes herself known by standing up for her friend to the F4, the four most popular, powerful, and rich boys at the school, she gets the red card: F4''s way of a "Declaration of War." But when she doesn''t let herself be beaten by them and is starting to fall for one of the F4, Rui Hanazawa, she starts to see that there is more than meets the eye...', 'Tsukushi Makino, a girl who comes from a poor family, just wants to get through her two last years at Eitoku Academy quietly. But once she makes herself known by standing up for her friend to the F4, the four most popular, powerful, and rich boys at the school, she gets the red card: F4''s way of a "Declaration of War." But when she doesn''t let herself be beaten by them and is starting to fall for one of the F4, Rui Hanazawa, she starts to see that there is more than meets the eye...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJeLfIGpfs5yIApGQYYOKHEhBgQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:27757'),
  ('598631005699856753', 'Boys Over Flowers', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoon Ji-ryun, Jeon Ki-sang', null, 'Koo Hye-sun, Lee Min-ho, Kim Hyun-joong, Kim Bum, Kim Joon, Kim So-eun, Lee Hye-young, Park Ji-bin', null, 'Unassuming high school girl Jan-di stands up to — and eventually falls for — a spoiled rich kid who belongs to the school''s most powerful clique.', 'Unassuming high school girl Jan-di stands up to — and eventually falls for — a spoiled rich kid who belongs to the school''s most powerful clique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ty8uAV6ihcpw6yfYoMxTulXZRYA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16420'),
  ('1009883186666289745', 'BOYS OVER FLOWERS', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Mao Inoue, Jun Matsumoto, Shun Oguri, Shota Matsuda, Tsuyoshi Abe, Toma Ikuta, Mako Ishino, Megumi Sato', null, 'Set at a famous high school for the super-wealthy, this is a puppy love story centered on Tsukushi Makino, a poor girl, and the F4 gang of rich kids headed by the rough and fearless Prince Charming, Tsukasa Domyoji.', 'Set at a famous high school for the super-wealthy, this is a puppy love story centered on Tsukushi Makino, a poor girl, and the F4 gang of rich kids headed by the rough and fearless Prince Charming, Tsukasa Domyoji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yL9l4zJXUPq2pLqQy3MeamPgqC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17438'),
  ('616807505037899467', 'Boys Over Flowers: Season 2', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Erika Yoshida', 'Sho Hirano, Tatsuomi Hamada, Hana Sugisaki, Taishi Nakagawa, Shun Oguri, Jun Matsumoto, Mio Imada', null, 'The setting of the drama takes place 10 years after the F4 graduated from Eitoku Academy. Edogawa Oto is the daughter of a former company president. Her life completely changed after their family business went bankrupt. Her fiance is Hase Tenma, the popular student council president of the rival school. With declining enrollment due to a recession and the rise of a rival school, Eitoku Academy is now ruled by the Correct5 whose leader is Kakuragi Haruto. The group seeks out, then runs out, any students whose families haven’t made appropriate donations to the school. When Haruto and Oto discover each other’s secrets — that Haruto buys self-help items to get stronger, and that Oto is poor and works at a convenience store – they promise to keep each other’s secret.', 'The setting of the drama takes place 10 years after the F4 graduated from Eitoku Academy. Edogawa Oto is the daughter of a former company president. Her life completely changed after their family business went bankrupt. Her fiance is Hase Tenma, the popular student council president of the rival school. With declining enrollment due to a recession and the rise of a rival school, Eitoku Academy is now ruled by the Correct5 whose leader is Kakuragi Haruto. The group seeks out, then runs out, any students whose families haven’t made appropriate donations to the school. When Haruto and Oto discover each other’s secrets — that Haruto buys self-help items to get stronger, and that Oto is poor and works at a convenience store – they promise to keep each other’s secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGznocCo5wssoQgH2cADxJ5hn1s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79058'),
  ('767308352647108875', 'Braceface', 2001, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', 'Melissa Clark', null, 'Stacey DePass', 'TV-Y7', 'The show, set in Elkford, British Columbia, is based around Sharon Spitz, who is a junior high school student with braces that get in her way of leading a normal teenage life. In the first season, she is enrolled at Mary Pickford Junior High.', 'The show, set in Elkford, British Columbia, is based around Sharon Spitz, who is a junior high school student with braces that get in her way of leading a normal teenage life. In the first season, she is enrolled at Mary Pickford Junior High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95K74OfPru4LPz7EJ5PAd6uhijz.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1763'),
  ('990561466714727938', 'Brad Neely''s Harg Nallin'' Sclopio Peepio', 2016, 'Animation', 'Brad Neely', null, 'Brad Neely, Affion Crockett, Ilana Glazer, Darrell Hammond, Gabourey Sidibe', null, 'Brad Neely''s Harg Nallin'' Sclopio Peepio is an American animated television series created by Brad Neely. Formatted as a sketch comedy show, it is made up of short films and routines, with songs composed by Neely.', 'Brad Neely''s Harg Nallin'' Sclopio Peepio is an American animated television series created by Brad Neely. Formatted as a sketch comedy show, it is made up of short films and routines, with songs composed by Neely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CDvz6OVnOrmlP3mIaRfyrpQ8bs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67083'),
  ('99234496976345474', 'Brain Games', 2011, 'Documentary, Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Keegan-Michael Key, Cara Santa Maria', 'TV-G', 'Get ready to have your mind messed with! "Brain Games" is a groundbreaking series that uses interactive experiments, misdirection and tricks to demonstrate how our brains create the illusion of seamless reality through our memory, through our sensory perception, and how we focus our attention.', 'Get ready to have your mind messed with! "Brain Games" is a groundbreaking series that uses interactive experiments, misdirection and tricks to demonstrate how our brains create the illusion of seamless reality through our memory, through our sensory perception, and how we focus our attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AQXFOcF1if3hSuzrv1UqHxQzmr.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:54315'),
  ('29410142577529717', 'Brain Powerd', 1998, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Romi Park, Run Sasaki, Maria Kawamura, Kumiko Watanabe, Akino Murata, Tetsu Shiratori, Gou Aoba, Shiho Nagoshi', null, 'In a future, decimated Earth after the discovery of a mysterious, alien spacecraft dubbed "Orphan". A group of researchers scour the planet for Orphan''s disc plates using mecha called "Antibodies" in order to revive the craft, an event that would result in the utter destruction of all lifeforms on Earth. The protagonists Yu Isami and Hime Utsumiya must utilize a special Antibody called "Brain Powerd" to counter the Orphan plans and save humanity.', 'In a future, decimated Earth after the discovery of a mysterious, alien spacecraft dubbed "Orphan". A group of researchers scour the planet for Orphan''s disc plates using mecha called "Antibodies" in order to revive the craft, an event that would result in the utter destruction of all lifeforms on Earth. The protagonists Yu Isami and Hime Utsumiya must utilize a special Antibody called "Brain Powerd" to counter the Orphan plans and save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8IICj6Bl2xnLmfA8hLhWEfl2bd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20112'),
  ('43686299145332611', 'Brain Works', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Park Ki-ho', null, 'Jung Yong-hwa, Cha Tae-hyun, Kwak Sun-young, Ye Ji-won, Jeong Dong-hwan, Kim Soo-jin, Im Cheol-hyung, Woo Hyeon', null, 'Two ill-fated men become a comic duo to investigate criminal cases involving a rare brain disease together.', 'Two ill-fated men become a comic duo to investigate criminal cases involving a rare brain disease together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luUgtziwZTL2upBpMlrLFCRbyXp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206674'),
  ('425767671497999993', 'BrainDead', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Michelle King, Robert King', null, 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Danny Pino, Aaron Tveit, Tony Shalhoub, Nikki M. James, Johnny Ray Gill, Charlie Semine, Jan Maxwell', 'TV-14', 'A young fresh-faced Hill staffer gets her first job in Washington, D.C. and discovers two things: 1. The government has stopped working, and 2. alien spawn have come to earth and eaten the brains of a growing number of Congressmen and Hill staffers.', 'A young fresh-faced Hill staffer gets her first job in Washington, D.C. and discovers two things: 1. The government has stopped working, and 2. alien spawn have come to earth and eaten the brains of a growing number of Congressmen and Hill staffers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glUWJyqN9EUO2kb8rB0T1PUmiJU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64554'),
  ('878556756231863129', 'Brainiac: Science Abuse', 2003, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Stewart Morris, Andy Milligan', null, 'Vic Reeves, Jon Tickle, Thaila Zucchi', 'NR', 'Brainiac is The Alternative science series that shows you the experiments you were never allowed to do in school. Richard Hammond aims to answer the scientific questions that have been bothering us all such as what you shouldn''t put in a microwave and Do mobile phones really cause explosions in petrol stations.', 'Brainiac is The Alternative science series that shows you the experiments you were never allowed to do in school. Richard Hammond aims to answer the scientific questions that have been bothering us all such as what you shouldn''t put in a microwave and Do mobile phones really cause explosions in petrol stations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWCwlz5XdVkYwwplqImx7VXp6iQ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2614'),
  ('383767953625804917', 'BrainSurge', 2009, 'Kids', 'Scott A. Stone, Clay Newbill', null, null, null, 'Warning: Watching this show may make your brain explode. Hold on to the couch while you watch kids compete in quick-moving, mind-bending challenges. Host, Jeff Sutphen, guides the competitors through three levels of challenges. One wrong answer could mean a trip down the Brain Drain. Or a Face Wall suck. Kids who are eliminated do not leave empty-handed, but the winner gets the ultimate prize...a gigantic, messy, victory Sliming!', 'Warning: Watching this show may make your brain explode. Hold on to the couch while you watch kids compete in quick-moving, mind-bending challenges. Host, Jeff Sutphen, guides the competitors through three levels of challenges. One wrong answer could mean a trip down the Brain Drain. Or a Face Wall suck. Kids who are eliminated do not leave empty-handed, but the winner gets the ultimate prize...a gigantic, messy, victory Sliming!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsuFupIye9R1oZG8dKMCezh1hd5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:17415'),
  ('595005859492452805', 'Brand New Cherry Flavor', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lenore Zion, Nick Antosca', null, 'Rosa Salazar, Catherine Keener, Eric Lange, Jeff Ward, Manny Jacinto, Hannah Levien, Daniel Doheny, Mark Acheson', 'TV-MA', 'A filmmaker heads to Hollywood in the early ’90s to make her movie but tumbles down a hallucinatory rabbit hole of sex, magic, revenge — and kittens.', 'A filmmaker heads to Hollywood in the early ’90s to make her movie but tumbles down a hallucinatory rabbit hole of sex, magic, revenge — and kittens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cX4acZbi2l4v051NJZfonqY0E3X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129418'),
  ('867155875231141092', 'Branded', 1965, 'Western', 'Larry Cohen', null, 'Chuck Connors', 'TV-G', 'Branded is an American Western series which aired on NBC from 1965 through 1966, sponsored by Procter & Gamble in its Sunday night 8:30 p.m. Eastern Time period, and starred Chuck Connors as Jason McCord, a United States Army Cavalry captain who had been drummed out of the service following an unjust accusation of cowardice.', 'Branded is an American Western series which aired on NBC from 1965 through 1966, sponsored by Procter & Gamble in its Sunday night 8:30 p.m. Eastern Time period, and starred Chuck Connors as Jason McCord, a United States Army Cavalry captain who had been drummed out of the service following an unjust accusation of cowardice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ACpRBnhTwZzmJ7K53nCspALyw3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13818'),
  ('991344264774022980', 'Branding in Seongsu', 2024, 'Drama', 'Choi Seon-mi', 'Jeon Seon-young, Choi Seon-mi', 'Kim Ji-eun, Lomon, Yang Hye-ji, Kim Ho-young, Jung Yi-rang, Chae Soo-ah, Jeon Jun-ho, Lee Gwang-hee', null, 'A relentless marketing executive and a warm-hearted intern are always at odds with each other but everything takes a wild turn when their souls switch after an unexpected kiss.', 'A relentless marketing executive and a warm-hearted intern are always at odds with each other but everything takes a wild turn when their souls switch after an unexpected kiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9BsaOEfL6GSBjm7v47pkdXYNrs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230824'),
  ('418377947755719016', 'Brandmerk', 2025, null, null, null, 'Menen Seijkens', null, 'Instead of focusing on the sensationalism of the crime or the legal aspects, Brandmerk opts for an ethical, human approach. Through in-depth conversations and personal footage, the viewer gains a unique insight into the emotional world of these young people.', 'Instead of focusing on the sensationalism of the crime or the legal aspects, Brandmerk opts for an ethical, human approach. Through in-depth conversations and personal footage, the viewer gains a unique insight into the emotional world of these young people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS936t8ErhyUynmDoXArCJTl7Ra.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:284774'),
  ('1418813303722659', 'Brandy & Mr. Whiskers', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Russell Marcus', null, 'Kaley Cuoco, Charlie Adler, Tom Kenny, Wayne Knight, Billy West, Sherri Shepherd, Alanna Ubach, Jennifer Hale', 'TV-G', 'Brandy & Mr. Whiskers is an American animated television series about a pampered yet spunky dog and a hyperactive rabbit who get stuck in the Amazon Rainforest together. The show originally aired from August 2004 to August 2006. It was televised in the United States by Disney Channel.', 'Brandy & Mr. Whiskers is an American animated television series about a pampered yet spunky dog and a hyperactive rabbit who get stuck in the Amazon Rainforest together. The show originally aired from August 2004 to August 2006. It was televised in the United States by Disney Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58Ao40FU4uA35WUTyMcd6XdN1ns.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:618'),
  ('222393562589253111', 'Braquo', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Olivier Marchal', null, 'Joseph Malerba, Karole Rocher, Alain Figlarz, Geoffroy Thiébaut, Samuel Le Bihan, Pascal Elso, Lou Bonetti', 'TV-MA', 'A group of police officers in Paris use violence and intimidation to solve crimes.', 'A group of police officers in Paris use violence and intimidation to solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thnPdAYdizRKrhfQFNNxrmjZvTp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:37363'),
  ('112535730413738725', 'Brass Eye', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Chris Morris', 'Chris Morris', 'Chris Morris, Mark Heap', null, 'Investigative reporter Chris Morris puts modern Britain under the spotlight, and smacks the issues of the day till they bleed. He tackles weighty issues including animals, drugs, sex and skewered celebrities and politicians alike - and in a later episode in 2001, paedophiles.', 'Investigative reporter Chris Morris puts modern Britain under the spotlight, and smacks the issues of the day till they bleed. He tackles weighty issues including animals, drugs, sex and skewered celebrities and politicians alike - and in a later episode in 2001, paedophiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCWMA285aPbdQ8x9ZcqSolOzUoo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63'),
  ('565367186321636585', 'Brassic', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Daniel Brocklehurst, Joseph Gilgun', null, 'Joseph Gilgun, Michelle Keegan, Steve Evets, Tom Hanson, Aaron Heffernan, Parth Thakerar, Ryan Sampson, Dominic West', 'TV-MA', 'A group of working-class friends finding unconventional ways to win at life in suburban northern England. These lads have dealt, scammed, bribed and conned their way through adolescence, but now, their dealing and stealing is catching up with them and a whole load of trouble is heading their way.', 'A group of working-class friends finding unconventional ways to win at life in suburban northern England. These lads have dealt, scammed, bribed and conned their way through adolescence, but now, their dealing and stealing is catching up with them and a whole load of trouble is heading their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnIq3yiLMZJpaJyRs8FNV7WJs6V.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:92621'),
  ('908445509151194683', 'Braunschlag', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'David Schalko', 'Robert Palfrader, Maria Hofstätter, Nicholas Ofczarek, Nina Proll, Manuel Rubey, Simon Schwarz, Sabrina Reiter, Christopher Schärf', null, 'To save his town Braunschlag from bankruptcy, the mayor decides to fake a Marian apparition. This black-humored farce revolves around greed, corruption, churchianity and alcohol.', 'To save his town Braunschlag from bankruptcy, the mayor decides to fake a Marian apparition. This black-humored farce revolves around greed, corruption, churchianity and alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jre6pjAGc10l1r5ORUhN1akKZA2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43879'),
  ('842425234760715003', 'Brava Gente', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Guel Arraes', 'Álvaro Ramos, Rosane Lima, João Bethencourt', null, null, 'Brava Gente was a television series aired by TV Globo in Brazil between 2000 and 2003, initially as a special year-end. The program was adapted from stories and national stories, and plays by famous playwrights, screenwriters and signed by a number represented by several actors and actresses. The genres of the stories varied each week with the style of each director or author. Brava Gente in the stories ranged from comedies and dramas. In all 53 episodes were shown, broadcast on Tuesday nights.', 'Brava Gente was a television series aired by TV Globo in Brazil between 2000 and 2003, initially as a special year-end. The program was adapted from stories and national stories, and plays by famous playwrights, screenwriters and signed by a number represented by several actors and actresses. The genres of the stories varied each week with the style of each director or author. Brava Gente in the stories ranged from comedies and dramas. In all 53 episodes were shown, broadcast on Tuesday nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijXzQoeRvgnUboHd0YDK55LD9s0.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:45041'),
  ('979310172018852370', 'Bravas', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Audri Nix, Nohemy Águila, Amanda Antonella, Liz Dieppa', 'NR', 'BRAVAS is a new eight episode drama series inspired by Latin urban music that follows three friends, Mila, Roja and Ashley, who seek to find their place in the world - at whatever cost.', 'BRAVAS is a new eight episode drama series inspired by Latin urban music that follows three friends, Mila, Roja and Ashley, who seek to find their place in the world - at whatever cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajWQL7jS5dWW8oHztUy7KM2kCcK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117974'),
  ('682822702550500442', 'Brave 10', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Mamiko Ikeda', 'Rina Sato, Daisuke Ono, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Tetsuya Kakihara, Hiroshi Kamiya, Motoki Takagi, Yuu Asakawa, Izumi Kitta', null, 'Brave 10 is a manga series by Kairi Shimotsuki, serialized in Media Factory''s Comic Flapper from 2007 to 2010. The series was resumed on June 15, 2011 and retitled Brave 10 Spiral, better known as Brave 10 S, serialized in Monthly Comic Gene. An anime adaptation by Studio Sakimakura and TMS Entertainment began airing on January 8, 2012. The original manga series is licensed by Tokyopop, though no volumes have been released as of 2012. The series is based on the legendary Sanada Ten Braves, a group of ninja that assisted warlord Sanada Yukimura during the Sengoku period of Japan. The series had been licensed for streaming on Crunchyroll.', 'Brave 10 is a manga series by Kairi Shimotsuki, serialized in Media Factory''s Comic Flapper from 2007 to 2010. The series was resumed on June 15, 2011 and retitled Brave 10 Spiral, better known as Brave 10 S, serialized in Monthly Comic Gene. An anime adaptation by Studio Sakimakura and TMS Entertainment began airing on January 8, 2012. The original manga series is licensed by Tokyopop, though no volumes have been released as of 2012. The series is based on the legendary Sanada Ten Braves, a group of ninja that assisted warlord Sanada Yukimura during the Sengoku period of Japan. The series had been licensed for streaming on Crunchyroll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCzjlnQhPoVLaB6iXyJK28BjAIj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42502'),
  ('16564252430913050', 'Brave and Beautiful', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ece Yörenç', 'Ece Yörenç, Elif Usman', 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Tuba Büyüküstün, Tamer Levent, Erkan Avcı, Serkan Altunorak, Sezin Akbaşoğulları, Fırat Altunmeşe, Irmak Örnek', 'NR', 'Tahsin is head of the Korludag family, his wealth and great influence in society makes him feared and respected by everyone. There isn’t a place or person in town that he does not control. Tahsin has two children; his son Korhan is a big disappointment to his father, but Sühan, his smart and beautiful daughter, he loves dearly. Korhan’s wife is without success trying to get pregnant. As she fears that Sühan will deliver an heir to the family fortune before herself, she tries to kill her sister-in-law. However, her evil plans are spoiled when a handsome stranger enters the story, saving Sühan''s life, becoming her lover and taking his place as the son Tahsin always dreamt of. But what no one knows is that revenge runs in this stranger’s veins and it is no coincidence that he showed up when he did. Will his love for Sühan stop him going ahead with his plan to get vengeance on Tahsin or is it all part of his master plan…?', 'Tahsin is head of the Korludag family, his wealth and great influence in society makes him feared and respected by everyone. There isn’t a place or person in town that he does not control. Tahsin has two children; his son Korhan is a big disappointment to his father, but Sühan, his smart and beautiful daughter, he loves dearly. Korhan’s wife is without success trying to get pregnant. As she fears that Sühan will deliver an heir to the family fortune before herself, she tries to kill her sister-in-law. However, her evil plans are spoiled when a handsome stranger enters the story, saving Sühan''s life, becoming her lover and taking his place as the son Tahsin always dreamt of. But what no one knows is that revenge runs in this stranger’s veins and it is no coincidence that he showed up when he did. Will his love for Sühan stop him going ahead with his plan to get vengeance on Tahsin or is it all part of his master plan…?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcgAtV22GsMxYKKsvHcJ4BlsiEv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68848'),
  ('1146651934529083570', 'Brave Bang Bravern!', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Yohei Azakami, Kenichi Suzumura, Saya Aizawa, Yume Miyamoto, Ai Kakuma, Kaori Maeda, Yukiyo Fujii', 'TV-14', 'In the future, humanity wages war with giant humanoid weapons called Titanostrides. Isami Ao of the Japan Ground Self-Defense Force and Lewis Smith of the United States Marine Corps meet on the battlefield in Oahu, Hawaii. An enemy aircraft attacks, scattering their forces. To survive the battle and save their friends, unlikely comrades must find the courage to defeat this new threat.', 'In the future, humanity wages war with giant humanoid weapons called Titanostrides. Isami Ao of the Japan Ground Self-Defense Force and Lewis Smith of the United States Marine Corps meet on the battlefield in Oahu, Hawaii. An enemy aircraft attacks, scattering their forces. To survive the battle and save their friends, unlikely comrades must find the courage to defeat this new threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1VNaNW6myz6jNUuqyF6GI0bNZk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238846'),
  ('400973735719437060', 'Brave Command Dagwon', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Koichi Tochika, Takehito Koyasu, Jin Yamanoi, Hiro Yuuki, Atsushi Kisaichi, Miki Nagasawa, Nao Nagasawa', null, 'Brave Command Dagwon is a Japanese anime series begun in 1996, created by Takara and Sunrise under the direction of Tomomi Mochizuki (who also did screenplay for the show) and was the seventh and penultimate entry in the Brave (Yūsha) franchise.', 'Brave Command Dagwon is a Japanese anime series begun in 1996, created by Takara and Sunrise under the direction of Tomomi Mochizuki (who also did screenplay for the show) and was the seventh and penultimate entry in the Brave (Yūsha) franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ6tcad3zjPbhf55Y8VFOVsgxhn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98561'),
  ('336050208146203101', 'Brave Express Might Gaine', 1993, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, 'Takao Koyama', 'Nobuyuki Hiyama, Daiki Nakamura, Akiko Yajima, Masami Kikuchi, Kazuhiko Kishino, Yuri Amano, Masaharu Sato, Yu Shimaka', null, 'Maito Senpuuji is a billionaire crime-fighting teenager, taking up his father''s company and assets at the age of only 15. Taking control of the Might Gaine team of robots that his late father created, Senpuuji and his free-thinking robot teams take on the crime lords that plague Nouvelle Tokyo City.', 'Maito Senpuuji is a billionaire crime-fighting teenager, taking up his father''s company and assets at the age of only 15. Taking control of the Might Gaine team of robots that his late father created, Senpuuji and his free-thinking robot teams take on the crime lords that plague Nouvelle Tokyo City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2jRkHxLpbIveSdozwxCYvLtvPW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101717'),
  ('186389484452976311', 'Brave Heart', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, 'Wei Fenghua, Guo Jingyu', 'Yang Zhigang, Johnny Kou, Zhang Zijian, Darren Chiu, He Hua, Yang Kun, Ni Hongjie, Wang Zhen', 'TV-14', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBAIEQ7wnBUFE7mDdu3kZI3pyhq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100676'),
  ('522628417605064380', 'Brave New World', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David Wiener, Grant Morrison, Brian Taylor', null, 'Alden Ehrenreich, Jessica Brown Findlay, Harry Lloyd, Kylie Bunbury, Hannah John-Kamen, Sen Mitsuji, Joseph Morgan, Nina Sosanya', 'TV-MA', 'In a utopia whose perfection hinges upon control of monogamy and privacy, members of the collective begin to question the rules, putting their regimented society on a collision course with forbidden love and revolution.', 'In a utopia whose perfection hinges upon control of monogamy and privacy, members of the collective begin to question the rules, putting their regimented society on a collision course with forbidden love and revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPl7hAY0vt0OPhIflRb5IXrssBv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93289'),
  ('273772604125472273', 'Brave Police J-Decker', 1994, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiromi Ishikawa, Toru Furusawa, Michiko Neya, Etsuko Ishikawa, Fumihiko Tachiki, Hiro Yuuki, Mitsuaki Hoshino, Naoki Makishima', null, 'Brave Police J-Decker is the fifth series of the anime television meta Brave series which aired in Japan during 1994 and 1995. Brave Police J-Decker returns the series to a subtly lighter tone, focusing more on the concept of "robot as human-built AI construct" emphasized by the previous season''s series, The Brave Express Might Gaine. The series takes place in the fictional city of Nanamagari City.', 'Brave Police J-Decker is the fifth series of the anime television meta Brave series which aired in Japan during 1994 and 1995. Brave Police J-Decker returns the series to a subtly lighter tone, focusing more on the concept of "robot as human-built AI construct" emphasized by the previous season''s series, The Brave Express Might Gaine. The series takes place in the fictional city of Nanamagari City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBhaRPyLfX5MUcXlJGUt4ACspFz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17691'),
  ('92024561099467670', 'Brave Witches', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ai Kakuma', null, 'The Neuroi, an enemy of mankind, suddenly appeared mainly in Europe in the 1930s. Only girls with special magical powers called Witches could confront the Neuroi who were difficult to destroy with ordinary weapons. In 1944, the Neuroi nest above the republic of Gallia was eradicated, and safety of western Europe has been ensured. The allied forces earnestly began planning for an oppositional operation towards central and eastern Europe. An order to scramble is given to the 502nd Joint Fighter Wing "Brave Witches" whose base is in Peterburg within the Orussian Empire.', 'The Neuroi, an enemy of mankind, suddenly appeared mainly in Europe in the 1930s. Only girls with special magical powers called Witches could confront the Neuroi who were difficult to destroy with ordinary weapons. In 1944, the Neuroi nest above the republic of Gallia was eradicated, and safety of western Europe has been ensured. The allied forces earnestly began planning for an oppositional operation towards central and eastern Europe. An order to scramble is given to the 502nd Joint Fighter Wing "Brave Witches" whose base is in Peterburg within the Orussian Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBhdfjoT8Co0ogfjuKSQgLrcaTy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68102'),
  ('694278918755709515', 'Brave Woman', 2012, 'Soap, Drama, Romance', 'Glória Perez', 'Glória Perez', 'Nanda Costa, Rodrigo Lombardi, Cláudia Raia, Totia Meireles, Giovanna Antonelli, Alexandre Nero, Cleo, Domingos Montagner', null, 'A moving tale of courage and resilience in the struggle for freedom – this is the role that life has cast for headstrong Morena in Brave Woman. Raised in a poor neighborhood in the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro, this tough and humble woman will spare no effort to protect her family and gain her independence.', 'A moving tale of courage and resilience in the struggle for freedom – this is the role that life has cast for headstrong Morena in Brave Woman. Raised in a poor neighborhood in the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro, this tough and humble woman will spare no effort to protect her family and gain her independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehbB6L0gMU2ILJCScO2036crfEw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46126'),
  ('410948004525326465', 'Bravest Warriors', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Family', 'Pendleton Ward', null, 'Liliana Mumy, Ian Jones-Quartey, John Omohundro, Breehn Burns, Sam Lavagnino, Michael-Leon Wooley, Tara Strong, Graeme Jokic', 'NR', 'In the year 3085, Chris, Beth, Wallow and Danny, four teenage heroes-for-hire, warp through the universe to save adorable aliens and their worlds using the power of their emotions.', 'In the year 3085, Chris, Beth, Wallow and Danny, four teenage heroes-for-hire, warp through the universe to save adorable aliens and their worlds using the power of their emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Fjkjr3m6cLB8PKtZOooE3D9Dg8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60877'),
  ('582912653626777728', 'BraveStarr', 1987, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Peter Locke, Donald Kushner', null, 'Pat Fraley, Charlie Adler, Alan Oppenheimer, Susan Blu, Ed Gilbert, Lou Scheimer, Erika Scheimer', null, 'On the planet New Texas, people live in futuristic conditions reminiscent of the Wild West. Here, Marshall Bravestarr fights for justice and righteousness with his supernatural abilities.', 'On the planet New Texas, people live in futuristic conditions reminiscent of the Wild West. Here, Marshall Bravestarr fights for justice and righteousness with his supernatural abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNDqyAhOFNplKQNbTqYshdj5tpX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5172'),
  ('306704519390671652', 'Bravo 650', 2024, 'Reality', null, '杨奕, 李迪', 'Silence Wang, Xu Zhisheng, Li Xueqin, Jackie Li', null, 'The Social Squad 650 (Wang Sulong, Xu Zhisheng, Li Xueqin, Li Jiaqi) has established the "Big Face" team-building company, taking on various briefs within the industry. They utilize the most imaginative, humorous, and impactful group styles to creatively engage in activities, aiming to create a team-building hub in the entertainment industry. If you can''t imagine it, don''t worry - 650 can make it happen!', 'The Social Squad 650 (Wang Sulong, Xu Zhisheng, Li Xueqin, Li Jiaqi) has established the "Big Face" team-building company, taking on various briefs within the industry. They utilize the most imaginative, humorous, and impactful group styles to creatively engage in activities, aiming to create a team-building hub in the entertainment industry. If you can''t imagine it, don''t worry - 650 can make it happen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAa3ch1VqvwaDJjBMkzvqTEpVBD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271971'),
  ('734762830507809661', 'Brawn: The Impossible Formula 1 Story', 2023, 'Documentary', null, 'Simon Hammerson', 'Keanu Reeves, Jenson Button, Ross Brawn, Rubens Barrichello, Christian Horner, Martin Brundle, Mark Webber, Ted Kravitz', 'TV-MA', 'Keanu Reeves tells one of the greatest sagas in Formula 1 history. Through the insights of Ross Brawn and revered racing icons like Jenson Button and Rubens Barrichello, all is revealed in this gripping four-part series. From the formation of Brawn GP see their remarkable journey through strategic manoeuvres and financial trials during an exceptionally competitive era in the annals of the sport.', 'Keanu Reeves tells one of the greatest sagas in Formula 1 history. Through the insights of Ross Brawn and revered racing icons like Jenson Button and Rubens Barrichello, all is revealed in this gripping four-part series. From the formation of Brawn GP see their remarkable journey through strategic manoeuvres and financial trials during an exceptionally competitive era in the annals of the sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwBvRnL5cZb942oxwzC9OhmXK9d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233254'),
  ('104665456298051583', 'Braxton Family Values', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, 'Toni Braxton, Traci Braxton, Tamar Braxton, Towanda Braxton, Trina Braxton, Evelyn Braxton', 'TV-14', 'Like their famous sister Toni Braxton, Traci, Towanda, Trina and Tamar were all blessed with the gift of song and shared that gift as a group called "The Braxtons," managed by their mom Evelyn. Now, after battling debilitating illnesses that left her out of the spotlight, Toni Braxton is now fighting her way back to the top. She enlists the help of her sisters, but the drama they bring proves to be too much at times.', 'Like their famous sister Toni Braxton, Traci, Towanda, Trina and Tamar were all blessed with the gift of song and shared that gift as a group called "The Braxtons," managed by their mom Evelyn. Now, after battling debilitating illnesses that left her out of the spotlight, Toni Braxton is now fighting her way back to the top. She enlists the help of her sisters, but the drama they bring proves to be too much at times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEvOwtfoyTcrRqznPFZix7b9sSn.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39103'),
  ('432930176675816708', 'Brazil Avenue', 2012, 'Soap, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Márcia Prates, Antonio Prata', 'Débora Falabella, Adriana Esteves, Murilo Benício, Cauã Reymond, Marcello Novaes, Vera Holtz, José de Abreu, Eliane Giardini', null, 'Brazil Avenue is a dynamic, lifelike, and modern telenovela that reveals how unrelenting ambition and inflicted cruelty can change a young girl’s destiny and lead her to seek revenge.', 'Brazil Avenue is a dynamic, lifelike, and modern telenovela that reveals how unrelenting ambition and inflicted cruelty can change a young girl’s destiny and lead her to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wH4kZ0hdoizAcgqCgp3gUD1fFq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45815'),
  ('627842260777629253', 'Brazil with Michael Palin', 2012, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Michael Palin', null, 'Brazil with Michael Palin is a travel documentary series by Michael Palin consisting of four episodes. Palin, had never been to Brazil which, in the 21st century, has become a global player with a booming economy bringing massive social changes to this once-sleeping giant which, as the fifth largest country, is as big as some continents.', 'Brazil with Michael Palin is a travel documentary series by Michael Palin consisting of four episodes. Palin, had never been to Brazil which, in the 21st century, has become a global player with a booming economy bringing massive social changes to this once-sleeping giant which, as the fifth largest country, is as big as some continents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69Q0Mu9LI8pzdKA2BPhd9vqICjL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44181'),
  ('852614896239639801', 'Bread', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Carla Lane', null, 'Jean Boht, Bryan Murray, Graham Bickley, Nick Conway, Jonathon Morris, Deborah Grant, Kenneth Waller, Melanie Hill', null, 'Bread is a British television sitcom, written by Carla Lane, produced by the BBC and screened on BBC1 from 1 May 1986 to 3 November 1991. The series focused on the devoutly-Catholic and extended Boswell family of Liverpool, in the district of Dingle, led by its matriarch Nellie through a number of ups and downs as they tried to make their way through life in Thatcher''s Britain with no visible means of support. The street shown at the start of each programme is Elswick Street. A family called Boswell had also featured in Lane''s earlier sitcom The Liver Birds and Lane admitted in interviews that the two families were probably related. Nellie''s feckless and estranged husband, Freddie, left her for another woman known as ''Lilo Lill''. Her children Joey, Jack, Adrian, Aveline and Billy continued to live in the family home in Kelsall Street and contributed money to the central family fund, largely through benefit fraud and the sale of stolen goods.', 'Bread is a British television sitcom, written by Carla Lane, produced by the BBC and screened on BBC1 from 1 May 1986 to 3 November 1991. The series focused on the devoutly-Catholic and extended Boswell family of Liverpool, in the district of Dingle, led by its matriarch Nellie through a number of ups and downs as they tried to make their way through life in Thatcher''s Britain with no visible means of support. The street shown at the start of each programme is Elswick Street. A family called Boswell had also featured in Lane''s earlier sitcom The Liver Birds and Lane admitted in interviews that the two families were probably related. Nellie''s feckless and estranged husband, Freddie, left her for another woman known as ''Lilo Lill''. Her children Joey, Jack, Adrian, Aveline and Billy continued to live in the family home in Kelsall Street and contributed money to the central family fund, largely through benefit fraud and the sale of stolen goods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUDoYVLJralNogkkIFlChMhjtJn.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:11563'),
  ('129286771422673611', 'Breadwinners', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Steve Borst, Gary Doodles', null, 'Robbie Daymond, Eric Bauza, Alexander Polinsky, Fred Tatasciore, Kari Wahlgren, S. Scott Bullock, Audrey Wasilewski, Nolan North', 'TV-PG', 'Two ducks fly around in a rocket-powered van, delivering bread to other ducks in Pondgea.', 'Two ducks fly around in a rocket-powered van, delivering bread to other ducks in Pondgea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOWAf4jeNPQX2JLMdJ3T1ad1kqR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:27318'),
  ('647002707442622882', 'BREAK IT ALL: The History of Rock in Latin America', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Nicolás Entel', 'Nicolás Gueilburt, Nicolás Entel', 'Gustavo Santaolalla, Rubén Albarrán, Fito Páez, Andrea Echeverri, Andrés Calamaro, Charly García, Alex Lora, Billy Bond', 'TV-MA', 'Soda Stereo, Café Tacvba, Aterciopelados and others figure in this 50-year history of Latin American rock through dictatorships, disasters and dissent.', 'Soda Stereo, Café Tacvba, Aterciopelados and others figure in this 50-year history of Latin American rock through dictatorships, disasters and dissent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFGKNC0szIkbfpUb1VRUwI4mPCj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114404'),
