  ('28142004307214256', 'Brideshead Revisited', 1981, 'Drama', 'Derek Granger', null, 'Jeremy Irons, Diana Quick', null, 'Agnostic Charles Ryder is seduced by the allure of the Flytes, a wealthy aristocratic family. Although he finds himself at odds with their strong Catholicism, his ties to the family deepen for the decades between the two world wars.', 'Agnostic Charles Ryder is seduced by the allure of the Flytes, a wealthy aristocratic family. Although he finds himself at odds with their strong Catholicism, his ties to the family deepen for the decades between the two world wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cW8q58wK151DdpbT0Zlt42G5JVF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4951'),
