  ('879308145808897375', 'Britain''s Got Talent', 2007, 'Reality', 'Ken Warwick, Simon Cowell', null, 'Simon Cowell, Amanda Holden, Alesha Dixon, Declan Donnelly, Anthony McPartlin, KSI', null, 'Britain''s best (and worst) variety acts compete to win a spot at the Royal Variety Show.', 'Britain''s best (and worst) variety acts compete to win a spot at the Royal Variety Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWzxYJz1OfwoXwCPxanloNIz5LS.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:11370'),
