  ('737310175944482201', 'Britain''s Most Evil Killers', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Geoffrey Wansell, Elizabeth Yardley, Fred Dinenage', 'TV-14', 'The smiling parents, the respectable groom, the helpful official... all with evil inside. Britain''s Most Evil Killers explores the crimes of Britain''s most brutal killers.', 'The smiling parents, the respectable groom, the helpful official... all with evil inside. Britain''s Most Evil Killers explores the crimes of Britain''s most brutal killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CKBjfdlMJt6rVdpa1PEgX3rT5N.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:85224'),
  ('963031207656700322', 'Britannia', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jez Butterworth, Tom Butterworth, James Richardson', null, 'Kelly Reilly, David Morrissey, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Zoë Wanamaker, Stanley Weber, Eleanor Worthington-Cox, Hugo Speer, Annabel Scholey', 'TV-MA', 'An epic drama set in 43AD as the Roman Imperial Army – determined and terrified in equal measure - returns to crush the Celtic heart of Britannia - a mysterious land ruled by warrior women and powerful druids who can channel the powerful forces of the underworld. Or so they say.', 'An epic drama set in 43AD as the Roman Imperial Army – determined and terrified in equal measure - returns to crush the Celtic heart of Britannia - a mysterious land ruled by warrior women and powerful druids who can channel the powerful forces of the underworld. Or so they say.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjdXymXAas9NSehc6GCOHQcEM05.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:70484'),
  ('168087586900974511', 'Britney', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Charly Clive, Ellen Robertson', null, 'Charly Clive, Ellen Robertson', null, 'After living thousands of miles apart, Charly and Ellen are reunited. But they are not as inseparable as Ellen had hoped, and some big news puts their friendship to an even greater test.', 'After living thousands of miles apart, Charly and Ellen are reunited. But they are not as inseparable as Ellen had hoped, and some big news puts their friendship to an even greater test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE1fH6IB5kZAthByyyystaqSqOX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156458'),
  ('762484640013033357', 'Broad City', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ilana Glazer, Abbi Jacobson', null, 'Abbi Jacobson, Ilana Glazer', 'TV-14', 'Broad City follows two women throughout their daily lives in New York City, making the smallest and mundane events hysterical and disturbing to watch all at the same time.', 'Broad City follows two women throughout their daily lives in New York City, making the smallest and mundane events hysterical and disturbing to watch all at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRu9zQFdWHjEVyHwnIYqm0LRoKA.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:60839'),
  ('1081513550080205102', 'Broadcast Life', 2000, 'Soap', null, null, 'Cheung Tat-Ming, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Elle Choi, Yang Yu, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Lau Cheuk-Kei, Tavia Yeung', null, 'Argumentative, sarcastic and smart girl, KUNG MING LI (CHAN SUK LAN, SHELLA) is invited to join the radio station FM701. There she meets CHANG KWOK PO (CHEUNG TAT MING) and YU TAK LUK (KOK TAK CHIU, VINCENT) who have embarrassed and humiliated her before. PO is very smart but a bit sneaky, so he only has a small post in the station. He and LUK together form a partnership, named ‘Traffic Marios’, and report the traffic news. LUK is honest and simple-minded. He is sometimes friendly but occasionally unpleasant towards PO. LI is asked to work with PO and LUK for a new show. She quite often yells at and teases them for revenge. These ‘Marios’ of course will not let her beat them and fight back when the time is right. The three of them quarrel with each other leading to lots of hilarious jokes...', 'Argumentative, sarcastic and smart girl, KUNG MING LI (CHAN SUK LAN, SHELLA) is invited to join the radio station FM701. There she meets CHANG KWOK PO (CHEUNG TAT MING) and YU TAK LUK (KOK TAK CHIU, VINCENT) who have embarrassed and humiliated her before. PO is very smart but a bit sneaky, so he only has a small post in the station. He and LUK together form a partnership, named ‘Traffic Marios’, and report the traffic news. LUK is honest and simple-minded. He is sometimes friendly but occasionally unpleasant towards PO. LI is asked to work with PO and LUK for a new show. She quite often yells at and teases them for revenge. These ‘Marios’ of course will not let her beat them and fight back when the time is right. The three of them quarrel with each other leading to lots of hilarious jokes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGB8bgftc1KCL6D5OC3h5z0YYqB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209576'),
  ('174560047673718997', 'Broadchurch', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Chris Chibnall', 'Chris Chibnall, Louise Fox', 'David Tennant, Olivia Colman, Julie Hesmondhalgh, Mark Bazeley, Lenny Henry, Sebastian Armesto, Georgina Campbell, Sarah Parish', 'TV-MA', 'The murder of a young boy in a small coastal town brings a media frenzy, which threatens to tear the community apart.', 'The murder of a young boy in a small coastal town brings a media frenzy, which threatens to tear the community apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NhBFUTg5KVBmGwafxtLwVdsqrr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1427'),
  ('855240897123413080', 'Brockmire', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Hank Azaria', 'Hank Azaria, Amanda Peet, Reina Hardesty', 'TV-MA', 'A famed major league baseball announcer who suffers an embarrassing and very public meltdown live on the air after discovering his beloved wife''s serial infidelity decides to reclaim his career and love life in a small town a decade later.', 'A famed major league baseball announcer who suffers an embarrassing and very public meltdown live on the air after discovering his beloved wife''s serial infidelity decides to reclaim his career and love life in a small town a decade later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qt3pvbEqIhCI2pBCAPES0v8zP3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70964'),
  ('346534642868975604', 'Brødrene Dal og legenden om Atlant-is', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Trond Kirkvaag, Lars Mjøen, Knut Lystad', 'Knut Lystad, Trond Kirkvaag, Bjørn Sundquist, Hilde Lyrån, Nils Ole Oftebro, Øyvind Johannesen, Lars Mjøen, Ingor Ânnte Âilu Gaup', null, 'In 2002, Milla Weber’s infant son was abducted in Juárez. Desperate, she founded the “Finders” to locate missing people along the US–Mexico border. Years later, on a night search, she spots one of her son’s kidnappers and teams with outlaw James Díaz. As they unravel a child-smuggling ring turned organ-trafficking network, Milla and Díaz become the criminals’ next targets.', 'In 2002, Milla Weber’s infant son was abducted in Juárez. Desperate, she founded the “Finders” to locate missing people along the US–Mexico border. Years later, on a night search, she spots one of her son’s kidnappers and teams with outlaw James Díaz. As they unravel a child-smuggling ring turned organ-trafficking network, Milla and Díaz become the criminals’ next targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XOFkrKcxOpt7Rtws8yOibJFglv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38655'),
  ('1076382474367387872', 'Brødrene Dal og mysteriet om Karl XIIs gamasjer', 2005, 'Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Lars Mjøen, Trond Kirkvaag, Tom Mathisen, Knut Lystad, Åsleik Engmark, Johannes Joner', null, 'On a dark and stormy night, the Dal Brothers are summoned to the King. He needs their help, for the future of the nation hangs in the balance. In the old 1905 Union Treaty with Sweden, the Swedes slipped in a seemingly insignificant clause: within 100 years, Norway must return King Charles XII’s gaiters, left behind at Fredriksten Fortress when he died there in 1718, or else the dissolution of the Union would be invalid. Now, just before the centenary of that dissolution, it turns out the gaiters were never returned, and, worse still, they’ve vanished without a trace.', 'On a dark and stormy night, the Dal Brothers are summoned to the King. He needs their help, for the future of the nation hangs in the balance. In the old 1905 Union Treaty with Sweden, the Swedes slipped in a seemingly insignificant clause: within 100 years, Norway must return King Charles XII’s gaiters, left behind at Fredriksten Fortress when he died there in 1718, or else the dissolution of the Union would be invalid. Now, just before the centenary of that dissolution, it turns out the gaiters were never returned, and, worse still, they’ve vanished without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EzVmYRlxAkR1uckNUmLi1cWZaQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38661'),
  ('220141743622384905', 'Brødrene Dal og Spektralsteinene', 1982, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Trond Kirkvaag, Lars Mjøen, Knut Lystad', 'Trond Kirkvaag, Knut Lystad, Lars Mjøen, Tom Mathisen, Arne Bang-Hansen, Torkjell Berulfsen, Nils Ole Oftebro', null, 'While digging for a meteor fragment containing Curium 82, a substance that can cure the common cold, the three brothers Dal finds a shining, diamond-like stone. Later, Roms Dal is visited by an alien in a space ship, and receives a ring containing blueprints to an unknown machine. The brothers decide to build the contraption, hoping to find out what it does. When Roms accidentaly triggers its mechanism using the stone, they are off on an exciting time-traveling adventure.', 'While digging for a meteor fragment containing Curium 82, a substance that can cure the common cold, the three brothers Dal finds a shining, diamond-like stone. Later, Roms Dal is visited by an alien in a space ship, and receives a ring containing blueprints to an unknown machine. The brothers decide to build the contraption, hoping to find out what it does. When Roms accidentaly triggers its mechanism using the stone, they are off on an exciting time-traveling adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4u1l7wqbFBR4tMtMQyuCKchDHp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38646'),
  ('522699561671821831', 'Broke', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Alex Herschlag', 'Aaron Izek, Jenna Martin, Cindy Caponera', 'Pauley Perrette, Jaime Camil, Izzy Diaz, Natasha Leggero, Antonio Raul Garcia, Kyle Bornheimer', 'TV-PG', 'Single suburban mother Jackie is shocked when her estranged sister, Elizabeth, her sister''s outrageously wealthy, big-hearted husband, Javier, and Javier''s fiercely loyal assistant/driver/friend land on her doorstep in need of a place to live after the couple''s money dries up.', 'Single suburban mother Jackie is shocked when her estranged sister, Elizabeth, her sister''s outrageously wealthy, big-hearted husband, Javier, and Javier''s fiercely loyal assistant/driver/friend land on her doorstep in need of a place to live after the couple''s money dries up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5im3hm58kN4M2bKZgXz8ZvFuRlh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97558'),
  ('427942938548711356', 'Broken', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sean Bean, Anna Friel, Paula Malcomson, Adrian Dunbar, Muna Otaru, Mark Stanley, Aisling Loftus, Lauren Lyle', 'TV-MA', 'Father Michael, a Catholic priest presiding over a Northern urban parish, who is modern, maverick, and reassuringly flawed, must be confidante, counselor and confessor to a congregation struggling to reconcile its beliefs with the challenges of daily life.', 'Father Michael, a Catholic priest presiding over a Northern urban parish, who is modern, maverick, and reassuringly flawed, must be confidante, counselor and confessor to a congregation struggling to reconcile its beliefs with the challenges of daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvwcRQiE7aanggwKgwj9T3x4pdt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71705'),
  ('413768634596813404', 'Broken', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Sarah Holm Johansen, Steve Rivo', null, 'Jenise Morgan', null, 'This investigative docuseries shows how negligence and deceit in the production and marketing of popular consumer items can result in dire outcomes.', 'This investigative docuseries shows how negligence and deceit in the production and marketing of popular consumer items can result in dire outcomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42njPFgW3cQcMrOpLYeA4IM2xlC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95417'),
  ('15931416349223982', 'BROKEN (Of) LOVE', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Supaporn Malisorn, Pariya Piyapanopas, Yarinda Bunnag, Gandhi​ Wasuvitchayagit, Peerapol Kijreunpiromsuk, Supoj Janjareonborn', null, 'Arisa is a woman who seeks revenge on a capitalist behind her mother’s murder; but while doing so, she falls in love with the enemy’s daughter.', 'Arisa is a woman who seeks revenge on a capitalist behind her mother’s murder; but while doing so, she falls in love with the enemy’s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpq7STVKFwfLF19Gs5K6GaPEYmL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307837'),
  ('273109326120971325', 'Broken Angel', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'José Ignacio Valenzuela', null, 'Gaby Espino, Aarón Díaz, Carlos Ponce, Ximena Duque, Frances Ondiviela, Ezequiel Montalt, Zully Montero, Lincoln Palomeque', 'TV-14', 'Santa Diabla is the story of Santa Martínez, a woman who seeks revenge for the murder of her husband Willy Delgado.', 'Santa Diabla is the story of Santa Martínez, a woman who seeks revenge for the murder of her husband Willy Delgado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eo1QrCSL40RlNDocWtW9h0jN7Tp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58931'),
  ('627939205657235863', 'Broken Blade', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Soichiro Hoshi, Chiwa Saito, Marina Inoue, Minoru Shiraishi, Tomoya Kawai, Yuichi Nakamura', 'TV-14', 'In the continent of Cruzon, an impending war between the Kingdom of Krisna and the nation of Athens is brimming. The people of this land are able to use quartz for whatever purpose they desire. Yet one person, Rygart Arrow, is not. He is an "un-sorcerer," a person unable to use quartz. But this characteristic will enable him to pilot an ancient Golem, one strong enough to put up a fight against the invading army of Athens.', 'In the continent of Cruzon, an impending war between the Kingdom of Krisna and the nation of Athens is brimming. The people of this land are able to use quartz for whatever purpose they desire. Yet one person, Rygart Arrow, is not. He is an "un-sorcerer," a person unable to use quartz. But this characteristic will enable him to pilot an ancient Golem, one strong enough to put up a fight against the invading army of Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bUEwEjjVXVICjKwtwDd48wIzZJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44163'),
  ('376299730104963510', 'Broken Pieces', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family, Crime', null, null, 'Erkan Petekkaya, Ebru Özkan, Nurgül Yeşilçay, Barış Falay, Alina Boz, Mine Tugay, Leyla Tanlar, Civan Canova', null, 'A story about difficult choices, tough decisions, entwined lives and parents torn between their children and their hearts. Gulseren comes from a poor background, while Cihans wife Dilara is wealthy. They both gave birth in the same hospital on the same day 15 years ago but a mistake was made that would change their destinies. Having similar surnames, an absent-minded nurse mixed the babies and nobody noticed. As the truth about the children is revealed, fundamental problems arise between the two families because of their totally different lifestyles and economic statuses. However these events bring Cihan and Gulseren closer together. They have inexplicable feelings towards each other that they cannot run away from or ignore.', 'A story about difficult choices, tough decisions, entwined lives and parents torn between their children and their hearts. Gulseren comes from a poor background, while Cihans wife Dilara is wealthy. They both gave birth in the same hospital on the same day 15 years ago but a mistake was made that would change their destinies. Having similar surnames, an absent-minded nurse mixed the babies and nobody noticed. As the truth about the children is revealed, fundamental problems arise between the two families because of their totally different lifestyles and economic statuses. However these events bring Cihan and Gulseren closer together. They have inexplicable feelings towards each other that they cannot run away from or ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqfZq8ZOFR7tDFo0KqZMlAdzgl2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69238'),
  ('499498803094344492', 'Broken Promise', 2024, 'Drama', 'Inês Gomes, Cândida Ribeiro', null, 'João Catarré, Victoria Guerra, Joana Ribeiro, Lourenço Ortigão, Paula Magalhães, Diogo Martins, Ana Padrão, Sofia Alves', null, 'The search for love and redemption... Helena is a former secretary of António Fontes Morais’s who cunningly managed to get married to her boss, thus earning the title of a trophy wife. Together, they had two children: Tomás and Camila. Their firstborn is a playboy who has been living in the United States and Camila is a spoiled young woman who spends her days spending money and on her phone. The family enjoys a lavish lifestyle, but António doesn’t go without a driver and armed security since his brother Fausto was murdered, leaving his son Miguel under the care of his aunt and uncle. Helena’s hatred for the Rocha family has grown as much as the cousins Tomás and Miguel''s love for Laura. So, without realizing, the nurse sees herself in the middle of a love triangle that will undermine the harmony between the Fontes Morais and Rocha families. Still, Verónica, who is totally in love with Tomás, and Helena will resort to any means necessary in order to get rid of Laura.', 'The search for love and redemption... Helena is a former secretary of António Fontes Morais’s who cunningly managed to get married to her boss, thus earning the title of a trophy wife. Together, they had two children: Tomás and Camila. Their firstborn is a playboy who has been living in the United States and Camila is a spoiled young woman who spends her days spending money and on her phone. The family enjoys a lavish lifestyle, but António doesn’t go without a driver and armed security since his brother Fausto was murdered, leaving his son Miguel under the care of his aunt and uncle. Helena’s hatred for the Rocha family has grown as much as the cousins Tomás and Miguel''s love for Laura. So, without realizing, the nurse sees herself in the middle of a love triangle that will undermine the harmony between the Fontes Morais and Rocha families. Still, Verónica, who is totally in love with Tomás, and Helena will resort to any means necessary in order to get rid of Laura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7f2fpzdLKDXfSkjh4PNimxdxJJR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:252373'),
  ('524652462509521903', 'Broken Promises', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Klych Lopez', null, 'Julieth Restrepo, Aislinn Derbez, Nicole Santamaría, Zharick León, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Christian Tappán, Juan Sebastián Calero, Brian Moreno', 'TV-MA', 'Persuaded by promises of a better life, three young women are sold into prostitution and must risk their lives and their families to escape.', 'Persuaded by promises of a better life, three young women are sold into prostitution and must risk their lives and their families to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUkz1YyVpoG4yZSAUC2twNIIi1B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70865'),
  ('840470621235934281', 'Broken Trail', 2006, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Western', null, 'Alan Geoffrion', 'Robert Duvall, Thomas Haden Church, Greta Scacchi, Chris Mulkey, Rusty Schwimmer, Gwendoline Yeo, Valerie Tian, Olivia Cheng', 'TV-14', 'The story is about an aging cowboy and his nephew who transport 500 horses from Oregon to Wyoming to sell them to the British Army. Along the way, their simple horse drive is complicated when they rescue five Chinese girls from a slave trader, saving them from a life of prostitution and indentured servitude. Compelled to do the right thing, they take the girls with them as they continue their perilous trek across the frontier, followed by a vicious gang of killers sent by the whorehouse madam who originally paid for the girls. Broken Trail weaves together two historical events: the British buying horses in the American West in the late 19th century and Chinese women being transported from the West Coast to the interior to serve as prostitutes.', 'The story is about an aging cowboy and his nephew who transport 500 horses from Oregon to Wyoming to sell them to the British Army. Along the way, their simple horse drive is complicated when they rescue five Chinese girls from a slave trader, saving them from a life of prostitution and indentured servitude. Compelled to do the right thing, they take the girls with them as they continue their perilous trek across the frontier, followed by a vicious gang of killers sent by the whorehouse madam who originally paid for the girls. Broken Trail weaves together two historical events: the British buying horses in the American West in the late 19th century and Chinese women being transported from the West Coast to the interior to serve as prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjYXwnRLZFrWXdS97IoXxsSbADi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20056'),
  ('176546095562725949', 'Broker', 2021, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Victoria Song, Luo Yunxi, Xu Kaicheng, Sun Jiayu, Ding Yiyi, Jiang Xueming, Ning Xiaozhi, Wang Zheng', null, 'A broker with a hidden agenda plots to steal a scientist''s research, yet a mutual attraction develops between them.', 'A broker with a hidden agenda plots to steal a scientist''s research, yet a mutual attraction develops between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x73CggY8KDNfodvvUzgUVp8lRPE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117874'),
  ('176594485683227034', 'Bronco', 1958, 'Western', null, null, 'Ty Hardin', 'TV-PG', 'Bronco is a Western series on ABC from 1958 through 1962. It was shown by the BBC in the United Kingdom. The program starred Ty Hardin as Bronco Layne, a former Confederate officer who wandered the Old West, meeting such well-known individuals as Wild Bill Hickok, Billy the Kid, Jesse James, Theodore Roosevelt, Belle Starr, Cole Younger, and John Wesley Hardin.', 'Bronco is a Western series on ABC from 1958 through 1962. It was shown by the BBC in the United Kingdom. The program starred Ty Hardin as Bronco Layne, a former Confederate officer who wandered the Old West, meeting such well-known individuals as Wild Bill Hickok, Billy the Kid, Jesse James, Theodore Roosevelt, Belle Starr, Cole Younger, and John Wesley Hardin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSnbs4XqnEC65TazeU8ace8ZVBK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:12789'),
  ('516908525224638489', 'Bronco The Series', 2019, 'Drama', 'Diego Álvarez', 'Itzel Lara, Iliana Pichardo, Elías Marín Govea', 'Hernán Mendoza, Luis Felipe Tovar, Florencia Ríos, Raúl Sandoval, Yigael Yadin, Baltimore Beltrán, Luis Alberti, Pablo Astiazarán', 'TV-14', 'This is the story of José Guadalupe Esparza and his three friends, and how they became one of the most successful regional music bands in México: Bronco. Together, they will fight the music industry establishment, escaping poverty and facing discrimination. After years of great and hard work, they managed to sell out their good-bye show at the Azteca Stadium in 1997, with over 30 million records sold all over the region.', 'This is the story of José Guadalupe Esparza and his three friends, and how they became one of the most successful regional music bands in México: Bronco. Together, they will fight the music industry establishment, escaping poverty and facing discrimination. After years of great and hard work, they managed to sell out their good-bye show at the Azteca Stadium in 1997, with over 30 million records sold all over the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWf4Yrnr17CHwJjhAOcMgVdv7Cj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94703'),
  ('639737992562161616', 'Bronk', 1975, 'Drama, Crime', 'Carroll O''Connor, Ed Waters', null, 'Henry Beckman, Joseph Mascolo, Jack Palance, Tony King, Dina Ousley', null, 'Bronk is an American television series starring Jack Palance as Detective Lieutenant Alex Bronkov. The series is set in the fictional Ocean City, California. 24 episodes were aired from September 21, 1975 to March 28, 1976 on CBS. The series lasted only one season.', 'Bronk is an American television series starring Jack Palance as Detective Lieutenant Alex Bronkov. The series is set in the fictional Ocean City, California. 24 episodes were aired from September 21, 1975 to March 28, 1976 on CBS. The series lasted only one season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7egp54IjnF0EqyBGGvpVLJQFTG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32343'),
  ('337209982636118633', 'Brooklyn Nine-Nine', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Daniel J. Goor, Michael Schur', null, 'Andy Samberg, Melissa Fumero, Terry Crews, Joe Lo Truglio, Stephanie Beatriz, Andre Braugher, Dirk Blocker, Joel McKinnon Miller', 'TV-14', 'A single-camera ensemble comedy following the lives of an eclectic group of detectives in a New York precinct, including one slacker who is forced to shape up when he gets a new boss.', 'A single-camera ensemble comedy following the lives of an eclectic group of detectives in a New York precinct, including one slacker who is forced to shape up when he gets a new boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3SymGlOHefSKbz1bCOz56moupS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:48891'),
  ('62971126588573429', 'Brooklyn South', 1997, 'Drama', 'Steven Bochco, David Milch, William M. Finkelstein', null, 'Jon Tenney, Michael DeLuise, Gary Basaraba, James B. Sikking, Yancy Butler, Titus Welliver, Klea Scott, Patrick McGaw', null, 'An American ensemble police drama series following the life of police officers from the 74th Precinct in southern Brooklyn, New York City.', 'An American ensemble police drama series following the life of police officers from the 74th Precinct in southern Brooklyn, New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueKX3woAcnF7zSokmdhin84lfV3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15215'),
  ('826760396985943334', 'Brookside', 1982, 'Soap, Drama', 'Phil Redmond, Colin McKeown', null, 'Amanda Burton, Dean Sullivan, Claire Sweeney, Gene Foad, Gillian Kearney, Helen Grace, Ian Hendry, Jennifer Ellison', null, 'The ground-breaking soap set in a housing estate on the outskirts of Liverpool.', 'The ground-breaking soap set in a housing estate on the outskirts of Liverpool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17NsCtMBMKmzaKLDCfPp8gpSOr3.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:1526'),
  ('5381794474567840', 'Brother vs. Brother', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Drew Scott, Jonathan Silver Scott', 'TV-G', 'Team Jonathan vs. Team Drew. The Brothers get two teams built of various skills (contractors, designers, realtors) &amp; have a series of competitions, each week sending home a competitor. The final man (or woman) standing takes the title of Brother vs. Brother.', 'Team Jonathan vs. Team Drew. The Brothers get two teams built of various skills (contractors, designers, realtors) &amp; have a series of competitions, each week sending home a competitor. The final man (or woman) standing takes the title of Brother vs. Brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJNikR9taFaNuJHOk4BUowVdo0k.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:57758'),
  ('625739071668256521', 'Brother-in-Laws', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Kids', 'Rajesh Thalachira', 'Rajiv Karumadi', 'Aneesh Ravi, Saumya Bhagyan Pillai, Riyas Narmakala, Manju Pathrose, Sethu Lakshmi, Abhilash Kottarakkara, Akshaya, Muhammad Raihan', 'TV-G', 'Aliyans (Brother-in-Laws) is a hit Malayalam sitcom on Kaumudy TV, directed by Rajesh Thalachira. It premiered on February 24, 2020, as a sequel to Aliyan vs Aliyan (Brother-in-Law vs Brother-in-Law). Set in Thiruvananthapuram, the show follows Ratnamma and her family, centering on the love-hate dynamic between brothers-in-law Kanakan and Cleatus. Most episodes revolve around Cleatus landing in trouble thanks to his quirky ideas, with Kanakan often stepping in to save the day.', 'Aliyans (Brother-in-Laws) is a hit Malayalam sitcom on Kaumudy TV, directed by Rajesh Thalachira. It premiered on February 24, 2020, as a sequel to Aliyan vs Aliyan (Brother-in-Law vs Brother-in-Law). Set in Thiruvananthapuram, the show follows Ratnamma and her family, centering on the love-hate dynamic between brothers-in-law Kanakan and Cleatus. Most episodes revolve around Cleatus landing in trouble thanks to his quirky ideas, with Kanakan often stepping in to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5J5Tkd4owWs3c9pxt9D5wdzjeFP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285581'),
  ('138551004503252652', 'Brother''s Keeper', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Sum-Wai Wong', null, 'Ruco Chan, Edwin Siu, Linda Chung Ka-Yan, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung, Louis Cheung, Louise Lee Si-Kei, Lau Kong', 'NR', 'A story about two brothers of the same mother but different fathers. "Sam" Kiu Tin-seng and Lo Wai-son separate after growing up together. Over the course of twenty years, with major historical events occurring in the background of their lives, the two brothers face different moral life struggles while living in Hong Kong and Macau.', 'A story about two brothers of the same mother but different fathers. "Sam" Kiu Tin-seng and Lo Wai-son separate after growing up together. Over the course of twenty years, with major historical events occurring in the background of their lives, the two brothers face different moral life struggles while living in Hong Kong and Macau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ETjjwRe2FHKTJ1Lh5HVpRH6qEw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47034'),
  ('1098500786742775312', 'Brotherhood', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Blake Masters', null, 'Jason Isaacs, Jason Clarke, Fionnula Flanagan, Annabeth Gish, Ethan Embry, Kevin Chapman, Karl Bury, Kerry O''Malley', 'TV-MA', 'A working-class Irish family rules a city built on loyalty and corruption. The Caffee brothers, Tommy, a rising politician desperate for reelection, and Michael, a hardened criminal returning from seven years on the run and eager to reclaim his turf, fight for survival on opposite sides of the law. In their ruthless quest for power, the entire Caffee family is driven to lies, betrayal and infidelity -- threatening to tear them and the city of Providence, RI apart.', 'A working-class Irish family rules a city built on loyalty and corruption. The Caffee brothers, Tommy, a rising politician desperate for reelection, and Michael, a hardened criminal returning from seven years on the run and eager to reclaim his turf, fight for survival on opposite sides of the law. In their ruthless quest for power, the entire Caffee family is driven to lies, betrayal and infidelity -- threatening to tear them and the city of Providence, RI apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qb3qTvq1Wo0HxzfwECTuj7Aa80.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2204'),
  ('771185500445769646', 'Brotherhood', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Pedro Morelli', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An honest lawyer reaches a moral crossroads after the cops force her to inform on her incarcerated brother, the leader of a rising criminal faction.', 'An honest lawyer reaches a moral crossroads after the cops force her to inform on her incarcerated brother, the leader of a rising criminal faction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igGrWYT2iOK4umpXoIRNCwY0sA6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94696'),
  ('265165775721513143', 'Brotherhood of the Rose', 1989, 'Action & Adventure', 'David Morrell', null, 'Peter Strauss, Robert Mitchum, Connie Sellecca, David Morse, James B. Sikking, M. Emmet Walsh, James Hong, Rhys McConnochie', 'TV-14', 'Romulus and Remus were picked up at an orphanage at a young age, raised together as brothers and trained to supersede every other CIA agents.', 'Romulus and Remus were picked up at an orphanage at a young age, raised together as brothers and trained to supersede every other CIA agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUuKw3oZmh4cwUVQ7KguNQWl61o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77231'),
  ('339989075670874025', 'Brotherhood: Final Fantasy XV', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Makoto Koichi, Kenta Miyake, Tetsuya Kakihara, Mamoru Miyano, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Sayaka Kinoshita, Akio Kaneda, Rina Kitagawa', null, 'A story set alongside the video game Final Fantasy XV, starring one of its main characters, Noctis, and his friends.', 'A story set alongside the video game Final Fantasy XV, starring one of its main characters, Noctis, and his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBnVTXHvlVXpfHE5Lp0tzNxMDwf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66987'),
  ('231698035412903017', 'Brotherly Love', 1995, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jonathan Schmock, Jim Vallely', null, 'Joey Lawrence, Matthew Lawrence, Andrew Lawrence, Michael McShane, Liz Vassey, Melinda Culea', null, 'Brotherly Love is an American sitcom that ran from September 16, 1995 to April 1, 1996, on NBC, and then moved to The WB, where it aired from September 15, 1996 until May 18, 1997. The series was created by Jonathan Schmock and Jim Vallely, and produced by Witt/Thomas Productions in association with Touchstone Television and Walt Disney Television. The primary focus of the series is on the relationship of three brothers, played by Joey Lawrence, Matthew Lawrence and Andrew Lawrence.', 'Brotherly Love is an American sitcom that ran from September 16, 1995 to April 1, 1996, on NBC, and then moved to The WB, where it aired from September 15, 1996 until May 18, 1997. The series was created by Jonathan Schmock and Jim Vallely, and produced by Witt/Thomas Productions in association with Touchstone Television and Walt Disney Television. The primary focus of the series is on the relationship of three brothers, played by Joey Lawrence, Matthew Lawrence and Andrew Lawrence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6paGJlSIS1OX11LsmA1m6b4SbJt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4442'),
  ('152893577601761331', 'Brothers', 1984, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Robert Walden, Paul Regina, Brandon Maggart, Philip Charles MacKenzie, Hallie Todd, Yeardley Smith, Mary Ann Pascal, Timothy Williams', null, 'Two conservative men support their younger brother when he comes out as gay, and help him navigate being openly homosexual in 1980s Philadelphia.', 'Two conservative men support their younger brother when he comes out as gay, and help him navigate being openly homosexual in 1980s Philadelphia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mBJsdAXYbNdbNquwxu5AKzEnQ2.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:12635'),
  ('309179996837355235', 'Brothers', 2015, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Rondel P. Lindayag', null, 'Coco Martin, Julia Montes, Susan Roces, Jaime Fabregas, John Arcilla, Lorna Tolentino, Tirso Cruz III, Angel Aquino', null, 'Ador is a well known and respected CIDG Police Official, with a loving family as his support. Cardo, on the other hand, loves the solitude of the mountains in the province as a SAF Trooper. Their lives take a sudden turn when Ador gets himself entangled in a syndicate by being betrayed by one of his own colleagues, resulting to his death. To conceal this fact, Cardo was ordered to pretend to be Ador and finish the mission what his brother left behind. He will also be force to pretend to his brother''s family and friends, and be re-united with his grandmother, whom he despised, for assuming she abandoned him.', 'Ador is a well known and respected CIDG Police Official, with a loving family as his support. Cardo, on the other hand, loves the solitude of the mountains in the province as a SAF Trooper. Their lives take a sudden turn when Ador gets himself entangled in a syndicate by being betrayed by one of his own colleagues, resulting to his death. To conceal this fact, Cardo was ordered to pretend to be Ador and finish the mission what his brother left behind. He will also be force to pretend to his brother''s family and friends, and be re-united with his grandmother, whom he despised, for assuming she abandoned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX5ldo2snjJuZ8P9AxOharboxJn.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:66515'),
  ('16221845672772441', 'Brothers and Sisters', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jon Robin Baitz', null, 'Dave Annable, Sally Field, Calista Flockhart, Rachel Griffiths, Matthew Rhys, Ron Rifkin, Luke Macfarlane, Gilles Marini', 'TV-14', 'The close-knit Walker family deals with struggles and triumphs.', 'The close-knit Walker family deals with struggles and triumphs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5eJF2tve9qBxxAYle1Q8S1HrUU.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:341'),
  ('1030461976895611909', 'Brothers and Sisters', 2025, 'Family', null, null, 'Barbora Černá, František Beleš, Martina Jindrová, Igor Chmela, Lenka Vlasáková, Roman Zach, David Matásek, Veronika Žilková', null, 'What can a simple DNA test do? For example, it can trigger an avalanche of surprising findings that will shake up the fates of parents and their adult children. The secrets revealed can hurt many, but they can also bring a lot of new possibilities. Because what''s better than having good siblings? And does the rule "the more, the better" apply in this case too?', 'What can a simple DNA test do? For example, it can trigger an avalanche of surprising findings that will shake up the fates of parents and their adult children. The secrets revealed can hurt many, but they can also bring a lot of new possibilities. Because what''s better than having good siblings? And does the rule "the more, the better" apply in this case too?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0Ez8FCq0kS9FnCk8NQHKkX9RpS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:294284'),
  ('208902075051053144', 'Brothers Conflict', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ken Takeuchi, Tomoaki Maeno, Kenichi Suzumura, Daisuke Namikawa, Rina Sato, Daisuke Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Kohsuke Toriumi', null, 'Imagine being the only child your whole life, and then suddenly finding yourself gaining 13 step-brothers! Ema Hinata''s lonely life takes a new and exciting turn when her single father Rintarou Hinata, a famous adventurer, falls in love and marries Miwa Asahina, an apparel maker. In order to give the newly-wed couple space, Ema starts living with her new step-brothers in a mansion called Sunrise Residence and for the first time, experiences being part of a lively and big family. She finally feels safe and content. Each brother has his own unique personality, and Ema soon realizes that it is not only family love that grows between them, but romance as well. Which brother will be the one to steal her heart in the end?', 'Imagine being the only child your whole life, and then suddenly finding yourself gaining 13 step-brothers! Ema Hinata''s lonely life takes a new and exciting turn when her single father Rintarou Hinata, a famous adventurer, falls in love and marries Miwa Asahina, an apparel maker. In order to give the newly-wed couple space, Ema starts living with her new step-brothers in a mansion called Sunrise Residence and for the first time, experiences being part of a lively and big family. She finally feels safe and content. Each brother has his own unique personality, and Ema soon realizes that it is not only family love that grows between them, but romance as well. Which brother will be the one to steal her heart in the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkngCjl9v9ierjyuGcPI1Ubp20m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57757'),
  ('161517393829479111', 'Brothers Four', 1981, null, null, null, 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Liu Kai-Chi, James Ching, Simon Yam, Deanie Ip, Barbara Chan, Rebecca Chan, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan', null, 'The series revolves around the four Lin brothers, Lin Shangfu, Lin Shanggui, Lin Shangrong and Lin Shanghua. Shangfu, who works as a car salesman, narrowly avoids being laid off and begins a relationship with TV star Xia Chuqiao. Shanghua, a lounge singer, falls in love with a fellow music enthusiast, Sun Yide, but their relationship becomes complicated due to feelings between Shangfu and Yide. The Lin brothers also face multiple attacks from an unscrupulous artist agent, Lei Litao, but manage to overcome his schemes.', 'The series revolves around the four Lin brothers, Lin Shangfu, Lin Shanggui, Lin Shangrong and Lin Shanghua. Shangfu, who works as a car salesman, narrowly avoids being laid off and begins a relationship with TV star Xia Chuqiao. Shanghua, a lounge singer, falls in love with a fellow music enthusiast, Sun Yide, but their relationship becomes complicated due to feelings between Shangfu and Yide. The Lin brothers also face multiple attacks from an unscrupulous artist agent, Lei Litao, but manage to overcome his schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBdGnqVWA9tJ8vOuyUPQnHxSeAH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112644'),
  ('560334562548727548', 'Brown Nation', 2016, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Rajeev Varma, Shenaz Treasury, Melanie Chandra, Doug E. Doug, Omi Vaidya, Jaspal Binning, Kapil Bawa, Sana Serrai', 'TV-14', 'Hasmukh operates a small IT Consulting company "Shree Ganesh Computers Limited Inc" in Queens, NY. Staffed by a disinterested and lazy cast of characters, his business flounders. His home life is not much better. His wife Dimple, a frustrated and jobless artist, complains constantly about not having enough time to explore her creativity because of the demands of taking care of her dog, Bobby. Hasmukh tries desperately to balance his work and family, but neither seem to have his best interest at heart.', 'Hasmukh operates a small IT Consulting company "Shree Ganesh Computers Limited Inc" in Queens, NY. Staffed by a disinterested and lazy cast of characters, his business flounders. His home life is not much better. His wife Dimple, a frustrated and jobless artist, complains constantly about not having enough time to explore her creativity because of the demands of taking care of her dog, Bobby. Hasmukh tries desperately to balance his work and family, but neither seem to have his best interest at heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esoE5f7jyHnKM9fUb8NWoeVIoC8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68727'),
  ('25419561125537039', 'Brum', 1991, 'Kids', 'Anne Wood', null, 'Toyah Willcox', 'TV-G', 'Brum is a British children''s superhero rescue television series about the adventures of a radio controlled car of the same name. It was produced by Ragdoll Productions for HIT Entertainment and first broadcast in 1991. It was initially directed, written and produced by Anne Wood, latterly directed and written by Vic Finch, Paul Leather, Emma Lindley, Morgan Hall, Brian Simmons, Nigel P Harris and others. It was initially narrated by Toyah Willcox and later by Tom Wright. The show was first aired on Children''s BBC on BBC One and also aired in the United States on Discovery Kids as part of the Ready Set Learn kids block on the channel that lasted from 1996 to 2010. The show has also aired on ABC, ABC1 and ABC2 in Australia.', 'Brum is a British children''s superhero rescue television series about the adventures of a radio controlled car of the same name. It was produced by Ragdoll Productions for HIT Entertainment and first broadcast in 1991. It was initially directed, written and produced by Anne Wood, latterly directed and written by Vic Finch, Paul Leather, Emma Lindley, Morgan Hall, Brian Simmons, Nigel P Harris and others. It was initially narrated by Toyah Willcox and later by Tom Wright. The show was first aired on Children''s BBC on BBC One and also aired in the United States on Discovery Kids as part of the Ready Set Learn kids block on the channel that lasted from 1996 to 2010. The show has also aired on ABC, ABC1 and ABC2 in Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpF9QZjzSMlUqUZWPxZpzHMk2la.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6232'),
  ('1055723683063771900', 'Bruno Barbieri - 4 Hotel', 2018, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Bruno Barbieri, Elena Andreoli, Dario Maria Dossena', null, 'The show is a spin-off of the format Alessandro Borghese - 4 Ristoranti, where hotels, rather than restaurants, compete against each other. These hotels belong to the same commercial category and are located in the same geographical area. Each of the four hotel owners takes turns hosting the other three colleagues and Barbieri for a day and a night at their establishment. The hoteliers rate the location, services, rooms, prices, and, starting from the fourth season, the quality of the breakfast, giving scores from 0 to 10.', 'The show is a spin-off of the format Alessandro Borghese - 4 Ristoranti, where hotels, rather than restaurants, compete against each other. These hotels belong to the same commercial category and are located in the same geographical area. Each of the four hotel owners takes turns hosting the other three colleagues and Barbieri for a day and a night at their establishment. The hoteliers rate the location, services, rooms, prices, and, starting from the fourth season, the quality of the breakfast, giving scores from 0 to 10.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pq7F4Wx36DAap7ikO5eBrY52G3I.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:96172'),
  ('463305769843212951', 'Brush Strokes', 1986, 'Comedy', 'John Esmonde, Bob Larbey', null, 'Karl Howman, Howard Lew Lewis, Mike Walling, Nicky Croydon, Jackie Lye, Elizabeth Counsell, Erika Hoffman', null, 'Jacko (Karl Howman) is a painter and decorator with an eye for the ladies. He works with Eric (Mike Walling), who''s married to his sister Jean (Nicky Croydon). The painting and decorating firm they work for is owned by Lionel Bainbridge (Gary Waldhorn). Other characters include Lionel''s wife, Veronica (Elizabeth Counsell), his daughter Lelsey (Kim Thomson, later Erika Hoffman) and wine bar owner Elmo Putney (Howard Lew Lewis).', 'Jacko (Karl Howman) is a painter and decorator with an eye for the ladies. He works with Eric (Mike Walling), who''s married to his sister Jean (Nicky Croydon). The painting and decorating firm they work for is owned by Lionel Bainbridge (Gary Waldhorn). Other characters include Lionel''s wife, Veronica (Elizabeth Counsell), his daughter Lelsey (Kim Thomson, later Erika Hoffman) and wine bar owner Elmo Putney (Howard Lew Lewis).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nn5ahx9PxTDDkDLwt9QNlUZgTBc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:6296'),
  ('515235414936717911', 'Bryggeren', 1996, 'Drama', 'Kaspar Rostrup', 'Kaspar Rostrup, Gerz Feigenberg', null, null, 'A story about Carlsberg founder JC Jacobsen, his son Carl, and their struggle to create a brewing company, and simultaneously a look at fifty years of Danish history.', 'A story about Carlsberg founder JC Jacobsen, his son Carl, and their struggle to create a brewing company, and simultaneously a look at fifty years of Danish history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4LmEq36DGds8RUGqYC4e0lx0wl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44177'),
  ('393919400226259168', 'Brynhildr in the Darkness', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Risa Taneda, Aya Suzaki, Manami Numakura, Mao Ichimichi, Azusa Tadokoro, Mamiko Noto, Kentaro Ito', 'TV-MA', 'When he was a child, Murakami was friends with a girl he called Kuroneko. One day, while trying to prove the existence of aliens to Murakami, she is killed in an accident that he barely survives. Guilty of his role in the accident, Murokami decides to dedicate his life to proving that aliens exist. Then, one day, a new student with mysterious powers transfers into his class who not only looks a lot like Kuroneko, but is named Kuroha, Neko.', 'When he was a child, Murakami was friends with a girl he called Kuroneko. One day, while trying to prove the existence of aliens to Murakami, she is killed in an accident that he barely survives. Guilty of his role in the accident, Murokami decides to dedicate his life to proving that aliens exist. Then, one day, a new student with mysterious powers transfers into his class who not only looks a lot like Kuroneko, but is named Kuroha, Neko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8O3GlJESEjfRnV72Ju50AjxjB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60805'),
  ('571142802638460840', 'Btooom!', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Kanata Hongo, Suzuko Mimori, Toru Okawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yuichi Nakamura, Meijin Takahashi', 'TV-MA', 'Sakamoto, an unemployed young man, is one of the world''s top players of an online fighting game called Btooom! One day, he wakes up on what appears to be a tropical island, although he doesn''t remember how or why he got there.', 'Sakamoto, an unemployed young man, is one of the world''s top players of an online fighting game called Btooom! One day, he wakes up on what appears to be a tropical island, although he doesn''t remember how or why he got there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzgp3jsZq0xRgwzWBqwf8ubVEUc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45125'),
  ('503444100817289281', 'BTS In the SOOP', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'RM, Jin, SUGA, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, '''In the SOOP BTS ver.'' is a reality show, portraying BTS members'' everyday life, relaxation, and everything in between, away from the city life. A time of freedom and healing in a place for BTS, and BTS only.', '''In the SOOP BTS ver.'' is a reality show, portraying BTS members'' everyday life, relaxation, and everything in between, away from the city life. A time of freedom and healing in a place for BTS, and BTS only.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkB6mHtF7g95N5j35D3GNeR9vOh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106600'),
  ('927361707495508281', 'BTS Monuments: Beyond the Star', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'RM, Jin, Suga, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', 'TV-MA', 'BTS mark its 10th anniversary as globally acclaimed 21st-century pop icons. Explore the daily lives and innermost thoughts of the seven BTS members as they pursue meaning and purpose in life.', 'BTS mark its 10th anniversary as globally acclaimed 21st-century pop icons. Explore the daily lives and innermost thoughts of the seven BTS members as they pursue meaning and purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4zBtETTby5WCLWAMvWPYHDuw41.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215421'),
  ('118203844043628264', 'BTS: Bon Voyage', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jimin, V, Jin, Suga, RM, j-hope, Jung Kook', 'TV-PG', 'Bon Voyage is a reality show about members of the South Korean group, BTS (Bangtan Sonyeondan). It shows them in everyday situations that every traveler encounters and offer a unique insight into the members'' lives.', 'Bon Voyage is a reality show about members of the South Korean group, BTS (Bangtan Sonyeondan). It shows them in everyday situations that every traveler encounters and offer a unique insight into the members'' lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xczBVyTcwE9EMnEd2R0CefOLInG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:72568'),
  ('976836280192242397', 'BTS: Burn the Stage', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Suga, j-hope, Jin, RM, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'Follow the 300-day journey of BTS''s sold-out world tour, BTS Live Trilogy Episode III: The Wings Tour. Celebrate the triumph of their friendship as they overcome shared hardships, and witness the growth and hard work as BTS continues on the path to grow into fully-fledged artists.', 'Follow the 300-day journey of BTS''s sold-out world tour, BTS Live Trilogy Episode III: The Wings Tour. Celebrate the triumph of their friendship as they overcome shared hardships, and witness the growth and hard work as BTS continues on the path to grow into fully-fledged artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atc0gJa863BVZUxRigGC0MaK6EB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78741'),
  ('64615166719481349', 'Bubble Guppies', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Robert Scull, Jonny Belt', null, 'Frank Welker', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of seven fish-tailed kids- Molly, Gil, Oona, Deema, Nonny, Goby, and Zooli!', 'The adventures of seven fish-tailed kids- Molly, Gil, Oona, Deema, Nonny, Goby, and Zooli!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ50jTHpOY3wKmuxiONOL77t9DW.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:39107'),
  ('137016791197125802', 'Bubblegum Crash', 1991, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Toshimichi Suzuki', null, 'Akiko Hiramatsu, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Ryoko Tachikawa, Michie Tomizawa, Minami Takayama, Toshio Furukawa, Kenyu Horiuchi, Hideyuki Umezu', null, 'MegaTokyo 2034: The saga of the Knight Sabers continues. The group tries to find out who or what is behind the recent string of robberies, murders, and Boomer malfunctions which are somehow related to the creation of an advanced artificial intelligence. Furthermore, it seems that the Knight Sabers may be breaking up.', 'MegaTokyo 2034: The saga of the Knight Sabers continues. The group tries to find out who or what is behind the recent string of robberies, murders, and Boomer malfunctions which are somehow related to the creation of an advanced artificial intelligence. Furthermore, it seems that the Knight Sabers may be breaking up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CAaUWHOqBfPjdk3wQ87iZbZ5vG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44546'),
  ('250561764291875653', 'Bubblegum Crisis', 1987, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Toshimichi Suzuki', 'Kinuko Oomori, Akiko Hiramatsu, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Michie Tomizawa, Nozomu Sasaki, Kenyu Horiuchi, Toshio Furukawa, Shuichi Ikeda', 'TV-14', 'MegaTokyo 2033: Tokyo was left flattened as a result from a great earthquake. A new city, MegaTokyo, was then recreated due in no small part from the aid of a multi-million dollar company, Genom Corp. Genom created and mass-produced biomechanical creatures called Boomers to aid in the restoration of MegaTokyo. When the Boomers began to run out of control, the ADPolice at first tried to stop them, but they proved to be far more difficult to deal with than was first imagined. Under the ever looming Boomer threat, a group of four girls from varying degrees of society banded together. Calling themselves The Knight Sabers, they were the only ones with enough firepower and resourcefullness to defend the fledgling MegaTokyo from Genom and it''s berserk Boomers.', 'MegaTokyo 2033: Tokyo was left flattened as a result from a great earthquake. A new city, MegaTokyo, was then recreated due in no small part from the aid of a multi-million dollar company, Genom Corp. Genom created and mass-produced biomechanical creatures called Boomers to aid in the restoration of MegaTokyo. When the Boomers began to run out of control, the ADPolice at first tried to stop them, but they proved to be far more difficult to deal with than was first imagined. Under the ever looming Boomer threat, a group of four girls from varying degrees of society banded together. Calling themselves The Knight Sabers, they were the only ones with enough firepower and resourcefullness to defend the fledgling MegaTokyo from Genom and it''s berserk Boomers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnF1zD3GP3L4DDoLIshUEH0JYHJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42882'),
  ('569157012437298448', 'Bubblegum Crisis Tokyo 2040', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chiaki J. Konaka', null, 'Satsuki Yukino, Jouji Nakata, Yuu Asakawa, Hiroko Konishi, Rio Natsuki, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Hilary Haag, Kelly Manison', 'TV-MA', 'MegaTokyo 2040: Tokyo’s workforce is riddled with robots that tend to go on destructive killing sprees. Four young women gear up in cybernetic suits to battle an evil corporation’s bionic pawns while its grip on the city threatens to strangle humanity. In order to shut down an android uprising, these heavy metal heroines flirt with a critical meltdown in an adrenaline-fueled death match between woman and machine!', 'MegaTokyo 2040: Tokyo’s workforce is riddled with robots that tend to go on destructive killing sprees. Four young women gear up in cybernetic suits to battle an evil corporation’s bionic pawns while its grip on the city threatens to strangle humanity. In order to shut down an android uprising, these heavy metal heroines flirt with a critical meltdown in an adrenaline-fueled death match between woman and machine!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/visWGTzuyinneD8a2tNMSdHTP0y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9542'),
  ('479074187571606132', 'BUCCHIGIRI?!', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Genki Okawa, Masafumi Kobatake, Anna Nagase, Yusuke Hoshino, Jiro Saito, Yukihiro Nozuyama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Nozomu Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'Arajin Tomoshibi’s reunion with his old pal Matakara Asamine takes an unexpected turn when they stumble into a brawl with the toughest guys in town. And just when you thought things couldn’t get weirder, a colossal genie decides to drop in. Brace yourself for the ultimate showdown. It’s the clash of the cool and the magical!', 'Arajin Tomoshibi’s reunion with his old pal Matakara Asamine takes an unexpected turn when they stumble into a brawl with the toughest guys in town. And just when you thought things couldn’t get weirder, a colossal genie decides to drop in. Brace yourself for the ultimate showdown. It’s the clash of the cool and the magical!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhtkmLdMleHtGTq267VqhePgp5S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226905'),
  ('204343633473042528', 'Buck Rogers in the 25th Century', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Glen A. Larson, Leslie Stevens', null, 'Gil Gerard, Erin Gray, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Thom Christopher, Jay Garner, Felix Silla', 'TV-14', '20th-century astronaut Buck Rogers awakens in the 25th century after a freak accident puts him in suspended animation for 500 years. Upon returning to Earth and discovering the planet is recovering from a nuclear war, Buck uses his combat skills and ingenuity to protect Earth and fight evil throughout the galaxy alongside starfighter pilot Colonel Wilma Deering and robot companion Twiki.', '20th-century astronaut Buck Rogers awakens in the 25th century after a freak accident puts him in suspended animation for 500 years. Upon returning to Earth and discovering the planet is recovering from a nuclear war, Buck uses his combat skills and ingenuity to protect Earth and fight evil throughout the galaxy alongside starfighter pilot Colonel Wilma Deering and robot companion Twiki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SgcheHtEcacQxRFKpIuP0jYw6u.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2443'),
  ('594094677794576239', 'Bucky - The Incredible Kid', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', null, 'Akira Ishida, Hiroshi Kamiya, Yuu Asakawa, Masaharu Sato, Tomoko Kawakami, Yasunori Matsumoto, Hideo Ishikawa, Showtaro Morikubo', 'NR', 'Spaak, a very powerful and respected G.C. (Great Child) offers his position to a young boy named Bucky who has the dream to become the ruler of the world. In order to become a true G.C. to protect his land from animals that have gone haywire, he must cross the twelve countries and defeat each G.C. guardian who are ordered by the G.C. leader Hail to stop him. Kai and Pinky who are also G.C. follow Bucky on his journey to make his dream come true.', 'Spaak, a very powerful and respected G.C. (Great Child) offers his position to a young boy named Bucky who has the dream to become the ruler of the world. In order to become a true G.C. to protect his land from animals that have gone haywire, he must cross the twelve countries and defeat each G.C. guardian who are ordered by the G.C. leader Hail to stop him. Kai and Pinky who are also G.C. follow Bucky on his journey to make his dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fLhjgnHRZHBlPzPBRZny0Gsddk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34841'),
  ('613251680766142444', 'Buddy Complex', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Koki Uchiyama, Saori Hayami, Aoi Yuuki, Tomokazu Sugita, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nobunaga Shimazaki', 'TV-14', 'When a giant robot suddenly attacks the city, a high-school student named Aoba is saved by a classmate who''s piloting her own mecha. After accepting an offer to join the alliance she''s is a part of, Aoba is thrust into the middle of high-flying robot warfare.', 'When a giant robot suddenly attacks the city, a high-school student named Aoba is saved by a classmate who''s piloting her own mecha. After accepting an offer to join the alliance she''s is a part of, Aoba is thrust into the middle of high-flying robot warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JVwRxQEWVhehgzZblNfRe8zvHn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60663'),
  ('514915728870259968', 'Buddy Daddies', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, 'Vio Shimokura', 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Koki Uchiyama, Hina Kino, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Mitsuaki Madono, Nanako Mori, Haruka Terui, Shizuka Itoh', 'TV-14', 'Two assassins who never miss their mark must juggle fatherhood with their demanding job when they suddenly find themselves raising a four-year-old girl.', 'Two assassins who never miss their mark must juggle fatherhood with their demanding job when they suddenly find themselves raising a four-year-old girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjRWZ1Ak9Ag6EvcA5LNhphqX8oV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212963'),
  ('274380396261816018', 'Buddy Thunderstruck', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Ryan Wiesbrock', null, 'Brian Atkinson, Ted Raimi, Harry Chaskin, Debi Derryberry, Philip Maurice Hayes, Leigh Kelly, Justin Michael, Nick Shakoour', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow the outrageous, high-octane adventures of Buddy Thunderstruck, a truck-racing dog who brings guts and good times to the town of Greasepit.', 'Follow the outrageous, high-octane adventures of Buddy Thunderstruck, a truck-racing dog who brings guts and good times to the town of Greasepit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEtXiQqeNHR0RB4EowR2U3ADi3L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70454'),
  ('496651574260193621', 'Budgie', 1971, null, 'Willis Hall, Keith Waterhouse', null, 'Adam Faith, Iain Cuthbertson', null, 'Budgie is a popular British television series starring former popstar Adam Faith which was produced by ITV company London Weekend Television and broadcast on the ITV network between 1971 and 1972. The series was created by Keith Waterhouse and Willis Hall . The show was produced by Verity Lambert, Rex Firkin was the Executive producer.', 'Budgie is a popular British television series starring former popstar Adam Faith which was produced by ITV company London Weekend Television and broadcast on the ITV network between 1971 and 1972. The series was created by Keith Waterhouse and Willis Hall . The show was produced by Verity Lambert, Rex Firkin was the Executive producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2S5Lha69WVFmu7y0dF1JeXphs2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:972'),
  ('739177770887665816', 'Buffy the Vampire Slayer', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Joss Whedon', 'Drew Goddard', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Nicholas Brendon, Alyson Hannigan, Emma Caulfield, Michelle Trachtenberg, James Marsters', 'TV-14', 'Into every generation a slayer is born: one girl in all the world, a chosen one. She alone will wield the strength and skill to fight the vampires, demons, and the forces of darkness; to stop the spread of their evil and the swell of their number. She is the Slayer.', 'Into every generation a slayer is born: one girl in all the world, a chosen one. She alone will wield the strength and skill to fight the vampires, demons, and the forces of darkness; to stop the spread of their evil and the swell of their number. She is the Slayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7fVZkyheCEQHDUEHwNmYENGfT2.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:95'),
  ('944256080736676966', 'Buffy the Vampire Slayer: Season 8 Motion Comic', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joss Whedon', 'Joss Whedon', 'Kelly Albanese, Natalie Lander, J. Anthony McCarthy, Julie O''Connor, Daniel Taylor', null, 'Buffy''s adventures continue with new threats, old friends and brand new stories that await the Slayer.', 'Buffy''s adventures continue with new threats, old friends and brand new stories that await the Slayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SXd2LUwqCgYCAStzlHWFUFmiH8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65316'),
  ('436857419595289231', 'Bugs', 1995, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Brian Eastman', null, 'Jan Harvey, Jaye Griffiths, Jesse Birdsall, Steven Houghton', null, 'Bugs was a British television drama series which ran for four series from April 1995 to August 1999. The programme, a mixture of action/adventure and science-fiction, involved a team of specialist independent crime-fighting technology experts, who faced a variety of threats based around computers and other modern technology. It was originally broadcast on Saturday evenings on BBC One, and was produced for the BBC by the independent production company Carnival Films.', 'Bugs was a British television drama series which ran for four series from April 1995 to August 1999. The programme, a mixture of action/adventure and science-fiction, involved a team of specialist independent crime-fighting technology experts, who faced a variety of threats based around computers and other modern technology. It was originally broadcast on Saturday evenings on BBC One, and was produced for the BBC by the independent production company Carnival Films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ae1vRALxdMwxvtCR9YgvpKSHkbS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7'),
  ('793629848083871578', 'Bugs Bunny Builders', 2022, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eric Bauza, Chandni Parekh, Bob Bergen', 'TV-Y', 'At ACME Construction Company, Bugs Bunny and Lola Bunny manage an inept crew of builders. By working together as a team, Daffy Duck, Porky Pig, Tweety, and others use their tools and wild vehicles to pull off some of the looniest construction jobs ever.', 'At ACME Construction Company, Bugs Bunny and Lola Bunny manage an inept crew of builders. By working together as a team, Daffy Duck, Porky Pig, Tweety, and others use their tools and wild vehicles to pull off some of the looniest construction jobs ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llYAgSgJBH1EnC17e2d5WnxgP5K.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:203687'),
  ('525948238011907557', 'BUILD-DIVIDE', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yu Serizawa, Aoi Koga, Yuto Uemura, Sayumi Watabe, Atsushi Tamaru', 'TV-14', 'In Shin-Kyoto, people battle to become the new governing lord in a battle of intense card games!', 'In Shin-Kyoto, people battle to become the new governing lord in a battle of intense card games!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpTuOr1MjcPcHWjvxhe00X6O4o9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123670'),
