  ('282192502663462007', 'By Any Means', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'James Payne, Tony Jordan, Richard Lazarus', null, 'Warren Brown, Shelley Conn, Elliot Knight, Gina McKee, Andrew-Lee Potts', null, 'By Any Means follows a clandestine unit living on the edge and playing the criminal elite at their own game, existing in the grey area between the letter of the law and true justice.', 'By Any Means follows a clandestine unit living on the edge and playing the criminal elite at their own game, existing in the grey area between the letter of the law and true justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zELGJ9tP1NYD0pInhEvVdxSTQZV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60245'),
  ('621253690654511778', 'By the age of 30', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Honami Sato, Hirona Yamazaki, Ryo Sato, Natsumi Ishibashi, Shuntaro Yanagi, Akiko Kikuchi, Arata Horii, Kurumi Nakata', null, 'A humorous and bitter depiction of the real worries, impatience, and anger of a woman living in these times. Follow the love, career and sex lives of 29-year-old single women who try to survive in modern Tokyo.', 'A humorous and bitter depiction of the real worries, impatience, and anger of a woman living in these times. Follow the love, career and sex lives of 29-year-old single women who try to survive in modern Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6juOtdSd7TL4Tq07XAbCbCch3Wo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202795'),
  ('281948834921906190', 'By the Grace of the Gods', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Azusa Tadokoro, Hiroki Yasumoto, Makoto Koichi, Marika Kouno, Makoto Furukawa, Kikuko Inoue, Yuuki Kuwahara, Motomu Kiyokawa', 'TV-14', 'Only 39 years into a life full of bad luck, Ryoma Takebayashi passes away in his sleep! Taking pity on him, three divine beings show compassion by reincarnating him as a young boy to a magical, new world. Now he spends his time researching and caring for slimes in the forest. But after healing an injured traveler, Ryoma decides to set out with his new friends on a journey to use his power to help others. A whole new world awaits him, where his skills as a magic user and slime tamer continue to elicit surprise and admiration.', 'Only 39 years into a life full of bad luck, Ryoma Takebayashi passes away in his sleep! Taking pity on him, three divine beings show compassion by reincarnating him as a young boy to a magical, new world. Now he spends his time researching and caring for slimes in the forest. But after healing an injured traveler, Ryoma decides to set out with his new friends on a journey to use his power to help others. A whole new world awaits him, where his skills as a magic user and slime tamer continue to elicit surprise and admiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfYje9AgtWzYCeCQbMU3nHdE4k1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102086'),
  ('781129289553169349', 'Bye Bye, Earth', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Fairouz Ai, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ami Koshimizu, Kenjiro Tsuda, Junya Enoki, Saori Hayami, Junichi Suwabe, Natsuki Hanae', 'TV-14', 'Belle Lablac doesn’t really fit in as the only human being in a world full of anthropomorphic animals. No fangs, no fur, no scales, no claws. Lonely and eager to discover where she comes from, Belle journeys to find answers to the questions of her heart. Carrying nothing but her giant sword, the Runding, she faces a world of possibilities and pitfalls in hopes of discovering the truth.', 'Belle Lablac doesn’t really fit in as the only human being in a world full of anthropomorphic animals. No fangs, no fur, no scales, no claws. Lonely and eager to discover where she comes from, Belle journeys to find answers to the questions of her heart. Carrying nothing but her giant sword, the Runding, she faces a world of possibilities and pitfalls in hopes of discovering the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuo2jor1Hya3bT1imNxEScgoh5o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214587'),
  ('345938686157707843', 'Byhåla', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Peter Settman, Fredde Granberg', 'Peter Settman, Fredde Granberg', 'Peter Settman, Fredde Granberg', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iG9xIZJqaQhQiN9beAiElWnLY5D.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65985'),
  ('897537605111983244', 'Byker Grove', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Adele Rose', null, 'George Trotter', null, 'Byker Grove was a British television series which aired between 1989 and 2006 and was created by Adele Rose. The show was broadcast at 5.10pm after Newsround on CBBC on BBC One. It was aimed at an older teenager and young adult audience, tackling serious and sometimes controversial storylines.', 'Byker Grove was a British television series which aired between 1989 and 2006 and was created by Adele Rose. The show was broadcast at 5.10pm after Newsround on CBBC on BBC One. It was aimed at an older teenager and young adult audience, tackling serious and sometimes controversial storylines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6wgit9YTMGW9PnSYFL6pOv54NJ.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:3126'),
  ('521717077614658411', 'Byomkesh Bakshi', 1993, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Basu Chatterjee', 'Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay, Basu Chatterjee', 'Rajit Kapoor, K.K. Raina, Kartik Dutta, Sukanya Kulkarni', null, 'An intelligent detective from Kolkata solves many mystery that unsolved by police without any weapons.', 'An intelligent detective from Kolkata solves many mystery that unsolved by police without any weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Hudn4jiJArcg89UEDsF6gAvgWo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62707'),
  ('21755256295971346', 'Byplayers ~ What If 6 Supporting Actors Had a Houseshare', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Daigo Matsui', null, 'Kenichi Endo, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yutaka Matsushige, Susumu Terajima, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'Kenichi Endo, Ren Osugi, Tomorowo Taguchi, Susumu Terajima, Yutaka Matsushige and Ken Mitsuishi all receive offers to take part in a big budget drama series with a famous lead actor and world famous director. To study their roles and relationships, the director asks the six supporting actors to live together for 3 months at a share house. The actors begin their temporary living arrangement. An incident from 10 years ago though causes the actors to hold resentment.', 'Kenichi Endo, Ren Osugi, Tomorowo Taguchi, Susumu Terajima, Yutaka Matsushige and Ken Mitsuishi all receive offers to take part in a big budget drama series with a famous lead actor and world famous director. To study their roles and relationships, the director asks the six supporting actors to live together for 3 months at a share house. The actors begin their temporary living arrangement. An incident from 10 years ago though causes the actors to hold resentment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gStJWuDr1MTq5e4JZMS9xwTgKPR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71141'),
  ('957193702914635853', 'Byplayers: 100 Days in the Forest of Supporting Actors', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Kenichi Endo, Tomorowo Taguchi, Susumu Terajima, Yutaka Matsushige, Ken Mitsuishi, Kana Kita', null, 'Set in "Byplaywood" a large film studio surrounded by forest, far from the city. The story depicts 100 days of turmoil caused by the gathering of serial dramas and movies from various TV stations at once in this remote studio. It is a drama full of battles for ratings between studios, clashes between young, mid-career, and big names, and a heartwarming story of friendship and bonding. Also, the self-deprecation and parodies are enhanced by the fact that the actors play a role of themselves.', 'Set in "Byplaywood" a large film studio surrounded by forest, far from the city. The story depicts 100 days of turmoil caused by the gathering of serial dramas and movies from various TV stations at once in this remote studio. It is a drama full of battles for ratings between studios, clashes between young, mid-career, and big names, and a heartwarming story of friendship and bonding. Also, the self-deprecation and parodies are enhanced by the fact that the actors play a role of themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKLRrVo39HLIfntW7hcB87uWgMP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116665'),
  ('376698585484234551', 'Bytt är bytt', 2014, 'Reality', 'Joel Karsberg', null, 'Renée Nyberg', null, 'Big money gameshow, where it pays to know what''s valuable and what''s not. The show''s antique expert has travelled around the country and found 8 collectibles, ranging in value from 500 dollars up to a staggering 500 000 dollars. In each show a couple competing together faces the task of eliminating these objects, one by one, winning the value of the last collectible standing. Will their instincts and the expert''s advice send them home with a piece of trash or a valuable piece of treasure?', 'Big money gameshow, where it pays to know what''s valuable and what''s not. The show''s antique expert has travelled around the country and found 8 collectibles, ranging in value from 500 dollars up to a staggering 500 000 dollars. In each show a couple competing together faces the task of eliminating these objects, one by one, winning the value of the last collectible standing. Will their instincts and the expert''s advice send them home with a piece of trash or a valuable piece of treasure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LOrpgSTwddS2dvcWYzdQ2wfkxV.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:95043'),
  ('25714403038759691', 'C à vous', 2009, 'Talk', 'Alessandra Sublet, Pierre-Antoine Capton', null, null, null, 'Every day live on FRANCE 5, Anne-Élisabeth Lemoine and her team receive those who make the news. In the second part, the program welcomes, around a meal prepared by a qualified chef, artists in promotion.', 'Every day live on FRANCE 5, Anne-Élisabeth Lemoine and her team receive those who make the news. In the second part, the program welcomes, around a meal prepared by a qualified chef, artists in promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWUZ9Gb3qCiOusMtn2AC9uWez5C.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:79239'),
