  ('168285501701987777', 'CentoVetrine', 2001, 'Soap, Drama', 'Cristiana Farina', null, 'Roberto Alpi, Elisabetta Coraini, Marianna De Micheli, Michele D''Anca, Alessandro Mario, Sergio Troiano, Jgor Barbazza, Luca Biagini', 'NR', 'The series tells the stories of some of the characters who work or are related to an imaginary shopping center Centovetrine, located in the center of Turin. There are many stories of love and passion, but also struggles for power and dynastic quarrels in the telefilm.', 'The series tells the stories of some of the characters who work or are related to an imaginary shopping center Centovetrine, located in the center of Turin. There are many stories of love and passion, but also struggles for power and dynastic quarrels in the telefilm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25v6iDGmIpyG3zndfYdt4KfQgQ9.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:80318'),
  ('1146614134993352920', 'Central Park', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Josh Gad, Loren Bouchard, Nora Smith', null, 'Josh Gad, Leslie Odom Jr., Tituss Burgess, Daveed Diggs, Kathryn Hahn, Stanley Tucci', 'TV-14', 'Owen Tillerman and his family live an unconventional life in New York''s bustling Central Park, which Owen manages. Now, they''ll have to fend off a wealthy hotel heiress who wants to turn the park into condos.', 'Owen Tillerman and his family live an unconventional life in New York''s bustling Central Park, which Owen manages. Now, they''ll have to fend off a wealthy hotel heiress who wants to turn the park into condos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckmEgQdbSAw0jiJFJT1a1W1LEFy.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:98198'),
  ('319130496320235281', 'Century of Love', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Chawanon Sarapat', 'Pittaya Saechua, Kantapon Jindataweephol, Yada Suwanpattana, Ponlawit Ketprapakorn, Pornsroung Rouyruen, Koravich Sarasin, Deuntem Salitul, Jirawat Wachirasarunpat', null, 'To reunite with his long-dead love, a man uses a mystical secret to lengthen his life until her rebirth — only to learn her reincarnation is a young man.', 'To reunite with his long-dead love, a man uses a mystical secret to lengthen his life until her rebirth — only to learn her reincarnation is a young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JAJR9J0b4Br4rql4XHgq7qt7SC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253296'),
  ('158684752760995700', 'CEO-dol Mart', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Jang Kyung-rim', 'Lee Sin-young, Xiumin, HYUNGWON, Choi Won-myeong, Lee Sae-on, Choi Jung-woon, Kim Shana', 'TV-14', 'It depicts the various stories that unfold as past idol group members gather together to run a supermarket.', 'It depicts the various stories that unfold as past idol group members gather together to run a supermarket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aTeIyTADz2Q66Iu3Xtqca1z9Z5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210242'),
  ('429112441538708427', 'Cerberus', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Arisa Ogasawara, Manami Numakura, Masayuki Omoro, Shunsuke Sakuya, Mariya Ise, Yoji Ueda, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Mao Ichimichi', 'TV-MA', 'Sword and magic rule in the continent of Kuna''ahn. In this continent are three powerful nations: the Holy Kingdom of Amoria, the Kingdom of Ishilfen, and the Kingdom of Vanrodis, which share a delicate balance of power. Should disaster befall any one of the three nations, war would spread throughout the continent. Also residing there is the feared "Evil Dragon" Daganzord, an unstoppable force that leaves nothing but scorched land and destruction wherever he goes. Hiiro''s parents, Bairo and Kismitete, joined other sorcerers in a magic ritual ten years ago in an attempt to seal Daganzord, but failed when someone interfered. The ritual would later become known as the "Balbagoa Tragedy." After being rescued by Giruu, young Hiiro set out to learn swordsmanship so that he could avenge his parents.', 'Sword and magic rule in the continent of Kuna''ahn. In this continent are three powerful nations: the Holy Kingdom of Amoria, the Kingdom of Ishilfen, and the Kingdom of Vanrodis, which share a delicate balance of power. Should disaster befall any one of the three nations, war would spread throughout the continent. Also residing there is the feared "Evil Dragon" Daganzord, an unstoppable force that leaves nothing but scorched land and destruction wherever he goes. Hiiro''s parents, Bairo and Kismitete, joined other sorcerers in a magic ritual ten years ago in an attempt to seal Daganzord, but failed when someone interfered. The ritual would later become known as the "Balbagoa Tragedy." After being rescued by Giruu, young Hiiro set out to learn swordsmanship so that he could avenge his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFKUmHIeT2Ezjbdgi3oZK1oEJJP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66102'),
  ('399737812817683527', 'Ceres: Celestial Legend', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Katsuyuki Konishi, Kujira, Junko Iwao, Ayako Kawasumi, Tomokazu Seki, Shin-ichiro Miki, Matthew Erickson, Tomokazu Sugita', 'NR', 'Aya Mikage and her twin brother Aki are soon driven apart by the forces of fate… On their sixteenth birthday, Aya and Aki are called to the family home to be given a special present. What they thought was a birthday party, however, was really a test—one which Aya failed. She was found to possess the reincarnated spirit of an ageless celestial maiden (tennyo), one bent on the recovery of her heavenly raiment (hagoromo) and the destruction of the Mikage family. Aya quickly finds herself separated from her beloved brother, and hunted by her own family.', 'Aya Mikage and her twin brother Aki are soon driven apart by the forces of fate… On their sixteenth birthday, Aya and Aki are called to the family home to be given a special present. What they thought was a birthday party, however, was really a test—one which Aya failed. She was found to possess the reincarnated spirit of an ageless celestial maiden (tennyo), one bent on the recovery of her heavenly raiment (hagoromo) and the destruction of the Mikage family. Aya quickly finds herself separated from her beloved brother, and hunted by her own family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FZ2K6QGVgbfI6ZwaSVJY8wb0A9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26935'),
  ('849642510796949405', 'Cero en conducta', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Ortiz de Pinedo', null, 'Jorge Ortiz de Pinedo, Martha Ofelia Galindo, David Villalpando, Homero Ferruzca, Gerardo Flores, Alfonso Iglesias Ruaix "Pompin III", Luis Miguel Hernández "Queli", Patricia Álvarez', 'TV-14', 'Jorgito is a rebellious and insolent student who doesn''t mince words when it comes to making fun of his teachers. Maestra Canuta and Director Rigoberto Patiño are the butt of all his jokes and they do not hesitate to give him severe punishments when they realize that Jorgito''s sharp tongue is attacking them. This comedy program shows a group of irreverent students who, through their jokes, make fun of the current political and social situation in Mexico. Nobody is saved from the ridicule and the occurrences of these kids who, behind their harmless appearance, hide sharp criticism and double meaning jokes.', 'Jorgito is a rebellious and insolent student who doesn''t mince words when it comes to making fun of his teachers. Maestra Canuta and Director Rigoberto Patiño are the butt of all his jokes and they do not hesitate to give him severe punishments when they realize that Jorgito''s sharp tongue is attacking them. This comedy program shows a group of irreverent students who, through their jokes, make fun of the current political and social situation in Mexico. Nobody is saved from the ridicule and the occurrences of these kids who, behind their harmless appearance, hide sharp criticism and double meaning jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcZTqtDyOrrGBoHQWcXxJJ2OEE1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132702'),
  ('918175462650975336', 'Cesar 911', 2014, 'Reality', 'Cesar Millan', null, 'Cesar Millan', 'TV-PG', 'The world’s most loved dog behaviorist, Cesar Millan, rescues neighborhoods terrorized by badly misbehaving pooches. Each week, Cesar is called in by whistleblowers who tell on the four-legged thugs who scare neighbors, clients, friends, and even family members! Cesar surprises dog owners to witness the chaos firsthand and uses his unmatched expertise to bring balance to the dogs and humans.', 'The world’s most loved dog behaviorist, Cesar Millan, rescues neighborhoods terrorized by badly misbehaving pooches. Each week, Cesar is called in by whistleblowers who tell on the four-legged thugs who scare neighbors, clients, friends, and even family members! Cesar surprises dog owners to witness the chaos firsthand and uses his unmatched expertise to bring balance to the dogs and humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mplajKxJ56mL6VlUl6gWPA5gXJn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62105'),
  ('1066636975695848454', 'CESTVS -The Roman Fighter-', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiromu Mineta, Rikiya Koyama, Kensho Ono, Hiroki Touchi, Yuto Uemura, Kikuko Inoue, Aya Endo, Ryota Takeuchi', 'TV-14', 'Cestvs enters his first match at the slave gladiator training school. Though he''s bewildered to discover that his opponent is his best friend, he wins the match, and his opponent is killed on the spot. According to his instructor Zafar, losers have no future. "Every time you win, your opponent will die. You''re practically a murderer!" With all his sorrow and rage clenched in his fists, Cestvs survives, as one after another powerful opponents stand in his way, as well as the shadow of Nero, fifth emperor of the Roman Empire. With no other way to secure his freedom, can Cestvs seize his future?!', 'Cestvs enters his first match at the slave gladiator training school. Though he''s bewildered to discover that his opponent is his best friend, he wins the match, and his opponent is killed on the spot. According to his instructor Zafar, losers have no future. "Every time you win, your opponent will die. You''re practically a murderer!" With all his sorrow and rage clenched in his fists, Cestvs survives, as one after another powerful opponents stand in his way, as well as the shadow of Nero, fifth emperor of the Roman Empire. With no other way to secure his freedom, can Cestvs seize his future?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2teSdenh9YQOaNGRlg7XCgKXwj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112615'),
  ('654658696499779397', 'Cesty domů', 2010, 'Soap, Drama', 'Barbara Bulvová, Jan Coufal', null, 'Alois Švehlík, Veronika Freimanová, Roman Zach, Miroslav Etzler, Henrieta Hornáčková, Petr Štěpán, Martina Hudečková, Andrea Kerestešová', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LBQbWe2hyWuCJJwJdWRYx6etqw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:50829'),
  ('1137351592349839929', 'Chacha Vidhayak Hain Humare', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Zakir Khan', null, 'Zakir Khan, Alka Amin, Zakir Hussain, Kumar Varun, Venus Singh, Vyom Sharma, Abhimanyu Singh, Gaurav K Sharma', null, 'Ronny Bhaiya leads a double life - To the world he is the nephew of the MLA - and likes to think of himself as a Jann Neta, and at home he is the jobless 26 year old with no sense of responsibility to his family. The show explores Ronny''s adventures as he gets stuck in multiple situations because of this big lie that precedes him.', 'Ronny Bhaiya leads a double life - To the world he is the nephew of the MLA - and likes to think of himself as a Jann Neta, and at home he is the jobless 26 year old with no sense of responsibility to his family. The show explores Ronny''s adventures as he gets stuck in multiple situations because of this big lie that precedes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thMrz42QAhKOvf7dZu64LVvSeS4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99889'),
  ('913906838202639689', 'Chachi No.1', 2023, 'Drama', 'P.G.', null, 'Bharat Bhushan, Deepak Sharma, Prajakta Jahagirdar', null, 'Harsh has come to visit his aunt at the village. Upon coming here, he notices that his aunt is not satisfied with his uncle physically, so his infatuation gets the better of him, as he starts getting closer to his aunt.', 'Harsh has come to visit his aunt at the village. Upon coming here, he notices that his aunt is not satisfied with his uncle physically, so his infatuation gets the better of him, as he starts getting closer to his aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZI0Zdfh2fCAoL9vbZhmTmh7Dob.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237560'),
  ('964030539068371709', 'Chad', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Nasim Pedrad', null, 'Nasim Pedrad, Ella Mika, Saba Homayoon, Paul Chahidi, Jake Ryan, Alexa Loo, Thomas Barbusca', 'TV-MA', 'A 14-year-old Persian-American boy desperately tries to fit in, cope with his mother''s dating life, and figure out his cultural identity.', 'A 14-year-old Persian-American boy desperately tries to fit in, cope with his mother''s dating life, and figure out his cultural identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8i3KBIgdnxpHgzE0eBr0CuKWTF5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89578'),
  ('354440700343428923', 'Chad Powers', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Michael Waldron, Glen Powell', null, 'Glen Powell, Perry Mattfeld, Quentin Plair, Wynn Everett, Frankie A. Rodriguez, Steve Zahn', 'TV-MA', 'Eight years after an unforgivable mistake nukes his promising college football career, hotshot quarterback Russ Holliday tries to resurrect his dreams by disguising himself as Chad Powers - a talented oddball who walks on to the struggling South Georgia Catfish.', 'Eight years after an unforgivable mistake nukes his promising college football career, hotshot quarterback Russ Holliday tries to resurrect his dreams by disguising himself as Chad Powers - a talented oddball who walks on to the struggling South Georgia Catfish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgMS8irQKfMrR6mJhKtK6vbxDTC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247168'),
  ('346424305209549866', 'Chaika - The Coffin Princess', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junji Majima, Chika Anzai, Yuuko Hara, Chiwa Saito, Tetsuo Kanao, Naomi Ohzora', 'TV-14', 'Toru Acura is a 20-year-old retired soldier meandering through life now that the war has ended. He encounters Chaika Trabant, a 14-year-old sorceress carrying a coffin, and follows her in hopes of finding meaning to his life again. The two travel with Toru''s adopted sister, Akari, the employed member of the group and thus Toru''s source of income.', 'Toru Acura is a 20-year-old retired soldier meandering through life now that the war has ended. He encounters Chaika Trabant, a 14-year-old sorceress carrying a coffin, and follows her in hopes of finding meaning to his life again. The two travel with Toru''s adopted sister, Akari, the employed member of the group and thus Toru''s source of income.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eh02y67ge1J6ThiTH3zPVprri2o.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60825'),
  ('675803717290326634', 'Chain Chronicle: The Light of Haecceitas', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Ayane Sakura, Akira Ishida', null, 'Set in the land of Yuguto, the people thought that the land they live is the size of the world, but it’s actually divided into several areas, each with a respective king. Even though there were small wars among areas, the kings had roundtable meetings to maintain peace and balance. It was until a dark group of dark monsters appeared...', 'Set in the land of Yuguto, the people thought that the land they live is the size of the world, but it’s actually divided into several areas, each with a respective king. Even though there were small wars among areas, the kings had roundtable meetings to maintain peace and balance. It was until a dark group of dark monsters appeared...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wBEr3ZSPukbb2rS6lRauyeDv19.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69237'),
  ('378246602569597356', 'Chained Soldier', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuya Hirose, Akari Kito, Yume Miyamoto, Hina Tachibana, Maaya Uchida, Nene Hieda, Reina Ueda, Mari Hino', 'TV-MA', 'Destructive monsters from the Mato dimension threaten the earth, while women gifted with powers from Peaches try to stop them. But to save the world, Yuuki must be willing to become Chief Kyoka''s servant both on the battlefield and at home.', 'Destructive monsters from the Mato dimension threaten the earth, while women gifted with powers from Peaches try to stop them. But to save the world, Yuuki must be willing to become Chief Kyoka''s servant both on the battlefield and at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SFBctEZE0X4t1A2q16MC7EJrsC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139060'),
  ('348433366069144772', 'Chains of Heart', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'TJ Tommys', null, 'Sarunsathorn Tanawatcharawat, Raweewit Jiraphongkanon, Tanawat Sukfuengfoo, Natarit Worakornlertsith, Alongkorn Chaovanaprecha, Nawaporn Chansuk, Songsit Rungnopakunsi, Kiatkamol Lata', null, 'Haunted by a past love yet drawn to someone new, a grieving chef must decide if chasing revenge is worth risking the fresh start he’s finally found.', 'Haunted by a past love yet drawn to someone new, a grieving chef must decide if chasing revenge is worth risking the fresh start he’s finally found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz5Mhmg7s8q7meqUKffEDBsfKCf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217619'),
  ('874165386808088846', 'Chainsaw Man', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kikunosuke Toya, Tomori Kusunoki, Shogo Sakata, Fairouz Ai', 'TV-14', 'Denji has a simple dream—to live a happy and peaceful life, spending time with a girl he likes. This is a far cry from reality, however, as Denji is forced by the yakuza into killing devils in order to pay off his crushing debts. Using his pet devil Pochita as a weapon, he is ready to do anything for a bit of cash.', 'Denji has a simple dream—to live a happy and peaceful life, spending time with a girl he likes. This is a far cry from reality, however, as Denji is forced by the yakuza into killing devils in order to pay off his crushing debts. Using his pet devil Pochita as a weapon, he is ready to do anything for a bit of cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVtx7Xn9UxNJqvG2BkvhCcmed9S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114410'),
  ('617364999385970289', 'Chainsaw Man - The Compilation', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kikunosuke Toya, Tomori Kusunoki, Shogo Sakata, Fairouz Ai', 'TV-14', 'The two-part compilation, Part I and Part II, re-edits and condenses the key moments from the first season of the Chainsaw Man anime. This compilation revisits Denji''s journey, from his humble beginnings as a debt-ridden devil hunter to his transformation into the Chainsaw Man. In addition to the re-edited material, the compilation includes newly animated segments titled Chainsaw Days. These segments adapt bonus chapters from the original manga.', 'The two-part compilation, Part I and Part II, re-edits and condenses the key moments from the first season of the Chainsaw Man anime. This compilation revisits Denji''s journey, from his humble beginnings as a debt-ridden devil hunter to his transformation into the Chainsaw Man. In addition to the re-edited material, the compilation includes newly animated segments titled Chainsaw Days. These segments adapt bonus chapters from the original manga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23oDHewikLJRgwOrt7FlTzR0jnk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299555'),
  ('478922585043027394', 'ChalkZone', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids, Comedy', 'Bill Burnett, Larry Huber', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'When anything is erased from a chalkboard, it’s not really gone – it just enters a realm called the Chalkzone. And fifth grader Rudy Tabootie found a way to go there! With a piece of “White Lightning” chalk, he can enter the Chalkzone any time he likes. In the Chalkzone, Rudy befriends Snap, a bold superhero Rudy drew years ago. But Rudy soon discovers not every doodle is friendly.', 'When anything is erased from a chalkboard, it’s not really gone – it just enters a realm called the Chalkzone. And fifth grader Rudy Tabootie found a way to go there! With a piece of “White Lightning” chalk, he can enter the Chalkzone any time he likes. In the Chalkzone, Rudy befriends Snap, a bold superhero Rudy drew years ago. But Rudy soon discovers not every doodle is friendly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MuylmYxxXnTBCmASj9586Ug1mk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4413'),
  ('635251365515266888', 'Challenge of the GoBots', 1984, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Challenge of the GoBots is an American animated series produced by Hanna-Barbera, based on the Gobots toy-line released from Tonka. The show originally debuted in animated form as a five-part miniseries, which aired in syndication from October 29 - November 2, 1984. A regular series followed the next year, premiering on September 16, 1985 as part of the new weekday/weekend morning programming block called The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera. The series was later rerun on the USA Cartoon Express.', 'Challenge of the GoBots is an American animated series produced by Hanna-Barbera, based on the Gobots toy-line released from Tonka. The show originally debuted in animated form as a five-part miniseries, which aired in syndication from October 29 - November 2, 1984. A regular series followed the next year, premiering on September 16, 1985 as part of the new weekday/weekend morning programming block called The Funtastic World of Hanna-Barbera. The series was later rerun on the USA Cartoon Express.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mbE2Qy4ejloOLA1FMy8jHWi8CY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:697'),
  ('23128114503034762', 'Challenge of the Super Friends', 1978, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Casey Kasem, Jack Angel, Don Messick, Vic Perrin, Henry Corden, Frank Welker, Ted Cassidy, Buster Jones', null, 'Challenge of the Super Friends is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 9, 1978, to December 23, 1978, on ABC. The complete series was produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions for Warner Bros. Television and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics and created by Julius Schwartz, Gardner Fox and Mike Sekowsky. It was the third series of Super Friends cartoons, following the original Super Friends in 1973 and The All-New Super Friends Hour in 1977. It continues to air on Boomerang in the United States.', 'Challenge of the Super Friends is an American animated television series about a team of superheroes which ran from September 9, 1978, to December 23, 1978, on ABC. The complete series was produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions for Warner Bros. Television and is based on the Justice League and associated comic book characters published by DC Comics and created by Julius Schwartz, Gardner Fox and Mike Sekowsky. It was the third series of Super Friends cartoons, following the original Super Friends in 1973 and The All-New Super Friends Hour in 1977. It continues to air on Boomerang in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Hfl8qcSw0m4Lh3NMJd3McFB9mC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10610'),
  ('423356944742424999', 'Challenger: The Final Flight', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Steven Leckart, Glen Zipper', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Engineers, officials and the crew members'' families provide their perspective on the 1986 Space Shuttle Challenger disaster and its aftermath.', 'Engineers, officials and the crew members'' families provide their perspective on the 1986 Space Shuttle Challenger disaster and its aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJqCgP3vzu79mtf3i51Dv2B20Oy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108298'),
  ('23542630858766813', 'Challenges at Midlife', 2022, 'Drama', 'A Nai', 'A Nai', 'Lei Jiayin, Yuan Quan, Zhang Yixing, Jia Nailiang, Liang Guanhua, Luo Haiqiong, Lian Shumei, Li Naiwen', null, 'Jian Hongcheng, the son of a former factory director, returns to his hometown years after being forced out, determined to protect his late father’s legacy from being sold off by an untrustworthy relative. In the process, he reunites with his college love, Ning You, now divorced and revealed to be the daughter of a man connected to his family''s past turmoil. Together, they navigate complex family conflicts, legal battles, and unresolved feelings, while confronting the challenges and realities of middle age.', 'Jian Hongcheng, the son of a former factory director, returns to his hometown years after being forced out, determined to protect his late father’s legacy from being sold off by an untrustworthy relative. In the process, he reunites with his college love, Ning You, now divorced and revealed to be the daughter of a man connected to his family''s past turmoil. Together, they navigate complex family conflicts, legal battles, and unresolved feelings, while confronting the challenges and realities of middle age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nk6TEteJcBx4jGRWlg248eVJQEh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158168'),
