  ('492257010492196918', 'Check Out', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chahub Marut Ghoummeddin, Vittawin Veeravidhayanant, Boat Anakame Binsaman, M Sarawut Laoruamsap, Beam Atichart Lawansathian, Korravee Keawko, Sirilapas Kongtrakarn', null, 'Caught between a persistent first love and a vacation fling who has a girlfriend, Dao Nuea must decide where his heart truly belongs.', 'Caught between a persistent first love and a vacation fling who has a girlfriend, Dao Nuea must decide where his heart truly belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDnuMFuoEzMmwDVWiKqnCyVCy0E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130469'),
  ('509844544070793838', 'Checkmate', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Agatha Christie', null, 'Hu Yitian, Leon Zhang, Viann Zhang Xinyu, Xuan Yan, Qu Gang, Shen Yujie, Zeng Yongti', null, 'It tells the story of Situ Yan, a young lawyer from Peking who was dismissed from his post for sticking to his principles. He comes to Harbin to become a detective where he meets the forthright and wealthy friend Luo Shao Chuan in ensuing cases. He also meets Zhou Mo Wan, a woman who dares to love and hate. Together, they dig up a huge conspiracy.', 'It tells the story of Situ Yan, a young lawyer from Peking who was dismissed from his post for sticking to his principles. He comes to Harbin to become a detective where he meets the forthright and wealthy friend Luo Shao Chuan in ensuing cases. He also meets Zhou Mo Wan, a woman who dares to love and hate. Together, they dig up a huge conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPnZXp16k5Zjrzvo02GFGdPqFjG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207824'),
  ('93288364693631295', 'Checo Pérez: ¡No te rindas, cabr#n!', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Sergio Pérez', null, 'Checo begins his 2023 Formula 1 season under great pressure. He has the best car on the grid and aims to become the world champion. He has a great start on the street circuits of Baku and Jeddah, but an accident in Monaco puts his season at risk. Checo needs to show why he belongs among the best and never stop proving it.', 'Checo begins his 2023 Formula 1 season under great pressure. He has the best car on the grid and aims to become the world champion. He has a great start on the street circuits of Baku and Jeddah, but an accident in Monaco puts his season at risk. Checo needs to show why he belongs among the best and never stop proving it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXrTQwypkz96xIxbUXg2orksw9Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258597'),
  ('1145008662869620346', 'Cheeky Angel', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Nishimori', null, 'Yuji Ueda, Megumi Hayashibara, Kazunari Tanaka, Makiko Ohmoto, Naoko Matsui, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Wataru Takagi, Atsushi Kisaichi', null, 'Cheeky Angel is a comedy romance action manga series by Hiroyuki Nishimori. The story revolves around the adventures of 15-year-old schoolgirl Megumi Amatsuka, a popular and beautiful tomboy that always get into fights with a secret: she used to be a boy. Originally a serial in Shōnen Sunday, it has been collected in 20 tankōbon volumes and adapted as a 50-episode anime series. In 2001, the manga won the Shogakukan Manga Award for shōnen.', 'Cheeky Angel is a comedy romance action manga series by Hiroyuki Nishimori. The story revolves around the adventures of 15-year-old schoolgirl Megumi Amatsuka, a popular and beautiful tomboy that always get into fights with a secret: she used to be a boy. Originally a serial in Shōnen Sunday, it has been collected in 20 tankōbon volumes and adapted as a 50-episode anime series. In 2001, the manga won the Shogakukan Manga Award for shōnen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKRwRjnfwe9vC6IsRQ36LaJAo02.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42565'),
  ('770479905738142349', 'Cheeky Business', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuel Poulain-Arnaud, Armand Robin', null, null, null, '1980. The Videotex messaging service arrives in France. From the depths of their Parisian suburbs, Simon, Toni and Stéphanie, three students, will seize this technological innovation and challenge their enmity to draw a revolutionary idea: the first erotic chat service.', '1980. The Videotex messaging service arrives in France. From the depths of their Parisian suburbs, Simon, Toni and Stéphanie, three students, will seize this technological innovation and challenge their enmity to draw a revolutionary idea: the first erotic chat service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cyVQOyabhLlTS18r2whwcEwJZb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113819'),
  ('719695038135270221', 'Cheer', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Monica Aldama, Gabi Butler, Morgan Simianer, La''Darius Marshall, Maddy Brum, Gillian Rupert, Payton Sykes, Jada Wooten', null, 'The stakes on the mat are high, but for these cheerleaders, the only thing more brutal than their workouts and more exceptional than their performances are the stories of adversity and triumph behind the athletes themselves.', 'The stakes on the mat are high, but for these cheerleaders, the only thing more brutal than their workouts and more exceptional than their performances are the stories of adversity and triumph behind the athletes themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GzthY7qguoUs43K9qmwHJWjI05.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97401'),
  ('256074270353556206', 'Cheer Boys!!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Anri Katsu, Juri Kimura', 'TV-14', 'Disheartened with judo, college student Haruki Bando was invited by his childhood friend Kazuma Hashimoto to create "BREAKERS", an unprecedented boys'' cheerleading team. Those that came to join all were very characteristic in nature: argumentative Mizoguchi, voracious Ton, frivolous Kansai boys Gen and Ichiro, and Sho who has cheerleading experience.', 'Disheartened with judo, college student Haruki Bando was invited by his childhood friend Kazuma Hashimoto to create "BREAKERS", an unprecedented boys'' cheerleading team. Those that came to join all were very characteristic in nature: argumentative Mizoguchi, voracious Ton, frivolous Kansai boys Gen and Ichiro, and Sho who has cheerleading experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5g8lIymedbfQAuYTzVfhdgPc0J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67616'),
  ('1041137194790325964', 'Cheer Up', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Lee Ok-gyu', 'Cha Hae-won', 'Han Ji-hyeon, Bae In-hyuk, Kim Hyun-jin, Jang Gyu-ri, Lee Eun-saem, Yang Dong-geun, Han Su-ah, Kim Shin-bi', null, 'A renowned college cheerleading squad is about to go under. But love and mysteries occur within the team.', 'A renowned college cheerleading squad is about to go under. But love and mysteries occur within the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agyQFkNKBExKYiIealedXNDIDqn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155229'),
