  ('383553718256487304', 'Citadel', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'David Weil, Josh Appelbaum, Bryan Oh', null, 'Richard Madden, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Ashleigh Cummings, Roland Møller, Osy Ikhile, Caoilinn Springall, Lesley Manville, Stanley Tucci', 'TV-14', 'What if you lost your memory? What if a spy didn’t know they were a spy? Years ago, the top agents of Citadel, Mason Kane and Nadia Sinh, had their minds wiped. But, they’re called back to action as sinister forces emerge from the past. With the help of spymaster Bernard Orlick, these former lovers must remember the past to save the future.', 'What if you lost your memory? What if a spy didn’t know they were a spy? Years ago, the top agents of Citadel, Mason Kane and Nadia Sinh, had their minds wiped. But, they’re called back to action as sinister forces emerge from the past. With the help of spymaster Bernard Orlick, these former lovers must remember the past to save the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcrDB32TqpAGwvQFbICALGxSzn3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:114922'),
  ('943456142162708213', 'Citadel Honey Bunny', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sita Menon', null, 'Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Varun Dhawan, Kay Kay Menon, Kashvi Majmundar, Simran, Saqib Saleem, Sikandar Kher, Shivankit Singh Parihar', 'TV-14', 'When stuntman Bunny recruits struggling actress Honey for a side gig, they are hurled into a high-stakes world of action, espionage and betrayal. Years later, as their dangerous past catches up, the estranged Honey and Bunny must reunite and fight to protect their young daughter Nadia.', 'When stuntman Bunny recruits struggling actress Honey for a side gig, they are hurled into a high-stakes world of action, espionage and betrayal. Years later, as their dangerous past catches up, the estranged Honey and Bunny must reunite and fight to protect their young daughter Nadia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzZ9J2FOsaq1DCuD7k2f4ogbXdD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154084'),
  ('582777663238630559', 'Citadel: Diana', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Alessandro Fabbri', null, 'Matilda De Angelis, Lorenzo Cervasio, Maurizio Lombardi, Julia Piaton, Thekla Reuten, Giordana Faggiano, Daniele Paoloni, Jun Ichikawa', 'TV-14', 'Milan, 2030: Diana Cavalieri is a double agent for the secret syndicate Citadel, who infiltrated Manticore, the rival agency that destroyed Citadel eight years ago. Trapped behind enemy lines, Diana has a chance to leave the agency forever, but she has to decide whether to trust a surprising ally: the heir of Manticore Italy, Edo Zani.', 'Milan, 2030: Diana Cavalieri is a double agent for the secret syndicate Citadel, who infiltrated Manticore, the rival agency that destroyed Citadel eight years ago. Trapped behind enemy lines, Diana has a chance to leave the agency forever, but she has to decide whether to trust a surprising ally: the heir of Manticore Italy, Edo Zani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXfgTz0uYUfYVEiJ0gRra6tKoAp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214032'),
  ('497722191963389085', 'Cites', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pau Freixas', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Looking for love, sex, or just someone to move away from the loneliness, the characters in " Cites " meet face to face, after meeting online, laden with uncertainties and hopes. Based on the original format of the British series " Dates " Brian Elsley . Each episode of the series , located in Barcelona , focuses on two of these quotations , which come into play fears , secrets and expectations of its protagonists. A staff relations existing partner network around a character that cross each other and that we will find again throughout the series look.', 'Looking for love, sex, or just someone to move away from the loneliness, the characters in " Cites " meet face to face, after meeting online, laden with uncertainties and hopes. Based on the original format of the British series " Dates " Brian Elsley . Each episode of the series , located in Barcelona , focuses on two of these quotations , which come into play fears , secrets and expectations of its protagonists. A staff relations existing partner network around a character that cross each other and that we will find again throughout the series look.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z53FHnX4d91qy0oKXcTnSj00mEL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62453'),
  ('340558826197058397', 'Cites Barcelona', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'In the 21st Century, when dating has become a matter of texting, smartphone apps and virtual experiences, couples that have met via the internet go on a series of first dates. Catalan adaptation of the 2013 British series "Dates"', 'In the 21st Century, when dating has become a matter of texting, smartphone apps and virtual experiences, couples that have met via the internet go on a series of first dates. Catalan adaptation of the 2013 British series "Dates"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jStuS0GzjBQLo4Wli8DyLlLeQNb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:227554'),
  ('979987187269529590', 'Cities of the Underworld', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Don Wildman', 'TV-PG', 'Don Wildman travels to the farthest and deepest reaches of the globe, using cutting-edge technology to explore mysteries buried deep underground.', 'Don Wildman travels to the farthest and deepest reaches of the globe, using cutting-edge technology to explore mysteries buried deep underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSBetn4dWzxjIs5lXW6M3wxAOXj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3675'),
  ('789038291795648972', 'Citizen Khan', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Adil Ray', null, 'Adil Ray, Shobu Kapoor, Maya Sondhi, Bhavna Limbachia, Abdullah Afzal', null, 'Family-based sitcom set in the capital of British Pakistan - Sparkhill, Birmingham. Citizen Khan follows the trials and tribulations of loud-mouthed, tight-fisted, self-appointed community leader Mr Khan and his long suffering family, wife Mrs Khan and daughters Shazia and Alia.', 'Family-based sitcom set in the capital of British Pakistan - Sparkhill, Birmingham. Citizen Khan follows the trials and tribulations of loud-mouthed, tight-fisted, self-appointed community leader Mr Khan and his long suffering family, wife Mrs Khan and daughters Shazia and Alia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2Pgom5qonHPc4ihA2f4FYfVdmI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:58552'),
  ('444633390070072075', 'Citizen Smith', 1977, 'Comedy', 'John Sullivan', null, 'Robert Lindsay, Mike Grady, Hilda Braid', null, 'Classic BBC comedy starring Robert Lindsay as revolutionary leader Wolfie Smith of the Tooting Popular Front. Hoping to emulate his icons, Wolfie forms the Tooting Popular Front with a small group of his friends. However, he soon finds himself struggling to get his ambitious plans off the ground due to his laid back attitude and lack of organisation.', 'Classic BBC comedy starring Robert Lindsay as revolutionary leader Wolfie Smith of the Tooting Popular Front. Hoping to emulate his icons, Wolfie forms the Tooting Popular Front with a small group of his friends. However, he soon finds himself struggling to get his ambitious plans off the ground due to his laid back attitude and lack of organisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZ8tEdQkgozIP8d1NfzNp2nt3XZ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4234'),
  ('63583277528302993', 'Citrus', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Minami Tsuda, Hisako Kanemoto, Ikumi Hayama, Kana Ueda, Rei Matsuzaki, Shiori Izawa, Tomoaki Maeno', 'TV-14', 'Yuzu, a high school gyaru who hasn''t experienced her first love yet, transfers to an all-girls school after her mother remarries. She''s beyond upset that she can''t land a boyfriend at her new school. Then, on her first day, she meets the beautiful black-haired student council president Mei in the worst way possible. What''s more, she later finds out that Mei is her new step-sister, and they''ll be living under the same roof! And so the love affair between two polar opposite high school girls who find themselves drawn to one another begins!', 'Yuzu, a high school gyaru who hasn''t experienced her first love yet, transfers to an all-girls school after her mother remarries. She''s beyond upset that she can''t land a boyfriend at her new school. Then, on her first day, she meets the beautiful black-haired student council president Mei in the worst way possible. What''s more, she later finds out that Mei is her new step-sister, and they''ll be living under the same roof! And so the love affair between two polar opposite high school girls who find themselves drawn to one another begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h6v8gS1vKybZciqpNWeV5MFQNb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76063'),
  ('174169255701721059', 'City Detective', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Rod Cameron', null, 'Crime drama starring Rod Cameron as 43-year-old Bart Grant, a tough 1950s New York City police lieutenant.', 'Crime drama starring Rod Cameron as 43-year-old Bart Grant, a tough 1950s New York City police lieutenant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eF2EuE2fvXHQ5gm6sTt0fE2pbc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:17514'),
  ('235599666621336605', 'City Homicide', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Banas, John Hugginson', null, 'David Field, Shane Bourne, Noni Hazlehurst, Nadine Garner, Damien Richardson, Aaron Pedersen', null, 'City Homicide follows a group of detectives in the Homicide department of Melbourne''s Metropolitan Police Headquarters.', 'City Homicide follows a group of detectives in the Homicide department of Melbourne''s Metropolitan Police Headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSJWL9TKsOrb9Gz7CppvKJgU6Ii.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4850'),
  ('21942864436383261', 'City Hunter', 1987, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Mami Koyama, Tessyo Genda, Yoko Asagami', 'TV-14', 'Ryo Saeba works the streets of Tokyo as the City Hunter. He''s a "sweeper" and with his sidekick Kaori Makimura, he keeps the city clean. People hire the City Hunter to solve their dangerous problems, which he does with a Colt Python. When Ryo''s not working on a case, he''s working on getting the ladies, and Kaori must keep him in check with her trusty 10 kg hammer.', 'Ryo Saeba works the streets of Tokyo as the City Hunter. He''s a "sweeper" and with his sidekick Kaori Makimura, he keeps the city clean. People hire the City Hunter to solve their dangerous problems, which he does with a Colt Python. When Ryo''s not working on a case, he''s working on getting the ladies, and Kaori must keep him in check with her trusty 10 kg hammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BA0FDKiJD0N4ljYhlwOVjQKszR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:36046'),
  ('960192098072295406', 'City Hunter', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, 'Choi Soo-jin, Hwang Eun-kyung', 'Lee Min-ho, Park Min-young, Lee Jun-hyuk, Kim Sang-joong, Cheon Ho-jin, Yang Jin-sung, Shin Young-jin, Kim Sang-ho', 'TV-Y', 'The story takes place in Seoul, 2011. Lee Yoon-sung is a talented MIT-graduate who''s working on the international communications team at the Blue House. He encounters dangerous situations while solving a variety of cases, both big and small, for people who need his help, and eventually becomes a "city hunter."', 'The story takes place in Seoul, 2011. Lee Yoon-sung is a talented MIT-graduate who''s working on the international communications team at the Blue House. He encounters dangerous situations while solving a variety of cases, both big and small, for people who need his help, and eventually becomes a "city hunter."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbvXhmKr18oHdY7kwkeRXAbfDvD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39346'),
  ('142001733462999778', 'City Japes July 1987', 1986, null, null, null, 'Deric Wan, Chang Gan-Wing, Ting Yan, May Hoh, Leung See-Ho, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Marina Lau Suk-Wah', null, '"City Japes July 1987" is a classic sitcom set in a building in the Garden City. The story revolves around three families - the Xus, the Leungs, and the Sus - who live in the same building and interact with each other. Despite occasional conflicts, the families are close-knit and share heartwarming moments. The Xus are known for their helpfulness, the Leungs are a loving couple, and the Sus have three siblings with distinctive personalities. The show features many memorable characters, including coworkers and friends of the families.', '"City Japes July 1987" is a classic sitcom set in a building in the Garden City. The story revolves around three families - the Xus, the Leungs, and the Sus - who live in the same building and interact with each other. Despite occasional conflicts, the families are close-knit and share heartwarming moments. The Xus are known for their helpfulness, the Leungs are a loving couple, and the Sus have three siblings with distinctive personalities. The show features many memorable characters, including coworkers and friends of the families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0qeH7MeKz3V2qBubNcONkmoau9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224105'),
  ('877153023851746614', 'City of Angels | City of Death', 2021, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Matt Murphy, Bob Grogan, James Allen Fox', null, 'Documents the chilling 1970s-80s era of rampant serial killers in Los Angeles with first-hand accounts from the detectives who tracked down the Freeway Killer, Hillside Strangler and Sunset Strip Killer, bringing justice for the victims and survivors', 'Documents the chilling 1970s-80s era of rampant serial killers in Los Angeles with first-hand accounts from the detectives who tracked down the Freeway Killer, Hillside Strangler and Sunset Strip Killer, bringing justice for the victims and survivors', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EDSx71ys4YnzMq1DBXjyQIbOkd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138999'),
  ('725544225258731347', 'City of Dreams', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Nagesh Kukunoor, Rohit G. Banawlikar', null, 'Priya Bapat, Sachin Pilgaonkar, Atul Kulkarni, Eijaz Khan, Sushant Singh, Divya Seth Shah, Rannvijay Singha, Ali Asgar', 'TV-MA', 'An assassination attempt on Mumbai''s most powerful politician triggers a dirty game of power and politics in the Gaikwad family. With his son and daughter racing to the throne, lines between moral and immoral blur and a lot is at stake', 'An assassination attempt on Mumbai''s most powerful politician triggers a dirty game of power and politics in the Gaikwad family. With his son and daughter racing to the throne, lines between moral and immoral blur and a lot is at stake', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1uYNCBNHpLUuhh5FK82gcKY8RA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89080'),
  ('1120165242848614314', 'City of Ghosts', 2021, 'Kids, Animation', 'Elizabeth Ito', null, 'Blue Chapman, Michael Ren, Honor Calderon, Kirikou S''hai Muldrow, August Nuñez', 'TV-Y7', 'Meet the Ghost Club! Their adventures take them all around Los Angeles as they interview ghosts, solve problems and learn about their city''s history.', 'Meet the Ghost Club! Their adventures take them all around Los Angeles as they interview ghosts, solve problems and learn about their city''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGSNlbq14XAn92SH22j3kao7CbS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119831'),
  ('899163869258174093', 'City of God: The Fight Rages On', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Alexandre Rodrigues, Roberta Rodrigues, Andréia Horta, Sabrina Rosa, Dhonata Augusto, Eli Ferreira, Shirley Cruz, Luellem de Castro', 'TV-MA', 'Twenty years after City of God, Buscapé recounts how conflicts between police, traffickers, and militias impacted the community.', 'Twenty years after City of God, Buscapé recounts how conflicts between police, traffickers, and militias impacted the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4K0t47rrpRdhQGp4LnjD8WtqMq3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:223397'),
  ('320129358988156787', 'City of Light', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Edan Lui, Florica Lin, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, DeeGor Ho, Will Or Wai-Lam, Alan Luk, Adam Pak Tin-Nam', null, 'For decades, Kwong Ming Pawn Shop has been renowned for its expertise, with owner Uncle Kin treating orphaned siblings Kwan Ling and Kwan Chun like family. A rift separates them, but years later, as the shop faces financial troubles, the siblings return. Their reappearance brings both challenges and unexpected turns, reshaping their relationships and the shop’s fate.', 'For decades, Kwong Ming Pawn Shop has been renowned for its expertise, with owner Uncle Kin treating orphaned siblings Kwan Ling and Kwan Chun like family. A rift separates them, but years later, as the shop faces financial troubles, the siblings return. Their reappearance brings both challenges and unexpected turns, reshaping their relationships and the shop’s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/405Pwhb8JY92DSKvQhdIcXIuuOL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286441'),
  ('453376117786675272', 'City of Men', 2002, 'Drama', 'Kátia Lund, Fernando Meirelles', null, 'Douglas Silva, Darlan Cunha, Phellipe Haagensen, Jonathan Haagensen, Roberta Rodrigues, Luan Pessoa, Carlos Eduardo Jay, Thiago Martins', null, 'The series is based on the award-winning Brazilian film City of God, which itself was nominated for Oscars in four categories, including Best Director for Fernando Meireles. Based on the story of two friends, Laranjinha and Acerola, who live adventurous and dangerous lives in a Rio de Janeiro slum, ''City of Men'' brings into sharp relief the condition of children and adolescents in these areas, realistically yet with a dose of humor.', 'The series is based on the award-winning Brazilian film City of God, which itself was nominated for Oscars in four categories, including Best Director for Fernando Meireles. Based on the story of two friends, Laranjinha and Acerola, who live adventurous and dangerous lives in a Rio de Janeiro slum, ''City of Men'' brings into sharp relief the condition of children and adolescents in these areas, realistically yet with a dose of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/259wCChpB4RZkrcD5f9quXbMckk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3317'),
  ('820427480201605533', 'City of Shadows', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Isak Férriz, Verónica Echegui, Ana Wagener, Manolo Solo, Irene Montalà, Marc Clotet, Aina Clotet, María Adánez', 'TV-MA', 'A gruesome crime has taken place in La Pedrera – Casa Milà: a burned body is found on the facade of Gaudí''s iconic building. Inspector Milo Malart, previously suspended for misconduct by the Mossos d''Esquadra (Mossos of the Squadron), returns to Barcelona to find the perpetrator along with Sub-Inspector Rebeca Garrido.', 'A gruesome crime has taken place in La Pedrera – Casa Milà: a burned body is found on the facade of Gaudí''s iconic building. Inspector Milo Malart, previously suspended for misconduct by the Mossos d''Esquadra (Mossos of the Squadron), returns to Barcelona to find the perpetrator along with Sub-Inspector Rebeca Garrido.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4rguIB7Cf4h3l1IyqMo3THW5xn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:277752'),
  ('839796471212481916', 'City of Stars', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Li Jidanun Leungpiansamut', null, 'Krisz Ahandrik, Sitha Kanchana-alongkorn, Warodom Khemmonta, Thanathip Srithongsuk, Vashirawish Jaruruangphong, Rathasat Butwong, Pataravadee Thitivoodtikul, Nichanat Setasawatpong', null, 'A social media employee’s quiet vacation is ruined when Thailand’s biggest villain goes viral on his app—then shows up at his house for dinner.', 'A social media employee’s quiet vacation is ruined when Thailand’s biggest villain goes viral on his app—then shows up at his house for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0WlE9Xl74ZupaI2qShpkPXcgg2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241507'),
  ('589925541930587192', 'City of Streamer', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jing Tian, Timmy Xu, Jing Chao, Hai Ling, Chi Jia, Wang Yifei, Mi Mi, Ma Wenyuan', null, 'Set in the Shanghai Shores at the beginning of the 20th century, where warlords begin to seize their powers; many heroes emerge, and revolutionary movements begin to rise. Making use of their wealth, the influential Rong family often abused their powers to commit various heinous crimes. In order to uphold justice, Feng Shizhen decide to embark on the road of revenge. She successfully sneaked into the Rong family, and became a tutor of the young master Rong Jiashang. However, in the midst of testing and making use of each other, Feng Shizhen slowly finds herself falling for the enemy''s son. When the truth of the injustice and grievances that happened twenty years ago begin to surface, the two lovers who were initially in two different camps work together to brave through numerous hurdles, and ultimately reveal the shocking truth.', 'Set in the Shanghai Shores at the beginning of the 20th century, where warlords begin to seize their powers; many heroes emerge, and revolutionary movements begin to rise. Making use of their wealth, the influential Rong family often abused their powers to commit various heinous crimes. In order to uphold justice, Feng Shizhen decide to embark on the road of revenge. She successfully sneaked into the Rong family, and became a tutor of the young master Rong Jiashang. However, in the midst of testing and making use of each other, Feng Shizhen slowly finds herself falling for the enemy''s son. When the truth of the injustice and grievances that happened twenty years ago begin to surface, the two lovers who were initially in two different camps work together to brave through numerous hurdles, and ultimately reveal the shocking truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wixJxuPna4QxrRmc1nKKUwfJkk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155472'),
  ('295849114597083157', 'City on a Hill', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chuck MacLean', null, 'Kevin Bacon, Aldis Hodge, Jill Hennessy, Lauren E. Banks, Matthew Del Negro, Catherine Ashmore Bradley', 'TV-MA', 'In early 90s Boston, an African-American District Attorney comes in from Brooklyn advocating change and forms an unlikely alliance with a corrupt yet venerated FBI veteran invested in maintaining the status quo. Together they take on a family of armored car robbers from Charlestown in a case that grows to encompass and eventually upend Boston’s city-wide criminal justice system.', 'In early 90s Boston, an African-American District Attorney comes in from Brooklyn advocating change and forms an unlikely alliance with a corrupt yet venerated FBI veteran invested in maintaining the status quo. Together they take on a family of armored car robbers from Charlestown in a case that grows to encompass and eventually upend Boston’s city-wide criminal justice system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxa00ipClA8SUQxTdZQOyt2NlB8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79618'),
  ('623233874957963250', 'City on Fire', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stephanie Savage, Josh Schwartz', null, 'Jemima Kirke, Wyatt Oleff, Chase Sui Wonders, Nico Tortorella, Ashley Zukerman, Xavier Clyde, Max Milner, Alexandra Doke', 'TV-MA', 'A college student is shot in Central Park on July 4, 2003. The investigation connects a series of mysterious citywide fires, the downtown music scene, and a wealthy uptown real estate family fraying under the strain of the many secrets they keep.', 'A college student is shot in Central Park on July 4, 2003. The investigation connects a series of mysterious citywide fires, the downtown music scene, and a wealthy uptown real estate family fraying under the strain of the many secrets they keep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGzN8SgwlQMYn5uUI0pzG9EfXSD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155534'),
  ('222967994072476771', 'CITY THE ANIMATION', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu, Aki Toyosaki, Yui Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'This town, is not just a normal town. There''s laughter, love and emotional moments. An unpredictable ordinary life presented by the residents! Exciting stuffs come one after another. Welcome to CITY.', 'This town, is not just a normal town. There''s laughter, love and emotional moments. An unpredictable ordinary life presented by the residents! Exciting stuffs come one after another. Welcome to CITY.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B95cSzrFPCXQpCEXM4ajRVZKQW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272118'),
  ('1135187823303232590', 'Civilisation', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Kenneth Clark', 'Kenneth Clark', 'Kenneth Clark', null, 'Sir Kenneth Clark guides us through the ages exploring the glorious rise of civilisation in western man. Beginning with the bleakness of the dark ages to the present day, we consider civilisation''s articulations and expressions in some of man''s finest works of art.', 'Sir Kenneth Clark guides us through the ages exploring the glorious rise of civilisation in western man. Beginning with the bleakness of the dark ages to the present day, we consider civilisation''s articulations and expressions in some of man''s finest works of art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lmJlzj7eNUqd4AHf57AkRDLvM6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9285'),
  ('782427846433958660', 'Civilisations', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Liev Schreiber, Simon Schama, Jamal J. Elias', 'NR', 'The story of art from the dawn of human history to the present day—for the first time on a global scale. Inspired by Civilisation, Kenneth Clark’s acclaimed landmark 1969 series about Western art, this series broadens the canvas to reveal the role art and the creative imagination have played across multiple cultures and civilizations.', 'The story of art from the dawn of human history to the present day—for the first time on a global scale. Inspired by Civilisation, Kenneth Clark’s acclaimed landmark 1969 series about Western art, this series broadens the canvas to reveal the role art and the creative imagination have played across multiple cultures and civilizations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uXq3GvET6FGToIfJ4iqnPTxNS0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78012'),
  ('91105539034726306', 'Çılgın Bediş', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Özden Öğrük', null, 'Yonca Evcimik, Cenk Torun, Selahattin Taşdöğen, Çiçek Dilligil, Sonay Aydın, Selma Sonat, Sinan Bengier, Zeynep Kaçar', null, 'Turkish youth television series that began in 1996. Ended in 2001.Yonca Evcimik, Bediş characters portrayed. Çılgın Bediş is cartoon character who created by Ögden Öztürk in 1976.', 'Turkish youth television series that began in 1996. Ended in 2001.Yonca Evcimik, Bediş characters portrayed. Çılgın Bediş is cartoon character who created by Ögden Öztürk in 1976.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whxFibQUhTzcqZmnDDrCT75Ksap.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:49876'),
  ('239206688112008461', 'Claim to Fame', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kevin Jonas, Frankie Jonas', null, '12 celebrity relatives are challenged to step outside their famous family member’s shadow and live together under one roof, concealing their identity and lineage in the quest for their own fame and fortune. They will compete in challenges, form alliances and play DNA detective in hopes of avoiding elimination and winning the coveted $100,000 prize.', '12 celebrity relatives are challenged to step outside their famous family member’s shadow and live together under one roof, concealing their identity and lineage in the quest for their own fame and fortune. They will compete in challenges, form alliances and play DNA detective in hopes of avoiding elimination and winning the coveted $100,000 prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRAnYUCpIhIgSq5D9g5IvGnPJxn.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:205491'),
  ('69304986801429001', 'ClaireBell', 2025, 'Drama', 'Davika Hoorne, Chantavit Dhanasevi', null, 'Siriwalee Siriwibool, Paphavarin Sawasdiwech, Pantira Ouhirun, Jirakit Kanjanawaraporn, Siraphan Wattanajinda, Farida Sa-Ard, Kemisara Paladesh, Jidapa Phonrojpanya', null, 'Fate led Bell, an unfortunate young woman, into prison, where she had to struggle for survival alone, without hope. That was until Claire, a mysterious female inmate, appeared to help her. And from that moment on... the encounter between these two souls began to fill this dark and desolate place with a small glimmer of light, one that gradually grew into love.', 'Fate led Bell, an unfortunate young woman, into prison, where she had to struggle for survival alone, without hope. That was until Claire, a mysterious female inmate, appeared to help her. And from that moment on... the encounter between these two souls began to fill this dark and desolate place with a small glimmer of light, one that gradually grew into love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNb7PxdshRHLkJiDgfOuDB0IamA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282471'),
  ('646846303929850575', 'CLAMP School Detectives', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Omi Minami, Akira Ishida, Kikuko Inoue, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Shiho Niiyama, Haruna Ikezawa, Yuko Miyamura', null, 'CLAMP School has the size and resources of a small city. Over 10,000 people—students and their families—live, work, and study within its self-sufficient campus. Any student with talent, regardless of wealth, is gladly accepted into this amazing facility. Covering kindergarten through graduate school, it is without equal anywhere in the world. Nokoru Imonoyama, Student Council President of the Elementary School Division, as well as the Treasurer, Akira Ijūin, and Secretary, Suō Takamura, are three of the most well-liked and idolized students in school. Nokoru decides that he and his two friends are going to start a detective service, solving any mystery or crime, great or small. But, as Nokoru is a bit theatrical and a shameless romantic, he declares that these detectives will focus on aiding mostly girls and women. With all the resources the school has to offer at their disposal, the CLAMP School Detectives are on a mission to help damsels in distress.', 'CLAMP School has the size and resources of a small city. Over 10,000 people—students and their families—live, work, and study within its self-sufficient campus. Any student with talent, regardless of wealth, is gladly accepted into this amazing facility. Covering kindergarten through graduate school, it is without equal anywhere in the world. Nokoru Imonoyama, Student Council President of the Elementary School Division, as well as the Treasurer, Akira Ijūin, and Secretary, Suō Takamura, are three of the most well-liked and idolized students in school. Nokoru decides that he and his two friends are going to start a detective service, solving any mystery or crime, great or small. But, as Nokoru is a bit theatrical and a shameless romantic, he declares that these detectives will focus on aiding mostly girls and women. With all the resources the school has to offer at their disposal, the CLAMP School Detectives are on a mission to help damsels in distress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3vgha7LJjK8o5JeJbJUSbgrlmQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19229'),
  ('129062392716277400', 'Clangers', 1969, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Oliver Postgate', null, 'Oliver Postgate', 'NR', 'Chronicles the melancholically funny lives of the Clangers, a flutey-voiced family of woolen, knitted aliens living below the surface of a knobbly little planet far out in space. Their misadventures brought them into contact with such unlikely creatures as the Soup Dragon, the Froglets, the Iron Chicken and the Glow Buzzers.', 'Chronicles the melancholically funny lives of the Clangers, a flutey-voiced family of woolen, knitted aliens living below the surface of a knobbly little planet far out in space. Their misadventures brought them into contact with such unlikely creatures as the Soup Dragon, the Froglets, the Iron Chicken and the Glow Buzzers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P26sMQ0caG3Yod1ERxbJjVzgqm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:265'),
  ('42071296088834636', 'Clannad', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuichi Nakamura, Mai Nakahara, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kikuko Inoue', 'TV-PG', 'Tomoya Okazaki is a third year high school student resentful of his life. His mother passed away from a car accident when he was younger, causing his father to resort to alcohol and cigarettes. This results in fights between the two until Tomoya''s shoulder is injured in a fight. Since then, Tomoya has had distant relationships with his father, causing him to become a delinquent over time. While on a walk to school, he meets a strange girl named Nagisa Furukawa who is a year older, but is repeating due to illness. Due to this, she is often alone as most of her friends have moved on. The two begin hanging out and slowly, as time goes by, Tomoya finds his life shifting in a new direction.', 'Tomoya Okazaki is a third year high school student resentful of his life. His mother passed away from a car accident when he was younger, causing his father to resort to alcohol and cigarettes. This results in fights between the two until Tomoya''s shoulder is injured in a fight. Since then, Tomoya has had distant relationships with his father, causing him to become a delinquent over time. While on a walk to school, he meets a strange girl named Nagisa Furukawa who is a year older, but is repeating due to illness. Due to this, she is often alone as most of her friends have moved on. The two begin hanging out and slowly, as time goes by, Tomoya finds his life shifting in a new direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPBMYp4ddXkGJDSxxmaKBjzv2r3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:24835'),
  ('361835477116159896', 'Clarence', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Skyler Page', null, 'Spencer Rothbell, Tom Kenny, Sean Giambrone, Katie Crown, Eric Edelstein, Roger Craig Smith', 'TV-PG', 'In a world of noise, Clarence is a jar of sunshine, pure and simple. He sees the world only in his favorite colors: goofy grape and neon green. Clarence values his friends Jeff and Sumo and his mother Mary more than gold. No matter what happens, good or bad, nothing brings Clarence down.', 'In a world of noise, Clarence is a jar of sunshine, pure and simple. He sees the world only in his favorite colors: goofy grape and neon green. Clarence values his friends Jeff and Sumo and his mother Mary more than gold. No matter what happens, good or bad, nothing brings Clarence down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZkAyOlDAxHtQreQE4ZzGfrSQl8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:50035'),
  ('916885122384721055', 'Clarice', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jenny Lumet, Alex Kurtzman', null, 'Rebecca Breeds, Nick Sandow, Michael Cudlitz, Lucca De Oliveira, Devyn A. Tyler', 'TV-14', 'In 1993, six months after the events of The Silence of the Lambs, FBI Agent Clarice Starling returns to the field to pursue serial murderers and sexual predators while navigating the high stakes political world of Washington, D.C.', 'In 1993, six months after the events of The Silence of the Lambs, FBI Agent Clarice Starling returns to the field to pursue serial murderers and sexual predators while navigating the high stakes political world of Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OFxU0bBO0HDL4klXmM1ahJPbv8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103302'),
  ('913685428948508544', 'Clarissa Explains It All', 1991, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Mitchell Kriegman', null, 'Melissa Joan Hart, Jason Zimbler, Elizabeth Hess, Joe O''Connor, Sean O''Neal', 'TV-G', 'Clarissa Darling is a teen girl dealing with typical pre-adolescent concerns such as school, boys, pimples, wearing her first training bra and an annoying little brother Ferguson.', 'Clarissa Darling is a teen girl dealing with typical pre-adolescent concerns such as school, boys, pimples, wearing her first training bra and an annoying little brother Ferguson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cWvpbCMiYHLvn8ra5YooOAfigc.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:249'),
  ('1088745806418533580', 'Clark', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jonas Åkerlund', null, 'Bill Skarsgård, Kolbjörn Skarsgård, Lukas Wetterberg, Vilhelm Blomgren, Sandra Ilar, Peter Viitanen, Hanna Björn, Malin Levanon', 'TV-MA', 'This is the incredible story behind Sweden''s most notorious gangster, Clark Olofsson, whose infamous crimes gave rise to the term "Stockholm Syndrome".', 'This is the incredible story behind Sweden''s most notorious gangster, Clark Olofsson, whose infamous crimes gave rise to the term "Stockholm Syndrome".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rEDgwd6gVi7cPUHufZLnF63fS8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157008'),
  ('634437401181848205', 'Clarkson''s Farm', 2021, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Jeremy Clarkson, Kaleb Cooper, Charlie Ireland', 'TV-PG', 'Follow Jeremy Clarkson as he embarks on his latest adventure, farming. The man who on several occasions claims to be allergic to manual labour takes on the most manually labour intensive job there is. What could possibly go wrong?', 'Follow Jeremy Clarkson as he embarks on his latest adventure, farming. The man who on several occasions claims to be allergic to manual labour takes on the most manually labour intensive job there is. What could possibly go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKc3FqwD2eanWBUwqcRH7bChE3V.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117648'),
  ('24381007475079759', 'Clase 406', 2002, 'Soap, Drama', 'Pedro Damián', null, 'Sherlyn, Aarón Díaz, Alfonso Herrera, Dulce María, Grettell Valdéz, Christian Chávez, Francisco Rubio, Frantz Cossío', 'NR', 'The realistic chronicles of a working class group of Hispanic youth, with heavy subject matter like sex, drug dealing, teen pregnancy, abuse, drinking, rape, deception, and heartbreak.', 'The realistic chronicles of a working class group of Hispanic youth, with heavy subject matter like sex, drug dealing, teen pregnancy, abuse, drinking, rape, deception, and heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxDBJk0qwfoj18LMtK4gdvICa85.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:12614'),
  ('926457777623585927', 'Clash of Futures (1918-1939)', 2018, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Jan Peter, Gunnar Dedio', null, 'David Acton, Joel Basman, Gennaro Cannavacciuolo, Roxane Duran, Rebecka Hemse, Jan Krauter, Charlotte Merriam, Alexandre Nguyen', null, 'From the armistice of 1918, which marked the end of the First World War, to the declaration of war in September 1939, the beginning of the Second World War: an era during which there was an aspiration to create a new world, prosperous and at peace, but which provoked a new tragedy, seen through the destinies of thirteen people who were both actors and witnesses of the upheavals of the so-called inter-war period.', 'From the armistice of 1918, which marked the end of the First World War, to the declaration of war in September 1939, the beginning of the Second World War: an era during which there was an aspiration to create a new world, prosperous and at peace, but which provoked a new tragedy, seen through the destinies of thirteen people who were both actors and witnesses of the upheavals of the so-called inter-war period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIEC5GbJwECCl8CPVZhYekxTR40.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82111'),
  ('562587845081780119', 'Clash of the Dinosaurs', 2009, 'Documentary', null, 'Paul Donvito', 'Robert Bakker, Peter L. Larson, Timothy Larson, Richard Coyle', null, 'For the first time in 65 million years, innovative imaging technology enables viewers to see deep inside the body of a dinosaur to reveal the secrets of these ultimate prehistoric survival machines. Combining cinematic photo-real 3d graphics and leading-edge anatomy and paleontology, "Clash of the Dinosaurs" is a four-part special that peels back the skin, muscles and bones to show how they survived in such a violent world.', 'For the first time in 65 million years, innovative imaging technology enables viewers to see deep inside the body of a dinosaur to reveal the secrets of these ultimate prehistoric survival machines. Combining cinematic photo-real 3d graphics and leading-edge anatomy and paleontology, "Clash of the Dinosaurs" is a four-part special that peels back the skin, muscles and bones to show how they survived in such a violent world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dehVGVCmvhCOgTUBl5c24Kv8QSS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31532'),
  ('819805936844208478', 'Class', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Patrick Ness', null, 'Greg Austin, Katherine Kelly, Sophie Hopkins, Fady Elsayed, Vivian Oparah, Jordan Renzo', 'TV-14', 'Coal Hill School has been a feature of Doctor Who since the first episode, but now we get to see the day-to-day adventures of the students coping with intrusions from space and time.', 'Coal Hill School has been a feature of Doctor Who since the first episode, but now we get to see the day-to-day adventures of the students coping with intrusions from space and time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qC6c8Bx5LiWuZ5t9v3Iyn0818FL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64073'),
  ('378754743331500482', 'Class', 2023, 'Drama', 'Ashim Ahluwalia', 'Kersi Khambatta, Bhaskar Hazarika, Kashyap Kapoor', 'Gurfateh Pirzada, Anjali Sivaraman, Ayesha Kanga, Chayan Chopra, Chintan Rachchh, Cyaawal Singh, Madhyama Segal, Moses Koul', 'TV-MA', 'Three students from a poor neighborhood join an exclusive high school for Delhi elite where dark secrets and rumors ultimately lead to murder.', 'Three students from a poor neighborhood join an exclusive high school for Delhi elite where dark secrets and rumors ultimately lead to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo3NJhf4pejh1EsqU2AXgmECMLT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:211116'),
  ('162980476258634835', 'Class Act', 2023, 'Drama', 'Tristan Séguéla, Olivier Demangel', null, 'Laurent Lafitte, Joséphine Japy, Patrick d''Assumçao, Ophélia Kolb, Camille Chamoux, Ivan Murphy, David Talbot, Sarah Suco', 'TV-MA', 'A relentlessly ambitious working-class man becomes one of France''s most controversial public figures in this fictionalized biopic about Bernard Tapie.', 'A relentlessly ambitious working-class man becomes one of France''s most controversial public figures in this fictionalized biopic about Bernard Tapie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOYqoV3mxrm1dr4FZ5liCtVQecM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:198090'),
  ('398613913866186129', 'Class of ''07', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kacie Anning', null, 'Emily Browning, Caitlin Stasey, Megan Smart, Steph Tisdell, Emma Horn, Claire Lovering, Sana''a Shaik, Chi Nguyen', null, 'When an apocalyptic tidal wave hits during the ten-year reunion of an all-girls high school, a group of women must find a way to survive on the island peak of their high school campus.', 'When an apocalyptic tidal wave hits during the ten-year reunion of an all-girls high school, a group of women must find a way to survive on the island peak of their high school campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA678fpae4Qz1IWoWh8lRQ5F1DM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207374'),
  ('410339778049934131', 'Class of ''09', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tom Rob Smith', null, 'Kate Mara, Brian Tyree Henry, Sepideh Moafi, Brian J. Smith, Jon Jon Briones, Brooke Smith, Rosalind Eleazar, Jake McDorman', 'TV-MA', 'Set in three distinct points in time, follow a class of FBI agents who grapple with immense changes as the U.S. criminal justice system is altered by artificial intelligence.', 'Set in three distinct points in time, follow a class of FBI agents who grapple with immense changes as the U.S. criminal justice system is altered by artificial intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eCGq50CMloT2a1bMDB8JPpGuf2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127948'),
