  ('835606664313382691', 'Class of 3000', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Thomas W. Lynch, André 3000', null, 'Janice Kawaye, Jennifer Hale, Phil LaMarr, André 3000, Small Fire', 'TV-Y7', 'Magical, musical superstar Sunny Bridges, played by André 3000 of OutKast, has given up fame to return to his roots by becoming a music teacher and helping a cast of talented misfits make it to the top.', 'Magical, musical superstar Sunny Bridges, played by André 3000 of OutKast, has given up fame to return to his roots by becoming a music teacher and helping a cast of talented misfits make it to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJZuel2TsWFFdDi88ENQ2yOUwQ3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2094'),
  ('153109660265395151', 'Class of Lies', 2019, 'Crime, Mystery', null, 'Jang Hong-cheol', 'Yoon Kyun-sang, Lee Jun-young, Keum Sae-rok, Choi Yu-hwa, Choi Kyu-jin, Jang Dong-ju, Jeong Da-eun, Shin Seong-ha', null, 'Ki Moo-Hyeok, a lawyer with a high winning rate, only cares about money. Due to a murder case at a high school which he deals with, his reputation as a lawyer hits rock bottom. To regain his good name as a lawyer, he sneaks into the high school and work as a temporary teacher. He tries to reveal a secret which the students have, and gets involved with Teacher Ha So-Hyun, a P.E. teacher who loves her students. They then face the students''secret.', 'Ki Moo-Hyeok, a lawyer with a high winning rate, only cares about money. Due to a murder case at a high school which he deals with, his reputation as a lawyer hits rock bottom. To regain his good name as a lawyer, he sneaks into the high school and work as a temporary teacher. He tries to reveal a secret which the students have, and gets involved with Teacher Ha So-Hyun, a P.E. teacher who loves her students. They then face the students''secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j57pZCKyaXRParhXE18hDGJRfbA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90181'),
  ('434904800084593769', 'Class of the Titans', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids', null, null, 'Meghan Black, Kirby Morrow, Kelly Sheridan, Doron Bell, Sam Vincent, Ty Olsson', 'TV-Y7', 'Imprisoned thousands of years ago by his son Zeus, Cronus, the god of time, escapes from the Underworld. Now history is about to repeat itself as Cronus heads a legion of mythological monsters in his quest to conquer and destroy the world...But there is a prophecy... Seven teenagers stand in his way. The unknowing descendants of great mythological heroes, under the guidance of the Olympian Gods, find the power within themselves to save the world from the encroaching evil.', 'Imprisoned thousands of years ago by his son Zeus, Cronus, the god of time, escapes from the Underworld. Now history is about to repeat itself as Cronus heads a legion of mythological monsters in his quest to conquer and destroy the world...But there is a prophecy... Seven teenagers stand in his way. The unknowing descendants of great mythological heroes, under the guidance of the Olympian Gods, find the power within themselves to save the world from the encroaching evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e147LlM2RZKbyeXfLdzAtwdy6vt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2557'),
  ('295252810393012636', 'ClassicaLoid', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Tomokazu Sugita, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Mikako Komatsu, Tomoaki Maeno, Taiten Kusunoki, Aya Endo, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'In a rural town undergoing revival through music, high school students Kanae and Sousuke meet none other than Beethoven and Mozart! Calling themselves "ClassicaLoids," this mysterious duo creates a strange power through the "music" they play. One night, stars fall from the sky and gigantic robots appear, causing trouble every single day! Bach, Chopin, Schubert also appear as ClassicaLoids. What is the mystery behind the powers they possess? Are they humanity''s friend or foe?', 'In a rural town undergoing revival through music, high school students Kanae and Sousuke meet none other than Beethoven and Mozart! Calling themselves "ClassicaLoids," this mysterious duo creates a strange power through the "music" they play. One night, stars fall from the sky and gigantic robots appear, causing trouble every single day! Bach, Chopin, Schubert also appear as ClassicaLoids. What is the mystery behind the powers they possess? Are they humanity''s friend or foe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOlTZfo3psgInNh0chhl50aH6Tf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68271'),
  ('551396888912565075', 'Classified', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kagiso Lediga', null, 'Imani Pullum, Christine Horn, Sule Rimi, Nicola Northnagel, Paballo Koza, Matt Blerk, Kelly Damon, Victor Makgati', 'TV-14', 'Suddenly forced to leave her mother in the US to join her father''s stepfamily in South Africa, Ella is swept up in a whole new reality as an expat.', 'Suddenly forced to leave her mother in the US to join her father''s stepfamily in South Africa, Ella is swept up in a whole new reality as an expat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGJQETzGsYSXid1Ra2qOUteOkZp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240828'),
  ('249541722141645063', 'Classroom Crisis', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Showtaro Morikubo, Yuma Uchida, Sora Amamiya, Ari Ozawa, Yu Kobayashi, Minami Tsuda, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Aya Suzaki', null, 'Humanity has successfully colonized all the planets in the Solar System, with intentions to continue into new frontiers. Individuals live stable lives in these colonies, including young high school students living in 4th Tokyo on Mars. Two of these students are Iris Shirazaki and Mizuki Sera. Iris is finishing her last year of high school while studying to be a test pilot while her friend Mizuki also works as a mechanic on the aircraft. Her own brother, Kaito, oversees Mizuki and Iris as their homeroom teacher and program director.', 'Humanity has successfully colonized all the planets in the Solar System, with intentions to continue into new frontiers. Individuals live stable lives in these colonies, including young high school students living in 4th Tokyo on Mars. Two of these students are Iris Shirazaki and Mizuki Sera. Iris is finishing her last year of high school while studying to be a test pilot while her friend Mizuki also works as a mechanic on the aircraft. Her own brother, Kaito, oversees Mizuki and Iris as their homeroom teacher and program director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12vvTklZaXHSvfyuQMoi8HuHbh4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63499'),
  ('1035245565797356252', 'CLASSROOM FOR HEROES', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Reiji Kawashima, Misuzu Yamada, Nao Toyama, Hina Kino, Eri Yukimura, Haruka Shiraishi, Sarah Emi Bridcutt, Aya Uchida', null, 'Rosewood Academy isn’t for your average student. This prestigious school specializes in training future heroes destined to protect humanity. Among them is Earnest Flaming, a young girl with unmatched skill who holds the highest record. But her reign at the top is challenged when she’s assigned to mentor a new and carefree student, Blade, whose power rivals her own!', 'Rosewood Academy isn’t for your average student. This prestigious school specializes in training future heroes destined to protect humanity. Among them is Earnest Flaming, a young girl with unmatched skill who holds the highest record. But her reign at the top is challenged when she’s assigned to mentor a new and carefree student, Blade, whose power rivals her own!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf3k3EZzGWCpO68LWFgI8boryw5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134742'),
  ('503715142141204385', 'Classroom of the Elite', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Akari Kito, Ayana Taketatsu, Yurika Kubo, Mao Ichimichi, Ryota Osaka, Eiji Takeuchi, Rina Hidaka', 'TV-14', 'Kiyotaka Ayanokouji enrolls at the prestigious Tokyo Koudo Ikusei Academy, but is assigned to Class 1-D, where students with behavioral problems are housed. The school awards points equivalent to 100,000 yen per month and allows unusual freedom in classes, masking a more complex system.', 'Kiyotaka Ayanokouji enrolls at the prestigious Tokyo Koudo Ikusei Academy, but is assigned to Class 1-D, where students with behavioral problems are housed. The school awards points equivalent to 100,000 yen per month and allows unusual freedom in classes, masking a more complex system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuHanbUUIv2UWRxxQFt9n8jtmOJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:72517'),
  ('860580250201254799', 'Claws', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eliot Laurence', null, 'Niecy Nash, Carrie Preston, Jenn Lyon, Karrueche Tran, Judy Reyes, Jack Kesy, Evan Daigle, Dean Norris', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the life and crimes of five diverse and treacherous manicurists working at the Nail Artisan of Manatee County salon, where there is a lot more going on than silk wraps and pedicures.', 'Follow the life and crimes of five diverse and treacherous manicurists working at the Nail Artisan of Manatee County salon, where there is a lot more going on than silk wraps and pedicures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XtQTSWYpmv9NpC9MJt96nJ9fbf.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71199'),
  ('48851622147857867', 'Claymore', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Houko Kuwashima, Motoki Takagi', 'TV-MA', 'When a shapeshifting demon with a thirst for human flesh, known as "youma," arrives in Raki''s village, a lone woman with silver eyes walks into town with only a sword upon her back. She is a "Claymore," a being manufactured as half-human and half-youma, for the express purpose of exterminating these monsters. After Raki''s family is killed, the Claymore saves his life, but he is subsequently banished from his home. With nowhere else to go, Raki finds the Claymore, known as Clare, and decides to follow her on her journeys. As the pair travel from town to town, defeating youma along the way, more about Clare''s organization and her fellow warriors comes to light. With every town cleansed and every demon destroyed, they come closer to the youma on which Clare has sought vengeance ever since she chose to become a Claymore.', 'When a shapeshifting demon with a thirst for human flesh, known as "youma," arrives in Raki''s village, a lone woman with silver eyes walks into town with only a sword upon her back. She is a "Claymore," a being manufactured as half-human and half-youma, for the express purpose of exterminating these monsters. After Raki''s family is killed, the Claymore saves his life, but he is subsequently banished from his home. With nowhere else to go, Raki finds the Claymore, known as Clare, and decides to follow her on her journeys. As the pair travel from town to town, defeating youma along the way, more about Clare''s organization and her fellow warriors comes to light. With every town cleansed and every demon destroyed, they come closer to the youma on which Clare has sought vengeance ever since she chose to become a Claymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQt8X4kjBxah0laGwUVJISf1086.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34791'),
  ('427924958824764568', 'Clean Freak! Aoyama-kun', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Anzu Haruno, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Mai Nakahara, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Soichiro Hoshi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Ryotaro Okiayu, Tomokazu Seki', 'TV-14', 'He is charming, cool, athletic, a good cook, but more importantly, he''s a clean freak. Aoyama is idolized and respected by everyone, but they can only admire him from afar due to his mysophobia. Despite that, he plays soccer—a rather dirty sport! As the playmaker for Fujimi High School''s soccer club, Aoyama avoids physical contact at all cost and cleanly dribbles toward victory. However, the path to Nationals will not be easy for Fujimi''s underdog team. But alongside striker Kaoru Zaizen, Aoyama will show everyone that even as a clean freak, there are things he''s willing to get dirty for.', 'He is charming, cool, athletic, a good cook, but more importantly, he''s a clean freak. Aoyama is idolized and respected by everyone, but they can only admire him from afar due to his mysophobia. Despite that, he plays soccer—a rather dirty sport! As the playmaker for Fujimi High School''s soccer club, Aoyama avoids physical contact at all cost and cleanly dribbles toward victory. However, the path to Nationals will not be easy for Fujimi''s underdog team. But alongside striker Kaoru Zaizen, Aoyama will show everyone that even as a clean freak, there are things he''s willing to get dirty for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttWUsFsfco27JJFeXaTfXgOyNW7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72507'),
  ('726613576812292244', 'Clean House', 2003, 'Reality', null, null, 'Michael Moloney, Kellie Shanygne Williams, Lisa Arch, Trish Suhr, Tempestt Bledsoe, Debi Gutierrez, Didiayer Snyder, Allen Lee Haff', 'TV-PG', 'Clean House is a home makeover and interior design television show, originally broadcast in 2003 which has aired 9 seasons of programs on the Style Network. Currently hosted by Tempestt Bledsoe and formerly hosted by Niecy Nash, the show brings a four-person cleanup-and-renovation crew to the homes of families to clean up clutter. In 2010, Nash announced that she would be leaving the series, though it will continue on without her. Her final episode aired on December 1, 2010. Later that month, the Style Network confirmed that former Cosby Show cast member Tempestt Bledsoe will take over as host. Her first episode aired on January 26, 2011. As of 2013, the show has believed to have been canceled due to low ratings after Nash''s departure.', 'Clean House is a home makeover and interior design television show, originally broadcast in 2003 which has aired 9 seasons of programs on the Style Network. Currently hosted by Tempestt Bledsoe and formerly hosted by Niecy Nash, the show brings a four-person cleanup-and-renovation crew to the homes of families to clean up clutter. In 2010, Nash announced that she would be leaving the series, though it will continue on without her. Her final episode aired on December 1, 2010. Later that month, the Style Network confirmed that former Cosby Show cast member Tempestt Bledsoe will take over as host. Her first episode aired on January 26, 2011. As of 2013, the show has believed to have been canceled due to low ratings after Nash''s departure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDWKn1VYZ3ABTpXHUS8QBxLe99C.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:14689'),
  ('726061524969619798', 'Clean Slate', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Laverne Cox, George Wallace, Dan Ewen', null, 'Laverne Cox, George Wallace, Telma Hopkins, D.K. Uzoukwu, Jay Wilkison, Norah Murphy', null, 'Harry is an old-school car wash owner in Alabama who has a lot of soul searching to do when the child he once called "son" returns after 17 years as a proud trans woman named Desiree. Her homecoming brings together a hilarious cast of friends, coworkers, and love interests as Desiree and Harry try to get it right the second time around.', 'Harry is an old-school car wash owner in Alabama who has a lot of soul searching to do when the child he once called "son" returns after 17 years as a proud trans woman named Desiree. Her homecoming brings together a hilarious cast of friends, coworkers, and love interests as Desiree and Harry try to get it right the second time around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlOai4ajGuFJ8lssruozPc66vx8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279836'),
  ('1119514480369385955', 'Clean with Passion for Now', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Noh Jong-chan, Han Hee-jung', 'Han Hee-jung', 'Song Jae-rim, Kim Yoo-jung, Yoon Kyun-sang, Joo Jong-hyuk, Yu Seon, Ahn Suk-hwan, Kim Won-hae, Min Do-hee', null, 'Gil Oh-so, an employee at a cleaning company, meets Jang Seon-gyul, the boss of the company. The two are diametric opposite when it comes to cleanliness. With the help of Oh-sol, Seon-gyul faces his mysophobia and falls in love with her.', 'Gil Oh-so, an employee at a cleaning company, meets Jang Seon-gyul, the boss of the company. The two are diametric opposite when it comes to cleanliness. With the help of Oh-sol, Seon-gyul faces his mysophobia and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ig2QeFmZuiHi07wpD4OULQiUmx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78869'),
  ('786180133573301584', 'Cleaners', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Paul Leyden', null, 'David Arquette, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Clifton Collins Jr., Emily Osment, Missi Pyle, Nathan Keyes', 'TV-MA', 'Roxie and Veronica are two gorgeous young women - who also happen to be highly trained contract killers. While on an errand for their boss, an unpleasant surprise in the trunk of their car turns this lethal pair into hunted targets.', 'Roxie and Veronica are two gorgeous young women - who also happen to be highly trained contract killers. While on an errand for their boss, an unpleasant surprise in the trunk of their car turns this lethal pair into hunted targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIR6rJCrOZfprUEsvfRyO66kUgf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61437'),
  ('557324746057557881', 'Cleaning Up', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mark Marlow', null, 'Sheridan Smith, Matthew McNulty, Branka Katić, Rosie Cavaliero, Neil Maskell, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Kristy Philipps', 'TV-14', 'This characterful drama focuses on an ordinary working class woman, Sam, who is caught between two worlds - the everyday life of a devoted and loving Mum and the darker, dangerous world of insider trading. While struggling with an online gambling addiction, Sassy office cleaner Sam realises she has access to lucrative Stock Market information which if used correctly could be the answer to all her prayers.', 'This characterful drama focuses on an ordinary working class woman, Sam, who is caught between two worlds - the everyday life of a devoted and loving Mum and the darker, dangerous world of insider trading. While struggling with an online gambling addiction, Sassy office cleaner Sam realises she has access to lucrative Stock Market information which if used correctly could be the answer to all her prayers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LSpeWnsSDX6MNNNs5AfEticY3L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85699'),
  ('139183544199537112', 'Cleaning Up', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Choi Kyung-mi', null, 'Yum Jung-ah, Jeon So-min, Kim Jae-hwa, Lee Mu-saeng, Na In-woo, Jang Shin-young, Kim Tae-woo, Song Jae-hee', null, 'Three cleaning ladies at an investment firm get their hands on insider stock information and hatch a chance on a scheme that could change their lives.', 'Three cleaning ladies at an investment firm get their hands on insider stock information and hatch a chance on a scheme that could change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AcClT7XsvdzJyQ47s2EU1jkHMp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195745'),
  ('1146458415278051613', 'Clem', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuelle Rey-Magnan, Pascal Fontanille', 'Pascal Fontanille, Emmanuelle Rey-Magnan', 'Lucie Lucas', null, 'Clem follows the life of a young teenager, Clémentine, who becomes a mother at the age of sixteen, at the centre of tensions between her parents and Julien, the father of her child Valentin. It deals with the problems of teenage life and that of a mother with a strong personality.', 'Clem follows the life of a young teenager, Clémentine, who becomes a mother at the age of sixteen, at the centre of tensions between her parents and Julien, the father of her child Valentin. It deals with the problems of teenage life and that of a mother with a strong personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6Ixh6NsU89VU3T4ydKcn6Dzn44.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:62824'),
  ('9985353741676684', 'Clémentine', 1985, 'Animation', 'Bruno-René Huchez', null, 'Céline Monsarrat, Roger Carel, Laurence Badie, Gérard Hernandez, Jean-Claude Montalban, Monique Tarbès, Catherine Lafond', null, 'Clémentine was a 1985 French animated television series. The series consisted of 39 episodes which featured the fantastic adventures of a 10-year-old girl who uses a wheelchair. The show was produced by "IDDH", a company that originally started out producing French-dubbed versions of Japanese anime. It originally aired on Antenne 2. The series was released on VHS in 1990 and on DVD in 2006.', 'Clémentine was a 1985 French animated television series. The series consisted of 39 episodes which featured the fantastic adventures of a 10-year-old girl who uses a wheelchair. The show was produced by "IDDH", a company that originally started out producing French-dubbed versions of Japanese anime. It originally aired on Antenne 2. The series was released on VHS in 1990 and on DVD in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4qdt60H33TkKHXY0tIC3l3pjF1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:19859'),
  ('1071939019088757485', 'Cleo & Cuquin', 2018, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, 'Ruben Ray', 'TV-Y', 'Sister and brother Cleo and Cuquin carry out different job roles to help their friends.', 'Sister and brother Cleo and Cuquin carry out different job roles to help their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C1rt8mSL1jvafiSOIXx9MDmV0O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81913'),
  ('965230526146093672', 'Cleopatra', 1999, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Stephen Harrigan, Anton Diether', 'Margaret George', 'Leonor Varela, Billy Zane, Timothy Dalton, Rupert Graves, John Bowe, Owen Teale, Sean Pertwee, David Schofield', null, 'Cleopatra, the famed Egyptian Queen born in 69 B.C., is shown to have been brought by Roman ruler Julius Caesar at age 18. Caesar becomes sexually obsessed by the 18 year old queen, beds her, and eventually has a son by her. However, his Roman followers and his wife are not pleased by the union. In fact, as Caesar has only a daughter by his wife, he had picked Octavian as his successor.', 'Cleopatra, the famed Egyptian Queen born in 69 B.C., is shown to have been brought by Roman ruler Julius Caesar at age 18. Caesar becomes sexually obsessed by the 18 year old queen, beds her, and eventually has a son by her. However, his Roman followers and his wife are not pleased by the union. In fact, as Caesar has only a daughter by his wife, he had picked Octavian as his successor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IE344ILuvDURHVwkXJQOQRaoU8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:47119'),
  ('590538377497235434', 'Cleopatra 2525', 2000, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Robert Tapert', 'Melissa Blake', 'Gina Torres, Victoria Pratt, Jennifer Sky', null, 'An exotic dancer is frozen in 2001 and unfrozen in 2525 by two female warriors fighting against robots that have taken over the world. The three join forces and try to escape from the underground caves to which humanity has been banished.', 'An exotic dancer is frozen in 2001 and unfrozen in 2525 by two female warriors fighting against robots that have taken over the world. The three join forces and try to escape from the underground caves to which humanity has been banished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lWBv9PbECkmmZ41uX1qgH022yB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:5398'),
