  ('1123302915673741433', 'Complete Savages', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Julie Thacker, Mike Scully', null, 'Keith Carradine, Erik von Detten, Andrew Eiden, Shaun Sipos, Evan Ellingson, Jason Dolley, Vincent Ventresca', 'TV-PG', 'As a single father of five teenage boys, Nick Savage faces the daunting challenge of trying to control the mayhem. A career firefighter, he finds running into a burning building a relaxing break from his parental duties.', 'As a single father of five teenage boys, Nick Savage faces the daunting challenge of trying to control the mayhem. A career firefighter, he finds running into a burning building a relaxing break from his parental duties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFaNmMuGowqKJxJFhco6qRH9TnG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1736'),
