  ('1043447463593221445', 'Computer Chronicles', 1984, 'Talk', 'Stewart Cheifet', null, 'Stewart Cheifet', 'TV-G', 'The Computer Chronicles was an American television series, broadcast during 1981-2002 on Public Broadcasting Service public television, which documented the rise of the personal computer from its infancy to the immense market at the turn of the 21st century. The series was created in the Fall of 1981, by Stewart Cheifet, then the station manager of the College of San Mateo''s KCSM-TV, initially broadcast as a local weekly series. Jim Warren was its founding host for its 1981-1982 season. It aired continuously from 1981 to 2002 with Cheifet co-hosting most of its later seasons. Gary Kildall served as co-host for six years providing insights and commentary on products as well as discussions on the future of the ever-expanding personal computer sphere.', 'The Computer Chronicles was an American television series, broadcast during 1981-2002 on Public Broadcasting Service public television, which documented the rise of the personal computer from its infancy to the immense market at the turn of the 21st century. The series was created in the Fall of 1981, by Stewart Cheifet, then the station manager of the College of San Mateo''s KCSM-TV, initially broadcast as a local weekly series. Jim Warren was its founding host for its 1981-1982 season. It aired continuously from 1981 to 2002 with Cheifet co-hosting most of its later seasons. Gary Kildall served as co-host for six years providing insights and commentary on products as well as discussions on the future of the ever-expanding personal computer sphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuLf05Qw4Ki5brXfrUaK1iTowr9.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:9821'),
  ('501948886744054823', 'Comrade Detective', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Alessandro Tanaka, Brian Gatewood', null, 'Channing Tatum, Florin Piersic Jr., Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Corneliu Ulici, Kim Basinger', 'TV-MA', 'In the 1980s, millions of Romanians tuned in to Comrade Detective, a gritty, sexy, communist buddy cop show that has now been digitally remastered and dubbed into English for the first time.', 'In the 1980s, millions of Romanians tuned in to Comrade Detective, a gritty, sexy, communist buddy cop show that has now been digitally remastered and dubbed into English for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n19gxtUntrsAIfKCILKZRBm4O8G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73030'),
  ('443511415482921796', 'Con el culo al aire', 2012, 'Comedy', 'David Abajo, David Fernández', null, 'Paco Tous, María León, Raúl Arévalo, Raúl Fernández de Pablo, Goizalde Núñez, Carmen Ruiz, Iñaki Miramón, Toni Acosta', 'TV-G', 'A white-collar crook, an itinerant carnival vendor and other colorful characters keep on chugging through life while residing in a campground. They are down on their luck. They live in a campground. But these eccentrics still embrace their own joie de vivre.', 'A white-collar crook, an itinerant carnival vendor and other colorful characters keep on chugging through life while residing in a campground. They are down on their luck. They live in a campground. But these eccentrics still embrace their own joie de vivre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujsqIDRPpMuepBrKHDOVXhsr8Wa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62432'),
  ('538191289760047860', 'Con esa misma mirada', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Angélica Rivera, Diego Klein, Iván Sánchez, Ximena Herrera, Pamela Almanza, Sofía Castro, Adriana Llabrés, Nicolás Haza', 'TV-MA', 'After 25 years of marriage, Eloísa learns her husband is having an affair with a younger man and separates. Her newfound solitude leads her to self-discovery and the pursuit of new love.', 'After 25 years of marriage, Eloísa learns her husband is having an affair with a younger man and separates. Her newfound solitude leads her to self-discovery and the pursuit of new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8jycD9AJgbm1jtVZoQgQpzvkQx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:286993'),
  ('350543175197651305', 'Con Man', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Alan Tudyk', null, 'Alan Tudyk, Mindy Sterling, Nathan Fillion', 'TV-14', 'Con Man centers on the post-show life of Wray Nerely the co-star of “Spectrum,” a sci-fi series, which was canceled before its time and went on to become a cult classic beloved by fans. Wray’s good friend, Jack Moore starred as the series Captain and has gone on to become a major celebrity, while Wray hasn’t found his desired level of stardom. Wray is the begrudging guest of sci-fi conventions, comic book store appearances, and different pop culture events; however, everything is not as it seems from the outside. The series will explore these events and all the weird and crazy things that happen to them along the way.', 'Con Man centers on the post-show life of Wray Nerely the co-star of “Spectrum,” a sci-fi series, which was canceled before its time and went on to become a cult classic beloved by fans. Wray’s good friend, Jack Moore starred as the series Captain and has gone on to become a major celebrity, while Wray hasn’t found his desired level of stardom. Wray is the begrudging guest of sci-fi conventions, comic book store appearances, and different pop culture events; however, everything is not as it seems from the outside. The series will explore these events and all the weird and crazy things that happen to them along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4bBydf2JlrZYqk2tadNtXuP5wT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63196'),
  ('38992446539148691', 'Conan', 2010, 'Talk, Comedy, News', 'Conan O''Brien', null, 'Conan O''Brien, Andy Richter', 'TV-14', 'A late night television talk show hosted by Conan O''Brien.', 'A late night television talk show hosted by Conan O''Brien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQxrvUhP3ycwnlxIrIMQ9Z3kleq.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:32415'),
