  ('335204341990045289', 'Conan the Adventurer', 1992, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Christian Choquet', null, 'Michael Donovan, Scott McNeil, Michael Beattie', 'TV-Y7', 'Conan was created by Robert E. Howard, who wrote novels based on the legendary barbarian. This animated series follows the legendary barbarian as he struggles against Wrath-Amon and his legions of evil.', 'Conan was created by Robert E. Howard, who wrote novels based on the legendary barbarian. This animated series follows the legendary barbarian as he struggles against Wrath-Amon and his legions of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmaAXXZ4rvRw3LSuGQwtgtBVaM6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:13885'),
  ('798082477396983385', 'Conan the Adventurer', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Max A. Keller', null, 'Ralf Moeller, Danny Woodburn, Jeremy Kemp, T.J. Storm, Omar Ayala, Robert McRay', null, 'Conan: The Adventurer is an American television series created, developed, financed, distributed and produced by Max A. Keller and Micheline Keller from 1997 to 1998 and loosely based on the fantasy hero Conan the Barbarian. The TV show premiered on September 22, 1997, and ran for 22 episodes. The series has been broadcast in over 150 countries throughout the world. Keller Entertainment Group continues to market and distribute the series worldwide and the series has longevity among international broadcasters and dvd aggregators. The series will soon be available on the internet. This live-action series stars Ralf Möller as Conan of Cimmeria and Danny Woodburn as his sidekick Otli. The storyline is quite different from the Conan lore created in the original Conan novels and short stories by Robert E. Howard, as well as that of the Conan earlier depicted in the various Conan comic book series by Marvel Comics. The TV character is based on the version in the 1980s films, but there is no continuity between the films and TV series.', 'Conan: The Adventurer is an American television series created, developed, financed, distributed and produced by Max A. Keller and Micheline Keller from 1997 to 1998 and loosely based on the fantasy hero Conan the Barbarian. The TV show premiered on September 22, 1997, and ran for 22 episodes. The series has been broadcast in over 150 countries throughout the world. Keller Entertainment Group continues to market and distribute the series worldwide and the series has longevity among international broadcasters and dvd aggregators. The series will soon be available on the internet. This live-action series stars Ralf Möller as Conan of Cimmeria and Danny Woodburn as his sidekick Otli. The storyline is quite different from the Conan lore created in the original Conan novels and short stories by Robert E. Howard, as well as that of the Conan earlier depicted in the various Conan comic book series by Marvel Comics. The TV character is based on the version in the 1980s films, but there is no continuity between the films and TV series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFdetJ60vxQih5PPUZeqY0MlKol.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13260'),
  ('469016993928693114', 'Conception', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Emiri Kato, Aya Endo, Asami Shimoda, Yukiyo Fujii, Saki Fujita', 'TV-MA', 'On his high school graduation day, Itsuki''s cousin, Mahiru, tells him that she''s pregnant. Just then, a gate of light emerges and transports the two into the world of Granvania. In this land, "Impurities" have been causing a disturbance to the Stars, ultimately plunging Granvania into chaos and disorder. And Itsuki, now revealed to be one who is fated to meet with the "Star Maidens", is seen as Granvania''s last hope and was thus given the task to produce "Star Children" and combat the "impurities". And unless the task is complete, Itsuki may never be able to return home.', 'On his high school graduation day, Itsuki''s cousin, Mahiru, tells him that she''s pregnant. Just then, a gate of light emerges and transports the two into the world of Granvania. In this land, "Impurities" have been causing a disturbance to the Stars, ultimately plunging Granvania into chaos and disorder. And Itsuki, now revealed to be one who is fated to meet with the "Star Maidens", is seen as Granvania''s last hope and was thus given the task to produce "Star Children" and combat the "impurities". And unless the task is complete, Itsuki may never be able to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utuOBLomLO63df6c28A7fppwl6c.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82988'),
  ('843301570115673576', 'Concrete Revolutio', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Aki Toyosaki, Eriko Nakamura, Tokuyoshi Kawashima, Kaito Ishikawa, Kenichi Suzumura, Toru Okawa, Sumire Uesaka, Tetsuo Kanao', null, 'What if every fabled superhuman existed at the same time, in the same place? Titans from outer space, life forms from a mystical world, phantoms and goblins from ancient times. In another Japan, it’s not just a question of "what if"—it''s a reality.', 'What if every fabled superhuman existed at the same time, in the same place? Titans from outer space, life forms from a mystical world, phantoms and goblins from ancient times. In another Japan, it’s not just a question of "what if"—it''s a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxem8mWfpT1LD7GZ1wKEKRDlLqp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65932'),
  ('426027394716887531', 'Condor', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jason Smilovic, Todd Katzberg, Ken Robinson', null, 'Max Irons, Constance Zimmer, Alexei Bondar, Isidora Goreshter, Kristen Hager, Eric Johnson, Toby Leonard Moore, Jonathan Kells Phillips', 'TV-MA', 'Young CIA analyst Joe Turner has his idealism tested when he learns that the CIA has been using an algorithm he developed to spy on American citizens, leading the organization to a terrorist plot that threatens the lives of millions. Inspired by Sydney Pollack’s 1975 political thriller Three Days of the Condor.', 'Young CIA analyst Joe Turner has his idealism tested when he learns that the CIA has been using an algorithm he developed to spy on American citizens, leading the organization to a terrorist plot that threatens the lives of millions. Inspired by Sydney Pollack’s 1975 political thriller Three Days of the Condor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28cIK70tN2t4gPTV8CBQZED1H2G.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71146'),
  ('640407789861578242', 'Confess', 2017, 'Drama', 'Elissa Down', null, 'Katie Leclerc, Ryan Cooper, Sherilyn Fenn, Rocky Myers, Amy Pham', 'TV-14', 'Auburn Reed is determined to put her challenging past behind her and get her future on track. Now in her mid-twenties and struggling to fund her custody battle for her only son, she stumbles upon the art studio of the talented and charming artist, Owen Gentry. The two wrestle with their developing romance and the secrets they''re both keeping until they realize they may risk their future if they don''t reveal their pasts to each other.', 'Auburn Reed is determined to put her challenging past behind her and get her future on track. Now in her mid-twenties and struggling to fund her custody battle for her only son, she stumbles upon the art studio of the talented and charming artist, Owen Gentry. The two wrestle with their developing romance and the secrets they''re both keeping until they realize they may risk their future if they don''t reveal their pasts to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9usoZt3kpuZoVvINdtGjtXwPkoX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71131'),
  ('997002934838506388', 'Confession', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Im Hee-chul', 'Lee Jun-ho, You Chea-myung, Shin Hyun-been, Jang Jae-ho, Yoon Kyung-ho, Nam Kee-ae, Ryu Kyung-soo, Lee Ki-hyuk', null, 'A sickly man with a strong mind has spent most of his childhood in a hospital. He is involved in a case of "double jeopardy," the principle that one cannot be tried for the same crime twice following either a conviction or an acquittal.', 'A sickly man with a strong mind has spent most of his childhood in a hospital. He is involved in a case of "double jeopardy," the principle that one cannot be tried for the same crime twice following either a conviction or an acquittal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbkcieJjeKfT6oJFc0eomdQITLO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87430'),
  ('1104266051186001260', 'Confidence Queen', 2025, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Hong Seung-hyeon', 'Park Min-young, Park Hee-soon, Joo Jong-hyuk', null, 'Three con artists with different backgrounds, team up for a daring and adventurous scheme of revenge against the villains of this era.', 'Three con artists with different backgrounds, team up for a daring and adventurous scheme of revenge against the villains of this era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUCmw1B6MBRiN6TUSbssKHuJnV0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259710'),
  ('392418884784914592', 'Conflict', 1978, 'Drama', 'Lee Tim-Sing', null, 'Chow Yun-Fat, Angie Chiu Nga-Chi, Shek Sau, Kam Hing-Yin, Lee Heung-Kam, Nam Hung, Law Kwok-Wai, Regina Tsang Hing-Yu', null, 'Conflict is a TVB television series, premiered on October 2, 1978. Theme song "Conflict" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Jenny Tseng.', 'Conflict is a TVB television series, premiered on October 2, 1978. Theme song "Conflict" composition and arrangement by Joseph Koo, lyricist by Wong Jim, sung by Jenny Tseng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEPzRfftgeZ0MSyyCqBBV4dafK8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110057'),
  ('933780478822130270', 'Conflict', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, War & Politics', 'Andrei Alén', 'Jari Rantala, Andrei Alén, Helena Immonen', 'Sara Soulié, Peter Franzén, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Julia Korpinen, Salah Isse Mohamed, Charles Gibbons, Elias Keränen, Nadia Forde', null, 'A small, Finnish seaside town is preparing to celebrate midsummer''s eve. An unknown enemy arrives and takes the entire area hostage.', 'A small, Finnish seaside town is preparing to celebrate midsummer''s eve. An unknown enemy arrives and takes the entire area hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kESvBNLPTAXw1Oh4gDU8zeAwPoP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240253'),
  ('117772469187643128', 'Confrontation', 1985, 'Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Oleg Basilashvili, Andrei Boltnev, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Murman Jinoria', null, 'Operatives are looking for a killer who has appropriated someone else''s identity. The story of a real case based on the story of Yulian Semyonov.', 'Operatives are looking for a killer who has appropriated someone else''s identity. The story of a real case based on the story of Yulian Semyonov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkoW4m7M4Omb4heuwGojc7yp8yn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63442'),
  ('994392031222098981', 'Confronting a Serial Killer', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Joe Berlinger', null, 'Jillian Lauren', 'TV-MA', 'The timely story of the unprecedented relationship between acclaimed New York Times best-selling author and memoirist Jillian Lauren and the most prolific serial killer in American history, Samuel Little, and her race against time to identify his victims before it''s too late. As she slips deeper into his sordid world, Jillian realizes that she may become, psychologically, Little''s last victim.', 'The timely story of the unprecedented relationship between acclaimed New York Times best-selling author and memoirist Jillian Lauren and the most prolific serial killer in American history, Samuel Little, and her race against time to identify his victims before it''s too late. As she slips deeper into his sordid world, Jillian realizes that she may become, psychologically, Little''s last victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioL88iGckwYib3O5WFxT0ehwRua.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120984'),
  ('171897365443583517', 'Connect', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Takashi Miike', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Jung Hae-in, Go Kyung-pyo, Kim Hye-jun, Kim Roi-ha, Yang Dong-geun, Jo Bok-rae, Jang Kwang, Sung Hyuk', 'TV-MA', 'Dongsoo leads a solitary life, spending his time uploading music to the internet. His ordinary life is upended when he is kidnapped by an organ hunter, who takes out one of his eyes. Soon, Dongsoo is sharing the vision of someone who got his eye. Through the connected vision, he learns that the taker is a notorious serial killer, and pursues the murderer to get his eye back.', 'Dongsoo leads a solitary life, spending his time uploading music to the internet. His ordinary life is upended when he is kidnapped by an organ hunter, who takes out one of his eyes. Soon, Dongsoo is sharing the vision of someone who got his eye. Through the connected vision, he learns that the taker is a notorious serial killer, and pursues the murderer to get his eye back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVgwlYamm5gplckeMWKNFBVyNXi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137043'),
  ('747629657630534911', 'Connected', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Latif Nasser', null, 'Science journalist Latif Nasser investigates the surprising and intricate ways in which we are connected to each other, the world and the universe.', 'Science journalist Latif Nasser investigates the surprising and intricate ways in which we are connected to each other, the world and the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1xTMUr9aCplVLi67zsJ0DOpbz0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106525'),
  ('689793859913416928', 'Connection', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Ji Sung, Jeon Mi-do, Lee Hyun So, Kwon Yul, Kim Kyung-nam, Lee Sang-jun, Jung Yoo-min, Jung Soon-won', null, 'Someone causes a narcotics unit detective to become addicted to drugs. What is the connection between them?', 'Someone causes a narcotics unit detective to become addicted to drugs. What is the connection between them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dsw8j5jNOaoq0nFEKLh0PSPEcT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234590'),
  ('299407722685609585', 'Connections', 1978, 'Documentary', 'James Burke', null, 'James Burke', null, 'Taking an interdisciplinary approach to the history of science and invention, Connections explores an "Alternative View of Change" that rejects the conventional linear and teleological view of historical progress. To demonstrate this view, Burke begins each episode with a particular event or innovation in the past (usually ancient or medieval) and traces a path from that event through a series of connections to a fundamental and essential aspect of the modern world.', 'Taking an interdisciplinary approach to the history of science and invention, Connections explores an "Alternative View of Change" that rejects the conventional linear and teleological view of historical progress. To demonstrate this view, Burke begins each episode with a particular event or innovation in the past (usually ancient or medieval) and traces a path from that event through a series of connections to a fundamental and essential aspect of the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XToMleIbB8MxoMM2JDOgqBXX9E.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:219569'),
  ('75037498653864009', 'Conquistadores: Adventum', 2017, 'Drama', 'Israel del Santo', null, 'Nacho Acero, Paco Illescas, César Díaz Capilla, Eduardo Ruiz, Eduardo San Juan', null, 'Narrates faithfully the first 30 years of America''s discovery and conquer, from Colon''s departure from Spain in 1492 until Juan Sebastián Elcano completed the first travel around the world in 1522.', 'Narrates faithfully the first 30 years of America''s discovery and conquer, from Colon''s departure from Spain in 1492 until Juan Sebastián Elcano completed the first travel around the world in 1522.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30AEXzzywyEjT6db6d3ZYoiIRyP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74588'),
  ('729251638806469639', 'Conscience', 1994, 'Drama', null, null, 'Deric Wan, Maggie Shiu, Amy Kwok, Ng Wai-Kwok, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Cheung Kwok-Keung, Miu Kam-Fung, Lau Kong', null, 'TV reporter Wei Haiyi (Played by Maggie Shao) interviews the cage house where the urban poor live, and meets the young Ma Zhongbao (Wen Zhaolun). Zhongbao grew up in a cage house since childhood, indulged in reading all day long, and his personality was extremely closed. After the interview, Haiyi inadvertently took away Zhongbao''s novel "Frog and Scorpion", and was deeply impressed by Zhongbao''s bitter pursuit. The highly reputable lawyer and lawmaker Cham Yourong (Luo Yingjun) is the underground lover of Haiyi''s mother, Wei Jinling (Miao Jinfeng), but intends to invade Haiyi, and Haiyi kills him in a hurry. The mercenary Jin Ling accepted a huge bribe from Rong''s wife and even testified against her daughter in court.', 'TV reporter Wei Haiyi (Played by Maggie Shao) interviews the cage house where the urban poor live, and meets the young Ma Zhongbao (Wen Zhaolun). Zhongbao grew up in a cage house since childhood, indulged in reading all day long, and his personality was extremely closed. After the interview, Haiyi inadvertently took away Zhongbao''s novel "Frog and Scorpion", and was deeply impressed by Zhongbao''s bitter pursuit. The highly reputable lawyer and lawmaker Cham Yourong (Luo Yingjun) is the underground lover of Haiyi''s mother, Wei Jinling (Miao Jinfeng), but intends to invade Haiyi, and Haiyi kills him in a hurry. The mercenary Jin Ling accepted a huge bribe from Rong''s wife and even testified against her daughter in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsDBkJLOSHH86c6FbnNnimpOUHH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109435'),
  ('1008775031302546966', 'Conscription', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Herman Flesvig', null, 'Herman Flesvig, Mikkel Niva, Jonas Kinge Bergland', null, 'A war enthusiast, a spoiled brat, a female male chauvinist and an identity-confused guy from Oslo east. Are these to protect Norway?', 'A war enthusiast, a spoiled brat, a female male chauvinist and an identity-confused guy from Oslo east. Are these to protect Norway?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlBzPUEFuGH23ZK1fOY0r6ePHFA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99307'),
  ('1130118110406260638', 'Conspiracies & Coverups', 2026, null, null, null, 'Andrew Bustamante', null, 'Former CIA covert intelligence officer Andrew Bustamante exposes the truth behind some of the most sensational, "ripped from the headlines" conspiracy theories in the all-new series. Driven by a relentless hunt for the truth, Bustamante pulls back the curtain on modern-day mysteries that blur the line between fact and fiction. Using his unique perspective and insider techniques, he investigates, pressure-tests, and challenges prevailing narratives to reveal the hidden forces behind these events and the motives used to manipulate the truth.', 'Former CIA covert intelligence officer Andrew Bustamante exposes the truth behind some of the most sensational, "ripped from the headlines" conspiracy theories in the all-new series. Driven by a relentless hunt for the truth, Bustamante pulls back the curtain on modern-day mysteries that blur the line between fact and fiction. Using his unique perspective and insider techniques, he investigates, pressure-tests, and challenges prevailing narratives to reveal the hidden forces behind these events and the motives used to manipulate the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/267R91mdS8Sb3XBgdpr033REWKW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317265'),
  ('294073691336705025', 'Conspiracy Theory with Jesse Ventura', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jesse Ventura, June Sarpong, Daniel Kucan', 'TV-14', 'Conspiracy Theory with Jesse Ventura is an American television series hosted by Jesse Ventura and broadcast on truTV. It premiered on December 2, 2009. The second season premiered on October 15, 2010, with the third season premiering on November 7, 2012. In May 2013, Ventura stated that the show has been discontinued and a fourth season will not air.', 'Conspiracy Theory with Jesse Ventura is an American television series hosted by Jesse Ventura and broadcast on truTV. It premiered on December 2, 2009. The second season premiered on October 15, 2010, with the third season premiering on November 7, 2012. In May 2013, Ventura stated that the show has been discontinued and a fourth season will not air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p16Re3DJTW4tfzyZco8uYy5Li60.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:23747'),
  ('499006763090855248', 'Constantine', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Daniel Cerone, David S. Goyer', null, 'Matt Ryan, Angélica Celaya, Charles Halford, Harold Perrineau', 'TV-14', 'A man struggling with his faith is haunted by the sins of his past but is suddenly thrust into the role of defending humanity from the gathering forces of darkness.', 'A man struggling with his faith is haunted by the sins of his past but is suddenly thrust into the role of defending humanity from the gathering forces of darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQ3bA1DBKyZwkDCHJFEAT0MkKpu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60743'),
  ('675115520005675099', 'Constantine: City of Demons', 2018, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Matt Ryan, Damian O''Hare, Jim Meskimen, Robin Atkin Downes, Laura Bailey, Emily O''Brien, Rachel Kimsey', 'TV-MA', 'Armed with an arcane knowledge of the dark arts and a wicked wit, John Constantine fights the good fight. With his soul already damned to hell, he’ll do whatever it takes to protect the innocent. With the balance of good and evil on the line, Constantine uses his skills to face the supernatural terrors that threaten our world and send them back where they belong. After that, who knows…maybe there’s hope for him and his soul after all.', 'Armed with an arcane knowledge of the dark arts and a wicked wit, John Constantine fights the good fight. With his soul already damned to hell, he’ll do whatever it takes to protect the innocent. With the balance of good and evil on the line, Constantine uses his skills to face the supernatural terrors that threaten our world and send them back where they belong. After that, who knows…maybe there’s hope for him and his soul after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7I3zKEk8E9o061jxJz7s6UuxDg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78081'),
  ('566479413207762067', 'Constellation', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Harness', null, 'Noomi Rapace, Jonathan Banks, James D''Arcy, Rosie Coleman, Davina Coleman, William Catlett, Julian Looman', 'TV-MA', 'When a fatal accident occurs on board the International Space Station, a lone astronaut makes the heroic journey back to Earth, only to discover key pieces of her life—including her young daughter—have changed.', 'When a fatal accident occurs on board the International Space Station, a lone astronaut makes the heroic journey back to Earth, only to discover key pieces of her life—including her young daughter—have changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21ICs3fxlxGslbzS4moCHk9HNo6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197125'),
