  ('961578045503582262', 'Counterpart', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Justin Marks', null, 'J.K. Simmons, Nazanin Boniadi, Harry Lloyd, Olivia Williams, Sara Serraiocco, Nicholas Pinnock, Betty Gabriel, James Cromwell', 'TV-MA', 'Howard Silk is a lowly cog in a bureaucratic UN agency who is turning the last corner of a life filled with regret when he discovers the agency he works for is guarding a secret: a crossing to a parallel dimension.', 'Howard Silk is a lowly cog in a bureaucratic UN agency who is turning the last corner of a life filled with regret when he discovers the agency he works for is guarding a secret: a crossing to a parallel dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVTpkoTkl7LJSoVCnuoHRPJvS4o.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63646'),
  ('407600379002664785', 'Counting Cars', 2012, 'Reality', null, null, 'Danny Koker, Ryan Evans, Kevin Mack, Horny Mike, Shannon Aikau', 'TV-14', 'Danny “The Count” Koker and his team restore, customize and sell cars in a hurry, scrambling to keep their Las Vegas shop in the black. From classics to exotics, from hotrods to choppers, Danny and the crew of Count’s Kustoms will stop at nothing to find and flip the greatest rides of all time.', 'Danny “The Count” Koker and his team restore, customize and sell cars in a hurry, scrambling to keep their Las Vegas shop in the black. From classics to exotics, from hotrods to choppers, Danny and the crew of Count’s Kustoms will stop at nothing to find and flip the greatest rides of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHVAwZVjTFqJQDo8n6pEVdqGMWX.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:45669'),
  ('179567866252433049', 'Country Comfort', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Caryn Lucas', null, 'Katharine McPhee, Eddie Cibrian, Ricardo Hurtado, Jamie Martin Mann, Griffin McIntyre, Shiloh Verrico, Pyper Braun', 'TV-PG', 'When an up-and-coming young country singer accepts a job as a nanny with a musical family, she finds the bond she''s always missed.', 'When an up-and-coming young country singer accepts a job as a nanny with a musical family, she finds the bond she''s always missed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzutbxi3Ki66Un16KCfZI2vwELk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119180'),
  ('351682286629258586', 'Country Music', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Peter Coyote', 'TV-PG', 'Explore the history of a uniquely American art form: country music. From its deep and tangled roots in ballads, blues and hymns performed in small settings, to its worldwide popularity, learn how country music evolved over the course of the 20th century, as it eventually emerged to become America’s music.', 'Explore the history of a uniquely American art form: country music. From its deep and tangled roots in ballads, blues and hymns performed in small settings, to its worldwide popularity, learn how country music evolved over the course of the 20th century, as it eventually emerged to become America’s music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT4El65ShM6fzQ2RSbvgW7Bf8Qs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86558'),
  ('683474039196410276', 'Country Queen', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Melissa Kiplagat, Sheila Munyiva, Oliver Litondo, Tirus Gathwe', 'TV-MA', 'A Nairobi event planner returns to her village after 10 years, where she confronts her past — and a mining company that threatens to destroy her home.', 'A Nairobi event planner returns to her village after 10 years, where she confronts her past — and a mining company that threatens to destroy her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39rLohFji3qUKu6A5OXZW4NMJ8l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205722'),
  ('1134492906189270577', 'Country Spirit', 2001, 'Drama', null, null, 'Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Paul Chun Pui, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Lo Hoi-Pang, Yuen Wah, Rebecca Chan, Derek Kwok Jing-Hung', null, 'Country Spirit aka Plain Love III was a television drama series produced by TVB. The series takes place in a winery in China in around 1900-1930. Winemaking, as well as the trials and tribulations of a touching love story between a widow, who is part of a ghost marriage, and her husband''s house servant, are the main theme of this series.', 'Country Spirit aka Plain Love III was a television drama series produced by TVB. The series takes place in a winery in China in around 1900-1930. Winemaking, as well as the trials and tribulations of a touching love story between a widow, who is part of a ghost marriage, and her husband''s house servant, are the main theme of this series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5yHYRM1SvY4cWpB3DbUIt2cv5z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94915'),
  ('137900885150689841', 'Countryfile', 1988, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The people, places and stories making news in the British countryside.', 'The people, places and stories making news in the British countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18tR8DX1DRHp6HfLF53BDgwyFYy.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:2023'),
  ('978713226213862088', 'Couple of Mirrors', 2021, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Nan, Sun Yihan, Liu Zhiyang, He Fengtian, Zhou Dawei, Anna Fang, Huang Xinyao', 'TV-PG', 'You Yi is a young, innocent, and kind-hearted socialite and a successful author, living with everyone''s adoration and envy. Her perfect life is turned upside-down when she discovers a betrayal by the two most trusted people in her life. With no one left to turn to, she finds refuge in the friendship and support of Yan Wei, a young photographer with a cold personality. Unbeknownst to all, Yan Wei has a deadly secret identity.', 'You Yi is a young, innocent, and kind-hearted socialite and a successful author, living with everyone''s adoration and envy. Her perfect life is turned upside-down when she discovers a betrayal by the two most trusted people in her life. With no one left to turn to, she finds refuge in the friendship and support of Yan Wei, a young photographer with a cold personality. Unbeknownst to all, Yan Wei has a deadly secret identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdgbMKxiRMgMPziBjKxyLvPqgs5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130819'),
  ('197952298631246602', 'Coupled', 2016, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Terrence J, Alyssa Reeves', 'TV-14', 'Coupled follows 12 single, smart and young professional women looking for love who will meet face-to-face with eligible single men against the beautiful backdrop of the Caribbean islands.', 'Coupled follows 12 single, smart and young professional women looking for love who will meet face-to-face with eligible single men against the beautiful backdrop of the Caribbean islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64gRCgTqjGhRgm1LUwNRJoAy1Ov.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66518'),
  ('20161130840702744', 'Couples Therapy', 2019, 'Reality, Documentary', 'Eli Despres', null, 'Orna Guralnik', 'TV-MA', 'Far from reality-show caricatures, this is true documentary filmmaking that brings viewers into the authentic and visceral experience of weekly therapy with four couples. World-class therapist Dr. Orna Guralnik deftly guides the couples through the minefield of honest confrontation with each other and with themselves, revealing the real-life struggles — and extraordinary breakthroughs — typically hidden behind closed doors.', 'Far from reality-show caricatures, this is true documentary filmmaking that brings viewers into the authentic and visceral experience of weekly therapy with four couples. World-class therapist Dr. Orna Guralnik deftly guides the couples through the minefield of honest confrontation with each other and with themselves, revealing the real-life struggles — and extraordinary breakthroughs — typically hidden behind closed doors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYN2JRrfUZfxLhcQtQC0QTTLR3Q.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:91820'),
  ('823778016497469713', 'Coupling', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Steven Moffat', null, 'Jack Davenport, Gina Bellman, Sarah Alexander, Kate Isitt, Ben Miles, Richard Mylan', 'TV-14', 'Six friends in their thirties navigate dating, sexual adventures, and mishaps on their quest to find love.', 'Six friends in their thirties navigate dating, sexual adventures, and mishaps on their quest to find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfHQwmPUrCbm6XAPnuuBAVZpC94.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2719'),
  ('1123917146904987540', 'Coupling', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Steven Moffat', 'J. J. Philbin', 'Colin Ferguson, Jay Harrington, Christopher Moynihan, Lindsay Price, Rena Sofer, Sonya Walger', 'TV-14', 'The mating ritual can get messy. Let''s see if we have this straight... Steve''s with Jane but he''s suddenly hot for Susan who met Steve through Jeff whom Susan used to go out with though she''s just dumped Patrick despite the great sex so Patrick''s asked Sally out which bugs Susan since Sally is her best friend... Based on the outrageous British hit series of the same name, Coupling concerns love and lust among six thirty- somethings who are either involved, formerly involved or looking to become intimately involved -- often with each other. The result, not surprisingly, is a very involving comedy filled with eye-popping situations and equally jaw-dropping one-liners.', 'The mating ritual can get messy. Let''s see if we have this straight... Steve''s with Jane but he''s suddenly hot for Susan who met Steve through Jeff whom Susan used to go out with though she''s just dumped Patrick despite the great sex so Patrick''s asked Sally out which bugs Susan since Sally is her best friend... Based on the outrageous British hit series of the same name, Coupling concerns love and lust among six thirty- somethings who are either involved, formerly involved or looking to become intimately involved -- often with each other. The result, not surprisingly, is a very involving comedy filled with eye-popping situations and equally jaw-dropping one-liners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pne160vqidRdthKOpEGg0U3j39N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9897'),
  ('395813544811490379', 'Courage the Cowardly Dog', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'John R. Dilworth', null, 'Marty Grabstein, Thea White, Simon Prebble, Billie Lou Watt, Paul Schoeffler, Arthur Anderson', 'TV-Y7', 'The bizarre misadventures of a cowardly dog named Courage and his elderly owners in a farmhouse in Nowhere, Kansas.', 'The bizarre misadventures of a cowardly dog named Courage and his elderly owners in a farmhouse in Nowhere, Kansas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJQsBgzlrgZpjeB5fHBtJQA04nS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2085'),
  ('387569045161923613', 'Court Cam', 2019, 'Reality, Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Dan Abrams', 'TV-14', 'An in-depth examination of some of the most stunning and emotional courtroom moments caught on camera, from frightening outbursts to furious judges.', 'An in-depth examination of some of the most stunning and emotional courtroom moments caught on camera, from frightening outbursts to furious judges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIAuvw7BRciIOoW8dOatwY3qUdj.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:96152'),
  ('1105475516104494602', 'Court Lady', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Feng Nong', 'Feng Nong', 'Li Yitong, Xu Kai, Wu Jiayi, Tan Jianci, Hong Yao, He Fengtian, Li Zefeng, Wang Yizhe', null, 'Sheng Chumu, once a shiftless young man, transforms his life after falling for Fu Rou, a diligent merchant''s daughter. To win her heart, Chumu dedicates himself to studying and eventually decides to serve his country by leading a campaign against coastal pirates. Meanwhile, Fu Rou becomes a court-weaving official through a series of events, complicating their secret meetings. As she uncovers dark secrets and a dangerous plot, Fu Rou and Chumu must use their wits and skills to overcome their challenges together.', 'Sheng Chumu, once a shiftless young man, transforms his life after falling for Fu Rou, a diligent merchant''s daughter. To win her heart, Chumu dedicates himself to studying and eventually decides to serve his country by leading a campaign against coastal pirates. Meanwhile, Fu Rou becomes a court-weaving official through a series of events, complicating their secret meetings. As she uncovers dark secrets and a dangerous plot, Fu Rou and Chumu must use their wits and skills to overcome their challenges together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9F5ICeZT12inPyTmhm0lcL6AbeF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95487'),
  ('5116433490613255', 'Court of Gold', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Stephen Curry, Kevin Durant, Victor Wembanyama, LeBron James, Steve Kerr, Barack Obama, Dwyane Wade, Shai Gilgeous-Alexander', 'TV-MA', 'Go behind the scenes with the top medal contenders in men''s basketball as they battle for gold and glory at the 2024 Olympic Games in Paris.', 'Go behind the scenes with the top medal contenders in men''s basketball as they battle for gold and glory at the 2024 Olympic Games in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9Hia8NKk9DBIyb5mNzoDxMDGMN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282846'),
