  ('812935182058013146', 'Crims', 2020, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Carles Porta', null, 'Carles Porta', null, 'This is a series about true crimes that happened in Catalonia. Carles Porta presents the cases from the Catalunya Ràdio studio with a brief introduction before giving way to each chapter. Her voice over accompanies the whole chapter, with a tone and style to captivate and connect with the viewer.', 'This is a series about true crimes that happened in Catalonia. Carles Porta presents the cases from the Catalunya Ràdio studio with a brief introduction before giving way to each chapter. Her voice over accompanies the whole chapter, with a tone and style to captivate and connect with the viewer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6gR5rAIiGtWa7JzYIeDduB4df6.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:117180'),
  ('1028021679731677729', 'Crimson Sabre', 2000, 'Drama', null, 'Mai Guanzhi', 'Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Kwong Wa, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Melissa Ng Mei-Heng, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Evergreen Mak Cheung-Ching, Lam King-Kong, Fiona Yuen Choi-Wan', null, 'Crimson Sabre is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel Sword Stained with Royal Blood. The series was first broadcast on TVB in Hong Kong in 2000.', 'Crimson Sabre is a Hong Kong television series adapted from Louis Cha''s novel Sword Stained with Royal Blood. The series was first broadcast on TVB in Hong Kong in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TYcVubeUK1ZylBCBY1OcZUw6zA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94068'),
  ('702792801942779085', 'Cris Miró (She|Her|Hers)', 2024, 'Drama', 'Martín Vatenberg', null, 'Mina Serrano, Katja Alemann, César Bordón, Agustín Aristarán, Victorio D''Alessandro, Marcos Montes, Toto Rovito, Manuel Fanego', 'TV-MA', 'Cris Miró''s journey as Argentina''s first trans vedette in 1995, shedding light on the trans community. Despite challenges, she embraced her true self until her untimely passing, leaving a legacy of inspiration and acceptance', 'Cris Miró''s journey as Argentina''s first trans vedette in 1995, shedding light on the trans community. Despite challenges, she embraced her true self until her untimely passing, leaving a legacy of inspiration and acceptance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRnjqvpDsfjGk3vitYLbbZ8M9nw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256212'),
  ('1146821045687815812', 'Crisis', 2014, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Rand Ravich', null, 'Dermot Mulroney, Rachael Taylor, Lance Gross, James Lafferty, Max Martini, Michael Beach, Stevie Lynn Jones, Halston Sage', 'TV-14', 'When Washington''s most powerful players are pulled into an international conspiracy, an unlikely puppeteer will bring everyone from CEOs to The President of the United States to their knees by threatening the things they hold most dear.', 'When Washington''s most powerful players are pulled into an international conspiracy, an unlikely puppeteer will bring everyone from CEOs to The President of the United States to their knees by threatening the things they hold most dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BvcrUL7G9mVZo7YrfC5uWu4fpa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50558'),
  ('357952933707663489', 'Crisis Aftermath', 2019, 'Talk', null, null, 'Kevin Smith', 'TV-PG', 'Join Kevin Smith as he takes you into one of the greatest crossover events in television history.', 'Join Kevin Smith as he takes you into one of the greatest crossover events in television history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaCjmS5tyAcfCrcdKuqxQ1CwvZ9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98069'),
  ('783255260079121512', 'Crisis in Six Scenes', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Miley Cyrus, Elaine May, Rachel Brosnahan, John Magaro, Gad Elmaleh, Michael Rapaport, Lewis Black', 'TV-PG', 'A comedy that takes place in the 1960s during turbulent times in the United States when a middle class suburban family is visited by a guest who turns their household completely upside down.', 'A comedy that takes place in the 1960s during turbulent times in the United States when a middle class suburban family is visited by a guest who turns their household completely upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNb2QVOiqxmfDhn4r5F1zZRQog1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67443'),
  ('1124920809075681405', 'Crisis Jung', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Karim Tougui, Martial Le Minoux, Pauline Moingeon', 'TV-MA', 'Welcome to a world ravaged by explosions of violence, a world without love. Jung, the broken-hearted hero, pursues his quest: reunite with Maria, his lost love, savagely decapitated by Little Jesus. He can count on the support of allies met along his bloody path, encounters that provide an understanding of others, but especially of himself. He also has to deal with his “violent outbreaks,” an incontrollable curse that springs from his murderous soul.', 'Welcome to a world ravaged by explosions of violence, a world without love. Jung, the broken-hearted hero, pursues his quest: reunite with Maria, his lost love, savagely decapitated by Little Jesus. He can count on the support of allies met along his bloody path, encounters that provide an understanding of others, but especially of himself. He also has to deal with his “violent outbreaks,” an incontrollable curse that springs from his murderous soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9313uBwRZFsnDU7n5MECjLhtZZm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81554'),
  ('810714730572637574', 'Criss Angel Mindfreak', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Reality', 'Criss Angel', null, 'Criss Angel', null, 'Criss Angel Mindfreak is a show that aired on A&E Network. It debuted in 2005 and ended in 2010. It centered on stunts and street magic acts by magician Criss Angel.', 'Criss Angel Mindfreak is a show that aired on A&E Network. It debuted in 2005 and ended in 2010. It centered on stunts and street magic acts by magician Criss Angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ioUNHy0h9nZ5IT8jMgYeOCn40Q.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:12278'),
  ('368871028521557016', 'Cristela', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Cristela Alonzo, Kevin Hench', null, 'Cristela Alonzo, Maria Canals-Barrera, Carlos Ponce, Terri Hoyos, Sam McMurray, Andrew Leeds, Justine Lupe, Isabella Day', 'TV-PG', 'In her sixth year of law school, Cristela is finally on the brink of landing her first big (unpaid) internship at a prestigious law firm. The only problem is that her pursuit of success is more ambitious than her traditional Mexican-American family thinks is appropriate.', 'In her sixth year of law school, Cristela is finally on the brink of landing her first big (unpaid) internship at a prestigious law firm. The only problem is that her pursuit of success is more ambitious than her traditional Mexican-American family thinks is appropriate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmvHnL6TP5XoUJB9pUDMaz95tOz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61510'),
  ('571743293871275119', 'Cristóbal Balenciaga', 2024, 'Drama', 'Aitor Arregi, Jose Mari Goenaga, Lourdes Iglesias', null, 'Alberto San Juan, Thomas Coumans, Adam Quintero, Josean Bengoetxea, Cecilia Solaguren, Gemma Whelan, Anouk Grinberg', 'TV-MA', 'Cristóbal Balenciaga makes his debut as a designer in Paris, but the designs that set a trend in Spain don''t work well in the sophisticated empire of fashion where Chanel, Dior, and Givenchy set the trends. Guided by his obsession with control in all aspects of his life, Balenciaga will define his style and end up becoming the greatest of all.', 'Cristóbal Balenciaga makes his debut as a designer in Paris, but the designs that set a trend in Spain don''t work well in the sophisticated empire of fashion where Chanel, Dior, and Givenchy set the trends. Guided by his obsession with control in all aspects of his life, Balenciaga will define his style and end up becoming the greatest of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97Dtc3l0HbVurtTrQCcjNnK35pO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138498'),
  ('955612980531229414', 'Critical', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jed Mercurio', null, 'Lennie James, Catherine Walker, Kimberley Nixon, Neve McIntosh, Prasanna Puwanarajah, John Macmillan, Danny Kirrane', 'NR', 'The Major Trauma Centre is a state-of-the-art unit which treats only the most gravely ill or seriously injured. Whether that patient lives or dies is determined by knife-edge decisions and procedures, but can the diverse team of medical professionals knit together and rise to the challenge? Our team hold a life in their hands but in every case they face the agonisingly real fear that it could slip through their fingers.', 'The Major Trauma Centre is a state-of-the-art unit which treats only the most gravely ill or seriously injured. Whether that patient lives or dies is determined by knife-edge decisions and procedures, but can the diverse team of medical professionals knit together and rise to the challenge? Our team hold a life in their hands but in every case they face the agonisingly real fear that it could slip through their fingers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bY8dFrdSIuXgSiRjqYWNVup6a9o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62107'),
  ('869460169652007572', 'Critical Role', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Matthew Mercer, Ashley Johnson, Marisha Ray', null, 'Brennan Lee Mulligan, Laura Bailey, Luis Carazo, Robbie Daymond, Aabria Iyengar, Taliesin Jaffe, Ashley Johnson, Matthew Mercer', null, 'Critical Role is a weekly actual play series that uses tabletop role-playing game mechanics as a means to explore and develop stories from the vast fantasy worlds of Exandria, Aramán, and beyond, with sweeping narratives intricately woven through collaboration between Game Masters and players.', 'Critical Role is a weekly actual play series that uses tabletop role-playing game mechanics as a means to explore and develop stories from the vast fantasy worlds of Exandria, Aramán, and beyond, with sweeping narratives intricately woven through collaboration between Game Masters and players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keSNwdzmSgQzluKmqTI6kwDOFa7.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:254002'),
  ('769480890272928712', 'Critical Role Abridged', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Marisha Ray', null, 'Matthew Mercer, Laura Bailey, Liam O''Brien, Ashley Johnson, Taliesin Jaffe, Travis Willingham, Marisha Ray, Sam Riegel', null, 'All the twists and turns of an episode of Critical Role in half the time! In Critical Role Abridged, the rich tapestry of a Critical Role campaign is lovingly distilled to its most pivotal, hilarious, and poignant moments in about 60-90 minutes per episode.', 'All the twists and turns of an episode of Critical Role in half the time! In Critical Role Abridged, the rich tapestry of a Critical Role campaign is lovingly distilled to its most pivotal, hilarious, and poignant moments in about 60-90 minutes per episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HJj4ofnuisy37keTskVQr906jO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254039'),
  ('102260410024153897', 'Critical Role Cooldown', 2024, 'Talk', 'Matthew Mercer, Ashley Johnson, Marisha Ray', null, 'Brennan Lee Mulligan, Matthew Mercer, Laura Bailey, Liam O''Brien, Travis Willingham, Taliesin Jaffe, Marisha Ray, Ashley Johnson', null, 'Get a backstage pass to each Critical Role episode! You''ll be right there at the table immediately after the Game Master says, "Is it Thursday yet?" experiencing the cast''s post-show reactions.', 'Get a backstage pass to each Critical Role episode! You''ll be right there at the table immediately after the Game Master says, "Is it Thursday yet?" experiencing the cast''s post-show reactions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5P7RQrj90wDwVzHX2SpncnnVSY.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:254070'),
  ('663185761722962608', 'Critical: Between Life and Death', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'From critical emergencies to the operating room, this documentary series follows London''s trauma centres as they treat the most severely injured.', 'From critical emergencies to the operating room, this documentary series follows London''s trauma centres as they treat the most severely injured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s25OHjyqVuNUNJcUlzhx5lgzJU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259207'),
  ('427468557298845843', 'Critters: A New Binge', 2019, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jordan Rubin', null, 'Christian Sloan, Lauren K. Robek, Sean Owen Roberts, Stephi Chin-Salvo, Joey Morgan, Corrina Conlan, Daphne Hoskins, Jocelyn Ott', 'TV-MA', 'Pursued by intergalactic bounty hunters, the Critters return to Earth on a secret mission and encounter lovelorn high-schooler Christopher, his crush Dana, his best friend Charlie, and his mom Veronica, whose past will come back to bite them—literally.', 'Pursued by intergalactic bounty hunters, the Critters return to Earth on a secret mission and encounter lovelorn high-schooler Christopher, his crush Dana, his best friend Charlie, and his mom Veronica, whose past will come back to bite them—literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS4E3DZ01e5vVD0fgsExyDQBW9R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87208'),
  ('876895764531073067', 'Crocodile Tears', 1978, 'Drama', 'Stephen Shiu Yeuk-Yuen, Johnny Mak Tong-Hung', null, 'Pat Poon, Dominic Lam Ka-Wah, Mary Cheung, Iris Ma Man-Yee, Cheung Ying, Choi King-Fai, Lisa Yuen, Leung Ming', null, 'Restaurant owner Lu Ganyu has two sons and a daughter. His eldest son, Lu Wenjun, becomes a journalist and later opens his own newspaper. However, his newspaper is suppressed by rivals, making him realize the cunning nature of the business world and prompting him to change. Wenjun uses the wealthy Huang De to help him, but he later forces Huang to sell his shares. Wenqi, Wenjun''s sister, marries Huang despite her family''s objections, but they don''t get along. Wenjun falls in love with Xiao Ailian and Zou Shujuan. Although he marries Shujuan, he can''t forget about Ailian. In his bid for success, Wenjun ignores his family and even associates himself with Meng Yanhong, a famous matchmaker, leading to his eventual success but estrangement from his loved ones. Meanwhile, Huang and Wenjun''s enemies conspire to take him down.', 'Restaurant owner Lu Ganyu has two sons and a daughter. His eldest son, Lu Wenjun, becomes a journalist and later opens his own newspaper. However, his newspaper is suppressed by rivals, making him realize the cunning nature of the business world and prompting him to change. Wenjun uses the wealthy Huang De to help him, but he later forces Huang to sell his shares. Wenqi, Wenjun''s sister, marries Huang despite her family''s objections, but they don''t get along. Wenjun falls in love with Xiao Ailian and Zou Shujuan. Although he marries Shujuan, he can''t forget about Ailian. In his bid for success, Wenjun ignores his family and even associates himself with Meng Yanhong, a famous matchmaker, leading to his eventual success but estrangement from his loved ones. Meanwhile, Huang and Wenjun''s enemies conspire to take him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTTp5fWS5Y56zlYF0n1i8wloKCR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107990'),
  ('210826043198222354', 'Cromañón: The Night of the Fire', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Olivia Nuss, Toto Rovito, José Giménez-Zapiola, Soledad Villamil, Luis Machín, Paola Barrientos, Carolina Kopelioff, Esteban Lamothe', 'TV-14', 'It''s 2008. A news story connects Malena, 22, with her traumatic past. In 2004, she attended a rock concert at the República de Cromañón venue, where a fire broke out, and 194 young people died. Now, four years later, a new event will link her to past loves and friendships, helping her overcome the guilt she feels for being alive.', 'It''s 2008. A news story connects Malena, 22, with her traumatic past. In 2004, she attended a rock concert at the República de Cromañón venue, where a fire broke out, and 194 young people died. Now, four years later, a new event will link her to past loves and friendships, helping her overcome the guilt she feels for being alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CvdgDkG8eAVJmlBGpjSy3YsRqX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275677'),
  ('650942458102075127', 'Cromartie High School', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Eiji Nonaka', 'Eiji Nonaka', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Megumi Hayashibara, Mika Kanai, Norio Wakamoto, Akio Suyama, Tetsu Inada, Tomoyuki Shimura, Norihisa Mori', 'TV-14', 'Folks, meet Takashi Kamiyama. Enrolled at Cromartie High, where everybody is a delinquent, Kamiyama is apparently the only non-delinquent in the school. Logically, therefore, he must be the toughest in his class—by the rather twisted logic that only a really tough rabbit would lie down with lions. Thus begins a story that parodies every cliché of tough-guy anime that you''ve ever heard of, and some you haven''t. Oh, and Freddie Mercury is in it, too.', 'Folks, meet Takashi Kamiyama. Enrolled at Cromartie High, where everybody is a delinquent, Kamiyama is apparently the only non-delinquent in the school. Logically, therefore, he must be the toughest in his class—by the rather twisted logic that only a really tough rabbit would lie down with lions. Thus begins a story that parodies every cliché of tough-guy anime that you''ve ever heard of, and some you haven''t. Oh, and Freddie Mercury is in it, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fap9ADMD1xVnz62rmnQerxzmFoy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12260'),
  ('1027933299992986810', 'Crooked House', 2008, 'Mystery', 'Mark Gatiss', null, 'Lee Ingleby, Mark Gatiss', null, 'Crooked House is a British supernatural drama miniseries broadcast on BBC Four from 22-24 December 2008. Created and written by Mark Gatiss, and produced by Tiger Aspect Productions, the serial stars Lee Ingleby and Gatiss. A ghost story about a cursed house. The cursed house — Geap Manor — weaves together three ghost stories set during Georgian times, the 1920s, and present day.', 'Crooked House is a British supernatural drama miniseries broadcast on BBC Four from 22-24 December 2008. Created and written by Mark Gatiss, and produced by Tiger Aspect Productions, the serial stars Lee Ingleby and Gatiss. A ghost story about a cursed house. The cursed house — Geap Manor — weaves together three ghost stories set during Georgian times, the 1920s, and present day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIB1nzaFDp3uL56aVIErEDTfCX3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19887'),
  ('868024849888499139', 'Crookhaven', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Justin Young', 'Justin Young', 'Amari Bacchus', null, 'Set at mysterious Crookhaven School, high achieving young crooks from across the world are secretly selected to hone their skills in disciplines such as Deception, Crimnastics, Forgery and Infiltration, learning how to use their skills for good and to do what is right in their own way.', 'Set at mysterious Crookhaven School, high achieving young crooks from across the world are secretly selected to hone their skills in disciplines such as Deception, Crimnastics, Forgery and Infiltration, learning how to use their skills for good and to do what is right in their own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mmJrXEBlLKtR7ccTl4Qnw99fci.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291634'),
  ('38261892760939040', 'Crooks', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Georg Lippert, Benjamin Hessler, Marvin Kren', null, 'Frederick Lau, Christoph Krutzler, Svenja Jung, Jonathan Tittel, Erdal Yıldız, Lukas Thomas Watzl, Karl Welunschek, Nima Yaghobi', 'TV-MA', 'A priceless coin puts rival gangs across Europe at odds, forcing a retired safecracker to team up with a two-bit gangster for one last heist.', 'A priceless coin puts rival gangs across Europe at odds, forcing a retired safecracker to team up with a two-bit gangster for one last heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KkAi8uaCKainPE0OeBp6zHRWTa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:246799'),
  ('798501376584948444', 'Cross', 2018, 'Crime', null, 'choi min suk', 'Go Kyung-pyo, Cho Jae-hyun, Jeon So-min, Jin Yi-han, Yang Jin-sung, Jang Kwang, Kim Jong-goo, Heo Sung-tae', null, 'Kang In-Kyu’s father was brutally murdered 13 years ago. To take revenge on those who are responsible for his father’s death, he becomes a doctor. Kang In-Kyu volunteers at a prison medical office where the murderer is imprisoned.', 'Kang In-Kyu’s father was brutally murdered 13 years ago. To take revenge on those who are responsible for his father’s death, he becomes a doctor. Kang In-Kyu volunteers at a prison medical office where the murderer is imprisoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0npp1E1tOUQz5oaLce1UHEJoHl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76521'),
  ('837645010133935298', 'Cross', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ben Watkins', null, 'Aldis Hodge, Isaiah Mustafa, Juanita Jennings, Alona Tal, Samantha Walkes, Caleb Elijah, Melody Hurd, Johnny Ray Gill', 'TV-MA', 'Alex Cross is a brilliant but flawed homicide detective and full of contradictions. A doting father and family man, Cross is single-minded to the point of obsession when he hunts killers. He is desperate for love, but his wife’s murder has left him too damaged to receive it.', 'Alex Cross is a brilliant but flawed homicide detective and full of contradictions. A doting father and family man, Cross is single-minded to the point of obsession when he hunts killers. He is desperate for love, but his wife’s murder has left him too damaged to receive it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hhKdavCEZi8d584ZtIrQIrBvZI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213306'),
  ('509388521239494523', 'Cross Ange: Rondo of Angels and Dragons', 2014, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Nana Mizuki, Mamoru Miyano, Sumire Uesaka, Houko Kuwashima, Ami Koshimizu, Eri Kitamura, Yukari Tamura, Takako Honda', null, 'Humanity has advanced to great heights since it obtained the information technology known as "Mana." With that nearly magical power, problems like war, food shortages, and pollution have been eliminated. In this age of peace and freedom, First Princess Angelise Ikaruga Misurugi of the Misurugi Empire is a privileged girl with no disabilities. She learns, however, that she is a "Norma," a kind of human who cannot use Mana and are outcasts of society. Having lost everything, she is sent to an isolated island. There she meets other Normas who ride in humanoid weapons called Para-mails, protecting the world from dragon invaders from another dimension.', 'Humanity has advanced to great heights since it obtained the information technology known as "Mana." With that nearly magical power, problems like war, food shortages, and pollution have been eliminated. In this age of peace and freedom, First Princess Angelise Ikaruga Misurugi of the Misurugi Empire is a privileged girl with no disabilities. She learns, however, that she is a "Norma," a kind of human who cannot use Mana and are outcasts of society. Having lost everything, she is sent to an isolated island. There she meets other Normas who ride in humanoid weapons called Para-mails, protecting the world from dragon invaders from another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUSu7WKW4KfNARFL0eEmdXdqbpn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61425'),
  ('162314242193056017', 'Cross Fire', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Li Kuangning, Wang Xiaohan, Фу Ли', 'Lu Han, Leo Wu, Cecilia Boey, Dai Luwa, Liu Shuailiang, Zhu Junlin, Huang Zien, Pan Meiye', null, 'In 2008, struggling team captain Xiao Feng fights to keep his fledgling e-sports squad alive despite ridicule and a dying dream. Eleven years later, wheelchair-bound gaming prodigy Lu Xiaobei vows to fulfill his late brother’s unfinished path to becoming a pro. A mysterious glitch links the two across time—sparking a friendship that alters fate and chase the championship that once felt impossible.', 'In 2008, struggling team captain Xiao Feng fights to keep his fledgling e-sports squad alive despite ridicule and a dying dream. Eleven years later, wheelchair-bound gaming prodigy Lu Xiaobei vows to fulfill his late brother’s unfinished path to becoming a pro. A mysterious glitch links the two across time—sparking a friendship that alters fate and chase the championship that once felt impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yan0WCKsxBnd8g5cPimODygT87u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106227'),
  ('164896018610717305', 'Cross Game', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Miyu Irino, Haruka Tomatsu, Akemi Kanda, Megumi Toyoguchi, Noriko Shitaya, Takahiro Sakurai, Masako Nozawa, Yoshinori Sonobe', 'TV-G', 'Kō Kitamura, whose family owns a sporting goods store, has known the Tsukishima girls since he was born. The Tsukishima family runs a batting center and cafe, and they have four daughters. There''s Ichiyo, the responsible eldest; Wakaba, Kō''s cheerful best friend; Aoba, who doesn''t get along with Kō; and Momiji, the energetic youngest daughter. When Kō enters high school, he aspires to lead his baseball team to the Koshien National High School Championship as their ace pitcher and make Wakaba''s dream come true.', 'Kō Kitamura, whose family owns a sporting goods store, has known the Tsukishima girls since he was born. The Tsukishima family runs a batting center and cafe, and they have four daughters. There''s Ichiyo, the responsible eldest; Wakaba, Kō''s cheerful best friend; Aoba, who doesn''t get along with Kō; and Momiji, the energetic youngest daughter. When Kō enters high school, he aspires to lead his baseball team to the Koshien National High School Championship as their ace pitcher and make Wakaba''s dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3M701nra5h9ChMjT1ACOPfJqQnv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46337'),
  ('854015670347876090', 'Crossbones', 2014, 'Drama', 'Neil Cross', null, 'John Malkovich, Richard Coyle, Yasmine Al Massri, David Hoflin, Claire Foy, Tracy Ifeachor, Chris Perfetti, Peter Stebbings', 'TV-14', 'It''s 1715 on the Bahamian island of New Providence, the first functioning democracy in the Americas, where the diabolical pirate Edward Teach, a.k.a. Blackbeard, reigns over a rogue nation of thieves, outlaws and miscreant sailors. Part shantytown, part marauder''s paradise, this is a place like no other on earth - and a mounting threat to international commerce. To gain control of this fearsome society, Tom Lowe, a highly skilled undercover assassin, is sent to the buccaneers'' haven to take down the brilliant and charismatic Blackbeard. But the closer Lowe gets, the more he finds that his quest is not so simple. Lowe can''t help but admire the political ideals of Blackbeard, whose thirst for knowledge knows no bounds - and no law. But Lowe is not the only danger to Blackbeard''s rule. He is a man with many villainous rivals and one great weakness - a passionately driven woman whom he cannot deny.', 'It''s 1715 on the Bahamian island of New Providence, the first functioning democracy in the Americas, where the diabolical pirate Edward Teach, a.k.a. Blackbeard, reigns over a rogue nation of thieves, outlaws and miscreant sailors. Part shantytown, part marauder''s paradise, this is a place like no other on earth - and a mounting threat to international commerce. To gain control of this fearsome society, Tom Lowe, a highly skilled undercover assassin, is sent to the buccaneers'' haven to take down the brilliant and charismatic Blackbeard. But the closer Lowe gets, the more he finds that his quest is not so simple. Lowe can''t help but admire the political ideals of Blackbeard, whose thirst for knowledge knows no bounds - and no law. But Lowe is not the only danger to Blackbeard''s rule. He is a man with many villainous rivals and one great weakness - a passionately driven woman whom he cannot deny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1FvNiEC61VvuNPkaKMseDXnDGc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58810'),
  ('553262635387376198', 'Crossfire', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Louise Doughty', 'Louise Doughty', 'Keeley Hawes, Lee Ingleby, Josette Simon, Anneika Rose, Shalisha James-Davis, Marta Fuenar, Daniel Ryan, Vikash Bhai', null, 'A group of holidaymakers are caught up in a gun attack on the hotel where they are staying', 'A group of holidaymakers are caught up in a gun attack on the hotel where they are staying', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1opiu4UYkPDwxmXr6IxV0Az24nX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156763'),
  ('650181250032640167', 'Crossing Jordan', 2001, 'Drama', 'Tim Kring', null, 'Jill Hennessy, Miguel Ferrer, Jerry O''Connell, Steve Valentine, Ravi Kapoor, Kathryn Hahn', null, 'Crossing Jordan is an American television crime/drama series that stars Jill Hennessy as Jordan Cavanaugh, M.D., a crime-solving forensic pathologist employed in the Massachusetts Office of the Chief Medical Examiner.', 'Crossing Jordan is an American television crime/drama series that stars Jill Hennessy as Jordan Cavanaugh, M.D., a crime-solving forensic pathologist employed in the Massachusetts Office of the Chief Medical Examiner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bywFoHoLZvW2vxDc7n4ToAKkR0y.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:2406'),
  ('442152250717061882', 'Crossing Lines', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Rola Bauer, Edward Allen Bernero', null, 'Tom Wlaschiha, Donald Sutherland, Lara Rossi, Elizabeth Mitchell, Goran Višnjić, Stuart Martin, Naomi Battrick', 'TV-14', 'Through globalization, many countries have been opened and barriers removed to ensure easy trade, travel and cultural diversity. However, this openness has given opportunities to criminals looking to exploit the system and ultimately threaten our global safety. As Europe has become a "safe house" for criminals eluding law enforcers, a special kind of law enforcement team is needed to handle specific ongoing crimes on a global level. "Crossing Lines" is the story of one such team, made up of five international cops, headed by Captain Daniel. The team - comprised of individuals who have little in common - must learn to live and work under the most dangerous and potentially deadly conditions. Housed in an unused storage section underneath the ICC, this mismatched team faces bureaucratic, jurisdictional and cultural obstacles while traversing continents in pursuit of justice.', 'Through globalization, many countries have been opened and barriers removed to ensure easy trade, travel and cultural diversity. However, this openness has given opportunities to criminals looking to exploit the system and ultimately threaten our global safety. As Europe has become a "safe house" for criminals eluding law enforcers, a special kind of law enforcement team is needed to handle specific ongoing crimes on a global level. "Crossing Lines" is the story of one such team, made up of five international cops, headed by Captain Daniel. The team - comprised of individuals who have little in common - must learn to live and work under the most dangerous and potentially deadly conditions. Housed in an unused storage section underneath the ICC, this mismatched team faces bureaucratic, jurisdictional and cultural obstacles while traversing continents in pursuit of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow8RQrZJUQfOeR5alsj9OAXoxic.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46975'),
  ('1002355954983484101', 'Crossing Swords', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Tom Root, John Harvatine IV', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Goodhearted hero wannabe Patrick lands his dream job as a squire, only to learn the royal castle is a corrupt hornet’s nest of horny monarchs, crooks and charlatans. War, murder, full frontal nudity—who knew brightly colored peg people led such exciting lives?', 'Goodhearted hero wannabe Patrick lands his dream job as a squire, only to learn the royal castle is a corrupt hornet’s nest of horny monarchs, crooks and charlatans. War, murder, full frontal nudity—who knew brightly colored peg people led such exciting lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3jSJcrXTcXK1ibq7vM4GPDGSrk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:104127'),
  ('1132671542192499240', 'Crossing Time', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kazuki Matsunaga, Sayaka Senbongi, Yui Ogura, Yuri Komagata, Yasuhiro Mamiya, Mariko Honda, Suzuna Kinoshita, Mitsuhiro Ichiki', 'TV-14', '“Clank, clank, clank, clank...” Today, the railroad crossing bar goes down again, stopping someone on their way somewhere. The various stories of youth, eros, art, first love, etc that occur during the time spent waiting at a railroad crossing... All railroad crossings, all the time. Bringing you a variety of short stories about railroad crossings!', '“Clank, clank, clank, clank...” Today, the railroad crossing bar goes down again, stopping someone on their way somewhere. The various stories of youth, eros, art, first love, etc that occur during the time spent waiting at a railroad crossing... All railroad crossings, all the time. Bringing you a variety of short stories about railroad crossings!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F8Y6Usd5DSGTCdgEogFOMNf5wU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78467'),
  ('195530653771380553', 'Crossover Singer', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Qin Hailu, Wang Kai, Xiao Shenyang, Li Xiaomeng, Zhong Chuxi, Niu Junfeng, Tan Jianci, Ke Song', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uARgxYjA2F6vnNSoXFOkH7YBwNg.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:106677'),
  ('346071316471831148', 'Crossroads', 1964, 'Drama', 'Peter Ling', null, 'Kate O''Mara, Jane Rossington, Roger Tonge, Kathy Staff, Sue Lloyd, Gabrielle Drake, Susan Hanson, Terence Rigby', null, 'Crossroads is a British television soap opera set in a fictional motel near Birmingham, England. Created by Hazel Adair and Peter Ling, the commercial ITV network originally broadcast the series between 1964 and 1988. Produced by ATV and later by Central it became a byword for cheap production values, particularly in the 1970s and early 1980s. The series was revived in a glossier version by Carlton Television in 2001, but was again cancelled in 2003. The original theme tune was composed by Tony Hatch, and notably covered by Paul McCartney & Wings on their 1975 album Venus and Mars. A new version, which was first aired in 1987 when the series was relaunched as Crossroads, Kings Oak, was composed by Raf Ravenscroft and Max Early.', 'Crossroads is a British television soap opera set in a fictional motel near Birmingham, England. Created by Hazel Adair and Peter Ling, the commercial ITV network originally broadcast the series between 1964 and 1988. Produced by ATV and later by Central it became a byword for cheap production values, particularly in the 1970s and early 1980s. The series was revived in a glossier version by Carlton Television in 2001, but was again cancelled in 2003. The original theme tune was composed by Tony Hatch, and notably covered by Paul McCartney & Wings on their 1975 album Venus and Mars. A new version, which was first aired in 1987 when the series was relaunched as Crossroads, Kings Oak, was composed by Raf Ravenscroft and Max Early.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEXMvsUgtXmYzCnewX8c89SP0Zw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3753'),
  ('523769614729275771', 'Crossroads', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Alexia Barlier, Thomas Jouannet, Cyril Lecomte, Mariama Gueye, Oussama Kheddam, Wanja Mues, Fred Bianconi, Aïssatou Diop', null, 'The story of the family of lawyer Sofie and Commissioner Thomas that is struck by fate. Their five-year-old son, Arthur, disappears without a trace. This tragedy makes Sofie question her life. She ends her career as a criminal lawyer and starts training as a police officer. Three years later, she has a clear goal: to lock up as many criminals as possible while continuing to passionately search for her missing son.', 'The story of the family of lawyer Sofie and Commissioner Thomas that is struck by fate. Their five-year-old son, Arthur, disappears without a trace. This tragedy makes Sofie question her life. She ends her career as a criminal lawyer and starts training as a police officer. Three years later, she has a clear goal: to lock up as many criminals as possible while continuing to passionately search for her missing son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ukMt8pKCpAqobbCJP0oRL1BY6I.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126074'),
  ('967347296806062274', 'Crow''s Blood', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Clint Sears', 'Sakura, Anna Iriyama, Mayu Watanabe, Jurina Matsui, Yuki Kashiwagi, Yui Yokoyama, Rena Kato, Mion Mukaichi', 'TV-MA', 'As science is growing ever closer to the taboo field of regenerative medicine, a mysterious new student named Maki Togawa begins attending the International Dolly Girls'' College. Soon after, a series of strange and horrific events occur in and around the school, seemingly in the proximity of or due to new student Maki.', 'As science is growing ever closer to the taboo field of regenerative medicine, a mysterious new student named Maki Togawa begins attending the International Dolly Girls'' College. Soon after, a series of strange and horrific events occur in and around the school, seemingly in the proximity of or due to new student Maki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckc4RIOA8fjjTdEH1ribQtIs5fp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74531'),
  ('419052917070264272', 'Crowded', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Suzanne Martin', null, 'Patrick Warburton, Carrie Preston, Miranda Cosgrove, Mia Serafino, Stacy Keach, Carlease Burke', 'TV-14', 'No more sex, booze and paying the bills naked. After 20 years of parenting, empty nesters Mike and Martina are finally reclaiming their wild side. But when both of their two grown daughters unexpectedly move back in and Mike''s parents scratch their plans to spend their golden years in Florida, their roost is full again. This new (and very timely) family comedy proves that life is crazy with a full house, especially the second time around.', 'No more sex, booze and paying the bills naked. After 20 years of parenting, empty nesters Mike and Martina are finally reclaiming their wild side. But when both of their two grown daughters unexpectedly move back in and Mike''s parents scratch their plans to spend their golden years in Florida, their roost is full again. This new (and very timely) family comedy proves that life is crazy with a full house, especially the second time around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7FwiyuzQp5vmUAkQLPLp5OedWm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65553'),
  ('1022405907014245659', 'Crown Court', 1972, 'Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Crown Court is an afternoon television courtroom drama produced by Granada Television for the ITV network that ran from 1972, when the Crown Court system replaced Assize courts and Quarter sessions in the legal system of England and Wales, to 1984.', 'Crown Court is an afternoon television courtroom drama produced by Granada Television for the ITV network that ran from 1972, when the Crown Court system replaced Assize courts and Quarter sessions in the legal system of England and Wales, to 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nT9SyvLcIkXeYRT6me3Tb8YHGV.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:3673'),
  ('190727055005884532', 'Crown Lake', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Francesca Capaldi, Kyla-Drew, Emily Skinner, Lilia Buckingham, Glory Curda, Mia Dinoto, Vanessa Angel, Paul Thomas Arnold', 'TV-14', 'When Eleanor "Nellie" Chambers shows up at Crown Lake Academy, a fancy all-girls boarding school, she knows this school is her ticket to a new & better life. But she also knows fitting in and learning the ropes isn’t going to be easy. Until she finds a guide.', 'When Eleanor "Nellie" Chambers shows up at Crown Lake Academy, a fancy all-girls boarding school, she knows this school is her ticket to a new & better life. But she also knows fitting in and learning the ropes isn’t going to be easy. Until she finds a guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8srn4G7m1JTCbHrl5HiCP2iHasI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90393'),
  ('889165763304919185', 'Cruel Intentions', 2024, 'Drama', 'Phoebe Fisher, Sara Goodman', null, 'Sarah Catherine Hook, Zac Burgess, Savannah Lee Smith, Sara Silva, John Harlan Kim, Khobe Clarke, Brooke Lena Johnson, Sean Patrick Thomas', 'TV-MA', 'At an elite Washington, D.C.-adjacent university, two ruthless step-siblings will do anything to stay on top of the cutthroat social hierarchy. After a brutal hazing incident threatens the entire Greek Life system at their school, they''ll do whatever is necessary to preserve their power and reputation – even if that means seducing, the daughter of the Vice President of the United States.', 'At an elite Washington, D.C.-adjacent university, two ruthless step-siblings will do anything to stay on top of the cutthroat social hierarchy. After a brutal hazing incident threatens the entire Greek Life system at their school, they''ll do whatever is necessary to preserve their power and reputation – even if that means seducing, the daughter of the Vice President of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWtcyehBCO9fksIj30pdtVldntw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228528'),
  ('713652778174446933', 'Cruel Romance', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Yuan Shuai', 'Huang Xiaoming, Joe Chen, Qiao Renliang, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Yang Le, Xie Wenxuan, Chieh Chang, Lv Jiarong', null, 'Rong Jinxiu, a country girl, travels to Shanghai to uncover the truth behind her family''s death and crosses paths with Zuo Zhen, a triad leader. As they fall in love, Jinxiu also draws the attention of businessman Xiang Yingdong. Amidst growing danger, Jinxiu must navigate love, rivalry, and threats to her family’s survival.', 'Rong Jinxiu, a country girl, travels to Shanghai to uncover the truth behind her family''s death and crosses paths with Zuo Zhen, a triad leader. As they fall in love, Jinxiu also draws the attention of businessman Xiang Yingdong. Amidst growing danger, Jinxiu must navigate love, rivalry, and threats to her family’s survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqXhbvlc7NpaTYSMaYwwj6r6yZe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62548'),
  ('255197020654372393', 'Cruel Summer', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Bert V. Royal', null, 'Sadie Stanley, Lexi Underwood, Griffin Gluck, Lisa Yamada, Sean Blakemore, KaDee Strickland', 'TV-14', 'Taking place over three summers - 1993, 1994, 1995 - in a small Texas town, a beautiful popular teen, Kate, is abducted and, seemingly unrelated, a girl, Jeanette, goes from being a sweet, awkward outlier to the most popular girl in town and, by ’95, the most despised person in America.', 'Taking place over three summers - 1993, 1994, 1995 - in a small Texas town, a beautiful popular teen, Kate, is abducted and, seemingly unrelated, a girl, Jeanette, goes from being a sweet, awkward outlier to the most popular girl in town and, by ’95, the most despised person in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7CMVS7kjWJFdt1wdtj5rdvTwss.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98201'),
  ('292518322190962986', 'Cruijff', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PfjASnVbMwvVOebuCEa4arvZtL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316841'),
  ('23463953682710644', 'Crusade', 1999, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'J. Michael Straczynski', null, 'Gary Cole, Daniel Dae Kim, David Allen Brooks, Carrie Dobro, Marjean Holden, Peter Woodward', null, 'Crusade is an American spin-off TV show from J. Michael Straczynski''s Babylon 5. Its plot is set in AD 2267, five years after the events of Babylon 5, and just after the movie A Call to Arms. The Drakh have released a nanovirus plague on Earth, which will destroy all life on Earth within five years if it is not stopped. To that end, the Victory class destroyer Excalibur has been sent out to look for anything that could help the search for a cure.', 'Crusade is an American spin-off TV show from J. Michael Straczynski''s Babylon 5. Its plot is set in AD 2267, five years after the events of Babylon 5, and just after the movie A Call to Arms. The Drakh have released a nanovirus plague on Earth, which will destroy all life on Earth within five years if it is not stopped. To that end, the Victory class destroyer Excalibur has been sent out to look for anything that could help the search for a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nro8P92M0XFA4sxwD7xy1h6yFIy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2120'),
  ('735062696914439938', 'Crusades', 1995, 'Documentary', null, 'Terry Jones, Alan Ereira', 'Terry Jones, Anthony Smee, Steve Purbrick, Marcello Walton, Robin Sebastian, Kate Binchy, Suheil Zakkar, Sean Arnold', 'NR', 'Terry Jones explores the history of the Crusades.', 'Terry Jones explores the history of the Crusades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQNLuaVVNWhs6YbAavYNztXZg87.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33932'),
  ('1075950430176001799', 'Crush', 2021, 'Drama, Family', 'Mu Fusheng', null, 'Lin Yanjun, Wan Peng, Li Jiahao, Chen Meiyi, Niu Yukun, Jiaqi Li, Ma Li, Zeng Yixuan', null, 'A passionate radio fan falls for a reclusive songwriter — her longtime idol who secretly lives with visual impairment. As their love grows, misunderstandings and harsh realities put their fragile connection to the test.', 'A passionate radio fan falls for a reclusive songwriter — her longtime idol who secretly lives with visual impairment. As their love grows, misunderstandings and harsh realities put their fragile connection to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXbuAVAn5ITohJG145BDoGJHO2W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129053'),
  ('65745226557024528', 'Crushology 101', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Lee Seul, Seong So-eun', 'Roh Jeong-eui, Lee Chae-min, Cho Jun-young, Kim Hyun-jin, Choi Ji-su, Lee Ji-hoon, Hong Min-gi, Nam Kyu-hee', null, 'Bunny is a talented sculpture student with a warm personality but struggles with low self-esteem due to a failed first love.', 'Bunny is a talented sculpture student with a warm personality but struggles with low self-esteem due to a failed first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9K4rTjVM9YLsYLeQxgKuea8qonE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262828'),
  ('1017131569665887457', 'Crusoe', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Stephen Gallagher, Daniel Defoe', 'Stephen Gallagher', 'Sam Neill, Philip Winchester, Tongayi Chirisa, Joaquim de Almeida, Sean Bean, Anna Walton, Mía Maestro', 'TV-PG', 'Crusoe is a television adventure drama based loosely on the novel Robinson Crusoe by Daniel Defoe. The series'' 13 episodes aired on NBC during the first half of the 2008–2009 television season. It follows the adventures of Robinson Crusoe: a man who has been shipwrecked on an island for six years and is desperate to return home to his wife and children. His lone companion is Friday, a native whom Crusoe rescued and taught English.', 'Crusoe is a television adventure drama based loosely on the novel Robinson Crusoe by Daniel Defoe. The series'' 13 episodes aired on NBC during the first half of the 2008–2009 television season. It follows the adventures of Robinson Crusoe: a man who has been shipwrecked on an island for six years and is desperate to return home to his wife and children. His lone companion is Friday, a native whom Crusoe rescued and taught English.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMhLX6t3C5xAmPqqHoD6ddcwI3I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7224'),
  ('23146636786882165', 'Crutch', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Owen Smith', null, 'Tracy Morgan, Jermaine Fowler, Adrianna Mitchell, Kecia Lewis', null, 'Francois ''Frank'' Crutchfield or ''Crutch'' to those who know him well, is a Harlem widower whose empty-nest plans are put on hold after his millennial son and free-spirited daughter move back home.', 'Francois ''Frank'' Crutchfield or ''Crutch'' to those who know him well, is a Harlem widower whose empty-nest plans are put on hold after his millennial son and free-spirited daughter move back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tDDG9mLfhJmqOyvolWneeF6Y1g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253750'),
  ('472779999032094628', 'Cry Wolf', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Maja Jul Larsen', null, 'Bjarne Henriksen, Flora Ofelia Hofmann Lindahl, Christine Albeck Børge, Peter Plaugborg, Noah Storm Otto', 'NR', 'The intense and emotional story of a teenage girl who has written a vivid school essay detailing her stepfather’s violent behavior. The parents deny the accusations, but who is lying – and who is telling the truth?', 'The intense and emotional story of a teenage girl who has written a vivid school essay detailing her stepfather’s violent behavior. The parents deny the accusations, but who is lying – and who is telling the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmgoRVXCWnXYf1xQ2b7pM4utGNb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111410'),
  ('608145332813245591', 'Crying Out Love, in the Center of the World', 2004, 'Drama', 'Kyouichi Katayama', null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Haruka Ayase, Naoto Ogata, Sachiko Sakurai, Kotaro Tanaka, Tasuku Emoto, Yuika Motokariya, Yuki Matsushita', null, '"I thought I might be using a lifetime''s happiness in a moment. I was that happy and she was that beautiful." A young boy stands on the red earth of Australia under its blue sky. It is 17-year-old Sakutaro Matsumoto. His time with the girl comes back to him. The colored sand runs through his hands and a tear appears on his cheek. He wakes up. It''s 2004 and he is 34 years old and in Japan. He thinks "I have been in a world without her for 17 years." Returning home to see his old high school for the last time before it is demolished, Saku confronts anew the loss of the love of his life, Aki, to leukemia 17 years ago. Now a medical researcher at graduate school, he has been living as if half of him died with her since then.', '"I thought I might be using a lifetime''s happiness in a moment. I was that happy and she was that beautiful." A young boy stands on the red earth of Australia under its blue sky. It is 17-year-old Sakutaro Matsumoto. His time with the girl comes back to him. The colored sand runs through his hands and a tear appears on his cheek. He wakes up. It''s 2004 and he is 34 years old and in Japan. He thinks "I have been in a world without her for 17 years." Returning home to see his old high school for the last time before it is demolished, Saku confronts anew the loss of the love of his life, Aki, to leukemia 17 years ago. Now a medical researcher at graduate school, he has been living as if half of him died with her since then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFgvWctpLhRE1F0BIllEI96FCHz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46076'),
  ('414681677137693350', 'Cryptid', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Sylvain Runberg, Daniel di Grado', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer, Morgan Jensen', 'Maja Johanna Englander, Julius Fleischanderl, Astrid Morberg, Beata Borelius, Angelina Håkansson, Deniece Ignacio Nyman, Johan Hedenberg, Christian Sundgren', null, 'As a chain of horrific and inexplicable events start to unfold in their small town on the northern hemisphere, an ensemble of high school students will be forced to face their darkest fears in order to overcome a supernatural force feeding on chaos and the misery of mankind.', 'As a chain of horrific and inexplicable events start to unfold in their small town on the northern hemisphere, an ensemble of high school students will be forced to face their darkest fears in order to overcome a supernatural force feeding on chaos and the misery of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osC6DLGcup7Uy48DrOrqHVWdQ1y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111818'),
  ('607049667489078436', 'Crystal City', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Anton Vasilyev, Nikolay Shrayber, Ekaterina Olkina, Karina Razumovskaya, Darya Ekamasova, Sergey Gilev, Vladimir Vinogradov, Andrey Kurnosov', null, 'Investigator Sergei Smirnov, must return to the city of his childhood to investigate some high-profile murders. In Crystal city, there is a maniacal pedophile on the loose. Not only does he torture and kill children, he does it in a devious, brutal way. Sergei is the best in his field, so he entrusted with the investigation. Sergei has a complex character; the hero has obviously been through a lot, and his most terrible secrets are buried here, in Crystal city, where Sergei was born and raised.', 'Investigator Sergei Smirnov, must return to the city of his childhood to investigate some high-profile murders. In Crystal city, there is a maniacal pedophile on the loose. Not only does he torture and kill children, he does it in a devious, brutal way. Sergei is the best in his field, so he entrusted with the investigation. Sergei has a complex character; the hero has obviously been through a lot, and his most terrible secrets are buried here, in Crystal city, where Sergei was born and raised.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYzGugGunPPEGLeIGIbM3gzRCqv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123901'),
  ('524141586210408367', 'CSI: Crime Scene Investigation', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ann Donahue, Anthony E. Zuiker', 'Anthony E. Zuiker', 'Ted Danson, George Eads, Jorja Fox, Eric Szmanda, Robert David Hall, Wallace Langham, Jon Wellner, Elisabeth Harnois', 'TV-14', 'A Las Vegas team of forensic investigators are trained to solve criminal cases by scouring the crime scene, collecting irrefutable evidence and finding the missing pieces that solve the mystery.', 'A Las Vegas team of forensic investigators are trained to solve criminal cases by scouring the crime scene, collecting irrefutable evidence and finding the missing pieces that solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5hmoRjHNWady4AtAGICTUXknKH.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:1431'),
  ('440428684546364683', 'CSI: Crime Scene Talks', 2011, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takaya Kamikawa, Chiaki Kuriyama, Masaru Nagai, Karen Miyazaki, Masahiro Komoto, Keiko Toda, Junki Tozuka', null, 'Satoshi Itomura is an assistant police investigator who belongs to the Metropolitan Police Department’s Scientific Investigation Team. Reenactments, fingerprint and voice data collections, profiling... His team collects scientific evidence and pieces together fragments of information in order to help build evidences. However, Itomura often does not care about the scientific approach and instead pays a great deal of attention to the things that the victims always carried with them or treasured. And he focuses on these things because they usually carry the victim’s dying wishes, understanding that last message not only helps solve the cases but also brings closure to the depressed family of victims.', 'Satoshi Itomura is an assistant police investigator who belongs to the Metropolitan Police Department’s Scientific Investigation Team. Reenactments, fingerprint and voice data collections, profiling... His team collects scientific evidence and pieces together fragments of information in order to help build evidences. However, Itomura often does not care about the scientific approach and instead pays a great deal of attention to the things that the victims always carried with them or treasured. And he focuses on these things because they usually carry the victim’s dying wishes, understanding that last message not only helps solve the cases but also brings closure to the depressed family of victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsOKrhIu9jaG9ZAJ1xURw71a2Yx.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:49564'),
  ('166553881364825507', 'CSI: Cyber', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Carol Mendelsohn, Anthony E. Zuiker, Ann Donahue', null, 'Patricia Arquette, James Van Der Beek, Charley Koontz, Shad Moss, Hayley Kiyoko, Ted Danson', 'TV-14', 'The FBI''s team of Cyber Crime Investigators, headed by Special Agent Avery Ryan, works to solve cases involving the dark-net. Avery, a Special Agent in Charge and esteemed Cyber-Psychologist heads up a team, including Senior Special Agent Elijah Mundo, tasked with solving murders, cyber-theft, hacking, sex offences, and blackmail.', 'The FBI''s team of Cyber Crime Investigators, headed by Special Agent Avery Ryan, works to solve cases involving the dark-net. Avery, a Special Agent in Charge and esteemed Cyber-Psychologist heads up a team, including Senior Special Agent Elijah Mundo, tasked with solving murders, cyber-theft, hacking, sex offences, and blackmail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p56xB5YJDeYaGGOaYFtsjWycTYl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61811'),
  ('176697195271182603', 'CSI: Miami', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Ann Donahue, Anthony E. Zuiker, Carol Mendelsohn', null, 'David Caruso, Emily Procter, Omar Benson Miller, Jonathan Togo, Adam Rodriguez, Rex Linn, Eva LaRue', 'TV-14', 'The show follows Crime Scene Investigators working for the Miami-Dade Police Department as they use physical evidence, similar to their Las Vegas counterparts, to solve grisly murders. The series mixes deduction, gritty subject matter, and character-driven drama in the same vein as the original series in the CSI franchise, except that the Miami CSIs are cops first, scientists second.', 'The show follows Crime Scene Investigators working for the Miami-Dade Police Department as they use physical evidence, similar to their Las Vegas counterparts, to solve grisly murders. The series mixes deduction, gritty subject matter, and character-driven drama in the same vein as the original series in the CSI franchise, except that the Miami CSIs are cops first, scientists second.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNW64pjaHvf6purNaFhq4SHYRfl.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:1620'),
  ('379681441338858978', 'CSI: NY', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ann Donahue, Carol Mendelsohn, Anthony E. Zuiker', null, 'Gary Sinise, Anna Belknap, Sela Ward, Carmine Giovinazzo, Hill Harper, Eddie Cahill, Robert Joy, A.J. Buckley', 'TV-14', 'Follow the investigations of a team of NYPD forensic scientists and police officers identified as "Crime Scene Investigators".', 'Follow the investigations of a team of NYPD forensic scientists and police officers identified as "Crime Scene Investigators".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TGV4Bb3OPay4cHkQRlfwghv3vC.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2458'),
  ('794843756865875005', 'CSI: Vegas', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Tracey, Anthony E. Zuiker, Ann Donahue', null, 'Paula Newsome, Matt Lauria, Mandeep Dhillon, Marg Helgenberger, Ariana Guerra, Jay Lee, Lex Medlin', 'TV-14', 'Facing an existential threat that could bring down the Crime Lab, a brilliant team of forensic investigators must welcome back old friends and deploy new techniques to preserve and serve justice in Sin City.', 'Facing an existential threat that could bring down the Crime Lab, a brilliant team of forensic investigators must welcome back old friends and deploy new techniques to preserve and serve justice in Sin City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DtOnaOQPiptM9umpV0Xntwv9t3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:122194'),
  ('805024127585592561', 'Cuando quiero llorar no lloro', null, 'Drama', 'Miguel Otero Silva, Carlos Duplat Sanjuan', null, null, null, 'Cuando quiero llorar no lloro was a Spanish language TV series produced by Colombia''s R.T.I.. It debuted in April 1991 and concluded in August 1991. It was the subject of much controversy at the time was a huge success which inspired two remakes; Victorinos produced also by R.T.I for Telemundo and Tres Milagros produced by Teleset for RCN TV. It is based on the novel of the same name by Miguel Otero Silva.', 'Cuando quiero llorar no lloro was a Spanish language TV series produced by Colombia''s R.T.I.. It debuted in April 1991 and concluded in August 1991. It was the subject of much controversy at the time was a huge success which inspired two remakes; Victorinos produced also by R.T.I for Telemundo and Tres Milagros produced by Teleset for RCN TV. It is based on the novel of the same name by Miguel Otero Silva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yen6Cbay3SM6n0d0wmDhUYlpFoC.jpg', 0, 'tmdb:tv:44922'),
  ('61886399586717624', 'Cuando seas mía', 2001, 'Drama', 'Fernando Gaitán', null, 'Silvia Navarro, Rodrigo Abed, Martha Cristiana Merino, Evangelina Elizondo, Anette Michel, Sergio Basañez, Sergio Bustamante, Margarita Gralia', null, 'Cuando Seas Mia is a Mexican telenovela produced by TV Azteca. It was the second reunion for Silvia Navarro and Sergio Basañez as protagonists.', 'Cuando Seas Mia is a Mexican telenovela produced by TV Azteca. It was the second reunion for Silvia Navarro and Sergio Basañez as protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0vcvQmyG7YakJx7wswB123YBkL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16763'),
