  ('229255125535839505', 'Dad Is a Hero, Mom Is a Spirit, I''m a Reincarnator', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Seria Fukagawa, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Mai Nakahara, Misato Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'Ellen, an 8-year-old girl and half-spirit, once lived as a scientist in modern-day Japan. Now she''s been reincarnated into a new family: Rovel, her father and the kingdom''s legendary hero, and Origin, her mother and the queen of spirits. On top of that, Ellen herself has the power to manipulate chemical elements! But are Ellen''s powers enough to protect their family''s happiness?', 'Ellen, an 8-year-old girl and half-spirit, once lived as a scientist in modern-day Japan. Now she''s been reincarnated into a new family: Rovel, her father and the kingdom''s legendary hero, and Origin, her mother and the queen of spirits. On top of that, Ellen herself has the power to manipulate chemical elements! But are Ellen''s powers enough to protect their family''s happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JMQ3DJMudsCgErn21Bv0NchmE6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280048'),
  ('54365115389712071', 'Dad Stop Embarrassing Me!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Bentley Kyle Evans', null, 'Jamie Foxx, Kyla-Drew, David Alan Grier, Porscha Coleman, Heather Hemmens, Valente Rodriguez, Paul Toweh, Jonathan Kite', 'TV-14', 'A single dad and cosmetics brand owner figures out fatherhood on the fly when his strong-minded teen daughter moves in with him.', 'A single dad and cosmetics brand owner figures out fatherhood on the fly when his strong-minded teen daughter moves in with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uyHcbsxmJRUsFYL9qsbN3QwA7J.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119122'),
  ('181729369307854606', 'Dad''s Army', 1968, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'Jimmy Perry', 'David Croft, Jimmy Perry', 'Arthur Lowe, John Le Mesurier, Clive Dunn, John Laurie, Arnold Ridley, Ian Lavender, Bill Pertwee, Edward Sinclair', null, 'Introducing the Walmington-On-Sea home guard. During WW2, in a fictional British seaside town, a ragtag group of Home Guard local defense volunteers prepare for an imminent German invasion.', 'Introducing the Walmington-On-Sea home guard. During WW2, in a fictional British seaside town, a ragtag group of Home Guard local defense volunteers prepare for an imminent German invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MujdHdJaQKML59PNP9jFXlclBn.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:505'),
  ('741286799278824644', 'Dad''s House', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Amin Gamal', 'Amin Gamal, Sherif Yousry, Mohamed Fathy Abdel Maksoud', 'Mohamed Anwar, Entesar, Sami Maghouri, Mariam El Gendy, Mohamed Mahmoud, Ahmed Abdelhamid, Selim Hani, Rania Mahmoud Yasseen', null, 'A retired principal comes home to his “model” family—only to learn the apple didn’t just fall far from the tree, it rolled into chaos. Secrets spill, halos slip, and fixing the mess proves harder than running a school.', 'A retired principal comes home to his “model” family—only to learn the apple didn’t just fall far from the tree, it rolled into chaos. Secrets spill, halos slip, and fixing the mess proves harder than running a school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTFHoGxcsqykxe3mFnFcvuCy9Ui.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:309165'),
  ('629811239582262132', 'Daddies on Request', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Ana Sofía Clerici', null, 'Jorge Blanco, Michael Ronda, Lalo Brito, Farah Justiniani', 'TV-14', 'California receives an unexpected gift: her mother, Itzel, has sent her a van together with a request: she wants her to travel to Zacatecas to be reunited with her after a nine-year absence. California convinces her three mistrustful parents that this trip will lead them to happiness. Soon, California, Miguel, Diego, and Morgan set out on an adventure that will turn their lives upside down. What they could never have imagined is that they are being followed by two funny thugs who are also after the mysterious woman.', 'California receives an unexpected gift: her mother, Itzel, has sent her a van together with a request: she wants her to travel to Zacatecas to be reunited with her after a nine-year absence. California convinces her three mistrustful parents that this trip will lead them to happiness. Soon, California, Miguel, Diego, and Morgan set out on an adventure that will turn their lives upside down. What they could never have imagined is that they are being followed by two funny thugs who are also after the mysterious woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk3vuzrw6ykkjiFEJC4pRkro3gZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:114138'),
  ('585469120776009619', 'Daddy at Home', 2022, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Li Ai, Vision Wei, 张雅莲, Liu Jiayu, Xi Mengyao', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4pxfbEafQWo9DMNU2b79r7Nafv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:201781'),
  ('163718271077440835', 'Daddy Is My Classmate', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kisa Miura', 'Tsuyoshi Muro, Mei Nagano, Taishi Nakagawa, Mio Imada, Junki Tozuka, Karin Ono, Shota Taniguchi, Megumi Hamada', null, 'Author Tarō Obika is an obsessed single father who loves his daughter so much, he decides to go to the same college. Nicknamed Gatarō, he was widowed when his wife died of an illness and has raised his only child Sakura all on his own. Things are about to change drastically as Sakura prepares to enter a coeducational university after going to an all-girls school all her life. Worried sick, Gataro enrolls not only in the same school, but also in the same department, and the madness begins! Unable to control his anxiety, he sticks his nose in her every business, from classes to extracurricular activities, parties, dating events, cultural festivals, part-time jobs, and everything else college kids do. But as the 40-year-old middle-aged dad gets involved in the youthful pursuits of Sakura and her colleagues, he finds himself enjoying life even more than them.', 'Author Tarō Obika is an obsessed single father who loves his daughter so much, he decides to go to the same college. Nicknamed Gatarō, he was widowed when his wife died of an illness and has raised his only child Sakura all on his own. Things are about to change drastically as Sakura prepares to enter a coeducational university after going to an all-girls school all her life. Worried sick, Gataro enrolls not only in the same school, but also in the same department, and the madness begins! Unable to control his anxiety, he sticks his nose in her every business, from classes to extracurricular activities, parties, dating events, cultural festivals, part-time jobs, and everything else college kids do. But as the 40-year-old middle-aged dad gets involved in the youthful pursuits of Sakura and her colleagues, he finds himself enjoying life even more than them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Lr7LguwSPnA