  ('243339470202464389', 'Dai Shogun - Great Revolution', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Ayako Kawasumi, Yukari Tamura, Hideki Ogihara, Miyuki Sawashiro, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-MA', 'In the late Edo period, Japan had experienced an unprecedented crisis by Kurofune (Black Ships), the ships from foreign countries. But a giant robot called Onigami, which has existed since ancient time, dispelled the Kurofune ships and the exclusion of foreigners was accomplished. The story begins in Japan where Meiji restoration in 1868 didn''t happen.', 'In the late Edo period, Japan had experienced an unprecedented crisis by Kurofune (Black Ships), the ships from foreign countries. But a giant robot called Onigami, which has existed since ancient time, dispelled the Kurofune ships and the exclusion of foreigners was accomplished. The story begins in Japan where Meiji restoration in 1868 didn''t happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsDz74RVqwvwpK8IdS5n4CpuWnA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60826'),
  ('392899345162105031', 'Dai-Guard: Terrestrial Defense Corp.', 1999, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Chiharu Suzuka, Michiko Neya, Shin-ichiro Miki, Akiko Hiramatsu, Hiro Yuuki, Kentaro Ito, Katsuyuki Konishi, Makoto Higo', null, 'Twelve years ago, the Earth was attacked by giant invaders. To defend our planet, the Earth''s greatest minds and corporations assembled to design a giant robot of incredible power. Unfortunately, as with most government projects, the contract went to the lowest bidder. Fortunately, by the time the robot was ready, the mysterious invaders had already disappeared without a trace. The giant robot became first a curiosity, then a tourist attraction. But now the invaders are back and the only thing in their way is Dai-Guard and a young team of office workers who''ve been supplementing their regular incomes as part time pilots and tour guides. Can these reluctant heroes halt their alien foes while simultaneously concealing the defects in their giant robot?', 'Twelve years ago, the Earth was attacked by giant invaders. To defend our planet, the Earth''s greatest minds and corporations assembled to design a giant robot of incredible power. Unfortunately, as with most government projects, the contract went to the lowest bidder. Fortunately, by the time the robot was ready, the mysterious invaders had already disappeared without a trace. The giant robot became first a curiosity, then a tourist attraction. But now the invaders are back and the only thing in their way is Dai-Guard and a young team of office workers who''ve been supplementing their regular incomes as part time pilots and tour guides. Can these reluctant heroes halt their alien foes while simultaneously concealing the defects in their giant robot?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DH0LKENOggunvkBR1xtP3RgAmM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8664'),
  ('263893207392076367', 'Daily Dose of Sunshine', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lee Ra-ha, JQ Lee, Lee Nam-kyu', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Da-hee, Oh Bo-hyun', 'Park Bo-young, Yeon Woo-jin, Jang Dong-yoon, Lee Jung-eun, Chang Ryul, Lee E-dam, Lee Sang-hee, Park Ji-yeon', 'TV-MA', 'A kind-hearted nurse working in psychiatry goes above and beyond to be a ray of light for those under her care, despite the challenges coming her way.', 'A kind-hearted nurse working in psychiatry goes above and beyond to be a ray of light for those under her care, despite the challenges coming her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9hIiomaPXu6W9qATzPSqHgxze8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205319'),
  ('213787166365409336', 'Daily Lives of High School Boys', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Tomokazu Sugita, Kenichi Suzumura, Miyu Irino', 'TV-14', 'Join Tadakuni, Hidenori and Yoshitake as they undergo the trials and tribulations of life in high school. Each episode presents the boys and their classmates in unique situations that you may or may not have faced in high school yourself.', 'Join Tadakuni, Hidenori and Yoshitake as they undergo the trials and tribulations of life in high school. Each episode presents the boys and their classmates in unique situations that you may or may not have faced in high school yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhNuEIObse9eQWW2vFGgB5sI6MZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45859'),
  ('1064539592234132588', 'Daimidaler: Prince vs Penguin Empire', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yoko Hikasa, Shizuka Ishigami, Natsuki Hanae, Ayaka Ohashi', 'TV-MA', 'In order to stop the mysterious "Penguin Empire" from interfering with world peace, secret organization "Prince Beauty Parlor" has developed a giant robot that is powered by a rare special energy source called "Hi-ERo particles." Organization member Kyōko Sonan has located an ordinary high school student, Kōichi Madanbashi, with high amounts of Hi-ERo particles, making him a suitable candidate to pilot of the giant robot. But there is only one way to release his particles: allow Madanbashi to persuade him with lewd behavior.', 'In order to stop the mysterious "Penguin Empire" from interfering with world peace, secret organization "Prince Beauty Parlor" has developed a giant robot that is powered by a rare special energy source called "Hi-ERo particles." Organization member Kyōko Sonan has located an ordinary high school student, Kōichi Madanbashi, with high amounts of Hi-ERo particles, making him a suitable candidate to pilot of the giant robot. But there is only one way to release his particles: allow Madanbashi to persuade him with lewd behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7becJ8vETWWXH6p40efr44APCvo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60817'),
  ('1144145951731438727', 'Daisy Jones & the Six', 2023, 'Drama', 'Michael H. Weber, Scott Neustadter', 'Nora Kirkpatrick', 'Riley Keough, Sam Claflin, Camila Morrone, Suki Waterhouse, Will Harrison, Josh Whitehouse, Sebastian Chacon, Nabiyah Be', 'TV-MA', 'In 1977, Daisy Jones & The Six were on top of the world. Fronted by two charismatic lead singers — Daisy Jones and Billy Dunne — the band had risen from obscurity to fame. And then, after a sold-out show at Chicago''s Soldier Field, they called it quits. Now, decades later, the band members finally agree to reveal the truth.', 'In 1977, Daisy Jones & The Six were on top of the world. Fronted by two charismatic lead singers — Daisy Jones and Billy Dunne — the band had risen from obscurity to fame. And then, after a sold-out show at Chicago''s Soldier Field, they called it quits. Now, decades later, the band members finally agree to reveal the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltfscPUljehY7IwGG85vij2TEbQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95555'),
  ('787109805167692434', 'DAKAICHI -I''m being harassed by the sexiest man of the year-', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroki Takahashi, Yuki Ono, Wataru Hatano, Takuya Sato, Yuma Uchida, Kohsuke Toriumi', null, '"I''ll make it so your body''s unable to forget mine." Saijou Takato''s 5 year reign as the ''Most Huggable No. 1'' has been snatched. Stealing his thunder is the newbie actor with a 3-year debut, Azumaya! Towards the stuffy hostile Takato, Azumaya''s sincere sparkling smile starts to become effective. Even as Takato sets his alert level on MAX, Azumaya catches Takato in his shameful drunken state and uses it to blackmail him! In exchange for Azumaya''s silence, Azumaya states, "Please let me hold you…?! Embrace me, who was the Most Huggable No.1?" What the heck is he saying! Includes a large quantity of other high suspense erotic stories.', '"I''ll make it so your body''s unable to forget mine." Saijou Takato''s 5 year reign as the ''Most Huggable No. 1'' has been snatched. Stealing his thunder is the newbie actor with a 3-year debut, Azumaya! Towards the stuffy hostile Takato, Azumaya''s sincere sparkling smile starts to become effective. Even as Takato sets his alert level on MAX, Azumaya catches Takato in his shameful drunken state and uses it to blackmail him! In exchange for Azumaya''s silence, Azumaya states, "Please let me hold you…?! Embrace me, who was the Most Huggable No.1?" What the heck is he saying! Includes a large quantity of other high suspense erotic stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YLoMavlrbMyK2CuYzmMu9GdheO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82867'),
  ('48122100374094596', 'Daktari', 1966, 'Family, Drama', 'Ivan Tors, Art Arthur', null, 'Marshall Thompson, Hari Rhodes, Yale Summers, Ross Hagen, Erin Moran, Hedley Mattingly, Cheryl Miller', null, 'Daktari is an American children''s drama series that aired on CBS between 1966 and 1969. The series, an Ivan Tors Films Production in association with MGM Television, stars Marshall Thompson as Dr. Marsh Tracy, a veterinarian at the fictional Wameru Study Centre for Animal Behaviour in East Africa.', 'Daktari is an American children''s drama series that aired on CBS between 1966 and 1969. The series, an Ivan Tors Films Production in association with MGM Television, stars Marshall Thompson as Dr. Marsh Tracy, a veterinarian at the fictional Wameru Study Centre for Animal Behaviour in East Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snopJzlOhhjG5LKkW2SZ6A9YA0W.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4530'),
  ('572198634053509779', 'Dalah: Death and the Flowers', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Prabda Yoon', 'Ruthaiwan Wongsirasawat, Aticha Tanthanawigrai', 'Urassaya Sperbund, Chayanit Chansangavej, Naphat Vikairungroj, Ron Banjongsang, Amarin Nitipon, Praewa Suthamphong, Kirana Pipityakorn, Phuwin Tangsakyuen', 'TV-MA', 'When her client dies on the eve of his wedding, a florist sets out to find the killer, unearthing high society''s dark secrets — while keeping her own.', 'When her client dies on the eve of his wedding, a florist sets out to find the killer, unearthing high society''s dark secrets — while keeping her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNXjZwYesgmveMMeQVHERGLQrRs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282792'),
