  ('184792779038465895', 'Dare You to Death', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'MTRD.S', 'Kanokphan Ornrattanasakul, Issaraporn Kuntisuk, Sorawit Muangkaew', 'Archen Aydin, Natachai Boonprasert, Thipakorn Thitathan, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Ochiris Suwanacheep, Jeeratch Wongpian, Preeyaphat Lawsuwansiri, Pathitta Pornchumroenrut', null, 'When seven college students find themselves trapped in a deadly game, two detectives compete to find the killer — even as their attraction grows.', 'When seven college students find themselves trapped in a deadly game, two detectives compete to find the killer — even as their attraction grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSKoGFRwbAbplM9XIEcI7S5SaBw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278146'),
  ('325625081436019930', 'Daredevil: Born Again', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Dario Scardapane, Chris Ord, Matt Corman', 'Omar Najam', 'Charlie Cox, Vincent D''Onofrio, Wilson Bethel, Deborah Ann Woll, Margarita Levieva, Matthew Lillard, Lili Taylor, Tony Dalton', 'TV-MA', 'Matt Murdock, a blind lawyer with heightened abilities, is fighting for justice through his bustling law firm, while former mob boss Wilson Fisk pursues his own political endeavors in New York. When their past identities begin to emerge, both men find themselves on an inevitable collision course.', 'Matt Murdock, a blind lawyer with heightened abilities, is fighting for justice through his bustling law firm, while former mob boss Wilson Fisk pursues his own political endeavors in New York. When their past identities begin to emerge, both men find themselves on an inevitable collision course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDUoAsU8lQHOOoRkFiBuarmACDN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202555'),
